ed for each time point t within the observation interval to is collected a second data collecting step of collecting data and and when the ratio p2 of the number of second data generated by satisfying the following formula 6 with respect to the total number of the second data is equal to or greater than a predetermined third specific ratio pc and a second result outputting step of estimating and outputting an inter block disconnection when the third specific ratio pc is less than a predetermined fourth specific ratio pd"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101630268-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "the peak level of the reservoir block of the target block and the peak level of the reservoir of the adjacent block may be different from each other or may be the same"}, {"pat_id": "US-4370865-A", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "when the ice drops the ice making plate 2 will experience an abrupt increase in temperature which is sensed by an ice drop or removal sensing thermostat th3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101042852-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "therefore if the water is confined to a certain place for a long time the pollution is further increased by the material decomposition and material binding action so that the water stored in the reservoir always maintains the full water level while the water that flows upstream from the upstream frequent discharge through the phone is the best way to prevent the contamination of the river water and also by using the method of discharging the water in the reservoir through the cyphon constituted in the sluice the substances contained in the water are combined"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200364573-Y1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "more specifically when the water level of the reservoir rises to a high level due to a failure of the existing water level control valve the discharged through the overflow water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200364573-Y1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "referring to the operation and effect of the present invention configured 