idation tank outflow storage tank sludge storage tank and acid pipe and by applying contact oxidation method using contact media in the aeration part and precipitation contact oxidation tank polluted river water and sewage in the apparatus for treating sewage installed on one side of the inflow distribution tank to adjust the level of the treated water flowing from the inlet each movable bank for adjusting the level of the treated water installed and installed on one side of the outlet storage tank perforated perforated walls 7 15 of area formed in the interface between the inlet distribution tank and the aeration contacting tank the interface between the aeration contacting tank and the sludge hopper and the interface between the precipitation contacting oxidation tank and the outflow reservoir a supernatant water storage tank which is formed by trapping the sludge hopper formed in the trapezoidal sludge hopper formed between the aeration contacting oxidation tank and the precipitation contacting oxidation tank to the sludge storage tank through an air lift and partitioned by an operation full width bank on one side of the sludge storage tank an diffuser installed in the inflow distribution tank and the outflow storage tank to supply dissolved oxygen at all times or intermittently to the inside of the contact oxidation tank and the treated water discharged while being prevented from being closed by sludge and contact oxidation method further comprises at least one contact medium selected from the group consisting of crushed stone of 30 to 40 of porosity or plastic of 80 or more of porosity in the aeration part contact oxidation tank and precipitation part contact oxidation tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100381901-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "precipitate contact oxidation tank 4 sludge hopper 5 to collect precipitated sludge outflow reservoir 10 to collect treated effluents outlet 11 to dispose of treated water and precipitation contact oxidation 4 it consists of a sludge storage tank 13 for sedimentation by storing the sludge precipitated in the"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6549343-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "that is by connecting the weather forecast to the internet of things iot platform of the electronic automatic shut off groundwater automatic inlet valve 12 inflow of runoff groundwater in summer when urban floods frequently occur due to continuous rainfall or heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100298244-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "pumped and transported to the sludge dehydrator 50 using a pump and when the transportation is completed open the closed blocking gate 23 and close the blocking gate 23 on the top of the other sedimentation tank to prevent the inflow of river water pumping and transporting the sludge dewatering device 50 and then dewatering and purifying the moisture contained in the journey is discharged back to the reservoir 11 characterized in that the stream water purification by sedimentation and dredging"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100298244-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the present invention for achieving the above object to form a coriander site on both sides of the sewer and formed in the central longitudinal direction to form embankment on both sides of the coriander site to let the river water flowing through the river flows through the stream in the river the sewer and coriander site has a block size to the river flow inflow to the side of the river inflow to the side of the river flows into a predetermined size so as not to affect the water flow capacity of the river so that the dredging of the journey to facilitate a housing having a bottom surface on which river water is discharged and having a plurality of sedimentation tanks divided by a sedimentation basin divider in a direction parallel to the reservoir in the center of the sedimentation basin so as to control the river water during the dredging operation a front end of the enclosure that is a sedimentation inlet flow path with a head protruding from the center connected to the sedimentation basin divider having a jaw and a groove at the bottom and an upper rod hook groove at the top the prefabricated movable blocking gate installed in the blocking gate installation unit is achieved by installing a sedimentation basin consisting of several prefabricated clasp plates that are miniaturized for easy transportation and an upper hook rod to support the prefabricated clasp plates"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100298244-B1", "para_id": "para_54", "text": "the dewatered degreased liquid collected in the lower collecting part 56 through the discharge hole and collected in the lower collecting part 56 is discharged back to the water reservoir 11 through the degreasing solution discharge pipe 54 while the overflowed sump is an inlet 53"}]</data>
