d to the backwash air supply pipe 810 through an air transfer pipe 831 and is connected to the backwash air supply pipe 810 through the air transfer pipe 831"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100715445-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "in addition the reason for the installation of the second screen 19b is to block the dumping of the solids or food waste through the storm discharge pipe 13 due to the lack of awareness of the residents to the integrated storm drain and sewage collector"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101484891-B1", "para_id": "claim_14", "text": "in an initial high boiling point contamination treatment system 100 connected to the end of the conduit or the river water from which the polluted water is discharged to provide pollution excellence and selectively supply only the initial nonpoint pollution excellence a reservoir 200 for storing initial boiling impurity contamination provided to the water collection channel 130 of the overflow collecting unit 100 and performing a primary settling of contaminants a siphon pipe 295 discharging the initial nonpoint contamination excellent stored in the reservoir 200 when the water level of the reservoir 200 becomes equal to or higher than the height of the highest part in the reversed u shape"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101484891-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "therefore in an environment in which contamination accumulated on the bottom surface of the reservoir 200 and contamination of the initial non point contamination may be mixed into the reservoir outflow portion 250 the outer circumference of the excellent supply port 260 is covered and an excellent supply cover 265 for switching the direction upward"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101889975-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "according to an embodiment of the present invention the storeroom 100 may include a grating seating surface 121 formed in a boundary area between the storage tank main body 110 and the grating insert tube 120 wherein the grating 200 comprises a grating frame 210 rotatably coupled