y rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101889974-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "an excellent storage tank 100 which is embedded in the inside of the ground and receives stormwater introduced from the ground a grating 200 rotatably coupled to the upper surface of the superior storage tank 100 for introducing the stormwater into the storage tank and blocking the foreign material a dirt collecting box 400 provided in the superior storage tank 100 for filtering dirt contained in the rainwater and a collection box support 300 provided at an upper portion of the superior storage container 100 and supporting the dirt collection box 400 the storm reservoir 100 a reservoir body 110 in which the storm is stored a grating insert tube 120 formed on the upper portion of the reservoir body 110 and coupled to the grating 200 and a grating seating surface 121 formed on the boundary region between the storage tank main body 110 and the grating insert tube 120 so as to be stepped inwardly in a predetermined area so that the grating 200 is seated and supported the grating 200 a grating frame 210 rotatably coupled to the grating insertion tube 120 and seated on the grating seating surface 121 in a closed state a plurality of manhole saws 220 disposed in the grating frame 210 at predetermined intervals in the longitudinal direction and having irregularities formed on the upper surface thereof to block rainwater from the storm reservoir 100 and block foreign matter a plurality of reinforcing frames 230 arranged in the grating frame 210 in a lateral direction at regular intervals a plurality of protrusions protruding from the ground at a predetermined interval in the lower portion of the outer reinforcing frame 230a to allow the gravel to flow into the gap between the grating insert tube 120 and the grating frame 210 and includes a soil inflow tooth 240 the height of the earth inflow tooth 240 and the height of the outer reinforcement frame 230a may be greater than the height of the reinforcement frame 230 located inside the outer reinforcement frame 230a and the reinforcing frame 230 is formed at the same height as the reinforcing frame 230"}]</data>
