  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100744631-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "hydrologic control unit for adjusting the connected via the plurality of chlorine ion meter and wired and wireless communication means and stores the concentration data received from the chlorine ion meter and to identify the variation in the water quality compared to the comparative chlorine ion concentration data stored in the database and stores the result a main server for outputting and transmitting to a remote place and a management server connected to the main server through a wired wireless communication means and controlling the operation of the water level or the sewage treatment plant of the reservoir into which the initial rainwater flows in accordance with the change in the water quality of the initial rainwater transmitted from the main server"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to minimize the initial excellent water remaining in the water channel does not cause water pooling the remaining water does not decay there is an effect of reducing the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "inflow to remove the contaminants from the pre treatment facility 100a to enter the reservoir 200a rainwater rainwater can be provided with a number of sedimentation basin 300a to remove fresh water or discharge this collection pipe inside the reservoir 1 of 201 the scour prevention crushed stone 202 may be installed to prevent scour due to rainwater flow rate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100781302-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "therefore the present invention stores the initial rainwater containing a large number of non point pollutants in urban areas with high pollution during rainfall and stored in the initial rainwater excellent storage 10 to enable the deposition of sand particles generated at this time such as branches and plastic bags when water level is measure