  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to minimize the initial excellent water remaining in the water channel does not cause water pooling the remaining water does not decay there is an effect of reducing the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_76", "text": "a margin can be provided and the amount of rainwater remaining in the waterway can be minimized so that water pooling does not occur and the remaining rainwater can be decayed or reduce the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100636832-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "more specifically when the water level of the reservoir rises to a high level due to a failure of the existing water level control valve it is discharged through the overflow water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configurat