north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102048724-B1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "4 and 5 the forest fire diffusion prevention reservoir wt in one embodiment of the present invention is provided with a polyethylene material free of deformation of its shape the reservoir body 100 based on the support wood 110 and by folding the catch plate 200 can be stored portable to a relatively small size by using a separate backpack strap not shown to facilitate the transport process the forest fire spread low reservoir wt of the forest area the installation or demolition process can be greatly simplified"}]</data>
