  <data key="d5">["rainwater", "leaf", "medium", "system", "center", "weight", "valve", "support", "invention", "device", "construction", "vinyl", "roof", "object", "house", "snow", "dust", "plant", "foundation", "water", "leak", "tank", "part", "capacity", "order", "level", "ground", "purification", "cistern", "portion", "adjustment", "cost", "gas", "inflow", "wall", "mesh", "example", "risk", "structure", "cover", "connection", "problem", "reservoir", "odor", "collection", "drain", "strainer", "rain", "amount", "respect", "unit", "shape", "embodiment", "collapse", "contamination", "pipe", "window", "storage", "column", "height", "incident", "drainage", "lid"]</data>
  <data key="d6">["handle", "enable", "mention", "receive", "include", "propose", "accumulate", "purify", "solve", "provide", "collect", "block", "prevent", "feed", "connect", "describe", "form", "construct", "fall", "accord", "simplify", "close", "structure", "have", "surround", "would", "may", "fill", "collapse", "continue", "can", "exist", "be", "discharge", "store", "replace", "bypass", "will", "adjust", "lower", "instal"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-12315357-B2", "para_id": "para_98", "text": "the incidents 404 may include a roof leak a foundation leak a wall leak or a window leak for example"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101016329-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "nothing has been done.the present invention has been proposed in order to solve the conventional problems as described above the object of the construction is to replace the roof of the existing storage tank while being constructed in a simplified structure to block the inflow of dust and lower the construction cost as well as drainage of rain water the present invention provides a reservoir cover device and a reservoir including the same which can smoothly and easily handle odors or harmful gases and in particular the height of the lid can be adjusted according to the reservoir level thereby enabling the adjustment of the storage capacity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101016329-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "therefore the reservoir cover device 1a of the first embodiment of the present invention will replace the roof that is previously installed on the reservoir and block the inflow of dust and the like and in particular will simplify the structure to lower the construction cost"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200499514-Y1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "a typical vinyl house 100 is structured so that rain or snow accumulates on the roof and therefore if a large amount of rain or snow accumulates on the roof due to heavy rain or heavy snow the vinyl house may collapse"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200499514-Y1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "here if water is continuously stored in the reservoir 200 there is a risk of the roof collapsing due to the weight of the water but in the present invention the water stored in the reservoir 200 is continuously discharged into the water tank 210 so there is no risk of collapse"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200499514-Y1", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "meanwhile if water continues to accumulate in the reservoir 200 there is a risk of roof collapse as previously mentioned"}, {"pat_id": "US-5730179-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "in this respect it would be desirable if a rainwater collection device were provided which is part of a relatively closed system to prevent contamination of collected rainwater from fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "US-6120210-A", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "rainwater from the roof or parts of the surrounding ground can be collected to feed into the cistern filled with a porous medium"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100699326-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "wow connected to the connecting pipe 41 by bypassing the initial excellent drainage portion 20 and at least one connection valve 42 formed with one or more connection valves 42 at the connection pipe 41 it is connected to the connection pipe 41 of the purified water connection valve part 40 to receive rainwater the lower center is formed with a drain valve 51a the cylindrical shape having a support column 51b formed around the drain valve 51a while forming the water purification plant 51 a strainer 52 having a mesh shape is formed inside the water purification plant 51 and the primary water purification unit 50 including a cover 53 which closes the upper portion of the water purification plant 51"}]</data>
</edge>
