ical paddle 200 flotation tank 210 discharge part 220 scum discharge unit 300 bubble generation unit 310 pressurized water supply unit 312 pump 314 pressure tank 316 compressor 320 fine bubble injection unit 322 branch piping 323 pressurized water inlet valve 324 injection pipe 326 decompression tube 330 backwash 332 backwash valve 334 water level sensor 336 control unit 400 guide unit 410 injured guide slope 420 dead zone prevention slope 500 floating scum removing unit 510 blade 600 sediment sludge removal unit 610 chain 620 scraper 700 outflow collecting part 710 porous pipe 720 block type sump 800 advanced oxidation processing unit 810 oxidizing gas supply unit 812 am generator 814 ozone storage tank 816 ozone pressurizer 820 uv contact unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101504881-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "further in the present invention the floating screen and the movable screen connected thereto are installed in front of the orifice so that the movable screen covers the orifice for a predetermined time during which the water level in the rainfall chamber rises during rains thereby temporarily filtering the foreign substances over the fence it is possible to temporarily block or reduce the inflow of foreign matter into the sewage treatment plant through the connection pipe at the time of bar and rainfall.brief description of the drawings fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101357244-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "as such the connection channel 112 is formed as an inclined surface 112b in which both top surfaces of the u shaped trench 112a are inclined downward toward the inner center of the chamber 110 and thus through the connection channel 112"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100314663-B1", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "and automatically discharges the excess air supplied to the automatic air discharge valve 34 and when the pressure in the water supply pressure tank 40 rises to a constant pressure the electronic safety valve 39 to prevent deformation or damage of the tank"}, {"pat_i