ent facility into a block concept and a localized detection data storage module for storing sensing data generated in each water treatment facility through the regional data matching module and a management data storage module for storing various control and management reference data and a control unit for reading data of the detected data detection module and the management data storage module to obtain information on the current state of each water treatment facility area to be managed by region a management target search module for selecting a corresponding water treatment facility to check the current state of the water treatment facility for an arbitrary one place with respect to the state generating module and a plurality of water treatment facilities and a management target display module for displaying information on an arbitrary management object selected in the module or information on the entire management object so as to select and display an arbitrary one water treatment facility for a plurality of water treatment facilities a management object selection module that receives a request from a remote manager for controlling the water treatment facility management module and a management object selection module that receives a request from a remote manager generated in the management object selection module control the database module and control an integrated remote control system for the via being configured as a remote supervisory control module that controls the entire operation of the mobile terminal multiple water treatment facilities"}, {"pat_id": "US-10480163-B2", "para_id": "para_62", "text": "if the water level in the trailer reservoir is not below the predetermined level the water available from the trailer reservoir may be considered sufficient for user use"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100690956-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "in addition in the conduit away from the sludge removal packer upstream a predetermined distance the packer for water quantity