evel is higher than a certain level the lifting and lowering operation of the elevating means is controlled and the water quality test result is received from the water quality inspection unit and the recovery line and the discharge opening and closing door are includes a driving control unit for controlling the driving and controlling whether or not the re inflow line is opened so that the re inflow of the reprocessed treated water is made and the elevating means it is configured on one side of the water quality inspection unit and when a driving signal is transmitted from the driving control unit a transfer driving unit that provides a predetermined power to perform an elevating and descending operation and the collecting means are coupled and connected to the transfer driving unit consisting of a transfer member for transferring the collecting means while lifting or lowering operation is performed when the transfer driving unit is driven in the first discharge tank a seating panel whose one end is fixedly coupled to an outer surface of the elevating means and a rotating panel rotatably coupled to the front end of the seating panel and configured to rotate vertically upward when the elevating means is moved upward and the a drive cylinder for controlling the rotation of the rotation panel and a drive control sensor that is interlocked by contact with the water quality inspection unit and receives a drive signal from the drive control unit to control the drive of the drive cylinder and the drive control unit a signal transmission unit configured to perform a water quality inspection while driving the water quality inspection unit only when the water quality inspection unit and the drive control sensor contact each other under the control of effluent water inspection device for a wastewater treatment facility comprising a"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102155071-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "according to an embodiment of the present invention for achieving such a problem it is configured to precipitate and transport the treated water introduced from the aeration tank and to perform reprocessing by secondary precipitation of the effluent that does not meet the water quality discharge standard"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101905810-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "when the rotation lever 126 is rotated a clutch mechanism 120 for bringing the clutch plate 122 into close contact with the friction plate 121 and transmitting the driving force of the rotating shaft 83 to the output shaft 124 a rotating arm 131 rotatably mounted on the inside of the collector 10 and connected to a rotating lever 126 of the clutch mechanism 120 to rotate the rotating lever 126 during the lifting and lowering operation a floater 130 comprising a buoyant body 132 provided at the tip of the swash plate 131 and operating the clutch mechanism 120 while the swing arm 131 is pivoted up and down according to the water level in the water collector 10 a transmission 90 having a transmission gear connected to the output shaft 124 of the clutch mechanism 120 and an output shaft 92 to increase the rotational speed of the clutch mechanism output shaft 124 and an impeller 103 connected to the output shaft 92 of the speed shift device 90"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101905810-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "when the rotation lever 126 is rotated a clutch mechanism 120 for bringing the clutch plate 122 into close contact with the friction plate 121 and transmitting the driving force of the rotating shaft 83 to the output shaft 124 a rotating arm 131 rotatably mounted on the inside of the collector 10 and connected to a rotating lever 126 of the clutch mechanism 120 to rotate the rotating lever 126 during the lifting and lowering operation a floater 130 comprising a buoyant body 132 provided at the tip of the swash plate 131 and operating the clutch mechanism 120 while the swing arm 131 is pivoted up and down according to the water level in the water collector 10 a transmission 90 having a tr