  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-0137696-Y1", "para_id": "para_53", "text": "moreover the method of checking the low water level in the water tank by using the air tank is very conventional and it only functions to block the flow of water only when the water is almost full in the water tank thereby making it difficult to identify the low water amount in the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5192294-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "when checking and maintaining the water level detection device it is possible to reduce the amount of water to be drained and the working time by draining only the water in the sub water tank after blocking the connecting pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100437342-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "accordingly an object of the present invention is to provide a two way transmission and reception wireless data signal using a dedicated frequency between a motor pump of a water supply and a remote intake tank for storing water so that the water level can be controlled while checking the operation state in the intake tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102092239-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "generating a deep learning model using a first water level value and determining a pump operation value in a pressure field for a second water level value received in a subsequent cycle based on the abnormal time point based on the deep learning model it may include steps.according to the present invention when the communication state with the water level meter installed in the reservoir does not satisfy a predetermined level based on the deep learning model generated using the water level value previously received from the water level meter the pump operation value in the pressurization field is determined"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102490133-B1", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "disinfection treatment system according to the present invention by checking the amount of breeding water supplied through the main transfer pump 3 in real time with the scale bar 17 it is possible to carry out the simultaneous transfer operation of breeding water and infectious organisms more efficiently such as a quantitative supply type treatment cycle of breeding water tailored to the treatment capacity of 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101427989-B1", "para_id": "para_48", "text": "at this time it is possible to increase or decrease the hydrogen generation and the circulation time according to the quantity so that the hydrogen dissolved amount can be prevented from rising excessively by checking the ph value"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101412529-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "the method of claim 4 the water level controller 32 includes a timer for checking the time after the water level is sensed by at least one of the first sensor 29 the second sensor 30 and the third sensor 31 of the water level sensor portion the rainwater stored in the rainwater storage tank 16 may be discharged through the discharge pipe 22 for a predetermined discharge time when the time counted by the timer 33 becomes longer than a predetermined time wherein the control unit controls the discharge valve 21 so that the discharge water 21 is discharged"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101412529-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "the water level controller may further include a timer for checking the time after the water level is sensed by at least one of the first sensor the second sensor and the third sensor of the water level sensor portion and controls the discharge valve so that the rainwater stored in the rainwater storage tank can be discharged through the discharge pipe for a preset discharge time when the discharge time exceeds the predetermined set time"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2678581-B2", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "while checking the dryness of the surface layer and the soil moisture of vegetation adjust the water level effectively and effectively using the water level adjustment basin"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100917650-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "the present invention additionally has a special opening degree measuring device and a water level measuring sensor is installed so that the automatic door operator can manage the water more efficiently while directly checking the opening state and the water level measurement value displayed on the control panel of the remote control room"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6779430-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "it is necessary to arbitrarily change how much the stirring tank is submerged and how much the water surface of the storage tank is immersed in the stirring part while checking the type and amount of food waste and the viscosity of the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromotive force generation 102d measuring point 102e reference point 103 thermocouple thermometer switch for detection sensor 103a configuration of thermocouple thermometer 103b temperature measurement limit 103c temperature 1 103d ammeter temperature scale 103e metal a 1