ed including the ultraviolet irradiation unit is provided at a position lower than the water level accommodated in the water tank the water tank is provided with an opening in which the ultraviolet irradiation unit is accommodated on the inner lower surface the ultraviolet irradiation unit is formed to correspond to the opening and transmits the ultraviolet rays further comprising a water blocking portion for preventing the water accommodated in the water tank from flowing into the interior the opening is formed to have a step and extends in an inward direction of the opening and includes a seating part on which the order part is seated the ultraviolet irradiation unit further comprises a the seating part is a vaporization type humidifier that prevents the uv rays from being directly irradiated to the leak prevention part"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102287262-B1", "para_id": "claim_18", "text": "uv lamps that produce uv light a tank containing water at a constant level and a receiving part provided at a position lower than the water level in which the ultraviolet lamp is accommodated a water blocking unit provided between the water tank and the receiving unit to prevent the water of the water tank from flowing into the receiving unit and a humidifying element provided in direct contact with the water of the water tank receiving the water contained in the water tank and performing humidification by vaporizing the supplied water and before the humidification operation of the vaporization type humidifier starts the ultraviolet irradiation unit is controlled so that ultraviolet rays are irradiated to the water accommodated in the water tank when the humidification operation of the vaporization type humidifier is finished the ultraviolet irradiation unit is controlled so that ultraviolet rays are irradiated to the water accommodated in the water tank a control unit for controlling the ultraviolet irradiation unit so that the ultraviolet rays contained in the water tank are irradiated at predetermined intervals when the humidification operation of the vaporization type humidifier is performed the ultraviolet lamp directly irradiates ultraviolet rays directly to the water in the water tank the ultraviolet irradiation unit is provided at a position lower than the water level accommodated in the water tank the water tank is provided with an opening in which the ultraviolet irradiation unit is accommodated on the inner lower surface the opening is formed to have a step and extends in an inward direction of the opening and includes a seating part on which the order part is seated the ultraviolet irradiation unit further comprises a a vaporization type humidifier that prevents the seating portion from being directly irradiated with the ultraviolet light to the leak prevention portion"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3017891-B2", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "next the circulating pump 4 is driven to apply pump pressure to the return pipe 9 via the hot water feed pipe 8 and the branch pipe 14 and at the same time time measurement is started by the water level change time measurement circuit 16 and this time is measured"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200194172-Y1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "in addition even if the internal water level rises due to the congestion of contents such as sewage it is unlikely to leak"}]</data>
