  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-9078419-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "when another appliance is turned on such as the high powered aquarium lights on the same circuit as the water pump power level may be reduced to water pump changing the water pressure it produces"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100652934-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a secondary filtration device 4 for reacting acidic nitrogen a flow rate adjustment tank 6 for aeration of the outflow water introduced from the secondary filtration device 4 activated carbon filtration device 8 filled with activated carbon to remove odor adsorb organic matter decompose biological matters and remove suspended matters on the effluent flowing from the flow rate adjustment tank 6 and a storage tank 10 for storing the effluent flowing from the activated carbon filtration device 8"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100652934-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "a secondary filtration device 4 for reacting acidic nitrogen a flow rate adjustment tank 6 for aeration of the outflow water introduced from the secondary filtration device 4 activated carbon filtration device 8 filled with activated carbon to remove odor adsorb organic matter decompose biological matters and remove suspended matters on the effluent flowing from the flow rate adjustment tank 6 it characterized in that it comprises a storage tank 10 for storing the outflow water introduced from the activated carbon filtration device 8"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_533", "text": "the above mentioned firefighter nozzle 10 is connected to multiple pipe nozzles 10 at a distance of 1 meter or 3 meters using a flexible hose 190 for forest fire prevention or indoors or outdoors of a building and a flexible high pressure hose 190 used in the event of an internal fire is formed by a hydraulic press with wire and rubber and a cloth"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of displa