 or treated water measured by the sensing device internal and external temperature of the water treatment unit internal and external humidity of the water treatment unit and a pump that analyzes the amount of sunlight irradiated to the water treatment device in real time and is installed in front of the first water quality detection device to supply raw water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102654101-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in more detail a bypass pipe for freeze and burst prevention is connected between the suction pipe and the discharge pipe so that the temperature detected by the temperature sensor in winter is lowered below the set temperature if there is no water flow because the user does not use water the pump is driven so that the pressure of the discharge pipe is higher than the opening pressure of the relief valve and water circulates through the bypass pipe to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102654101-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore the purpose of the present invention is to connect a bypass pipe for freeze prevention between the suction pipe and the discharge pipe so that in the winter if the temperature detected by the temperature sensor falls below the set temperature and there is no water flow because the user does not use water the pump is driven so that the pressure of the discharge pipe is higher than the opening pressure of the relief valve allowing water to circulate through the bypass pipe thereby providing a freeze prevention water supply pressurization device and a control method thereof that can prevent freezing in the winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200433469-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "on the other hand in the case of using a heating wire there is a concern of excessive use of energy a fire occurrence problem due to overheating and a loss of thermal insulation function due to breakage of the heating wire.the present invention was devised to improve such a conventional problem and it is configured to determine whether the intak