he chemicals of the present invention and secondary contamination from the source"}, {"pat_id": "JP-7009733-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "2 the microwave pretreatment apparatus of the present invention physically modifies the protein conformation and denatures the protein and in particular promotes the secondary conformational change of the protein thereby promoting the hydrolysis of the protein"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101508672-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "according to an aspect of the present invention there is provided a medicine dispensing apparatus for dispensing medicine formed by injecting medicine into water supplied to a water supply pipe the apparatus comprising a main body a medicine supply pipe 30 which is installed inside the main body and is for supplying medicines in a medicine storage tank provided in the medicine storage tank to the water supply pipe one side connected to the medicine storage tank and the other side connected to the water supply pipe a chemical supply pump provided with the chemical supply pump a motor interlocked with the medicine dispensing pump and adjusting a dose of the medicine by adjusting a rotation speed a control unit electrically connected to the motor to control the driving and rotating speed of the motor and a pressure sensor for sensing a pressure inside the medicine inlet pipe and electrically connected to the motor so that the medicine is supplied to the medicine inlet pipe only when water flows inside the water supply pipe the pipe is provided with a branch connecting member at one end for facilitating installation in the water supply pipe a heat radiating plate is installed inside the main body a temperature sensor interlocked with the heat radiating plate is further installed and a heating wire is installed on the medicine inlet pipe to prevent freezing of the medicine a side wall of the main body is connected to a first medicine inlet pipe connected to a medicine storage tank and supplying medicines to the