d reaction tank is introduced into the heat exchanger again so that the heated treated water of the acid wastewater flowing in contact with the outside of the coiled inner tube into which the acidic wastewater is introduced"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4407420-B2", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "that is since the water distribution amount on a rainy day is affected by rain the rainy day correction means 82 removes the rainy day correction coefficient to handle it as a clear day and use it as a calculated value of the average fluctuation pattern"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102191037-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a synthetic resin structure having a network structure including a plurality of pores and a water permeable base layer block comprising a porous concrete composition accommodated in the plurality of pores of the synthetic resin structure a water pocket block positioned on the permeable base layer block a water collecting tank configured to store water collected through the water permeable base layer block a sprinkler pipe positioned under the permeable base block and configured to sprinkle water stored in the water collecting tank under the permeable base block at least one sensor unit configured to measure at least one of a surface temperature and humidity of the water pocket block a water supply pump operating to supply water stored in the water collecting tank to the sprinkling pipe a communication unit configured to receive public data on one or more of weather population and vehicles of an installation area of the permeable base block from an external server and an automatic watering system using a water permeable base layer block comprising a control unit configured to control an operation of the water supply pump by further using the public data together with at least one of the surface temperature and the humidity measured by the sensor unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102191037-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "the automatic sprinkling system using the permeable base block