hamber 4 for transmitting the pressure to the pressure chamber 4 the control unit 8 controls the pressure change state of the pressure chamber 4 in real time so that the open close valve 2 operates by the control signal of the control unit 8 at the time of the pressure change in the pressure chamber 4 due to the operation a rotary motor 10 a pump 18 for allowing the fire water flowing through the connection pipe 12 to flow through the transfer pipe 20 at a high pressure by the rotation of the rotary motor 10 a fire hose 32 provided on the transfer pipe 20 for injecting a high pressure fire water for opening the opening closing valve 2 a rainwater receiver 28 for storing rainwater is installed on the ground and a check valve 30 for preventing foreign matter from entering the rainwater receiver 28 is provided at a lower portion of the rainwater receiver 28 a water storage tank 22 for storing the water for fire fighting and supplying the stored water for fire into the fire box 100 through the connection pipe 12 and a power generation unit 14 that supplies power to the fire fighting cabinet 100 by installing a self power generation facility among at least one of power generation using fossil fuel and solar power generation installed outside the control unit 8 checks the pressure in the pressure chamber 4 changed by the opening of the opening and closing valve 2 and operates the rotary motor 10 so that the fire fighting water is automatically injected into the fire hose 32 removable outdoor fire fighting cabinet"}, {"pat_id": "EP-2486988-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "the term liquid is therefore understood below to mean any liquid arriving naturally or artificially in the cavities of the mine or in the natural environment of the mine in particular groundwater or surface water for example rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101356690-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "as a stream type water flow circulation system installed around the river a permeable sidewalk block unit forming a sidewalk through which pedestrians pass an irrigation canal provided in parallel with the permeable sidewalk block unit and having a communication path capable of receiving rainwater from the permeable sidewalk block unit a conveying pipe member for conveying rainwater penetrating downward through the water permeable sidewalk block unit a filtration unit for filtering rainwater coming through the communication path of the irrigation canal and the transfer pipe member and being installed under the ground a storage unit provided to receive and store the rainwater filtered by the filtration unit and a pump for supplying water from the storage unit upstream of the stream or irrigation canal the filtration unit an inflow tank through which rainwater flows from the transport pipe member a filtering part installed in the inflow tank and the rainwater flowing upward from the lower part and filtered by the fluidized bed filter medium and it is installed on the upper portion of the filtration unit and includes a back washing unit for back washing the fluidized bed medium the filter unit includes an upper filter net and a lower filter net installed between the fluidized bed media and an upper portion of the lower filter net is provided with an air inlet to disturb the fluidized media by air during backwashing of the backwashing unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101356690-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "as a stream type water flow circulation system installed around the river a permeable sidewalk block unit forming a sidewalk through which pedestrians pass an irrigation canal provided in parallel with the permeable sidewalk block unit and having a communication path capable of receiving rainwater from the permeable sidewalk block unit a conveying pipe member for conveying rainwater penetrating downward through the water permeable sidewalk block unit a filtration unit for filtering rainwater coming through the communication path of the irrigation canal and the transfer pipe member and being installed under the ground a storage unit provided to receive and store the rainwater filtered by the filtration unit and a pump for supplying water from the storage unit upstream of the stream or irrigation canal the filtration unit a precipitation tank into which rainwater flows from the transfer pipe member a filtration tank communicating with an upper portion of the precipitation tank to receive rainwater from the precipitation tank a dewatering plate fixed to the inner wall of the lower portion of the filtration tank in a horizontal direction a fluidized bed medium loaded on the dewatering plate to filter rainwater a buoyancy weight plate installed in the horizontal direction on the fluidized bed upper part and lowered by buoyancy according to the water level and compressing and dehydrating the fluidized bed medium by the weight when lowered a washing nozzle installed on the buoyancy weight plate to wash the fluidized bed media a washing water storage tank connected to the filtered water discharge valve installed at the lower portion of the filtration tank to store rainwater and supply supernatant water to the storage unit and a pump for supplying rainwater stored in the wash water reservoir to the wash nozzle stream type water flow circulation system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100778254-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "in general the sewerage relay pump station the rainwater drainage pump station the end sewage treatment plant and the like are designed to prevent pollution of discharged water deposition of the earths in the inflow water wear loss and clogging due to the sand of the treatment facility after the geyser to make it smooth"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101927400-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "the storage tank includes a nonpoint source pollution reduction device installed at one end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the storm reservoir tank to remove contaminants and non point pollutants contained in the rainwater flowing through the inlet and an upper water purification unit installed at the other end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the stormwater storage tank to pumped stormwater stored in the stor age storage tank through the nonpoint pollutant reduction apparatus to highly purify the purified water a device the piping is installed at one end so as to be submerged in the stormwater in the storm reservoir and the other end has a high pressure spray nozzle at the end and is installed in the upper hollow portion of the storm reservoir an air supply device comprising an installed water supply pipe a pump mounted on the water supply pipe and pumping rainwater in an excellent storage tank and an air supply unit mounted on an exposed part of the water supply pipe and injecting air into the rainwater pumped into the water supply pipe the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention can be achieved by a storm water storage tank.the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention prevents or minimizes the flood damage in the event of heavy rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}]</data>
