e water discharge pipes 510 and 520 and the discharge pipe flow meter 620 and a control means 700 the control means 700 includes a fire detector 710 installed on the building an input unit 720 for inputting the normal mode and the test mode a main opening closing valve sensor 730 for detecting opening closing degree of the main opening closing valve 110 the sprinkler opening closing valve 210 and the 3 way valve 610 according to the fire detection signal of the fire detector 710 and the input signal of the input unit 720 the flow rate of the refrigerant is detected on the upstream side in accordance with the sensing signals of the first and second main supply pipe flow meters 410 and 420 the first and second sprinkler pipe flow meters 510 and 520 the drain pipe flow meter 620 it is possible to judge the abnormality of the main water supply pipe 101 and the downstream main water supply pipe 102 the sprinkler discharge pipe 200 and the water discharge pipe 600 to determine an abnormality position display command and an alarm command a control unit 740 for outputting a command to display the degree of opening of the main on off valve 110 a valve driver 750 for sending a driving signal to the main on off valve 110 the sprinkler on off valve 210 and the three way valve 610 according to a control command of the controller 740 a display unit 760 for displaying an abnormal position according to an abnormal position display command of the controller 740 and an alarm unit 770 for outputting an alarm according to an alarm command of the control unit 740 in case the water supply through the upstream main water pipe 101 the downstream main water pipe 102 and the sprinkler pipe 200 is not normally performed because the main on off valve 110 is not opened normally a bypass means for bypassing the upstream main supply pipe 101 to the downstream main supply pipe 102 without passing through the main opening closing valve 110 and supplying water to the sprinkler head 300 through the s