spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_74", "text": "here the invention is that the installation of the second renewable energy power generation device 100 installed to prevent subsidence due to the harmful gas 49 or rainwater on the slope is preferably installed in a hilly area 64 where sunlight and wind power are well transmitted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_75", "text": "therefore the purpose of this invention is to provide power and equipment for collection in an economical and environmentally friendly manner by providing a renewable energy power generation device which is the main component of the present invention and a suction pump suction pipe and storage facility connected thereto"}]</data>
