and a sewage outlet pipe connected to a downstream side a wall vertically coupled to an edge of the bottom net and having an upper end coinciding with a lower end of the sewer outlet pipe and a lower end of the sewer outlet pipe a filtration means including a partition net dividing the space into a space and a downstream space and passing through the sewage and a foreign substance and a filter net coupled to an upper end of the wall in the downstream space a water level meter for measuring the level of the sewage discharged through the sewage discharge pipe a water level measuring device installed at the upper end of the peripheral wall of the sewage discharge pipe a flow rate measuring unit for measuring a flow rate of the discharged sewage an input unit for inputting a flow rate measurement mode a flow rate calculation unit for calculating a flow rate of the sewage and a sectional area of the sewage calculated from the inner diameter and the water level of the sewage discharge pipe a memory unit for storing a flow rate measurement program and storing a unique number of the manhole a control unit for outputting a control command to the water level meter and the flow rate meter according to an input signal of the input unit a control unit for acquiring a flow rate value from a flow rate data table for each of the water level and flow rate according to the flow rate value by the flow rate measuring unit and outputting the flow rate value together with the unique number of the manhole as a flow rate display value and transmits the flow rate value by the flow velocity meter to the control unit and transmits the control command of the control unit to the water level meter and a flow rate measuring unit including a display unit for displaying a flow rate display value of the control unit wherein the sewage is introduced into the manhole body through the sewage inlet pipe a step of filtering the foreign matter by the partition net and the filter net in the sewage flowing into the manhole body a step of discharging the filtered sewage to the sewage outlet pipe the flow rate measurement control command of the control unit is transmitted through the communication unit and is received by the level meter and the flow meter and the level meter is connected to the outlet of the sewage outlet pipe measuring a water level and measuring the flow rate in the sewage outlet pipe the level value measured by the level gauge and the flow rate value measured by the flow rate meter are transmitted by the communication unit and received by the control unit obtaining a flow rate value corresponding to the received water level value and flow rate value from the flow rate data table for each of the water level and the flow rate of the memory unit and outputting the display flow rate value and displaying the displayed flow rate value output from the controller on the display unit.according to the method for measuring the flow rate of the sewage pipe of the present invention it is possible to remove foreign substances in the sewage flowing into the manhole through the sewage inlet pipe thereby allowing the sewage whose foreign substances have been removed to flow out through the sewage outlet pipe the flow rate of the sewage can be measured more accurately.1 to 7 show a preferred embodiment of a flow rate measuring method of a sewer pipe according to the present invention 1 is a perspective view of an apparatus for implementing a flow rate measurement method of a sewer pipe according to the present embodiment 2 is a longitudinal sectional view 3 is a partially cutaway perspective view 4 is a partially cutaway perspective view of the filtration means 5 is a partial cutaway exploded perspective view showing a water level measuring instrument a flow velocity measuring instrument a communication part and a protective cover 6 is a functional block diagram of the flow measuring means 7 is a flowchart showing a flow rate measurement method of a sewer pipe accordi