ected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner diameter of the body the outer peripheral surface of the partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body is coupled to the top of the body a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve a freeze proof shape memory alloy spring having an upper end coupled to the inside of the partition wall a stopper coupled to a lower end of the freeze protection shape memory alloy spring it is coupled to the lower end of the body to receive the stopper the top is open and comprises a freeze proof coupling having a water discharge pipe at the bottom a freezing hole is formed at the bottom of the body at room temperature through the fire valve and the stopper to form a sealed structure the fire retardant shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve and water is injected through the water injection port the sprinkler with a freeze protection structure characterized in that the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring is tensioned at a predetermined freezing temperature so that water flows out through the freeze protection hole and the water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "in the sprinkler a body having a cylindrical shape and having an open top and having at least one water jet it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner d