eter m due to a drop in winter temperature and a rapid drop in the temperature of the tap water the temperature of the heating wire w can be detected from the temperature information detected by the temperature sensor 100 and the flow rate information detected by the flow sensor 200 or not"}, {"pat_id": "EP-4071454-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "there the speed of sound in water is measured to determine the temperature of the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100438390-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "replenishment water supply system 4 which is the water supply source of the boiler circulation pump device 3 for pumping the circulating water into the heat exchanger or the circulating water heater 1 heat exchanger or circulating water heater for heating the water 1 the heat dissipation unit 2 radiating heat to the outside by heat exchange while the high temperature circulating water supplied from the heat exchanger or the circulating water heater 1 is sequentially piped to the circulation pipe p and the heat exchanger or the hot water unit 5 which discharges the hot water heated by the circulation water heater 1 to the outside has a flow control valve 160 a hot water valve 208 and a hot water outlet 209 sequentially for a hot water pipe p"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200387977-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the wastewater treatment apparatus using the underwater micro generator generator to prevent the drug and the air is sucked together in the drug suction pipe to prevent the drug remaining in the drug suction pipe and to simultaneously effect the stirring and flotation separation of the drug a first level sensor for sensing the level of the medicine drug storage unit for storing the drug a medicine pump for allowing the medicine storage unit to suck the medicine into the medicine suction pipe a protective box protecting the medicine and the medicine storage unit a heater located inside the protective box for preventing freezing of the protective box a temperature sensor