e temperature threshold value humidity threshold value and flow threshold value respectively and the temperature measurement value is below the temperature threshold value and the humidity measurement value exceeds the humidity threshold value and is frozen or when it is determined that there is a risk of freezing and when it is determined that drainage is not smooth due to freezing because the flow rate measurement value is less than the flow rate threshold value power is supplied to the heating wire to generate heat by driving the heating wire"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_128", "text": "in addition in addition to the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor other types of sensors capable of detecting freezing may be installed in the sensor unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_139", "text": "here the temperature measurement value and the humidity measurement value transmitted through the data connection line 510 from the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor are compared with the temperature threshold value and the humidity threshold value respectively and the temperature measurement value is less than the temperature threshold value and the humidity measurement value if it is determined that there is a risk of freezing or freezing above this humidity threshold it is determined to drive the heating wire"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_156", "text": "it is installed in a separate structure at the corresponding location to measure the surrounding temperature to derive a temperature measurement value and the humidity sensor 220 is attached to a pillar or plate located on one or both walls of the main body or it is installed in a separate structure and the humidity measurement value can be derived by measuring the surrounding humidity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_157", "text": "in addition in addition to the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor other types of sensors capable of d