o that the water meter 10 it is possible to prevent the tap water in the housing 11 from freezing and the water meter 10 from being frozen.1 is a side sectional view showing a conventional water meter fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200487219-Y1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "the apparatus for preventing freezing of water of the weighing machine has a water temperature sensor 30 provided inside the housing 11 for measuring the temperature of tap water in the housing 11 a heater 40 for heating the tap water in the housing 11 and a control means 50 for receiving the signal of the water temperature sensor 30 and controlling the operation of the heater 40 the control means 50 turns on the heater 40 and heats the tap water passing through the housing 11 so that the water meter 10 is turned on it is possible to prevent the tap water in the housing 11 from freezing and the water meter 10 from being frozen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200285485-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in a band that is wound around a pipe in which water flows such as a pipe to prevent freezing of the pipe in the cold an elastic band is arranged by sealing the heating wire 2 continuously on the back side of the elastic band 1 knitted with a rubber yarn"}, {"pat_id": "JP-7437515-B2", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "the items may be items of physical parameters such as the temperature of the breeding water the flow rate of the breeding water the oxidation reduction potential of the breeding water and the electrical conductivity of the breeding water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102724384-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a plurality of apartments 33 are installed in the space between a plant factory 41 and another plant factory 41 and the road surface of the access road 15 and the rooftop of the apartment 33 are installed at the same height the upper part of the rooftop of the apartment 33 and the rooftop of the plant factory 41 are connected to each other to install a hollow plate shaped building an emergency shelter 09 and a