  <data key="d6">["manage", "receive", "turbine", "warm", "make", "combine", "valve", "apply", "drill", "position", "weld", "deliver", "sink", "grasp", "drink", "connect", "reach", "carry", "trap", "float", "introduce", "base", "accord", "indicate", "display", "sld", "distribute", "dump", "refer", "increase", "cause", "leave", "secure", "anchor", "have", "comprise", "compile", "contact", "manipulate", "discard", "reinforce", "fix", "wash", "uvle", "flow", "retain", "reset", "erect", "go", "can", "trim", "relate", "revolve", "pump", "provide", "wrap", "immerse", "chamfer", "lift", "handle", "contain", "space", "grab", "cast", "hold", "uncoil", "ship", "bend", "set", "prevent", "attach", "scale", "meet", "escape", "rope", "correspond", "form", "measure", "plow", "crush", "size", "seal", "save", "spray", "vibrate", "switch", "screw", "limit", "pass", "occur", "suspend", "wind", "vary", "couple", "follow", "equip", "check", "fill", "delay", "mix", "push", "oil", "do", "protect", "determine", "settle", "bubble", "pack", "lower", "convert", "sonar", "alternate", "assemble", "flash", "join", "support", "illustrate", "regulate", "turn", "surface", "ld", "motorize", "baffle", "accompany", "tow", "mount", "wic", "hoist", "integrate", "dissolve", "move", "coat", "point", "clean", "chlorophyll", "lay", "weave", "respond", "lead", "insert", "spawn", "remove", "box", "cover", "show", "reduce", "branch", "plug", "inject", "may", "head", "configure", "communicate", "warn", "designate", "discharge", "cool", "store", "bush", "start", "detect", "fit", "decrease", "interlock", "net", "drive", "spot", "stream", "change", "obtain", "separate", "incline", "dispose", "propose", "act", "guide", "include", "operate", "consist", "thereto", "open", "block", "expand", "house", "blow", "mean", "supply", "reciprocate", "use", "raise", "propeller", "stop", "scour", "charge", "cut", "asphyxiate", "straighten", "throttle", "sense", "finish", "require", "draw", "close", "rotate", "classify", "galvanize", "maintain", "improve", "control", "extend", "case", "drain", "transmit", "monitor", "characterize", "shape", "elevate", "input", "keep", "be", "age", "rack", "generate", "collect", "instal", "bleed", "mark"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101859661-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "in addition when it is determined that the wastewater treatment capacity information is obtained by communicating with the wastewater treatment capacity management terminal configured in the wastewater treatment facility 210 to determine whether the treatment capacity limit is reached at the time of initial discharge by delaying the opening of the water gate or valve 500 for a connection and sewage treatment plant connection by a predetermined time the effect of preventing the processing capacity limit can be prevented in advance.brief description of the drawings fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102562303-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "10 1221646 a base plate fixed to the bottom surface of a small stream a sensor housing fixed at an eccentric position on the base plate and having a cross sectional area of the inlet through which water is introduced is larger than the cross sectional area of the outlet through which water is discharged a water quality sensor installed on one side wall of the sensor housing to detect the quality of water passing through the sensor housing and a screen unit fixed to the circumference of the base plate to block the inflow of foreign substances other than water through the front rear left right and upper sides of the water quality sensor it is possible to monitor water quality by installing it in a place with a low water depth such as a small river a water quality monitoring device for a small stream has been proposed to improve the safety and durability of the water quality monitoring device by using a screen unit and a sensor housing to protect the water quality sensor in two layers"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101859669-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the rainfall information obtained from the rainfall sensor 900 the water level information obtained from the water level measuring apparatus 400 and the water quality information obtained from the water quality measuring apparatus 1000 an industrial complex comprising an rtu 700 for controlling the closing or opening of the well water gate 500 and the wastewater connection gate 600 via the water gate switch 550 or the water gate switch 650 for the water connection type initial stormwater and accident runoff classification system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101210549-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the guide groove 111 is disposed to be spaced apart from each other the body portion 110 is installed across the river and integrally formed at both ends of the body portion 110 the floating material collected and collected floating material g g is a water barrier structure 100 having a collection box 120 having a space formed therein to be drawn out to the outside forming a rectangular shape as a whole the support frame 210 is inclined toward the collection box 120 both ends are installed on the support frame 210 the filter net 220 to pass the water and block the float g and support a network structure 200 having a buoyancy body 230 fixed to the frame 210 to provide buoyancy so that the support frame 210 and the strainer 220 are elevated according to the change in the water level of the river with a guide groove 311 formed along the inner longitudinal direction the guide bar 310 is installed along the upper longitudinal direction of the support frame 210 and can be rotated in the guide groove 311 of the guide bar 310 the lead screw 320 and the guide bar 310 which is installed so as to be movable are inserted into the guide groove 311 of the guide bar 310 and are screwed to the lead screw 320 to reciprocate along the longitudinal direction of the lead screw 320"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102388770-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "therefore it is possible to block the supply of river water or seawater backflowing to the stormwater chamber 110 to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101429033-B1", "para_id": "para_46", "text": "while the mobile water purification apparatus 200 is moving in a reservoir or a river the obstacle detection sensor outputs obstacle detection information to the automatic control unit 280 when it detects an obstacle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101429033-B1", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "while the mobile water purification apparatus 200 is moving in a reservoir or a river the obstacle detection sensor outputs obstacle detection information to the automatic control unit 280 when it detects an obstacle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromotive force generation 102d measuring point 102e reference point 103 thermocouple thermometer switch for detection sensor 103a configuration of thermocouple thermometer 103b temperature measurement limit 103c temperature 1 103d ammeter temperature scale 103e metal a 103f metal b 103g potential difference generated 103h thermocouple and compensation wire 103i temperature measurement contact 103j thermocouple 103k