  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102715270-B1", "para_id": "para_56", "text": "accordingly the protection scope of the present invention should be determined by the description of the claims and the scope of equivalents thereof.1 spawning area 2 water supply area 3 egg transfer unit 10 storage tank 20 drinking water pipe 30 drinking water pump 40 washing nozzle 50 washing pipe 60 washing pump 70 chlorine dioxide gas generating unit 80 gas pipe 90 water pipe a0 water supply valve b0 concentration measurement unit c0 water level measurement unit d0 contamination measurement unit d1 projector d2 camera e0 intensive cleaning section e1 guide rail e2 concentrated cleaning nozzle e3 concentrated cleaning pipe e4 concentrated washing pump e5 drive unit 110 1st tank 120 2nd tank 130 3rd tank 210 1st reaction tank 220 second reaction tank 230 third reaction tank 310 1st gas discharge pipe 320 2nd gas discharge pipe 330 3rd gas discharge pipe 400 integrated pipe 710 1st metering pump 720 2nd metering pump 730 3rd quantitative pump 1110 1st auxiliary tank 1120 second auxiliary tank 1130 third auxiliary tank 1200 level sensor 1300 alarm 1400 reservoir tank 1500 aeration device"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3347959-B2", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "0003 in a vacuum valve unit of this type of vacuum type sewer system when a sewage water level abnormality of a sewage tank occurs due to a vacuum valve failure or the like it is necessary to quickly detect this and notify a manager"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177665-Y1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "the air discharge valve 23 for discharging air to the outside to prevent the cavitation of the chamber when the water level is further dropped beyond the lowest point and is located at the top to measure the pressure in the air chamber 17 to control the a pressure transmitter 24 for delivering to the unit 10 a water gauge 25 for measuring the water level and delivering it to the control unit 10 and positioned at the top to allow cavitation of the chamber when the water level rises further past the highest point"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100706118-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "due to this replenishment when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102434590-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "thus it is composed of one set including a control panel that moves the sewage in the sewage tank along the sewage discharge path and discharges it through the sewage discharge pipe one set of sewage treatment equipment is installed one or more depending on the installation area the air supply path includes an air supply pipe installed between the air storage tank and the first end of the three way valve and an air inlet pipe installed between the second end of the three way valve and the sewage tank the control panel operates the compressor to supply the air in the air storage tank to the sewage tank through the air supply pipe the first and second ends of the three way valve and the air inlet pipe a regulator set is installed in the air supply pipe the regulator set includes a regulator for discharging air from the air storage tank to a preset pressure it further comprises at least one of a filter for removing moisture and impurities contained in the air from the air storage tank and an oil removal unit for removing oil contained in the air from the air storage tank the sewage auxiliary tank is installed in the sewage inflow path to remove the bubbles inside the sewage auxiliary tank to prevent the operation of the sewage treatment device due to the inflow of bubbles into the sewage tank when the control panel receives a notification of reaching the lowest water level from the water level sensor it is determined that the sewage discharge is complete it is counted after the operation of discharging the sewage from the sewage tank is performed and when a preset time elapses it is determined that the sewage discharge is complete when the discharge of sewage in the sewage tank is completed the knife valve installed on the sewage inflow path is controlled to be in an open state to open the sewage inflow path so that the sewage is moved to the sewage tank through the sewage inflow path and the three way valve of the air inlet and outlet installed on the air supply path is controlled so that the second end of the three way valve on the sewage tank side and the third end of the air discharge pipe are in an open state and the first end of the air storage tank side control to be closed to move the air in the sewage tank along the air discharge path and discharge it through the air discharge pipe after receiving the notification of reaching the highest water level and performing the operation of discharging wastewater when the notification of reaching the lowest water level is not notified from the water level sensor even after a predetermined time has elapsed after receiving the notification of the notification of reaching the highest water level a warning message to a preset terminal sewage treatment device characterized in that for transmitting"}, {"pat_id": "US-7802587-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "simultaneously therewith the battery operated audible alarm which is electrically connected to a water sensor on the conduit senses the rising water and makes a circuit thus causing the alarm to sound to notify the building occupant"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "in this case when the backwater valve to the building is closed building occupants should be aware that sewer water generated in the building has nowhere to go and therefore should limit or stop water use to prevent backflow of generate sewage into the building until the water level in the sewer has subsided and water can flow normally"}, {"pat_id": "US-10759676-B2", "para_id": "para_610", "text": "35 in alternate embodiments the apparatus may maintain a constant blowdown water flow to prev