g spray liquid from the line and discharges it to the outside through a discharge control valve and a raw water pump that may be configured in the raw water supply line"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102032302-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "6 the controller unit 130 applied to the present invention controls the raw water pump which may be configured in the raw water supply line to supply the raw water to the raw water supply unit and to control the on and off of the filtered water supply valve 109"}, {"pat_id": "US-5538031-A", "para_id": "para_47", "text": "this procedure fills the pipes with antifreeze thereby preventing freezing of fluid within the pipes when the outdoor temperature falls below thirty two degrees fahrenheit or zero degrees celsius"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101029692-B1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "the remaining water inside the inside is discharged to the ground through the discharge hole 130 to prevent freezing even if the outside air temperature is low"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101090211-B1", "para_id": "para_89", "text": "it is equipped with a compressor to allow drainage even in a building without drainage on the floor.it can be drained by air pressure.electric ball valves and strainers do not block or block pumps and pipes due to foreign substances such as hair even when water is circulated in the electrolysis tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100385593-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "of course the effective treatment to remove various heavy metals and salts is made safely and the high temperature high pressure steam generated during the hydrolysis process reaches the predetermined level and the electronic opening and closing valve 105 is opened in the steam storage chamber 2 separately installed"}, {"pat_id": "US-5651894-A", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "filtered water 152 may be passed through another flow regulation valve 154 and through a heat exchanger 156 before water 152 is directed into prefilters 158 and ro treatment stage 160"}]</data>
