  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "this operates to open the stem holder installation hole and the tap water in the first waterway is guided to the second waterway through the stem holder installation hole and the outlet of the water valve body and is gradually discharged to the outside through the tap water outlet to prevent the water valve from freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the present invention relates to a water valve for preventing freezing of a water pipe to prevent freezing of a water pipe by discharging water little by little as the stem holder operates and a waterway is partially opened when the temperature is lowered"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "by installing a high pressure gauge that opens the waterway together it has a structure that can respond to both low and high pressure so that damage to buildings and pipes due to leaks in connection parts of water pipes when water is supplied at high pressure as well as in case of freezing it is to provide a water valve for preventing freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "it is achieved by a water valve for preventing freezing characterized in that configured to prevent the water valve from being frozen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "since the water valve for preventing freezing according to the present invention has a structure in which the stem holder that selectively opens and closes the waterway in the supplied water valve is automatically operated according to the water pressure in winter when the water pressure is lowered before the water in the water valve freezes the stem as the holder operates and the waterway is partially opened water is discharged little by little which has the effect of preventing the water pipe from freezing and bursting"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "when the water pressure is lowered before the water freezes the low pressure opening and closing means operates to open the waterway to prevent freezing and bursting as well as to prevent water from being supplied at high pressure at this time the high pressure gauge functions as a pressure reducing device which has the effect of preventing the water valve from being damaged"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "thus the waterway communication hole 23 is opened and tap water is guided through a waterway composed of the first waterway 21 the waterway communication hole 23 and the second waterway 22 and discharged to the tap water outlet 25"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "it is configured to prevent the water valve from freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102467167-B1", "para_id": "para_54", "text": "although the discharge of the water is blocked when the tap water supplied to the first waterway 21 is introduced at a high pressure due to a specific situation the tap water is discharged through the outlet 274 while pushing up the high pressure stem holder 330 and the water valve body 30 is guided to the low pressure opening closing means installation hole 100 guided to the second waterway 22 through the outlet 120 and discharged to the outside through the tap water outlet 25 to prevent the water valve from being damaged by high pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "in order to prevent underground flooding a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and water damage control equipment in the sump tank 34 connected to the above mentioned flood control equipment a control box 2 of a vertical multistage pump control panel and a pump isolation valve 5 and a pump backflow prevention check valve 6 are provided in the suction junction pipe 3 and the discharge junction pipe 4 to form a vertical multistage pump 8 and a fire hose 9 and a fire nozzle frame 11 and a hook 13 in a detection sensor 12 and a jig 22 in a pipe 14 are configured to control the flow rate to the disaster prevention waterway 17 while forming a vertical multistage pump operation method inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment for flood prevention of underground passages the flood control equipment which consists of fire pumps and high performance submersible pumps a hook and a wire rope a machined hole and a shackle a bolt and nut a washer and a hinge a flange or a flange stopper a wire mesh a coupling a coupling female threaded body 30 a coupling male threaded body 31 a gasket or rubber packing a nozzle hose equipment holder a reducer and a pump wheel spray the discharged water through the fire hose and in the fire station 40 a water film or a curtain water film is formed and a double vinyl tent or bag controls the flow rate and an elbow or tie elbow changes the flow rate to prevent underground flooding and a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and flood control equipment the power supply which is a power supply device supplied from a hydroelectric power generator 213 is inverter 47 and inverter vio access point and internet network vertical multistage pump control server and monitor to pump control board or tagger winch control box and short range wireless communication antenna to short range wireless communication device wireless communication control module and display to electronic control device adc and switch input circuit to electronic control device mcu and electronic control device diac overcurrent breaker brake is connected to power supply to display screen and analog input and digital input are operated by hand to control on off of each pump main switch button and auxiliary switch button to configure vertical multistage pump operation method inside main body 1 of underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment in addition to the above mentioned vertical multi stage pump turbine pump 140 diaphragm pump vane pump or guide vane and propeller pump screw pump plunger pump axial plunger pump radial plunger pump and jet pump 157 are provided and are connected to an introduction pipe and a water supply port or a fire prevention and disaster prevention pipe line 168 and a water discharge port 169 and are connected to a limit switch or a limit switch and a power motor body 192 is provided with a hood and a snap ring a fan and a body frame a body front reinforcing plate a rotor assembly on a rotating shaft a stator assembly on a front rotating shaft support a motor protection casting frame a terminal box and a lifting bolt a terminal box cover a rear rotating shaft support a rear reinforcing plate a gap a fan cover or a protective cover a rotor core and a stator core with stator windings and are connected and connected and underground passage flood prevention a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment inside the main body 1 of the above mentioned flood control equipment after the rescue workers complete the rescue a plurality of high performance submersible pumps 36 are installed in each power pump i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1127", "text": "in order to prevent underground flooding a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and water damage control equipment in the sump tank 34 connected to the above mentioned flood control equipment a control box 2 of a vertical multistage pump control panel and a pump isolation valve 5 and a pump backflow prevention check valve 6 are provided in the suction junction pipe 3 and the discharge junction pipe 4 to form a vertical multistage pump 8 and a fire hose 9 and a fire nozzle frame 11 and a hook 13 in a detection sensor 12 and a jig 22 in a pipe 14 are configured to control the flow rate to the disaster prevention waterway 17 while forming a vertical multistage pump operation method inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment for flood prevention of underground passages the flood control equipment which consists of fire pumps and high performance submersible pumps a hook and a wire rope a machined hole and a shackle a bolt and nut a washer and a hinge a flange or a flange stopper a wire mesh a coupling a coupling female threaded body 30 a coupling male threaded body 31 a gasket or rubber packing a nozzle hose equipment holder a reducer and a pump wheel spray the discharged water through the fire hose and in the fire station 40 a water film or a curtain water film is formed and a double vinyl tent or bag controls the flow rate and an elbow or tie elbow changes the flow rate to prevent underground flooding and a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and flood control equipment the power supply which is a power supply device supplied from a hydroelectric power generator 213 is inverter 47 and inverter vio access point and internet network vertical multistage pump control server and monitor to pump control board or tagger winch control box and short range wireless communication antenna to short range wireless communication device wireless communication control module and display to electronic control device adc and switch input circuit to electronic control device mcu and electronic control device diac overcurrent breaker brake is connected to power supply to display the display screen and analog input and digital input are operated by hand to control on off of each pump main switch button and auxiliary switch button to configure vertical multistage pump operation method inside main body 1 of underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment in addition to the above mentioned vertical multi stage pump turbine pump 140 diaphragm pump vane pump or guide vane and propeller pump screw pump plunger pump axial plunger pump radial plunger pump and jet pump 157 are provided and are connected to an introduction pipe and a water supply port or a fire prevention and disaster prevention pipe line 168 and a water discharge port 169 and are connected to a limit switch or a limit switch and a power motor body 192 is provided with a hood and a snap ring a fan and a body frame a body front reinforcing plate a rotor assembly on a rotating shaft a stator assembly on a front rotating shaft support a motor protection casting frame a terminal box and a lifting bolt a terminal box cover a rear rotating shaft support a rear reinforcing plate a gap a fan cover or a protective cover a rotor core and a stator core with stator windings and are connected and connected and underground passage flood prevention a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment inside the main body 1 of the above mentioned flood control equipment after the rescue workers complete the rescue a plurality of high performance submersible pumps 36 are installed in each power pump i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1147", "text": "in order to prevent underground flooding a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and water damage control equipment a sump tank 34 connected to the above mentioned flood control equipment is provided with a control box 2 of a vertical multistage pump control panel a suction junction pipe 3 and a discharge junction pipe 4 a pump isolation valve 5 and a pump backflow prevention check valve 6 to form a vertical multistage pump 8 and a fire hose 9 and a fire nozzle frame 11 and a hook 13 on a detection sensor 12 and a jig 22 on a pipe 14 to control the flow rate to the disaster prevention waterway 17 thereby forming a vertical multistage pump operation method inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment for flood prevention of underground passages the flood control equipment which consists of fire pumps and high performance submersible pumps a hook and a wire rope a machined hole and a shackle a bolt and nut a washer and a hinge a flange or a flange stopper a wire mesh a coupling a coupling female threaded body 30 a coupling male threaded body 31 a gasket or rubber packing a nozzle hose equipment holder a reducer and a pump wheel spray the discharged water through the fire hose and in the fire station 40 a water film or a curtain water film is formed and a double vinyl tent or bag controls the flow rate and an elbow or tie elbow changes the flow rate to prevent underground flooding and a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and flood control equipment the power supply which is a power supply device supplied from a hydroelectric power generator 213 is inverter 47 and inverter vio access point and internet network vertical multistage pump control server and monitor to pump control board or tagger winch control box and short range wireless communication antenna to short range wireless communication device wireless communication control module and display to electronic control device adc and switch input circuit to electronic control device mcu and electronic control device diac overcurrent breaker brake is connected to power supply to display screen and analog input and digital input are operated by hand to control on off of each pump main switch button and auxiliary switch button to configure vertical multistage pump operation method inside main body 1 of underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment in addition to the above mentioned vertical multi stage pump turbine pump 140 diaphragm pump vane pump or guide vane and propeller pump screw pump plunger pump axial plunger pump radial plunger pump and jet pump 157 are provided and are connected to an introduction pipe and a water supply port or a fire prevention and disaster prevention pipe line 168 and a water discharge port 169 and are connected to a limit switch or a limit switch and a power motor body 192 is provided with a hood and a snap ring a fan and a body frame a body front reinforcing plate a rotor assembly on a rotating shaft a stator assembly on a front rotating shaft support a motor protection casting frame a terminal box and a lifting bolt a terminal box cover a rear rotating shaft support a rear reinforcing plate a gap a fan cover or a protective cover a rotor core and a stator core with stator windings and are connected and connected and underground passage flood prevention a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment inside the main body 1 of the above mentioned flood control equipment after the rescue workers complete the rescue a plurality of high performance submersible pumps 36 are installed in each power pump i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102559283-B1", "para_id": "claim_17", "text": "the method of claim 16 wherein the step s350 sensing the sludge level through a sludge level sensor s351 the limit switch box for sludge drain is connected to various contacts of the solenoid valve for sludge drain and drives and controls the solenoid valve for sludge drain according to the control signal of the smart control unit s352 the solenoid valve for sludge drain is driven according to the signal of the limit switch box for sludge drain to supply or block air transmitted to the actuator for sludge drain s353 the actuator unit for sludge drain is driven by the solenoid valve for sludge drain and the main valve for sludge drain is directly driven to turn on and off the flow of the waterway on the waterway s354 the main valve for sludge drain is driven according to the drive of the actuator unit for sludge drain and the flow of the waterway is turned on and off s355"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449313-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically it prevents freezing and perforation due to freezing in winter when there is little agricultural water flow"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200203441-Y1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "as shown here the present invention induces the circulation of water in the canal waterway and supplies dissolved oxygen in the circulation process for the purpose of improving the water quality of the canal waterway to maintain the ecosystem and to prevent the water impact of the discharged water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101015621-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "electrode plate fixing bolts for fixing the other end of the electrode plate to the other end of the electrolytic chamber of the main body housing and on the opposite surface of the main body housing to form an electrolytic chamber but formed in the other direction with the inlet sterilization water generation module consisting of a cover housing is formed with an outlet for the discharge of the disinfected sterilized water installed on the water inlet of the inlet water flowing into the disinfectant disinfection water generating module is a positive pressure valve and the sterilization disinfection water to detect the pressure drop is made based on the set pressure inside the waterway tube to operate the sterilization disinfection water generation module static pressure flow rate detection means comprising a flow rate detection sensor for detecting the flow rate inside the water pipe of the inflow water flowing into the module and stopping the flow of the flow rate to stop the operation of the sterilizing disinfection water generating module a filter installed at one side of the water pipe to filter foreign substances contained in influent water flowing into the sterilizing disinfection water generating module supplying power to the disinfectant disinfectant generating module while supplying a positive power and a negative power to the electrolytic reaction to remove the chloride attached to the electrode plate but the chloride generated during electrolysis is applied to the electrode plate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100555055-B1", "para_id": "para_55", "text": "the discharged water passing through the fiber filtration filter coated with the photocatalyst is sterilized while passing through the ultraviolet treatment device c provided in the pipeline or waterway type"}, {"pat_id": "US-9097390-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "in another aspect an embodiment of the invention provides a winery storm water protection system the system comprising an encapsulating capsule disposed under a crush pad of a winery the encapsulating capsule comprising an interior isolation chamber a valve assembly disposed within the isolation chamber of the encapsulating capsule the valve assembly comprising a valve body having a fluid passage including a upstream port and a downstream port and a valve member located within the valve body wherein the valve member is configured to move between an open position to allow fluid flow between the upstream port and the downstream port and a closed position to block fluid flow between the upstream port and the downstream port and an electric actuator assembly operatively coupled to the valve member for opening or closing the valve member when actuated an upstream pipeline extending through a first opening in the circumscribing sidewall of the encapsulating capsule the upstream pipeline having a first end operatively coupled to the upstream port of the fluid passage of the valve body and a second end operatively coupled to and in open fluid communication with a crush pad drain assembly disposed in and under the crush pad of the winery a downstream pipeline extending through a second opening in the circumscribing sidewall of the encapsulating capsule the downstream pipeline having a first end operatively coupled to the downstream port of the fluid passage of the valve body and a second end operatively coupled to and in open fluid communication with a holding tank a rain sensor a programmable logic controller operatively coupled to the electric actuator assembly and the rain sensor the programmable logic controller being configured to provide a control signal to the electric actuator assembly in response to receiving a rain sensed signal from the rain sensor to actuate the closing of the valve member from a default open position for closing fluid communication between the crush pad drain assembly disposed in and under the crush pad of the winery and the holding tank while simultaneously opening fluid communication between the crush pad drain assembly and a storm drain system or waterway and the programmable logic controller being configured to provide a control signal to the electric actuator assembly in order to massage the valve member by opening and closing the valve member after a predefined period of time in which a rain sensed signal has not been received to keep the valve member free of binding or clear of debris build up"}, {"pat_id": "KR-940000292-Y1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "in addition after the water supply is made when the faucet 25 is locked water still remains in the faucet tube 24 and at this time by locking the adjustment knob 17 forward the valve support pipe 14 is also moved to the front at the same time the on off valve disc 16 coupled to the front end to block the inlet hole 3a between the inner plate 3 no water supply in the faucet tube 24 water remaining in the faucet pipe 24 in the space portion 9a through the space generated between the front end wall of the packing support ring 9 and the on off valve disc 16 while the on off valve disc 16 is moved"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102448193-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "according to claim 1 the freeze prevention means 34 includes a chamber 341 fixed to be exposed to the water jet 31 and stored therein a freeze prevention valve 342 coupled to the bypass pipe 33 and the chamber 341 and a connecting pipe 343 connecting the anti freeze valve 342 to each other and an operating bar built in the connecting pipe 343 to partially open the anti freeze valve 342 according to the increase in the volume of the operating water 344 an artificial waterway having a water supply for freezing prevention characterized in that it consists of"}, {"pat_id": "JP-S592439-Y2", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a bypass waterway is provided with the other end connected to a waterway downstream of the check valve and the equipment water stop valve is closed to prevent freezing"}]</data>
