h finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "US-6237620-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "this expense can be considerable when it is realized that the pipes constituting the plumbing system for conveyance of water throughout the vehicle boat yacht cottage or lodge may proceed in relatively inaccessible regions which may require removal of a structural component of the mobile home boat yacht cottage or lodge in order to provide access to the freeze damaged length of pipe or the particular fitting adversely affected by the freezing temperature in the winter months"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100415814-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "in the forest air supply system for compressing the forest air in the storage tank and moving it to a specific place to selectively discharge to a plurality of discharge places determining whether the storage tank t 1 is mounted determining whether the main valve is open if the storage tank is not mounted outputting the corresponding information to the key operation panel provided at the discharge location if the main valve is not opened outputting a main valve closing message and its cause to the key control panel checking whether an auxiliary valve opening request signal is applied from the key control panel when the main valve is opened setting a discharge time of the forest atmosphere by the user when the diffusion time is set opening the auxiliary solenoid valve corresponding to the unique number of the key operation panel operated by the user to discharge the forest atmosphere checking whether or not the spread setting time set by the user arrives the air supply method of the forest characterized in that the operation is completed by closing the auxiliary valve opened when the diffusion set time arrives"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100415814-B1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "on the other hand the present invention is a forest air supply system for compressing the forest air in the storage tank and selectively discharge to a plurality of discharge places by moving to a specific place whether or not the storage tank t 1 is equipped if it is determined and not mounted outputting the corresponding information to the key operation panel provided at the discharge location judging whether the main valve is open and outputting the main valve closing message and its cause to the key operation panel when the main valve is not opened checking whether an auxiliary valve opening request signal is applied from the key control panel when the main valve is opened setting a discharge time of the forest atmosphere by the user when the diffusion time is set opening the auxiliary solenoid valve corresponding to the unique number of the key operation panel operated by the user to discharge the forest atmosphere checking whether or not the spread setting time set by the user arrives when the diffusion set time arrives there is provided a forest air supply method comprising the step of closing the open auxiliary valve to terminate the operation"}]</data>
</edge>
