e 874c feeder hopper 874d vibrating grease repeater 874e first jaw crusher of the crushing head 874f second jaw crusher at the rear of the crushing chamber 874g vibrating screen 874h drum elevator 875 air compressor 876 perforator 877 pilot and extractor 878 sand collector 879 dredger 879a pump dredger 879b bucket dredger 879c spotted shear 879d cab or control room 879e red shear 879f spotted 879g blast tank 879h blast pump 879i red 879j engine room 879k dipper dredger 879l grab dredger 879m bucket drive 879n after spotted 879o spotted winch 879p bucket 879q left and right front spotted 879r dipper 879s winch 879t anchor store 879u belt conveyor 879v grab 880 separately designated construction machinery 882 pile driver 882a boom 883 diesel pile hammer 884 steam hammer 885 hydraulic crane 885a piston motor 886 tower crane 886a names of each part of the guy derrick structure 886b guy derrick 886c main 886d boom 886e boom foil 886f turnbuckle 886g sling 886h triangular derrick 886i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "US-12305815-B2", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "for example the transport non return valve ensures that a higher pressure in the main line does not cause the fluid to flow back into the wind turbine which may provide the fluid at a lower pressure or in case of a leak the fluid would be prevented flowing back to the leak"}, {"pat_id": "US-12305815-B2", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "hence the one transport non return valves may be coupled to the transporting pipeline close to the first wind turbine and the further transport non return valves may be coupled close to the downstream located second wind turbine"}, {"pat_id": "US-12305815-B2", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "hence if a leakage in one of the main pipes is detected the leaking main pipe may be bypassed via the other main pipe"}, {"pat_id": "US-12305815-B2", "para_id": "para_91", "text": "since a leakage in the leaking transporting pipeline section 1201 has been detected the multiway valve 801 of the left wind turbine 110 closes the second valve inlet b and directs the electrolyzed gas from the electrolyzer unit 111 and or from the storage tank 901 via the first valve inlet a into the transporting pipeline 131"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102837277-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "in addition a second pressure gauge 234 is installed on one side of the fourth pipe 232 so that the pressure value of the air sent to the filter unit 200 can be adjusted while checking the actual pressure detected by the second pressure gauge 234"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4931039-B2", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "measurement procedure the procedure for measuring the degree of contamination of raw water by the water quality monitoring apparatus shown in fig"}]</data>
</edge>
