  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-4815492-A", "para_id": "claim_18", "text": "the flood control valve of claim 12 further characterized by said means for activating the pump being operable to turn the pump on and discharge any leaked fluid from a flood back into a sewer line to prevent sewage from leaking into the building should the flapper valve become corroded or clogged with protein accumulations allowing waste to leak there through"}, {"pat_id": "US-4815492-A", "para_id": "para_45", "text": "according to still further features of my invention the flapper valve if it should be corroded or clogged with protein accumulations allowing waste fluid to leak there through whereupon the means for activating the pump can be caused to operate and to turn the pump on and discharge the leaked fluid from a flood back into the city sewer line to prevent sewage from leaking into the building"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "in order to prevent underground flooding a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and water damage control equipment in the sump tank 34 connected to the above mentioned flood control equipment a control box 2 of a vertical multistage pump control panel and a pump isolation valve 5 and a pump backflow prevention check valve 6 are provided in the suction junction pipe 3 and the discharge junction pipe 4 to form a vertical multistage pump 8 and a fire hose 9 and a fire nozzle frame 11 and a hook 13 in a detection sensor 12 and a jig 22 in a pipe 14 are configured to control the flow rate to the disaster prevention waterway 17 while forming a vertical multistage pump operation method inside the main body 1 of the flood control equipment for flood prevention of underground passages the flood control equipment which consists of fire pumps and high performance submersible pumps a hook and a wire rope a machined hole and a shackle a bolt and nut a washer and a hinge a flange or a flange stopper a wire mesh a coupling a coupling female threaded body 30 a coupling male threaded body 31 a gasket or rubber packing a nozzle hose equipment holder a reducer and a pump wheel spray the discharged water through the fire hose and in the fire station 40 a water film or a curtain water film is formed and a double vinyl tent or bag controls the flow rate and an elbow or tie elbow changes the flow rate to prevent underground flooding and a vertical multi stage pump operation method is configured inside the main body 1 of the underground flooding prevention and flood control equipment the power supply which is a power supply device supplied from a hydroelectric power generator 213 is inverter 47 and inverter vio access point and internet network vertical multistage pump control server and monitor to pump control board or tagger winch control box and short range wireless communication antenna to short range wireless communication device wireless communication control module and display to electronic control device adc and switch input circuit to electronic control device mcu and electronic control device diac overcurrent breaker brake is connected to power supply to display screen and analog input and digital input are operated by hand to control on off of each pump main switch button and auxiliary switch button to configure vertical multistage pump operation method inside main body 1 of underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment in addition to the above mentioned vertical multi stage pump turbine pump 140 diaphragm pump vane pump or guide vane and propeller pump screw pump plunger pump axial plunger pump radial plunger pump and jet pump 157 are provided and are connected to an introduction pipe and a water supply port or a fire prevention and disaster prevention pipe line 168 and a water discharge port 169 and are connected to a limit switch or a limit switch and a power motor body 192 is provided with a