her side of the guide 50 is formed with a projection 55 the buoyancy material 30 is characterized in that the lifting and lowering movement by the buoyancy while being bitten by the projection 55 the storage tank movable structure using buoyancy characterized in that the water level control material 70 is installed in the storage tank 20 to adjust the waterproof door movable water level"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102512635-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "in addition the automatic dripping device for preventing freezing may include a falling water providing pipe installed to communicate with the falling water storage tank and to supply the falling water stored in the falling water storage tank to a user a water level detection and alarm unit installed in the fall water storage tank detecting the level of the fluid stored in the fall water storage tank and alerting an operator through an alarm member when the detected level exceeds a preset range and a falling water drain pipe installed to communicate with the falling water providing pipe and discharging the falling water from the falling water providing pipe to the outside when an alarm is generated by the alarm member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102512635-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in addition according to the automatic dripping device for preventing freezing of the present invention the falling water stored in the falling water storage tank can be re supplyed to the user by providing a falling water providing pipe a water level detection and alarm unit and a falling water drain pipe that perform specific roles it is possible to prevent the waste of water and the capacity of the water stored in the water storage tank can be adjusted within a safe range thereby providing an automatic water fall device for preventing freezing that can prevent an accident in which water overflows in the water storage tank during operation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102512635-B1", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "is possible and such variations fall within the protection scope of the present invention.10 piping entering the object to be frozen or bursting or piping exiting from the object 20 external power 100 automatic dripping device for freezing prevention 110 body part 111 opening and closing lid 112 power indicator lamp 113 operation indicator lamp 114 storage space 120 temperature detection unit 130 control unit 131 external power input terminal 132 transformer 133 relay 140 on off valve 150 on off valve driving unit 150e emergency operation button 151 opening and closing valve coupling part 152 rotary drive unit 153 heat supply unit 154 opening and closing valve warming part 161 additional mounting piping 161a extension pipe 162 additionally installed on off valve 163 falling water storage tank 164 falling water flow rate detection unit 165 falling water supply pipe 166 water level detection and alarm unit 167 water drain pipe 171 power supply unit 172 power supply part warming part 173 wireless communication module"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "in particular the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall that is the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "a temporary storage tank for chemicals having a cover installed on the unit one side is connected to the drug storage space of the drug temporary storage tank and the other side is connected to the connection pipe connected to the flocculation settler or the immersion well via the injector the drug discharge pipe is installed on the pipeline chemical discharge pump a discharge side bypass pipe bypassing the chemical discharge pipe and having a discharge side bypass valve in the middle a supply side byp