e water storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101491882-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "according to another embodiment of the present invention an air opening closing unit is provided on the side of the low level sensing hole formed in the second branch of the level sensing device and the same structure as the high level sensing unit is provided.the present invention relates to an unmanned water supply system for watering underground water to a water storage tank by controlling a motor pump for unloading groundwater by sensing the pressure applied to a water supply pipe and reading the water level the water level of the water supply pipe is sensed by instantaneously releasing the pressure of the water supply pipe by supplying air to the water supply pipe and when the water level of the water storage tank reaches the high water level requiring the water supply stop the water supply port is closed the water level sensor in the water tank can be accurately sensed by detecting the pressure change applied to the water supply pipe by providing a simple structure of the water level sensing device for blocking the pressure of the water supply pipe not only can a malfunction be significantly reduced but also a semi permanent number by keeping the present invention relates to unmanned water supply apparatus to contribute to improving reliability.1a and 1b are block diagrams of a conventional unattended water supply device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102490133-B1", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "disinfection treatment system according to the present invention by checking the amount of breeding water supplied through the main transfer pump 3 in real time with the scale bar 17 it is possible to carry out the simultaneous transfer operation of breeding water and infectious organisms more efficiently such as a quantitative supply type treatment cycle of breeding water tailored to the treatment capacity of 1"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5479252-B2", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "and by arranging the dis