econd discharge tank including a plurality of discharge units connected to the first discharge tank and a discharge opening closing door configured to be configured with the plurality of discharge units and operated so that only discharged water having a suitable water quality test result is introduced the water level information of the treated water is received from the water level detection unit and when the water level is higher than a certain level the lifting and lowering operation of the elevating means is controlled and the water quality test result is received from the water quality inspection unit and the recovery line and the discharge opening and closing door are includes a driving control unit for controlling the driving and controlling whether or not the re inflow line is opened so that the re inflow of the reprocessed treated water is made and the elevating means it is configured on one side of the water quality inspection unit and when a driving signal is transmitted from the driving control unit a transfer driving unit that provides a predetermined power to perform an elevating and descending operation and the collecting means are coupled and connected to the transfer driving unit consisting of a transfer member for transferring the collecting means while lifting or lowering operation is performed when the transfer driving unit is driven in the first discharge tank a seating panel whose one end is fixedly coupled to an outer surface of the elevating means and a rotating panel rotatably coupled to the front end of the seating panel and configured to rotate vertically upward when the elevating means is moved upward and the a drive cylinder for controlling the rotation of the rotation panel and a drive control sensor that is interlocked by contact with the water quality inspection unit and receives a drive signal from the drive control unit to control the drive of the drive cylinder and the drive control unit a signal transmission unit configured to per