ntain in advance and providing it as information it is easy to use the water in the freshwater tank necessary for firefighting in case of disaster the fresh water tank a hose connector connected to the water tank is configured on the outside the hose connector is wound by a large reel and the fire hose connected to the hose connector is coupled to the flight means the hose connector of the fresh water tank is coupled to the fresh water tank by extending the pipe downward from the lower flange part and securing a separation space between the lower flange part and the upper surface of the fresh water tank to provide a plurality of ball valve plates arranged in the circumferential direction the hose connector is configured to be rotated by the rotation of the ball valve so that the movement of the fire hose connected to the hose connector is flexible"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102046601-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "first the water storage tank 20 connects the water supply pipe 11 to the water supply port 12 formed in the lower water storage portion 21b with the water supply valve 12 interposed therebetween thereby opening and closing the water supply valve 12"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200385155-Y1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "therefore the raw water is smoothly filtered by the suction pump 40 by the suction pump 40 and then a small amount of the treated water is discharged and each separator of the membrane unit 11 is suspended by the air supplied from the broa 20"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101412529-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "the method of claim 4 the water level controller 32 includes a timer for checking the time after the water level is sensed by at least one of the first sensor 29 the second sensor 30 and the third sensor 31 of the water level sensor portion the rainwater stored in the rainwater storage tank 16 may be discharged through the discharge pipe 22 for a predetermined discharge time when the time counted by the timer 33 becomes longer than a predetermined time