ed to the outside through a discharge port formed at an upper end of the water level control tank and thus the acidic rock drainage is conventionally the present invention relates to a slope acid rock drainage treatment facility that prevents serious environmental pollution engineering damage namely concrete corrosion cracks in the bottom of the structure due to sulfate expansion and slope instability at the incision"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100688965-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "by moving to the water level control tank through the discharge port formed in the upper end of the water level control tank to the outside conventional environmental damage by acid rock drainage engineering damage namely concrete corrosion sulphate expansion by the bottom of the structure the purpose of this is to prevent cracking and slope instability at the incision site"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100688965-B1", "para_id": "para_48", "text": "the enclosed suspended solids settle and are the final purification.as described above the slope acid rock drainage natural purification treatment facility of the present invention the acid rock drainage flows into the treatment tank formed on the cut slope or the fill section slope the purification part composed of an organic material layer and a limestone layer to clean the acid rock drainage it is formed and the effluent water purified through the purifying unit is moved to the water level control tank through the hole pipe formed in the lower end of the limestone layer and discharged to the outside through the discharge port formed on the upper end surface of the water level control tank by conventional acid rock drainage it is effective in preventing severe environmental pollution engineering damage namely concrete corrosion cracks in the bottom of the structure due to sulfate expansion slope instability at the incision"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102436761-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the end part is immersed in the water level of undischarged sewage that 