ng on the metering pump and turning on the sterilizing water generator 24 so that a certain amount of water coming out through the outlet port of the three way valve is branched from the upstream of the supply pipe through the branch pipe passes through the sterilizing water generator 24 and then joins the downstream of the supply pipe through the joining pipe and if the charge level of the battery is less than the minimum value turning off the metering pump and turning off the sterilizing water generator 24 so as to stop the bypass process in which a certain amount of the supply water is branched and joins including a sterilizing component"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102704480-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "another eco friendly greenhouse control method according to the present invention may include the steps of determining whether it is irrigation time if it is irrigation time detecting the minimum value of the water level of the second tank and if it is below the minimum value turning on the three way valve to connect another discharge pipe 10a of the first tank and the supply pipe 26 checking the charge level of the battery and if the current charge level is above the predetermined minimum value turning on the metering pump and turning on the sterilizing water generator 24 so that a certain amount of water coming out through the outlet port of the three way valve 20 is branched off from the upstream of the supply pipe through the branch pipe passes through the sterilizing water generator 24 and then joins the downstream of the supply pipe through the joining pipe and if the charge level of the battery is below the minimum value turning off the metering pump and turning off the sterilizing water generator 24 so as to stop the bypass process in which a certain amount of the supply water is branched off and joins including a sterilizing component"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101080805-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "meanwhile the high concentration overflow water storage tank 