el detector it is equipped with a discharge device to achieve a smooth filtration operation of the filtration filter during the purification of wastewater and wastewater and to prevent the blockage of the purification system and to improve the filtration efficiency"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101272800-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "accordingly the present invention has been made to solve the above problems an object of the present invention is to monitor the water level change of the storage tank by the water level detector installed in the storage tank to quickly and accurately check whether the filtration filter is blocked and at the same time filtering by supplying compressed air to the lower part of the filter it is possible to provide a waste water purification system such as to improve the treatment efficiency of the wastewater and reduce the maintenance cost by preventing the blockage of the filtration filter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101272800-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "the compressed air supply means provides a compressed air shock wave to the filtration filter according to the state of the reservoir tank level of the water level detector to eliminate the blockage of the filtration filter or to provide a compressed air shock wave periodically or occasionally to prevent the blockage of the filtration filter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101090211-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "in order to achieve the above object the present invention provides a water pressure control encoder switch for adjusting the intensity of the water output the temperature of the water ph concentration the operation button to receive the output time the water level sensor for measuring the water level an input unit configured of a temperature sensor measuring a temperature of water a pump for raising the water to the shampoo ware a heater for heating the water to a temperature set by the operation button an electrolysis tank for ionizing the water and performing electrolysis to match the ph conc