eaction introducing the raw water which has undergone the corrosion reaction from the charging tank into a methane fermentation tank to proceed with fermentation by methane from the methane fermentation tank the fermentation complete digestion liquid is introduced into the fermentation filtrate collection tank and in a state in which the fermentation filtrate collection tank is introduced into the metering tank a predetermined amount of digestion liquid is introduced into the aeration tank and the remaining amount is returned to the fermentation filtrate collection tank to the aeration tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101654508-B1", "para_id": "claim_11", "text": "the precipitation inducing grooves 511 are formed so as to be curved downwardly inclined so as to reach one upper end portion the precipitation inducing groove 511 is formed at a predetermined distance from the upper end of one side of the swash plate 510 and the upper end of one side of the lower flat plate portion toward the other side upper end portion of the lower flat plate portion and curved downward and a plurality of depressions are formed in an inclined shape"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101654508-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "second the upper swash plate unit and the lower swash plate unit are provided and the lower swash plate unit is selectively rotatable such that the lower swash plate unit is inclined at a predetermined angle with respect to the upper end in the vertical state thereby selectively blocking the supply of the minute bubbles into the precipitation the sludge can be guided in an oblique direction to induce sedimentation thereby maximizing the sedimentation efficiency of the sludge.brief description of the drawings fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200408180-Y1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "therefore the raw water supplied from the raw water treatment tank 2 passes through the mixing tank 4 the coagulation tank 6 and the settling tank 8 and then flows into the separation membrane system 10 in a treated st