ion thereby causing breakage of the apparatus including the rotating shaft and the driving motor.summary of the invention the present invention has been made in order to solve the above mentioned problems and it is an object of the present invention to provide an impeller disk plate which rotates in a storage tank water and prevents precipitation of sludge the bearing is provided at a lower end side rotating portion of the rotating shaft so as to support and guide the rotating drive"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0126558-Y1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "in order to smoothly induce sediment residue a recovery hole 41 is formed at the bottom of the sedimentation chamber 40 composed of the inclined surface so as to drop the sedimentation debris into the decay chamber 20 in the recovery hole 41"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101019590-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the method according to claim 1 the rear end of the aeration tank is a water purification apparatus for removing iron and manganese characterized in that the reaction precipitation tank for aging the oxide of the aerated oxidation water oxidized in the aeration tank and settle the precipitate formed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101019590-B1", "para_id": "claim_16", "text": "the method according to claim 15 the water purification method for removing iron and manganese characterized in that it further comprises a reaction precipitation step of oxidizing the aerated oxidation water passed through the aeration step through a reaction precipitation tank and precipitates the precipitate formed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101019590-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "in addition in the water purifying apparatus for removing iron and manganese according to the present invention the rear end of the aeration tank is further provided with a reaction precipitation tank for aging the oxide of the aerated oxidation water oxidized in the aeration tank and settle the generated precipitate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101019590-B1", "para_id": "para_78", "text": "2 the aging