ay be further mounted between the ozone treatment tank and the ultraviolet treatment tank thereby further improving the filtration efficiency by further performing the removal of agglomerates through oxidation and precipitation and aggregation by the oxidant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100541844-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "this chemical coagulation reaction step is a mixing step of administering a chemical coagulant to bind the suspended solids or colloidal particles a coagulation step of coagulating the particles by promoting the collision between the floating and colloidal particles using a stirrer after the mixing step after the coagulation step the precipitation proceeds to precipitate the coagulated particulate matter contained in the wastewater and the supernatant of the precipitating tank which is cleaned by the chemical coagulation reaction is transferred to the next step of the electrochemical oxidation step and oxidized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102422847-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "in addition it is possible to prevent iron precipitation through real time ph measurement and to provide a waste liquid decomposition monitoring device according to decontamination of a nuclear power plant that can be used for uv reaction tank maintenance by checking the ph when washing lamps in the uv reaction tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102422847-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to prevent iron precipitation through real time ph measurement and it is possible to provide a waste liquid decomposition monitoring device that can be used for maintenance of the uv reaction tank by checking the ph when washing the lamp in the uv reaction tank"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5512033-B1", "para_id": "para_69", "text": "the water storage sterilization container l7 is a treatment tank for temporarily storing the purified circulating water while storing and sterilizing the water with ultraviolet rays"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101904985-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the anoxic tank 