 as a result of the oxidation reaction of the over supplied air and high temperature aerobic microorganisms to the inlet water storage tank not shown to prevent the outflow of bubbles or odor"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100722407-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "on the other hand carbon dioxide generated as a result of the oxidation reaction of the over supplied air and high temperature aerobic microorganisms are returned to the inlet water storage tank not shown through the air discharge pipe 60 to prevent the outflow of bubbles or odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102818339-B1", "para_id": "para_150", "text": "furthermore such modifications should not be individually understood from the technical idea or prospect of the present invention.temperature detection sensor 10 control module 20 automatic opening closing module 30 power supply module 40 foreign matter removal module 100 ball vibration body 110 vibration removal ball 120 body rotation gear 130 ball support home 131 module rotation axis 140 module moving gear 150 ball support home 151 module moving rail 160 ball vibrator 200 vibration body 210 vibration pressure tank 220 vibration pressure pipe 230 vibration spring 240 vibration ball 250 vibrating protrusion 260 stumbling block 270 vibrating moving shaft 280 shaft buffer 290 shaft support housing 300 absent home 301 absent support protrusion 302 shaft moving rail 310 vibration unit moving gear 320 1st gear shaft 330 drive transmission gear 340 2nd gear shaft 350 gear support member 360 vibration unit drive gear 370 vibration unit drive shaft 380 vibration drive motor 390 gap buffer 400 buffer installation ball 410 spacing shaft 420 buffer shaft 430 buffer cylinder 440 buffer spring 450 lateral support 460 axis fastening ring 470"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102344740-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a purified water tank unit 1000 for introducing purified water to remove foreign substances and supplying a fixed quantity by driving a metering pump an advanced oxidation process radica