artitioned by a plurality of partition walls for setting the movement path of the leachate therein at least one agitator disposed on the bottom surface of the nitrification tank to mix the leachate while rotating a first heat pump disposed in an upper part of the nitrification tank on the ground to heat the nitrification tank and heat exchanging the first chamber leachate and the heat exchanged refrigerant disposed in front of the nitrification tank in the direction in which the leachate flows 3 heat pump a fourth heat pump to a sixth heat pump arranged in parallel with the first heat pump to the third heat pump and arranged in the rear along the direction in which the leachate of the nitrification tank flows and the heat exchanged refrigerant is heat a first heat exchanger connected to the first heat pump to a third heat pump and disposed in the first chamber and performing heat exchange with the leachate a second heat exchanger connected to the fourth heat pump to the sixth heat pump and disposed in the second chamber and performing heat exchange with the leachate a first circulation pump for circulating the refrigerant in the first heat exchange unit a second circulation pump for circulating the refrigerant in the second heat exchange unit a preliminary circulation pump interposed between the first circulation pump and the second circulation pump and capable of temporarily operating corresponding to the first circulation pump or the second circulation pump a three way valve connected between any one of the first heat pump to the sixth heat pump and selectively supplying the heat exchanged refrigerant to the first chamber or the second chamber a sensor unit provided on the three way valve for sensing the temperature or pressure of the refrigerant flowing into the three way valve a first heat pump to a sixth heat pump a first circulation pump and a second circulation pump and a control unit controlling the temperature of the leachate in the nitrification tank to a 