o the temperature value measured by the temperature sensor 50"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102636300-B1", "para_id": "claim_10", "text": "as a method of using the air purifying device according to paragraph 1 passing the contaminated air transported through the supply pipe through a pretreatment unit provided inside the supply pipe to initially remove contaminants from the contaminated air s10 supplying the contaminated air that has passed through the pretreatment unit in the form of bubbles to the water inside the water tank to secondarily remove contaminants from the contaminated air s20 purifying the water inside the water tank through electrolysis s30 and it includes a step of controlling the temperature of the water tank s40 the pretreatment unit includes a filter made of at least one material of metal and polymer an eco friendly and easy to maintain method of air purification using reusable filters and water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102636300-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "in order to achieve the above object the present invention includes the steps of passing contaminated air transported through a supply pipe through a pretreatment unit provided inside the supply pipe to primarily remove contaminants in the contaminated air supplying the contaminated air that has passed through the pretreatment unit in the form of bubbles to the water inside the water tank to secondarily remove contaminants from the contaminated air purifying the water inside the water tank through electrolysis and controlling the temperature of the water tank wherein the pretreatment unit provides an eco friendly and easy to maintain air purification method using a reusable filter and water including a filter made of at least one of metal and polymer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102636300-B1", "para_id": "para_102", "text": "the air purification method includes passing contaminated air transported through a supply pipe through a pretreatment unit provided inside the supply pipe to primarily remove contaminants from