 to the ambient temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102065694-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "freeze protection function can achieve the purpose enough to prevent the freezing of the sewage the sewage contains a lot of impurities or foreign matter and storage tank 100 is also mainly installed in places where the temperature does not easily drop even in the winter such as underground therefore it is possible to prevent freeze by flowing sewage with only one minute of operation per hour"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101528712-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "therefore they can be stored and maintained for a long time in the water to be treated under the condition of being pressurized at normal temperature and the gas having ultrafine bubbles in addition to the dissolution effect it is possible to enhance the immunity of living organisms living in the for treatment water due to the purifying action of oxygen and ozone the sterilization action and the increased dissolved oxygen generated when the bubbles burst due to the self pressurizing effect and improve the living environment of the food.the microbubble generator for sterilization including oxygen and ozone according to the present invention can produce the same product repeatedly in the manufacturing industry of the water quality improvement device for sterilizing and purifying the water to be treated can do.10 raw milk input 20 ozone feed pipe 30 mixer 40 micro bubble generator 41 rotating disk 42 motor 50 micro bubble water flow tube 60 pressurized dissolving tank 61 vibration part 62 partial partition wall 70 discharge pipe 80 bypass pipe 90 bubble number size adjuster 100 pressure gauge 110 ozone regulator 120 ozone generator"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100271329-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the magnetic fine powder recovery apparatus of the magnetic fluid separation system of suspended solids in wastewater using magnetic fine powder mf slurry tank 21 for storage and supply of magnetic flux ms combined with the magnetic fine powder mf and suspended solids s a medium fluidized bed 24 having upper and lower portions formed in a cone shape and having a porous dispersion plate 25 installed in a predetermined lower portion of the inside thereof and having media particles 26 of a predetermined size introduced therein a slurry supply pump 22 for supplying a certain amount of magnetic flux ms stored in the slurry tank 21 to the nozzle 23 in the medium fluidized bed 24 hot air supply device for supplying a high temperature dry hot air to the lower portion of the medium fluidized bed 24 to flow the media particles 26 and magnetic flux ms introduced into the medium fluidized bed 24 to dry wear and scatter 50 and a magnetic separator installed on the medium fluidized bed 24 and having upper and lower portions formed in a cone shape and a magnet 27 installed at an outer circumference to collect magnetic fine powder mf that is scattered and discharged with hot air"}, {"pat_id": "US-8147117-B2", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "the present invention provides a means for mixing drinking water stored in large storage tanks preventing thermal stratification of the water to reduce risk of freezing by generating large mixing bubbles toward the bottom of the tank causing mixing of layers of water in the tank through turbulence created as the bubbles rise through the tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255667-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "5 in order to increase the warming effect of the reaction tank 10 using solar heat and in this case strong sunlight during the day is transparent window 50 and see through window"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101255667-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "in addition during the summer when the air temperature is high the light blocking pad 51 is closed to prevent the internal temperature of the reaction tank 10 and the temperature of the sewage or waste water from being excessively high to block sunlight from penetrating into the internal space of the housing 30"}, {"pat_id": "KR-10140817