  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-4171263-A", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "as shown sewage influent and oxygen are directed into an absorption vessel which is pressurized by the incoming gas to cause an accelerated rate of dissolution of the gas into the sewage influent and to considerably raise the saturation level of the influent so that a greater amount of gas can be dissolved into a given quantity of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100757461-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "in general the wastewater and sewage discharged from the home to the stream are purified through the wastewater treatment device to clean up the wastewater and sewage and then discharged to the river to prevent contamination of the stream"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "the reason for constructing a water purification promotion retention tank 11111 at each section by deeply excavating the river or stream bottom at each stage with a depth of 2m to 30m in the upstream riverbed land 11 is that various pollutants flowing into the river or stream automatically combine with water molecules after a certain period of time as they flow into the river or stream through which the river water flows and as a result their specific gravity becomes heavier than that of water molecules and sinks to the river or stream bottom due to the material cutting effect and the material agglomeration effect thereby preventing the phenomenon of the water quality of the river or stream from further worsening and at the same time promoting the decomposition of various pollutants flowing into the river or stream to naturally purify the polluted river water into heavy gravity river water as a structure mixed with the river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream and mixed in the polluted river water flowing down in the downstream direction of the river or stream and various pollutants of light gravity mixed in the pollutant molecules composed of wastes various organic substances and various plant substances which have become heavier due to the action of gravity and the combination of substances settle inside the water purification promotion retention tank 11111 configured in multiple stages on the upper part of the eco friendly movable dam 8888 for preventing the occurrence of green algae and which maintain a state of heavy specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the material friction action material explosion action and material oxidation action that occur naturally among the various pollutant molecules and at the same time the pollutant molecules combined with the polluted substance molecules with light specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the action of gravity and the material combination rejection action that the heavy specific gravity clean river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream pushes the light specific gravity polluted river water upward or sideways and tries not to combine with each other thereby preventing the water purification promotion retention tank 11111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "as the clean river water with a heavy specific gravity floats to the upper part the polluted river water with a light specific gravity pushes it sideways or upwards and preferentially flows downstream thereby maintaining the state of floating to the upper part of the eco friendly movable reservoir 8888 for preventing green algae which is composed of multiple stages and then as the specific gravity becomes heavier due to the material binding action that naturally occurs between pollutant molecules and river water and at the same time due to the action of gravity it sinks inside the water purification promotion storage tank 11111 which is composed of multiple stages and at the same time due to the material friction action material explosion action and material oxidation action the pollutant material molecules whose specific gravity becomes lighter are automatically moved to the upper part of the water purification promotion storage tank 11111 by the material binding rejection action in which the heavy clean river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream pushes the polluted river water with a light specific gravity and the polluted river water with a light specific gravity upward or sideways and tries not to combine with each other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_12", "text": "a structure comprising a dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 that naturally purifies polluted river water in a valley of a river or stream located higher than the sea or a large river a structure in which the lower discharge passage 223 is formed at the lower end of the above dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the above water storage device 1000 a structure in which the inflow control valve 222 is formed at one end of the lower discharge passage 223 a structure in which a power generation water movement line 331 is connected using a round or square pipe or a round square or rectangular concrete pipe configured to prevent leakage to the outside at the other end of the lower discharge passage 223 a structure in which the power generation water movement line 331 is installed in a form that goes over mountains and hills 221 and then an upward discharge line 332 is formed in a shape at the end of the power generation water movement line 331 so that it is 1 to 10 lower than the lower height and horizontal state of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 so that the power generation water discharged from the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 automatically falls downward by going over mountains and hills due to the action of gravity a structure in which a first acceleration discharge port 213 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at a high position above the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or river water stored in the storage facility 1000 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the frictional action and explosive action of materials naturally occurring between the power generation water passing through the power generation water movement line 331 that is constructed over mountains and hills a structure in which a secondary acceleration discharge port 215 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at the upper end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the material friction and material explosion that occur naturally between the power generation water passing through the above mentioned power generation water movement line 331 and the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to the outside at a position higher than the water level of the river water stored in the above mentioned dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or the above mentioned water storage device 1000 a structure in which the upper water tank 1503 is formed at the lower end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 a structure in which the lower discharge unit 1500 is formed at the lower part of the upper water tank 1503 a structure in which an emission control unit 203 is combined at the lower part of the above lower emission unit 1500 a structure in which the power generation unit 33 is combined with the lower part of the lower discharge unit 1500 the thickness and size of the upper water tank 1503 are such that the power generation water discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500 is easily discharged to the power generation unit 33 configured in the lower direction at a high speed due to the action of gravity and when the size and total discharge area of the lower discharge unit 1500 are converted to a ratio of 100 the storage capacity of the upper water tank 1503 is configured to be 1 000 to 16 000 larger in size and larger in capacity so that the power generation water flowing in through the dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the water storage device 1000 and the lower discharge passage 223 and the power generation water movement line 331 and the rising discharge line 332 is moved to the upper water tank 1503 and then discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_13", "text": "after installing foundation concrete 800 at one end of a cross section structure of a river or stream and constructing a dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 on the upper end of the foundation concrete 800 an inflow pipe 1110 and a lower discharge pipe 1120 are connected to discharge water stored in the lower end of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 and an inflow control valve 1170 is connected to adjust the inflow amount and an upper and lower raising and lowering device 5810 is connected to adjust the pipe in the upper and lower direction according to the inflow level of river water that changes frequently and a rising discharge pipe 101 a falling discharge pipe 103 a right angled falling pipe 202 a water storage tank 201 a discharge amount control unit 203 a right angled falling pipe 202 and in a method of producing electricity by using the dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or water storage device 1000 equipped with a power generation unit 33 a structure in which a water storage tank 8000 and a water purification promotion storage tank 11111 are constructed by dredging to a depth 20 to 600 times deeper than the surface 9000 of the soil layer constituting a river or stream and then the foundation concrete 800 is poured on the surface 9000 constituting a river or stream and the inflow pipe 1110 and the lower discharge pipe 1120 are constructed on the upper part of the foundation concrete 800 and the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or the water storage device 1000 is constructed to store river water on the upper part of the foundation concrete 800 the inflow pipe 1110 and the lower discharge pipe 1120 a structure in which an intermediate storage water inflow line 501 is formed to pump the stored water stored inside the upstream side of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 toward the rear side starting from the internal ground surface 9000 in the upstream direction of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 penetrating the middle part of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 to the rear part a structure in which a lower movement line 1919 is connected to the end of the intermediate storage water inflow line 501 to move the power generation water introduced through the intermediate storage water inflow line 501 downward a structure in which an entrance 1332 used for inspecting or repairing the lower movement line 1919 is combined with a locking device 1333 at the lower end of the lower movement line 1919 a structure in which the rising discharge pipe 101 is connected to the end of the lower movement line 1919 a structure in which the upper and lowering device 5810 is combined to adjust the discharge water level in the upper and lower directions according to the amount of water stored inside the dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or water storage device 1000 at the upper end of the above mentioned rising discharge pipe 101 a structure in which the upper part of the above mentioned up and down lifting device 5810 is connected to the lower part of the above mentioned dam reservoir lake and movable reservoir 8888 and the above mentioned down discharge pipe 103 for discharging the river water discharged upward through the above mentioned up and down discharge pipe 101 a structure in which an air discharge port 1331 for discharging air generated in the intermediate storage water inflow line 501 and the rising discharge pipe 101 are combined at the upper end of the descending discharge pipe 103 a structure in which the right angled descending pipe 202 is formed at the lower end of the above descending discharge pipe 103 a structure in which the water storage tank 201 is formed at the upper end of the above mentioned right angled descending pipe 202 with a volume ratio 10 to 200 times larger than the structural volume ratio of the above mentioned right angled descending pipe 202 a structure in which a plurality of emission control units 203 are combined at the lower end of the above rectangular lowering pipe 202 to control the emission amount the lower part of the above rectangular descending pipe 202 is configured to be connected to the above dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 which is configured to raise and discharge water through the above intermediate storage water inflow line 501 and the above lower moving line 1919 and the above rising discharge pipe 101 and the above falling discharge pipe 103 and the above water storage tank 201 and the above dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or the above water storage device 1000 which is configured to raise and discharge water through the above natural river water self purification action and the action of gravity and the action of gravity acceleration and the eco friendly method which purifies polluted river water and generates eco friendly hydroelectric power by preventing the occurrence of green algae thereby producing eco friendly electricity and at the same time exhibiting the function of an artificial fish farm"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "para_97", "text": "the reason for constructing a water purification promotion retention tank 11111 at each section by deeply excavating the river or stream bottom at each stage with a depth of 2m to 30m in the upstream riverbed land 11 is that various pollutants flowing into the river or stream automatically combine with water molecules after a certain period of time as they flow into the river or stream through which the river water flows and as a result their specific gravity becomes heavier than that of water molecules and sinks to the river or stream bottom due to the material cutting effect and the material agglomeration effect thereby preventing the phenomenon of the water quality of the river or stream from further worsening and at the same time promoting the decomposition of various pollutants flowing into the river or stream to naturally purify the polluted river water into heavy gravity river water as a structure mixed with the river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream and mixed in the polluted river water flowing down in the downstream direction of the river or stream and various pollutants of light gravity mixed in the pollutant molecules composed of wastes various organic substances and various plant substances which have become heavier due to the action of gravity and the combination of substances settle inside the water purification promotion retention tank 11111 configured in multiple stages on the upper part of the eco friendly movable dam 8888 for preventing the occurrence of green algae and which maintain a state of heavy specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the material friction action material explosion action and material oxidation action that occur naturally among the various pollutant molecules and at the same time the pollutant molecules combined with the polluted substance molecules with light specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the action of gravity and the material combination rejection action that the heavy specific gravity clean river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream pushes the light specific gravity polluted river water upward or sideways and tries not to combine with each other thereby preventing the water purification promotion retention tank 11111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "para_97", "text": "as the clean river water with a heavy specific gravity floats to the upper part the polluted river water with a light specific grav