ged to introduce water vapor into the air stream a body that in use surrounds both the air flow generator and the moisture source and a water supply system arranged to provide water to the moisture source"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102595234-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "an air treatment device includes an air flow generator arranged to produce an air flow a moisture source arranged to introduce water vapor into the air stream a body that in use surrounds both the air flow generator and the moisture source and a water supply system arranged to provide water to the moisture source"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100624556-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "drainage layer it is installed on one side lower portion of the drainage layer connected to any one side of the drainage layer to collect and store the inflow water flowing through the drainage layer and precipitates the unfiltered foreign matter while undergoing a purification process by the modular wetland infrastructure sedimentation tank a contact oxidation tank installed in connection with the settling tank and biologically purifying using a modular microbial contact material installed therein by introducing the inflow water passed through the settling tank and it is installed connected to the contact oxidation tank in the lower portion of the drainage layer comprising a filtration tank to finally remove the fine sludge and suspended solids that are not filtered through the filter medium installed therein by introducing the influent water through the contact oxidation tank a stream lake or effluent treatment unit that combines modular wetland infrastructure and modular catalytic oxidation and filtration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100624556-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "an inflow water distribution step of evenly distributing the energy of the stream water the lake water or the outflow water flowing into the integrated water purification device through the flow distribution tank to the modular wetland infrastructure a primary purification step in which the influent distributed to the modular wetland infrastructure is decomposed adsorbed and settled by the microorganisms of the wetland plants and wetlands planted in adjacent vegetation based modules a secondary purification step in which the inflow water is physically filtered while passing through the vegetation based module arranged adjacent to the modular wetland infrastructure a drainage storage step in which the inflow water passing through the modular wetland infrastructure flows into the sedimentation tank through the drainage layer installed while forming a predetermined space a precipitation step of precipitating unfiltered foreign matter while undergoing primary and secondary purification treatments included in the influent stored in the precipitation tank a third purification step in which the inflow water which has passed the precipitation step is biologically purified while being introduced and passed through the contact oxidation tank in which the microbial contact material is installed a fourth purification step of finally removing fine sludge and suspended solids not filtered in the contact oxidation tank through the filtering tank a flow rate adjusting step of adjusting a flow rate discharged into the water channel through the discharge pipe through the discharge control tank it is configured to include"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100578050-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "when the pit shaped jaw is aligned with the height of the inlet and the outlet similar to the gradient of the lower bed the inlet may form a small waterfall by the slope of the lower bed and the outlet may be similar to the height of the lower bed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100578050-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "the pump is not basically used for the inflow or outflow of the stream water of the pit type tank but pipes connected to the pump may be installed to drain water during maintenance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100578050-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "the aerator may be in the form of an air jet or diffuser such as a porous plate or disc type"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100578050-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "the latter half of the pit bath may be intermittently operated by mounting an ejector air jet or water jet not shown in order to disperse the deposited particles into the vortex area.the stream water purification device of the present invention has almost no operation mechanism except for the aerator mounted on the pit tank and the piping for supplying the pressurized air and has little utility or chemical cost except the blower that generates pressurized air"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102032253-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in general wastewater and sewage generated in industrial facilities or homes are purified by a wastewater treatment device and discharged into the river to prevent contamination of the stream"}, {"pat_id": "US-7842121-B2", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "the waste fluid stream 104 may enter the feed pump 106 directly from any oilfield process industrial process landfill leachate and or naturally occurring water source instead of from a feed tank 102"}, {"pat_id": "US-7520993-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "in an exemplary embodiment the system for treating an aqueous liquid containing dissolved minerals and dissolved hydrocarbons comprises passing the aqueous liquid or a waste water feed stream through a warm lime softener wherein the warm lime softener or warm lime softening system comprises a lime silo a sodium carbonate silo and a caustic storage tank in fluid communication with a lime and soda precipitation softener vessel which is in fluid communication with a sludge storage tank wherein contacting the waste water feed stream with lime and sodium carbonate in the lime and soda precipitation softener vessel produces a particulate suspension that settles to produce a sludge part of which may be recycled back to the lime and soda precipitation softener vessel"}, {"pat_id": "US-7585413-B2", "para_id": "