  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100757461-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "in general the wastewater and sewage discharged from the home to the stream are purified through the wastewater treatment device to clean up the wastewater and sewage and then discharged to the river to prevent contamination of the stream"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "the reason for constructing a water purification promotion retention tank 11111 at each section by deeply excavating the river or stream bottom at each stage with a depth of 2m to 30m in the upstream riverbed land 11 is that various pollutants flowing into the river or stream automatically combine with water molecules after a certain period of time as they flow into the river or stream through which the river water flows and as a result their specific gravity becomes heavier than that of water molecules and sinks to the river or stream bottom due to the material cutting effect and the material agglomeration effect thereby preventing the phenomenon of the water quality of the river or stream from further worsening and at the same time promoting the decomposition of various pollutants flowing into the river or stream to naturally purify the polluted river water into heavy gravity river water as a structure mixed with the river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream and mixed in the polluted river water flowing down in the downstream direction of the river or stream and various pollutants of light gravity mixed in the pollutant molecules composed of wastes various organic substances and various plant substances which have become heavier due to the action of gravity and the combination of substances settle inside the water purification promotion retention tank 11111 configured in multiple stages on the upper part of the eco friendly movable dam 8888 for preventing the occurrence of green algae and which maintain a state of heavy specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the material friction action material explosion action and material oxidation action that occur naturally among the various pollutant molecules and at the same time the pollutant molecules combined with the polluted substance molecules with light specific gravity naturally become lighter due to the action of gravity and the material combination rejection action that the heavy specific gravity clean river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream pushes the light specific gravity polluted river water upward or sideways and tries not to combine with each other thereby preventing the water purification promotion retention tank 11111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "as the clean river water with a heavy specific gravity floats to the upper part the polluted river water with a light specific gravity pushes it sideways or upwards and preferentially flows downstream thereby maintaining the state of floating to the upper part of the eco friendly movable reservoir 8888 for preventing green algae which is composed of multiple stages and then as the specific gravity becomes heavier due to the material binding action that naturally occurs between pollutant molecules and river water and at the same time due to the action of gravity it sinks inside the water purification promotion storage tank 11111 which is composed of multiple stages and at the same time due to the material friction action material explosion action and material oxidation action the pollutant material molecules whose specific gravity becomes lighter are automatically moved to the upper part of the water purification promotion storage tank 11111 by the material binding rejection action in which the heavy clean river water flowing down from the upstream of the river or stream pushes the polluted river water with a light specific gravity and the polluted river water with a light specific gravity upward or sideways and tries not to combine with each other"}, {"pat_