  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101859056-B1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "according to the present invention only a crush stone is installed at the lower end of the reservoir structure so as to penetrate not only the reservoir of the storm but also the stormwater and by implementing the water circulation system penetrating into the ground through the reservoir with the upper reservoir and the lower reservoir it is possible to keep reservoirs and infiltration for water circulation and thus to prevent flooding even in temporary storms in areas where the impervious area is wide and the effect on the water circulation system is large.brief description of the drawings fig"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3976072-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "according to the automatic detection system for small scale septic tank abnormality detection disclosed in patent document 1 even if a failure of the septic tank blower is detected by an abnormal current and an abnormality in treated water quality can be detected by the water quality sensor the contents of the septic tank abnormality aeration failure mainly due to blower failure stop aeration failure due to piping damage leakage due to damage cracking of tank body flooding in tank due to malfunction of discharge pump flooding in tank due to abnormal discharge destination etc"}, {"pat_id": "US-9771712-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "a sump pump connects directly to the sewer drain pipe using a drain pipe coupler or is located adjacent thereto within the tank where overflow from the drain triggers the sump pump to discharge fluid and sewage into an outlet pipe and out of the basement to prevent flooding and contamination"}, {"pat_id": "US-6105607-A", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "while this invention will not prevent leaks such as washing machine over flow hose rupture dishwasher overflow toilet tank flooding etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100242042-B1", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "therefore it is considered that it will be easy to construct a small wastewater treatment plant of small to medium size population of 5 000 to 50 000 people .as described above by treating wastewater using the intermittent long term aeration process of the present invention an efficient wastewater treatment method is provided which is economical and can be treated without bypass of wastewater during flooding as well as during rainy and dry seasons"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101259156-B1", "para_id": "para_71", "text": "the present invention relates to the fabrication of rainwater storage tanks having the ability to store rainwater and discharge or utilize rainwater rainwater to prevent flooding during heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_53", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_108", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment 811 the above flood control equipment 811 is the hull position movement construction machinery control equipment 811a the marine hydroelectric power generation control equipment 811b the power transmission control equipment 811c the harmful red tide prevention control equipment 811d the disaster prevention control equipment 811e the fishery spawning control equipment 811f and the dam water gate control control equipment 811g are each individually equipped and the floating dock device of the flood control equipment is connected to the inside of the flood control equipment body 1 to prevent 