nking water storage tank management platform service through real time water quality information monitoring an analysis algorithm exceeding the standard value and big data related to season rainfall and water quality"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100955909-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "in addition in order to solve the problem that the contaminants accumulated in the inflow tank decay and cause odor after the rainfall is over the hole is drilled at the bottom of the inflow tank and gravel or porous media is installed outside to filter the contaminants"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101129908-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a first opening and closing part installed in a first primary conduit buried in the ground of the sewer to inflow only sewage and initial rainwater a second opening and closing portion installed in a second collecting conduit buried in the ground of a sewer the second opening being closed by a relatively larger initial rainfall than the first opening and closing portion and the storage tank is connected to the first and second secondary conduits so as to increase the amount of initial excellent water flowing through the first opening and closing opening and closing portion inside the storage tank is installed foreign matter removal means for filtering foreign matter introduced during the initial rain the first opening and closing part and the second opening and closing part is an opening and closing plate formed with an inlet an inlet prevention plate fixed to the bottom of the opening and closing plate to block the inlet and a spring cylinder connected to the opening and closing plate by an initial excellent water pressure including and the second opening and closing part is connected to the first opening and closing part through an interlocking means so that the first opening and closing part may be opened simultaneously"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101181863-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "in addition the non contaminant having a high specific gravity may be precipi