le 886g sling 886h triangular derrick 886i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5240962-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "4 there is no contamination of groundwater because the total amount of radiation contaminated water that flows in is a collection type"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5240962-B2", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "since there is cloth and paper under the clay board it will not break or break during movement or construction"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101615356-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "this is excellent in durability so it is excellent in filtration because it is spherical with less wear on backwashing"}, {"pat_id": "US-4514366-A", "para_id": "para_304", "text": "prior to filling the tank a gelled clay was put in"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3830505-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the sandysoil or ranaru treated soil contained within a frame side is opened radial collapse and preventing the side water permeable to enhance breathability a flat plate as a ground anchor to the short tube of the mesh the supporting member fixed horizontally in the horizontal direction is embedded in the side surface of the treated soil horizontally and embedded in a plurality of stages thereby exposing the side surface to the atmosphere and further receiving the earth pressure from the whole treated soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102677255-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "accordingly foreign substances contained in the rainwater collected in the storage tank 20 and transported through the horizontal drain 22 are filtered thereby improving the degree of contamination caused by foreign substances when using the rainwater as vegetation water"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3794589-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "since clay soil clay is replenished partially in the lower part of the water tank it is replenished while checking the concentration in the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3794589-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "in the upper layer part from the slurry zone a large separation area is required in order to reduce the area load for precipitation separation of the remaining suspended substances"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101657211-B1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "therefore when the return sludge 9 3 is introduced denitrification bod removal coagulation and condensation and ion exchange occur in the water collecting tank 2 and 70 or more of the organic and inorganic pollutants in the liquid phase of the wastewater are removed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102230365-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "after chemical treatment in the reaction tank 120 colloidal fine clay which is difficult to remove due to precipitation is removed by passing through the filter tank 140 and reused as process water washing water thereby lowering the process load due to colloidal fine clay"}, {"pat_id": "US-10011509-B2", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "as a third step the resulting mixture of the second step is incubated during a period between 1 and 60 minutes preferably between 10 and 30 minutes to provoke the enzymatic hydrolysis of the suspended starchy material present in nejayote period during which the temperature of the mixture decreases"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100994248-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "as a result leakage of water is prevented from occurring during the precipitation of the treated water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100994248-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "however the ground layer other than the clay layer may prevent the leakage of treated water by forming a clay layer on the floor and the wall after the sedimentation tank 1 construction or by pouring nonwoven fabric or concrete"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100390652-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "oxidizing and removing contaminants by introducing the mixed wastewater into a lower portion of at least one photocatalytic reactor 7 penetrating and continuously circulating upwards by the oxidation of pollutants filtering the mixture to remove the pressure can be fitted with a scraper 16 to be maintained at 3 5 kg cm 2 passed through the catalyst collector 9 is disc shaped clay filter 15 installed tio 2 obtaining treated water from which is separated and and continuously removing tio 2 accumulated in the clay filter 15 with the scraper 16 and then removing the tio 2 continuously into the mixing tank 6 again"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100390652-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "oxidizing and removing contaminants by introducing the mixed wastewater into a lower portion of at least one photocatalytic reactor 7 penetrating and continuously circulating upwards by the oxidation of pollutants filtering the mixture to remove the pressure can be fitted with a scraper 16 to be maintained at 3 5 kg cm 2 passed through the catalyst collector 9 is disc shaped clay filter 15 installed tio 2 obtaining treated water from which is separated and continuously removing tio 2 accumulated in the clay filter 15 with the scraper 16 and then removing the tio 2 continuously into the mixing tank 6 again"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100390652-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "a plurality of disk type clay filter 15 may be connected about the vertical axis inside the catalytic recovery 9 the pores of the filter can be selectively formed on the order of 0.1 to 1 treated through the photocatalytic oxidation reactor 7 the treated water is separated from the treated water at the outside of the disk type clay filter installed inside the catalyst recoverer 9"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3597417-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water content of the treated soil is high powder materials such as fly ash calcium carbonate and clay powder can be used in combination in order to lower the water solids ratio and physically increase the solidification strength"}]</data>
</edge>
