  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200461134-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "evaporation prevention and collection system for multi purpose anti oxidation water tank evaporation prevention device and catchment device of multi purpose water tanks for forest fires prevnetion the present invention relates to a simple evaporation prevention and collection device of a multi purpose anti oxidation water tank more specifically a water vapor barrier to prevent evaporation of water in the middle ceiling type planar evaporation prevention where the top of the tank and the bottom of the cap meets simple evaporation prevention and collection system of multipurpose anti oxidant water tank which forms a membrane drills a hole in the middle of the interlayer installs a pipe at the lower part thereof receives water from the cap through the pipe and prevents water evaporation inside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102537944-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a plurality of fresh water tanks that naturally fall from a natural water supply source and receive and store water including a jurisdiction server for remote control of the freshwater tank in the forest fire fighting water management system the plurality of fresh water tanks are installed on one side of the mountain and one of the two connected to the water supply pipe is located above the other one the fresh water tank includes a water tank for receiving water therein including evacuation space where people can be located the two fresh water tanks connected by the water supply pipe are connected by two water supply pipes among the two water supply pipes a one of them includes a valve on one side so that the water contained in the upper water tank is dropped by the opening of the valve and the water is transferred to the lower water tank b the other one by using a pump the water contained in the lower freshwater tank is transferred to the upper freshwater tank when the valve is opened for the transfer of water a collision between water transferred from the upper water tank to the lower water tank and water transferred from the lower water tank to the upper water tank is prevented from occurring the water supply pipe is buried in the ground to prevent the water supply pipe from freezing and interfering with water supply between each water tank the jurisdiction server by selectively controlling the water supply pipe of the water supply source the valve of the water supply pipe of the fresh water tank or the pump of the water supply pipe of the fresh water tank according to the water level information of each fresh water tank it is possible to adjust the water to each fresh water tank by building a database based on the identification information of the freshwater tank and the identification information of the mountain in advance and providing it as information it is easy to use the water in the freshwater tank necessary for firefighting in case of disaster the fresh water tank a hose connector connected to the water tank is configured on the outside the hose connector is wound by a large reel and the fire hose connected to the hose connector is coupled to the flight means the hose connector of the fresh water tank is coupled to the fresh water tank by extending the pipe downward from the lower flange part and securing a separation space between the lower flange part and the upper surface of the fresh water tank to provide a plurality of ball valve plates arranged in the circumferential direction the hose connector is configured to be rotated by the rotation of the ball valve so that the movement of the fire hose connected to the hose connector is flexible"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_533", "text": "the above mentioned firefighter nozzle 10 is connected to multiple pipe nozzles 10 at a distance of 1 meter or 3 meters using a flexible hose 190 for forest fire prevention or indoors or outdoors of a building and a flexible high pressure hose 190 used in the event of an internal fire is formed by a hydraulic press with wire and rubber and a cloth"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromotive force generation 102d measuring point 102e reference point 103 thermocouple thermometer switch for detection sensor 103a configuration of thermocouple thermometer 103b temperature measurement limit 103c temperature 1 103d ammeter temperature scale 103e metal a 103f metal b 103g potential difference generated 103h thermocouple and compensation wire 103i temperature measurement contact 103j thermocouple 103k compensation contact 103l compensation wire 103m reference contact 103n type of thermocouple 103o no protection tube 103p protection tube 103q high temperature object 103r protection tube there is 103s sis type 103t temperature measuring terminal 103u temperature measuring contact 103v stainless steel metal sheath 103w platinum temperature measuring resistance bo