ps 36 are installed in each power pump i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1140", "text": "the internal block tank and the external block tank are then fixed to the top of the foundation floor reinforcement bar and then cement is mixed with sand and gravel using a concrete finisher and concrete spreader in a concrete batching plant which is a construction machine and transported by a concrete mixer truck and then the foundation floor of the water tank is configured as a concrete mat using a concrete pump thereby overcoming flood damage using the potential energy of water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1146", "text": "the internal block tank and the external block tank are then fixed to the top of the foundation floor reinforcement bar and then cement is mixed with sand and gravel using a concrete finisher and concrete spreader in a concrete batching plant which is a construction machine and transported by a concrete mixer truck and then the foundation floor of the water tank is configured as a concrete mat using a concrete pump thereby overcoming flood damage using the potential energy of water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1147", "text": "the present invention as a technical idea for achieving the above purpose is preferably in the underground passage flood prevention and water damage control equipment the above flood control equipment 811 is the hull position movement construction machinery control equipment 811a the marine hydroelectric power generation control equipment 811b the power transmission control equipment 811c the harmful red tide prevention control equipment 811d the disaster prevention control equipment 811e the fishery spawning control equipment 811f and the dam water gate control control equipment 811g are each individually equipped and the floating dock device of the flood control equipment is connected to the inside of the flood control equipment body 1 to prevent flooding of the undergroun