  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101345438-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "therefore even when the stainless steel panel and the smc panel having different thermal expansion coefficients are mutually coupled the inclined portion has an effect of compensating for deformation caused by dissimilar material bonding which may occur during and after fastening"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100661095-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "according to claim 1 wherein the interval between the steel square pipe 2 and the lower contact portion of the frp material is provided with a gap 11 to absorb the difference in thermal expansion amount between the steel and the frp material during operation is natural frp cover for preventing odor leak of sewage waste water tank characterized in that to prevent the cracks generated in the frp plate by being absorbed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100661095-B1", "para_id": "para_45", "text": "according to the present invention when using a steel square pipe to make a frame supporting the structure of the frp plate and cover the frp plate on the bottom or waste water tank of the round or tunnel type by the heat of solar heat in contact with the square steel pipe and frp material prevent the frp plate from cracking by making a certain interval to absorb the difference in thermal expansion between the steel square pipe and frp material due to thermal expansion caused by radiant heat and steam heat generated from sewage wastewater"}, {"pat_id": "US-7083733-B2", "para_id": "para_46", "text": "other examples of auxiliary or additional components include but are not limited to pressure relief valves designed to relieve internal pressure of any vessels and avoid or at least reduce the likelihood of vessel rupture and thermal expansion tanks that are suitable for maintaining a desired operating pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage