  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-6052943-B1", "para_id": "para_88", "text": "r site s soil purification facility t chelating agent recovery device 1 crushing unit 2 classifying unit 3 sedimentation separating unit 4 filtering unit 5 chelating agent regenerating unit 6 chelating agent replenishing unit 7 rainwater supply unit 8 chelate agent removal unit 9 chelating agent recovery unit 11 input hopper 12 mixing device 13 mill breaker 14 trommel 15 cyclone 16 seal tank 17 sand clean 18 feed tank 19 ph adjustment tank 20 coagulation tank 21 floating material recovery equipment 22 thickener 23 intermediate tank 24 filter press 25 wash water tank 26 spare water tank 27 wash water tank 28 acid liquid tank 29 water tank 30 liquid fluidized bed apparatus 31 pump 32 pipe line 33 pump 34 37 pipeline 38 pump 39 40 pipeline 41 pump 42 4 pipe line 44 to 51 valve 55 rainwater storage tank 56 rainwater supply device 61 disintegrator 62 disintegrated soil rinse device 63 washing wastewater evaporation device 65 blade 74 belt conveyor 75 disintegrated soil supply device 76 rinse water spray device 77 washing wastewater receiving tank 78 drive roller 78a shaft 79 driven roller 79a shaft 80 conveying belt 81 support roller 82 guide plate 83 washing wastewater discharge passage 84 washing wastewater storage tank 85 sand container 86 front end wall 87 rear end wall 88 left side wall 89 right side wall 90 bottom wall 92 roof 93 washing wastewater spray device 94 washing wastewater recirculation mechanism 100 ground 101 drainage groove 102 collecting drainage groove 103 convex 104 perforated plate 105 sand layer 107 left vertical frame 108 right vertical frame 10 horizontal frame 111 water supply pipe 112 drainage nozzle 113 intermediate pipe 114 cleaning waste water supply pipe 115 cleaning waste supply pump"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101113090-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the non circulating non discharge manure treatment method for purifying the manure and sewage discharged from the toilet the manure treatment method comprises the steps of installing a flush toilet in the toilet the sewage and manure from the flush toilet anaerobic storage tank 10 anaerobic digestion filtering the treated water while treating nitrogen phosphorus and the like which are physically and biologically organic suspended solids and eutrophication agents in the aerobic bioreactor 20 and treating the treated water in the flow regulating tank 30 storing in the anaerobic state of the treated water and stabilizing the stored treatment water while the waste water is sprayed onto the wood chip layer by the water spray nozzle in the organic decay reaction tank 40 while the manure and sewage flows through the adsorption adsorption to the wood chip layer decomposing and removing the organic substances and various suspended substances contained in the step of discharging the leachate the pump well 46 operating a transfer pump that operates when a predetermined water level is reached while storing water removing organic components and nitrogen phosphorus color odor and the like physically and biologically from the advanced treatment tank 50 by contact aeration with the media physically filtration of the discharged water storing the treated water in the second flow rate adjusting tank 60 and stabilizing the stored treated water organic suspended solids remaining in the treated water passing through the wood chip layer and nitrogen phosphorus decomposing the chromaticity odor in the bioreactor 70 and then removing the leachate storing the treated water in the pump well 77 operating the transfer pump when the water level reaches a certain value decolorizing the treated water discharging while discoloring in the disinfection filtration tank 80 storing the treated water in the treated water storage tank 90 and supplying the stored treated water to the toilet and excessively introduced the excess water to the outside jidoe comprises a step of output the rainwater storage tank is installed on the roof of the manure treatment device and rainwater flows into the treatment water storage tank through a pipe and an electric shutoff valve is installed between the rainwater storage tank and the treatment water storage tank so that the water level of the treatment water storage tank is set"}]</data>
