  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-6052943-B1", "para_id": "para_88", "text": "r site s soil purification facility t chelating agent recovery device 1 crushing unit 2 classifying unit 3 sedimentation separating unit 4 filtering unit 5 chelating agent regenerating unit 6 chelating agent replenishing unit 7 rainwater supply unit 8 chelate agent removal unit 9 chelating agent recovery unit 11 input hopper 12 mixing device 13 mill breaker 14 trommel 15 cyclone 16 seal tank 17 sand clean 18 feed tank 19 ph adjustment tank 20 coagulation tank 21 floating material recovery equipment 22 thickener 23 intermediate tank 24 filter press 25 wash water tank 26 spare water tank 27 wash water tank 28 acid liquid tank 29 water tank 30 liquid fluidized bed apparatus 31 pump 32 pipe line 33 pump 34 37 pipeline 38 pump 39 40 pipeline 41 pump 42 4 pipe line 44 to 51 valve 55 rainwater storage tank 56 rainwater supply device 61 disintegrator 62 disintegrated soil rinse device 63 washing wastewater evaporation device 65 blade 74 belt conveyor 75 disintegrated soil supply device 76 rinse water spray device 77 washing wastewater receiving tank 78 drive roller 78a shaft 79 driven roller 79a shaft 80 conveying belt 81 support roller 82 guide plate 83 washing wastewater discharge passage 84 washing wastewater storage tank 85 sand container 86 front end wall 87 rear end wall 88 left side wall 89 right side wall 90 bottom wall 92 roof 93 washing wastewater spray device 94 washing wastewater recirculation mechanism 100 ground 101 drainage groove 102 collecting drainage groove 103 convex 104 perforated plate 105 sand layer 107 left vertical frame 108 right vertical frame 10 horizontal frame 111 water supply pipe 112 drainage nozzle 113 intermediate pipe 114 cleaning waste water supply pipe 115 cleaning waste supply pump"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102281312-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "302 a spray nozzle 303 connected to the other end of the air supply line 302 and installed to be located under the body 201 of the water purification unit 20 installed inside the storage tank 10 and a submersible pump 304 installed on one side of the air supply line 302 to suck the rainwater inside the storage tank 10 and supply it to the air supply line 302 while interlocking with the air supply means 301 includes the lifting unit 40 a motor 401 installed on the upper part of the storage tank 10 by enabling forward and reverse rotation elevating means 402 installed between the motor 401 and the water purifying unit 20 to elevate the water purifying unit 20 by the power of the motor 401 includes a filtering unit 50 for filtering rainwater collected through the rainwater pipe and storing the filtered rainwater in the storage tank 10 further comprising the filter unit 50 a housing 501 in which a certain amount of rainwater flowing in through the rainwater pipe is stored and then discharged a filter cover 502 installed inside the housing 501 a lower filter 503 that is detachably inserted into the center of the filter cover 502 an upper filter 504 that is detachably seated on the upper portion of the filter cover 502 a fixing ring 505 installed on the filter cover 502 so as to be disassembled and assembled to fix the lower filter 503 and the upper filter 504 a cap 506 installed at the upper end of the housing 501 so as to be disassembled and assembled including but the inner circumferential surface of the housing 501 is further provided with a spiral inner wall 501d for inducing generation of a vortex on the inner circumferential surface while the inner diameter is reduced in multiple stages the upper part of the filter cover 502 is a plate shaped concave downward and a cup shaped upper and lower halves are formed in the center of the filter cover 502 and the forceps are formed at regular intervals in width and length as a whole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267401-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the air nozzle 20 is provided integrally with the injection pipe 21 and at the same time one or