cting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101441852-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a structure that is coupled to a conveyance belt for conveying contaminants to the outside on the rear side of the lifting bar the underwater pump connected to the conveyor belt constitutes a submerged pump at the lower end of the purifier box to remove the particulate contaminants remaining in the inside of the lifting jacket when lifting the particulate contaminants floating on the upper end of the booster box a pipeline coupled with the submersible pump an underwater pump for completely removing fine contaminants introduced into the purifier box by using a water injection nozzle formed at an end of a pipe connected to the pipeline and a discharge control valve coupled to a discharge control valve for controlling discharge of light organic matter molecules floating at the upper end of the purifier box at a downstream portion of the purifier box the process of cleansing polluted river water or contaminated rainwater using a river water or rain water purification system configured to purify polluted river water and contaminated rainwater by separate discharge is characterized in that the multifunctional water gate configured to store the river water to store river water or rainwater and to open the inflow adjusting gate constructed in the purifying box to inflow river water or rainwater into the inside of the purifying box and the air discharge pipe connected to the air pump continuously blows air into the purifying box to flood the contaminant molecules having a low specific gravity contained in the river water or rainwater flowing into the purifying box into the upper part of the purifying box and the large size lifting rake constructed in the damper is continuously rotated to remove large sized obstacles and small sized contaminants contained in the river water or rainwater and at the same time the lifting barrel coupled with the conveyor belt is continuously rotated thereby removing organic material contaminants which are light in weight on the upper part of the polluted river water or rainwater from the outside of the purifier box and at the same time continuously operating the submerged pump and the injection nozzle to completely remove the remaining particulate organic matter to remove through a point source and nonpoint source pollution river water and rainwater various waste and contaminants that are fully processed or stored in clean constant and non point sources of pollution generated in the processing system contained in the"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101927400-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "the storage tank includes a nonpoint source pollution reduction device installed at one end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the storm reservoir tank to remove contaminants and non point pollutants contained in the rainwater flowing through the inlet and an upper water purification unit installed at the other end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the stormwater storage tank to pumped stormwater stored in the stor age storage tank through the nonpoint pollutant reduction apparatus to highly purify the purified water a device the piping is installed at one end so as to be submerged in the stormwater in the storm reservoir and the other end has a high pressure spray nozzle at the end and is installed in the upper hollow portion of the storm reservoir an air supply device comprising an installed water supply pipe a pump mounted on the water supply pipe and pumping rainwater in an excellent storage tank and an air supply unit mounted on an exposed part of the water supply pipe and injecting air into the rainwater pumped into the water supply pipe the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention can be achieved by a storm water storage tank.the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention prevents or minimizes the flood damage in the event of heavy rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}]</data>
