uch as a high temperature piezo bender and any suitable wires such as high temperature wires with shielding jacketing and or conduit may be provided"}, {"pat_id": "US-4343683-A", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "the pumps 182 and 192 like pumps 132 and 134 are submersible and hence any heat generated thereby is utilized to raise the temperature of the water in the storage system"}]</data>
