assembly having one end connected to a water inlet provided at an upper end of the water storage tank and the other end connected to a roof drain of a building a water supply pipe connected to the lower end of the water storage tank and connected to the water storage tank a water pump mounted on the transfer tube to pump the storage tank in the water storage tank an advanced water purifier connected to the water storage tank to purify and sterilize the stored water stored in the water storage tank and supply the water to the drinking water and a water spraying hose connected to the water storage tank to connect the water storage tank to the water storage tank so as to use the water storage tank as the garden water and the wash water.the assembled storm water storage tank according to the present invention can be assembled and used in a simple and quick manner so as to have the capacity of the water storage tank in accordance with the required excellent use amount and can be used as drinking water in case of emergency and also the effect of water saving and flood control of the water supply is very large and the installation cost can be remarkably reduced.1 is an installation view showing an installation state of an assembled rainwater storage tank according to the present invention fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101552006-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "the assembled rainwater storage tank 10 according to the present invention having the above described structure can be installed rapidly and firmly to meet the capacity suitable for the building at low cost and can use rainwater as drinking water for drinking water and emergency drinking water it is possible to prevent flood control in the rainy season and typhoon as well as to surely prevent pollution by contaminated initial rainwater by eliminating a large but early power without extra power.10 assembly type stormwater tank 20 water storage tank tower 21 lower block 22 water quality observation block 23 upper block 24 c