length adjusting plate member 140"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102757669-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "referring to the drawing above drainage ditches are installed in various places such as roadsides parks and amusement parks to drain sewage such as rainwater and gratings g and garbage collection outlets 100 are installed in the drainage ditches to block the drainage ditches during normal times to prevent the drainage ditches from being clogged by foreign substances such as fallen leaves or cigarette butts and to prevent foul odors and the inflow of rats or pests and to quickly discharge sewage when rainwater suddenly flows in during rainy weather including heavy rain during the rainy season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101597496-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "preparing a plurality of concrete blocks digging a circular hole having a circular sidewall laying a mixture of soil and quicklime on the bottom of the circular pit to form a compaction layer installing a plurality of concrete blocks along the edges of the compaction layer connecting the adjacent blocks to each other to form the concrete block in a circular shape filling and compacting a mixture of rubble and salt on the compaction layer inside the concrete block to form a filling layer forming a cylindrical frame by connecting the columns to the concrete block so that the columns are spaced apart and connecting the plurality of columns erected at intervals with each other using the column connecting members attaching a plurality of panels to the cylindrical frame to form a cylindrical wall installing a waterproof bag inside the cylindrical wall and providing a passage for allowing the water of the waterproof bag to be discharged to the outside at a lower end portion of the cylindrical wall and providing water discharge means provided with a valve for opening and closing the passage the step of forming the compaction layer comprises the step of mixing 30 to 50 kg of quicklime per cubic meter of the local soil and laying