bility in the main material forming the void"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449090-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in order to solve this problem it is a device to prevent the backflow of sewage odors to the manhole and the rainwater smoothly flows into the sewer pipe and in the absence of rainwater it blocks the inlet through which rainwater flows into the atmosphere from the sewer pipe or manhole bucket"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100582121-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the storage block of claim 1 wherein a plurality of the storage blocks are arranged in a straight line along each of the outer sides of the storage block so as to surround the outer portion of the storage tank and the upper block may support the upper block on the storage block or an inner portion of the storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100582121-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "therefore research on a new storm storage tank that is structurally stable easy to manage internally and unnecessary waste of materials has been continued in the art.the present invention is to solve the above problems to provide a new coupling structure of rainwater storage facility through the combination of the block and the slab through which rainwater storage tank to prevent waste of unnecessary materials and to secure sufficient internal space it aims to provide"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100841267-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "an inflow pipe 2 into which rainwater and sewage flow in a discharge pipe 4 for releasing some of the rainwater and sewage introduced into the inflow pipe and a collecting pipe 3 into which sewage including floating impurities is introduced from the inflow pipe and a overflow control device having a overflowware 1 arranged to block the collecting pipe and the inflow pipe from the discharge pipe a guide wall 7 interposed between the opening of the inflow pipe and the overflowware to raise a water surface in the vicinity to prevent a water gradient from the opening of the inflow pipe toward the overflowware the lower end of the guide wall is located below the upper end of the overflow wear the upper end is located above the upper end of the overflow wear the water surface control apparatus for drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100841267-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "an inflow pipe 2 into which rainwater and sewage flow in a discharge pipe 4 for releasing some of the rainwater and sewage introduced into the inflow pipe and a collecting pipe 3 into which sewage including floating impurities is introduced from the inflow pipe and a overflow control device having a overflowware 1 arranged to block the collecting pipe and the inflow pipe from the discharge pipe a guide wall 7 interposed between the opening of the inflow pipe and the overflowware to raise a water surface in the vicinity to prevent a water gradient from the opening of the inflow pipe toward the overflowware the lower end of the guide wall is located below the upper end of the overflow wear the upper end is located above the upper end of the collection pipe the surface control apparatus for drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102702375-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the present invention was created to solve the above mentioned problems and needs and the purpose of the present invention is to provide a method for manufacturing a sewage prevention and odor blocking permeable grating that increases water permeability by using eco friendly cork and easily drains water even during heavy rain or monsoon rain while preventing sewage from flowing in and blocking odors.in order to achieve the above object a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking water permeable grating according to an embodiment of the present invention comprises an outer frame forming a frame to be installed on the upper part of a rainwater drain or a drain an inner frame forming a plurality of square spaces by intersecting a plurality of horizontal and vertical bars in a grid shape inside the outer frame and a water permeable block filling the square spaces formed in the inner frame the method comprising a a preparatory step of preparing the outer frame and the inner frame and cork b a crushing step of crushing the cork into a size of 6 to 9 mm c a coating step of immersing the crushed cork in a waterproof coating solution and taking it out in a state where the coating solution has been applied d a drying step of drying the waterproof coated cork at 70 to 80 c using a vibrating device b a mixing step of mixing the dried cork with a binder and c a pressing step of pressing the mixed cork into the square space at 80 to 90 c using a heat roller"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102702375-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "referring to the drawings mentioned above a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking permeable grating s100 according to an embodiment of the present invention comprises a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking permeable grating 100 including an outer frame 110 forming a frame that is installed on the upper part of a rainwater drain or a drain an inner frame 120 in which a plurality of horizontal and vertical bars 121 and a plurality of vertical and vertical bars 122 intersect in a grid shape to form a plurality of square spaces 120h inside the outer frame 110 and a permeable block 130 filled in the square spaces 120h formed in the inner frame 120"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101111185-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition another object of the present invention is to reduce the rainwater discharge load to reduce the rainwater pumping station and sewage treatment plant load to prevent flooding and flooding and to adjust the rainwater discharge according to the flow rate of rainwater flowing into the purification block"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101111185-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "in addition when a plurality of purification blocks are connected and connected to a rainwater pumping station or a sewage treatment plant rainwater is stored in the purification