  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200203779-Y1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "if the soldering parts are damaged to reduce the watertightness causing a problem of leakage of sewage or rainwater and in severe cases the main drain pipe hole or the connection socket 18 may develop to breakage.the present invention was devised to solve all the problems of the related art and its purpose is to provide a connection socket with its own cushion so that the airtightness can be maintained without a separate packing or soldering when joining and there is no partial damage even by external impact"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101246202-B1", "para_id": "para_81", "text": "the water collecting groove 402 provides a volume for collecting water introduced into the concrete structure 400 due to leakage of water supply pipes or inflow of rainwater and a worker is provided with a water pump hereinafter not shown separately provided through the inspection opening 401"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200499204-Y1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "however there was a problem that a step inevitably occurred inside the expansion pipe section which could lead to leakage of sewage or rainwater.the present invention was created to solve the above mentioned problems and the purpose of the present invention is to provide a rubber ring for watertightness and step removal by being inserted into a part where polyethylene pe double walled pipes or multi walled pipes having an expansion section formed at one end are connected to each other so that the double walled pipes or multi walled pipes can be connected to each other without a separate joint pipe and by eliminating the step created inside the expansion section the leakage of sewage water and the intrusion of unknown water can be prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300300-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in addition the elastic packing 1 is interposed between the end pipe 12 and the connecting pipe 13 the elasticity is generated it is possible to adjust a slight angle in any direction 360 and can adjust the angle of the connecting pipe 13 it is possible to construct a natural slope suitable for the terrain and to prevent the breakage and departure from natural phenomena such as repeated ground subsidence and elevation so that the life of the rainwater receiver can be extended"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101136508-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "therefore it is possible to fundamentally prevent the leakage of odors or pests generated by decaying miscellaneous matters accumulated in ordinary times or generated in drainage or sewers to the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101136508-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "therefore it is possible to fundamentally prevent the leakage of odors or pests generated by decaying miscellaneous matters accumulated in ordinary times or generated in drainage or sewers to the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200195784-Y1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "therefore when the sewage and rainwater introduced into the main sewage pipe 10 flows back to the branch sewer pipe 12 or conversely the rainwater or sewage introduced into the branch sewer pipe 12 enters the main sewer pipe 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200368643-Y1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "it is an object of the present invention to provide a resin reinforced joint structure to prevent the inflow and leakage of internal sewage and rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "EP-2885467-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "if the occurrence of water is detected this can be passed on via the control unit just like any other leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the water discharge member of claim 1 further comprising an index member at each side end of the rear body block the connection block and the front and rear block cover plates to prevent leakage of rainwater stored in the reservoir formed in a horizontal sealed structure through a fastening member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "at this time each one end of the rear body block and the connecting block and the front and rear block cover plate is further provided with an index member so as to prevent the leakage of rainwater stored in the reservoir made of a closed structure of the horizontal form through the tightening member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_51", "text": "at this time the upper and lower ends of the connection block is characterized in that the water discharge member is further provided so as to prevent the leakage of the rainwater stored from the reservoir made of a vertical closed structure through the weight of each member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_55", "text": "seating groove having a bottom surface of the form is formed the upper edge of the suction pipe seating member is characterized in that the water supply member is further provided to prevent the leakage of rainwater between the bottom plate and the suction pipe seating member bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_67", "text": "in addition one side end of the rear body block 10a that is one side end of the rear body block 10a formed with the coupling groove 14 from the water storage tank 1 made of a closed structure of the horizontal form through a tightening member 35 the index member 17 is installed to prevent leakage of the stored rainwater wherein the index member 17 is made of a general rubber material or a synthetic resin material so that the rear body block 10a and the connecting block 20 or it performs a sealing role between the rear body block 10a and the rear block cover plate 30a"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_74", "text": "an index member 33 made of a general rubber material or a synthetic resin material is installed to prevent leakage of rainwater stored from the water storage tank 1 having a horizontally sealed structure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_87", "text": "in addition the upper end of each of the connection block 50 the water r