  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200203779-Y1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "if the soldering parts are damaged to reduce the watertightness causing a problem of leakage of sewage or rainwater and in severe cases the main drain pipe hole or the connection socket 18 may develop to breakage.the present invention was devised to solve all the problems of the related art and its purpose is to provide a connection socket with its own cushion so that the airtightness can be maintained without a separate packing or soldering when joining and there is no partial damage even by external impact"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300300-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in addition the elastic packing 1 is interposed between the end pipe 12 and the connecting pipe 13 the elasticity is generated it is possible to adjust a slight angle in any direction 360 and can adjust the angle of the connecting pipe 13 it is possible to construct a natural slope suitable for the terrain and to prevent the breakage and departure from natural phenomena such as repeated ground subsidence and elevation so that the life of the rainwater receiver can be extended"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100596680-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "sedimentary causes of sewage can include various reasons such as not ensuring optimum flow rate in the conduit protruding other through and connecting pipes reverse gradient and inequality due to breakage and failure of construction and dumping of contaminants through rainwater or manholes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100478606-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "the luminous reflector 70 was installed to prevent breakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101017356-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "the third object of the present invention is to use a resilient force of the metal plate material without using the coupling means but can be elastically installed on the inner periphery of the drain pipe convenient disassembly and assembly while preventing the breakage of the drain pipe during installation in addition the present invention provides a odor reduction screening device for drainage pipes capable of removing impurities contained in initial rainwater and sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101012226-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in addition the conventional partition wall has a problem that the shrinkage phenomenon occurs in the winter the lifting phenomenon occurs on the mating surface to cause leakage and the breakage of the partition wall due to expansion in summer.the present invention has been made in view of the above problems the object of the present invention not only can adjust the height of the main body according to the change of rainwater and sewage but also a plurality of the main body by fixing a single reinforcing beam and coupling force and by increasing the stiffness of the body to prevent distortion of the body due to water pressure and further provided with a support beam in the body to improve the durability and to adjust the length of the body in accordance with temperature changes to prevent damage to the body to provide sewage and storm divider assemblies for sewage pipes with"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102626577-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "in the present invention the fixing cover can be fixed to the inside of the main body of the water meter protection box through the fixing means provided on the fixing cover thereby preventing the problem of rising of the insulation due to the inflow of rainwater or groundwater and preventing the loss of the insulation and the loss of the insulation by preventing the rise of the insulation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101043661-B1", "para_id": "para_55", "text": "the porosity formed by the filler 133 filled in the mesh 131 or the box structure 134 is preferably made of 20 to 40 which is when the porosity formed by the crushed stone is 20 or less this is because the spacing is not made to drain the rainwater smoothly and when the porosity is 40 or more the spacing between the crushed stones is opened which may cause breakage of the penetration tube 122 due to settlement of the filler"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100900679-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "and the manhole formed in this way is buried underground to protect the inside of the manhole body from the outside by the manhole cover or to prevent the backflow of rainwater and sewage such as vibration shock and other factors caused by the vehicle passing around the manhole due to the separation of each component of the manhole the flow and breakage of the manhole occurs and if the road surface and the height or inclination of the manhole cover due to the repacking of the road is different from each other the uneven surface of the road will be caused"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "in order to solve this problem the reinforcement core is molded in the molding of the lid to prevent breakage and deformation caused by impact and the sealing bushing is formed on the inner surface of the lid so that the rainwater can be prevented from flowing into the inner wall of the water meter protector"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100804203-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "this intrusion is caused by indirect intrusion caused by various kinds of piping failures such as pipe breakage and poor connection at the pipe connection due to the aging of the sewer trunk 301 and the sewer pipe 302 and through the manhole cover and the domestic drainage facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200339472-Y1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in order to prevent breakage of the fume pipe joint due to the flow rate and water pressure of the sewage flowing out of the concrete manhole and to prevent leakage of the fume pipe coupling hole in the concrete manhole the fume pipe of the concrete manhole it relates to a coupling device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102836032-B1", "para_id": "para_43", "text": "accordingly the manhole cover for rainwater according to the present invention can be manufactured in an environmentally friendly manner compared to manhole covers manufactured from cast iron casting and has a high strength relative to its thickness thereby preventing breakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101506117-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "first the high initial initial rainfall that occurs at the time of sewage or rainfall inflowing into the city can be collected in the sewage subway pipeline through the sewage discharge section and the large amount of rainfall introduced into the large amount during rainfall is increased by the water pressure the opening of the sewage water discharge pipe is reduced by rotating the rotating plate by the linkage part and the link part linked with the open front water gate and the linkage part linked thereto to prevent the inflow of rainwater and soil to the sewage water supply pipe channel and discharging it to the discharge river it is possible to reduce the dredging cost by cutting off the earth and sand and it is possible to reduce the sewage treatment cost because it is possible to collect only the planned amount of sewage in the sewage subway pipeline as well as the breakage of the sewer pipeline and manhole due to the water pressure caused by the over can be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100868067-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole such as rainwater and sewage and in particular the appearance is beautiful and firmly constructed to not only beautify the appearance of the city but also to prevent breakage caused by the impact of the lumbar impact or pressurization of the weight during use and also prevent slippage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100774588-B1", "para_id": "para_67", "text": "therefore water is dispersed and dropped by the guide plate 33 while the sewage falls in the middle of the main rotation opening and closing plate 31 to prevent breakage of the main rotation opening and closing plate 31 during long time use"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100699326-B1", "para_id": "para_67", "text": "on the other hand in places where the risk of breakage is large it may be molded of metal or opaque plastics but may be formed by forming a level gauge engraved on the outer circumferential surface to check the amount of rainwater collected"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101509202-B1", "para_id": "para_97", "text": "however since the present invention is installed solely with the water channel type collecting cores 2 there is no need to waste a lot of manpower and cost in maintenance because there is no connection part there is no problem of damage or breakage of the connecting portion and it is possible to fundamentally eliminate the soil pollution problem caused by leaking of rainwater and sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101301345-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "5 shows a state of use of controlling the storage space s of the rainwater storage tank by opening and closing the valve 13 the valve 13 connected to the section generated when the leakage of rainwater stored due to partial breakage of the rainwater storage tank to partially isolate the storage space s to prevent the outflow of water to the damaged section and to maintain normal operation of the rainwater storage tank other than the isolation section"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101301345-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "therefore when partial repair is required due to breakage of the storage block 10 as described above the valve v of the remaining transport pipe p1 except for the transport pipe p1 connected to the damaged storage block 10 is blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200483342-Y1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "it has a cold feeling that is not in harmony with the appearance of a house or a building it is covered with the rainwater reservoir of the color pattern and built in the inside space to prevent direct exposure to direct sunlight rain and wind so that even if it is used for a long time it does not cause deformation or breakage of rainwater reservoir and can prevent water from being spoiled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200483342-Y1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "it is possible to prevent the direct exposure to direct sunlight rain and wind by preventing the rainwater storage tank of the uniform color pattern from being covered with the inside of the rainwater storage compartment or breakage of the water can be prevented and the decay of the water can be prevented and the ceiling portion is formed with a sloped slope at a constant angle so that the snow or rain can flow without falling"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102079279-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "in this configuration although it consumes electrical energy and requires installation of a separate sensor motor and controller the initial rainwater inlet 61 of the initial rainwater storage unit 60 is clogged with contaminants or the initial rainwater storage unit even if the initial rainfall is not stored due to breakage of 60 the storm guide unit 50 may be driven as a driving source based on the information detected from the sensor thereby storing the storm"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101321349-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "as in the conventional case it is possible to detect the amount of water introduced through the inlet by using a flow meter but the flow meter has a high price and the zero point is inaccurate due to corrosion and breakage causing problems in performance"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5388757-B2", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "in this case the amount of rainwater in the tank main body 2 can be confirmed in advance by the measuring tube 18 by the above described method thereby avoiding inconveniences such as unexpected water breakage in the middle of watering and performing good watering"}]</data>
</edge>
