  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200418493-Y1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "although it is possible to prevent freezing of the water meter 5 the insulation cover 6 and the insulation tube 8 are formed in several pieces so there is no choice but to form a gap in the assembly part and the water meter box 10 in addition there is a gap between the fuselage 1 and the lid 2 so cold air from the surface flows through the gap or rainwater or groundwater or sewage from the surroundings permeates into the fuselage 1 it was caused by frost that caused frost or freezing inside the fuselage 1 due to the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101346424-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "the gravel bottom penetration facility installed at the bottom of the storage tank should be more than 10 13 mm per hour considering the infiltration rate of the lower layer soil and should be installed in the area where the function is not degraded by freezing in winter.the present invention is to solve the problems as described above the object is to provide a storage and permeation interlocking device of rainwater effluent which can easily adjust the size and shape and excellent workability by using a plastic cell as a pillar of the storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101070356-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "the geotextile 71 is to protect the unit storage frame 100 the order sheet 72 is to block the inflow of rainwater through the driveway 70 and to guide the inlet 13 the insulation reference numeral 73 is a heat insulating material to prevent freezing in winter and the reinforcement 74 is a geogrid to improve the strength of the road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102480228-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "this is to prevent the water stored in the rainwater storage tank 400 from freezing due to a temperature change in the winter season by maintaining a buried state while allowing rainwater to be easily collected"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in particular when the water meter is installed underground it is difficult to completely prevent freezing of the water meter in winter because it is vulnerable to the inflow of moisture groundwater and rainwater from underground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "therefore in order to sufficiently prevent freezing of the water meter a method capable of blocking the inflow of moisture groundwater rainwater etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "thereby sufficiently preventing freezing of the water meter in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "thereby sufficiently preventing freezing of the water meter in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "claim_7", "text": "the method of claim 5 the body portion comprises an upper and a lower unit the upper end of the lower unit is formed in the receiving portion in an expandable shape is accommodated the lower end of the upper unit in the receiving portion the insulating layer is the inner periphery of the receiving portion and the upper unit the freezing prevention rainwater reservoir characterized in that consisting of a closing ring for closing the top of the receiving portion and the top of the heat insulating material between the outer periphery of the lower end"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "therefore the present invention has been made to solve the problems of the prior art as described above in the sewage inlet pipe is not frozen sewage trapped in the trap in particular that the cold air flowing from the storm water collection can is delivered to the sewage inlet pipe the purpose is to provide a sewage receiver for preventing sewage from the sewage inlet pipe by freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "wow an elbow shaped rainwater discharge pipe communicating with the partition plate and discharging rainwater to the outside of the body a sewage inlet pipe configured at one side of the sewage collecting container and configured to protrude a trap into the sewage collecting container and having a heating wire installed therein the sewage inlet pipe is formed in a lower position than the sewage inlet pipe characterized in that the sewage inlet pipe particularly in the trap portion of the sewage freezes during the winter the sewage flow back to the problem the sewage inlet pipe it is to prevent freezing of winter sewage by heat generation by installing heating wire"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "it will be able to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101130757-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "in addition in the present invention between the rainwater discharge pipe 120 and the sewage inflow pipe 130 the heat insulating layer 150a 150b 150c in which the heat insulating material 152a 154b 152c is embedded is further configured to communicate with the atmosphere it is possible to prevent the cold air of the winter season from being delivered to the lower portion from the sump a can be delivered to the sewage inflow pipe 130 to prevent the sewage freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267401-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the air nozzle 20 is provided integrally with the injection pipe 21 and at the same time one or more are fixed so that the supplied air is sprayed so that water can circulate in the storage tank 80 and at the end of the injection pipe 21 a fitting 22 is provided so that one touch coupling with the air supply hose 23 is possible and the fitting 22 is installed on the side surface 12 of the main body 10 and the inner receiving space of the main body 10 11 is filled with anti pollution means 30 in which elvan quartz loess balls activated carbon and charcoal are mixed to prevent contamination or deterioration of stored water and a perforated groove 41 at the upper end thereof to prevent separation the formed cover plate 40 is coupled and fixed to the main body while on one side of the edge of the main body 10 a heating wire 50 for preventing freezing and a temperature at which the inside temperature is sensed to transmit a signal to the controller 70 one or more water pollution prevention units d having the sensor 60 installed and fixed are disposed on the bottom of the storage tank and fixing the water pollution prevention units installed and fixed in series or parallel when the rainwater collected through the rainwater pipe passes through the filter and is stored as water in the storage tank the stored water is contamination prevention means 30 by spraying air from the air nozzle 20 of the water pollution prevention unit d and sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100942717-B1", "para_id": "para_45", "text": "insulation material 10ac is filled in the separation space formed between the first plate 10aa and the second plate 10ab can be used in the form of urethane the winter of the water tank 10 by the temperature drop outside such as it prevents freezing of rainwater stored inside to prevent the collection tank 10 from freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100751233-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "rainwater that does not contain organic matter can be obtained in the purified water tank by using the u trap thereby mitigating load fluctuation due to contaminants and automatically backwashing the filter thereby maximizing the efficiency of the filter to maintain the piping system of the heavy water treatment apparatus clean thereby providing safer heavy water making it possible to utilize precious water resources and also to provide a heavy water system that can prevent freezing in the winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101147801-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "since the upper surface of the rainwater storage apparatus 10 can be recorded by this it can contribute to the improvement of a global environment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449313-Y1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "therefore in winter a small amount of water rainwater or tears accumulated on the bottom of the barrel can be quickly drained to the