t_id": "KR-101680010-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "that is in the conventional case when the check valve structure includes a nonmetallic material such as rubber it can not withstand repetitive shocks and easily breaks to cause leakage and the check valve made of a metal material has an internal check function there is a problem that the fluid is not accurately and smoothly operated due to strong impact of pneumatic and hydraulic pressure and malfunction occurs or partial leakage occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101932393-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in order to obtain a stable amount of treated water w1 it is necessary to increase the pressure of the supply pump for supplying the for treatment water w so that not only the power consumption is increased there is a problem that the risk of leakage from the ion device becomes high"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6686893-B2", "para_id": "para_64", "text": "the measured value deviates from the predicted value control target due to the unintended start or end of water use an increase in the amount of water leakage water theft a pump or pipe failure or a hydraulic pressure measurement device failure or physical failure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101068780-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "because the confidentiality is maintained by the sewage is smoothly discharged in the process there is no risk of opening more than necessary to prevent the leakage of odor or various harmful insects"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200266017-Y1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "to this end the downstream water supply pipe 4 connected to the elevated water tank installed on the roof of the high rise building the horizontal pipe 5 installed in parallel with the downward water supply pipe 4 and the horizontal pipe 5 connected to the meter 6 is provided and the interior pipe 11 having the bent portion 12 the intermediate valve 21 installed in the cross pipe 5 for reducing the water pressure to a predetermined pressure or less and the cross pipe 5 in the water supply piping