  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101396233-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "the spring is absorbed by the spring acting on the stirring wing to prevent the stirring wing from being damaged and the lifting plate is caused to behave by the spring deformed by the absorbed force and the water is automatically supplied by the measured value there is a purpose to be able.in order to accomplish the above object the present invention provides a fueling apparatus for an axial flow resource in which an axial feeder for feeding axial feed to one side of a stirring vessel is provided and an extrusion molding device is installed on one side of a lower portion of the stirring vessel a water channel 33 is formed inside the stirring shaft 31 and a water channel 33 is formed in the inside of the stirring blade 32"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101703883-B1", "para_id": "para_58", "text": "accordingly when the needle is suddenly increased by the sudden blowing of sewage the elevation member lifts the bottom of the screen to a predetermined height from the bottom surface of the water channel it is possible to prevent damage or breakage of the screen and to ensure a long service life"}]</data>
</edge>
