north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200430484-Y1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "it is introduced by itself while maintaining the same water quality and the same water temperature at the time of intake and at the same time prevents the contamination of the groundwater system and simultaneously withdraws and pumps the water automatically"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102910833-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "according to one embodiment the multi effect desalination device includes a first treatment device including a first injection port for spraying untreated water to generate first steam a first heat exchange channel for condensing the first steam to generate fresh water and a first fresh water channel for storing and moving the fresh water generated through the first heat exchange channel and a second treatment device including a second injection port for receiving and spraying untreated water remaining after the first steam is generated from the first treatment device to generate second steam a second heat exchange channel for condensing the second steam to generate fresh water and a second fresh water channel for storing and moving the fresh water generated through the second heat exchange channel wherein the first steam may have a relatively high temperature and a high pressure and the second steam may have a relatively low temperature and a low pressure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101720174-B1", "para_id": "para_85", "text": "as a result the sensing unit 270 is separated from the moving block 250 as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the anti icing system installed inside the sidewalk canal of an underpass a body part which is installed on the floor according to the width of the side channel water pipe and includes a lower frame to which the electric heating wire can be mounted and a column or plate to which a sensor can be attached to either side or one wall side of the water channel pipe can be erected a temperature sensor attached to a pillar or plate positioned on one or both walls of the main body or connected to the main body and installed at separate locations on one or both walls of the water pipe to measure the surrounding temperature to derive a temperature measurement value a humidity sensor attached to a pillar or plate positioned on one or both walls of the main body or connected to the main body and installed at separate locations on one or both walls of the waterway pipe to measure the surrounding humidity to derive a humidity measurement value a flow measurement device attached to the inner wall of the drain pipe located at the lower end of the side channel waterway and measuring the amount of water flowing from the side channel channel through the drain pipe to the collection well to derive a flow rate a heating wire mounted inside the lower frame of the main body to prevent freezing of the side channel and a control unit controlling driving of the heating wire using the temperature measurement value and the humidity measurement value measured by the temperature sensor and the humidity sensor anti icing system comprising a"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102193417-B1", "para_id": "para_84", "text": "here the pillar or plate is a part that rises upward from the main body so that freezing detection sensors such as temperature sensors and humidity sensors can be installed on both or one wall side of the water pipe.if the direction of the water channel is said to be front and rear the left and right sides it may be located on one or both side walls and in fig"}]</data>
