  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200395622-Y1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "even if the waterway 70 is completely closed the water is prevented from being contaminated because the stored water is continuously discharged over a part of the water pipe 50.as described above according to the present invention the deep water of the stored water is sprinkled and discharged to the outside according to the low water level thereby inducing the movement of the stored water thereby preventing water pollution"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101172182-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "moreover the present invention detects running water continuously supplied through waterways inside the frame and applies power only when water is supplied thereby preventing unnecessary electricity use and electrode wear caused by this and always keeps water into the lower water tank in the waterway inside the frame"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101224277-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "according to the initial rainwater storage system for sewage and valley water separation using the storage tank according to the present invention by overflowing the dividing wall during rainy weather to prevent contamination of the valley waterway and also to sewage initial rainfall and valley water rainwater on the other hand due to the initial rain that is supercharged during rainy weather the initial rainwater that has not been purified by the excess of the maximum treatment capacity of the sewage treatment plant is discharged to the river to prevent the river from being polluted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101450430-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "1 to 3 rainfall runoff on roads and other road surfaces is introduced into an existing waterway through an induction waterway and a separate flow distribution structure a pretreatment tank and various abatement facilities are installed in the existing waterway it can be seen that the initial effluent is introduced into the abatement facility and the rainwater effluent from which the non point pollutant is removed through the abatement facility is reintroduced into the existing canal thereby removing the nonpoint contamination of the initial effluent"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200375164-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "by assembling and constructing them in order the groundwater is treated with effluents into the culverts connected to prevent contamination of the groundwater or the sewage and wastewater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101927400-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "the storage tank includes a nonpoint source pollution reduction device installed at one end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the storm reservoir tank to remove contaminants and non point pollutants contained in the rainwater flowing through the inlet and an upper water purification unit installed at the other end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the stormwater storage tank to pumped stormwater stored in the stor age storage tank through the nonpoint pollutant reduction apparatus to highly purify the purified water a device the piping is installed at one end so as to be submerged in the stormwater in the storm reservoir and the other end has a high pressure spray nozzle at the end and is installed in the upper hollow portion of the storm reservoir an air supply device comprising an installed water supply pipe a pump mounted on the water supply pipe and pumping rainwater in an excellent storage tank and an air supply unit mounted on an exposed part of the water supply pipe and injecting air into the rainwater pumped into the water supply pipe the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention can be achieved by a storm water storage tank.the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention prevents or minimizes the flood damage in the event of heavy rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}]</data>
</edge>
