ice the piping is installed at one end so as to be submerged in the stormwater in the storm reservoir and the other end has a high pressure spray nozzle at the end and is installed in the upper hollow portion of the storm reservoir an air supply device comprising an installed water supply pipe a pump mounted on the water supply pipe and pumping rainwater in an excellent storage tank and an air supply unit mounted on an exposed part of the water supply pipe and injecting air into the rainwater pumped into the water supply pipe the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention can be achieved by a storm water storage tank.the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention prevents or minimizes the flood damage in the event of heavy rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102321943-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "the present invention relates to a process of excavating to a predetermined depth to form a water channel along the slope of the cut off site a process of constructing a wire mesh block by combining a wire mesh structure to be disposed at the bottom of the excavated water channel and a sustenance structure and a wire mesh block as a waterway the process of arranging the sub wire mesh to the side wall of the wire mesh block and the process of combining the lower part of the sub wire mesh with the bottom wire mesh protruding from the side wall of the wire mesh block the process of arranging the sub wire mesh joined to the lower part of the wire mesh block to be inclined in contact with the side wall of the waterway the process of fixing the side wire mesh and the auxiliary wire mesh using a latch and adjusting the gap between the auxiliary wire mesh and the side wire mesh the process of continuously connecting th