  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102069616-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "leakage monitoring system of leaky water pipe"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4441460-B2", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "a method for identifying a water leak point of a waterway according to claim 1 the said 3rd process wherein the discharge part of the said sawdust mixed water is movable to the direction of a water channel the specification method of the water leak location of the water channel characterized by the above mentioned"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4441460-B2", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "a method for identifying a water leak point of a waterway according to claim 2 the discharge part of the sawdust mixed water is a floating body that floats on the water surface in the target area of the leak test and the sawdust mixed water is discharged from the discharge part in the horizontal direction and the location of the water leak point of the water channel is specified method"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4441460-B2", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "the method for identifying a water leak point in a water channel is characterized in that the sawdust mixed water is discharged in a horizontal direction from the discharge section"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4441460-B2", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "thereby sawdust mixed water is discharged toward the side walls on both sides of the water channel from the pair of nozzles and sawdust gradually settles near the side walls on both sides.according to invention of claim 1 the said water leak location can be pinpointed by finding the sawdust left in the shape of a hump in the water leak location of a waterway"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4441460-B2", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "within this range the material and shape of the material constituting the floating body can be appropriately changed.it is sectional drawing which shows the water channel which implements the identification method of the water leak location which concerns on embodiment of this invention.it is explanatory drawing which shows the identification method of the water leak location of this waterway.the sawdust discharge part used for the specific method of this water leak location is shown a is a front view b is a rear view.it is a fragmentary sectional view which shows the state which the said sawdust accumulated in the leak location.it is a fragmentary sectional view which shows the repair method of the said water leak location"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100735064-B1", "para_id": "para_60", "text": "in this state after coupling the water lake h to the outlet pipe 110 and then remove the stopper 136 of the air inlet 134 provided in the packer 130 the packer 130 shrinks while the air is discharged as a result the channel 112 is opened"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200436228-Y1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "the present invention relates to a water channel that provides a passage through which water flows and more particularly even with a simple connection structure the sealing performance is excellent thus effectively preventing a pipeline leak at the connection part of the front and rear body parts and easily on site"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6889881-B2", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "a monitoring method and causes the monitoring step the soil pressure or applied to the pipe detected by the earth pressure sensor for storing the detection data of the strain of the pipe detected by the strain sensor to the data logger the tube and leakage determination step of determining the presence or absence of water leakage the said water pressure in the pipe is detected by the pressure sensors used in waterways after the leakage determination step leak location to identify the leakage position by introducing a leak exploration robots it is characterized by having a specific step"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100698889-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "in this case a defect occurs due to corrosion of the control valve 40 installed inside the manhole 10 and protected by the manhole and in case of emergency the control valve does not operate properly which may cause a great damage.the present invention is to solve the above mentioned conventional problems the groundwater to prevent the infiltration of the groundwater into the manhole through the improvement of the water film structure on the waterway entrance and exit side of the manhole the facility example inside the manhole that is protected by the manhole accordingly for example an object of the present invention is to provide a water supply manhole leak prevention facility that can prevent corrosion of control valves"}]</data>
</edge>
