  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102200910-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a drain pipe including a drain pipe upper plate a drain pipe lower plate disposed below the drain pipe upper plate and a holder mounted on an opening provided on the drain pipe upper plate by checking the flow of drainage in real time or periodically through the opening and closing of the top surface it is possible to determine whether the drainage pipe is clogged and whether the drainage pipe is repaired or not and find a countermeasure for the construction of the drainage pipe and repair of the defect and compare the situation and emergency measures in advance a drainage inspection port for checking the flowing state of the drainage passing through the designated location among the drainage pipes while watching and and a collecting well for collecting drainage flowing through the drain pipe and discharging the large capacity drainage collected by the collecting water to a downstream waterway and the drain pipe top plate includes a water vein pipe connected to the opening to prevent the soil material or contaminants separated from the pavement material existing on the road or ground from entering the drain pipe and a permeate guide pipe that supports left and right sides of the lower side of the water vein pipe it is manufactured as a facility having an inverted y shape and the lower plate of the drain pipe using one material selected from concrete metal nonferrous metal synthetic resin and plastic it is manufactured in a shape of a shape and a u shape and has a plurality of third drainage holes perforated on both left and right sides or bottom and a water permeable pad is attached to the left and right sides or bottom and is connected to the top of the drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102200910-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "a drainage inspection port for checking the flowing state of the drainage passing through the designated location among the drainage pipes while watching and a water collecting well collecting drainage flowing through the drain pipe and discharging the large capacity drainage collected by the collecting water to a downstream waterway"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101129512-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "in addition by checking the piping connected to the inside of the water tank during the reinforcement of the water reinforcement it checks whether there is an abnormality in waterproofing at the connection part and repairs it when the aging of the pipes and the waterway proceeds thereby enhancing the effect of remodeling the water tank"}]</data>
