  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101162228-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "there was.the present invention was created in view of the above mentioned problems in the prior art and the vegetation protrusions and vegetation holes are formed at both sides including the bottom surface of the waterway block so that the movement and vegetation of the animals are easy and the flow rate it reduces the erosion of the channel by reducing the erosion and the width of the channel can be freely changed because the lower part is a prefabricated type and the key is formed at the bottom of the installation to prevent conduction buckling and crushing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200346152-Y1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "in order to build a waterway put several block supporters 1 for the channel of the present invention while laying the ground and crushing the soil and connecting the support sections with bolts 4 or other connecting means using a coupling plate 3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0127564-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the inflow water is introduced into the inlet 51 through the inlet 51 is formed in a rectangular shape so that it can be discharged through the other outlet 52 inside the inflow water to the screen unit 10 of the screw device 20 inflow tank portion 50 formed with a waterway guide surface 53 so as to be to detect the water level of the inflow water flowing into the inflow tank portion 50 to stop the operation of the detection signal device or to adjust the speed of the inflow to the inlet port 51 of the tank section 50 and a water level detection control unit 60 for controlling the opening and closing of the gate valve 510 to be engaged with each other a solid conveyance unit 70 formed with the screw 21 in a non spindle shape and having a blade having a predetermined pitch it is formed so as to have a blade in the reverse direction on the screw 21 end drive side of the solid conveying portion 70 and the saw blade shaped cutting blade 81 is integrally formed on the tip side of the blade to crush the compressed and dehydrated solids crushing unit 80 and the brush 91 is planted in the outer peripheral edge of the tip blade of the screw 21 is formed integrally with the crushing unit 80 by the rotation of the screw 21 11 automatic screen device for solid waste collection of the waste water treatment facility characterized in that consisting of the washer portion 90 to sweep up"}]</data>
