  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102058301-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "round water pipe circular drain ditch the present invention relates to a circular waterway pipe installed along the roadside and the waterway side to drain the rainwater smoothly more specifically the pipe made of synthetic resin material is installed in close contact with the inner channel of the circular waterway tube made of concrete material it relates to a circular waterway pipe that allows rainwater to flow through a pipe made of synthetic resin material without directly contacting the inner surface of the inner waterway thereby reducing corrosion of the circular waterway pipe and suppressing the occurrence of odor"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102617451-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a settling basin 10 consisting of a planar circular bottom plate installed in a sewage treatment plant or water purification plant and a side wall 11 outside the bottom plate and a side wall of the settling tank in 11 a planar annular channel 20 is formed which has a concave groove and an overflow wear surrounding the inside of the concave groove with a corrosion resistant steel material a cover portion 110 consisting of an outer frame 120 and a cover casing 130 in the shape of a trapezoid with an outer circumference width larger than the inner width so as to cover the waterway 20 and an outer support member 140 that supports the outer frame 120 on the inner surface of the outer wall 21 of the water channel 20 it is coupled to the sediment side end 151 of the overflow weir 150 of the waterway has a certain height is coupled to the outer frame 120 and consists of a connection hinge that can rotate so that the outer frame 120 can be opened toward the top"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100698889-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "in this case a defect occurs due to corrosion of the control valve 40 installed inside the manhole 10 and protected by the manhole and in case of emergency the control valve does not operate properly which may cause a great damage.the present invention is to solve the above mentioned conventional problems the groundwater to prevent the infiltration of the groundwater into the manhole through the improvement of the water film structure on the waterway entrance and exit side of the manhole the facility example inside the manhole that is protected by the manhole accordingly for example an object of the present invention is to provide a water supply manhole leak prevention facility that can prevent corrosion of control valves"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102215279-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "however although the above described corrosion prevention drainage is not corroded by hydrogen sulfide in sewage or a concrete waterway pipe to prevent corrosion due to neutralization of concrete the acid rain that can be applied to the polymer concrete drainage pipe is alkalinized and neutralized"}]</data>
</edge>
