y module provided to supply power to the above automatic opening closing module a foreign matter removal module arranged adjacent to the water pipe and equipped to vibrate while moving along the water pipe to separate foreign matters a control module provided to control the operations of the temperature detection sensor the automatic opening closing module the power supply module and the foreign substance removal module using the above administrator terminal including a step in which the above temperature detection sensor monitors the external temperature in real time a step for the temperature detection sensor to send a notification to the administrator terminal when the external temperature falls below a preset temperature a step in which the above administrator terminal transmits a control signal toward the above control module a step of controlling power to the power supply module by the control signal transmitted by the control module a step in which the power supply module supplies power to the automatic opening closing module and the foreign matter removal module a step for controlling the opening closing valve of the water pipe by using the automatic opening closing module according to the control signal transmitted by the control module a step in which the automatic opening closing module controls the opening closing valve to open close the water pipe a step of removing ice and foreign substances from the water pipe by using the foreign substance removal module according to a control signal transmitted by the control module an automatic water pipe opening closing device for preventing freezing comprising a feature for performing the above"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102818339-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "according to an embodiment of the present invention for solving the above problem an automatic water pipe opening closing device for preventing freezing includes a temperature detection sensor 10 installed in a water pipe to detect an external temperature and t