er supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner diameter of the body the outer peripheral surface of the partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body is coupled to the top of the body a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve it is coupled to the lower end of the body and the freeze proof coupling body having an upper portion and a water discharge pipe in the lower portion a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring coupled to one side of the freeze protection assembly a stopper accommodated inside the freeze protection assembly and coupled to a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring a freezing hole is formed at the bottom of the body at room temperature through the fire valve and the stopper to form a sealed structure the fire retardant shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve and water is injected through the water injection port sprinkler having a freeze protection structure characterized in that the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined freezing temperature water flows through the freeze protection hole and the water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "because of its structural characteristics the possibility of freezing in a low temperature environment is high so it is mainly used in places where there is no fear of freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "the present invention in order t