reezing of the water meter and equipped with a clip to closely fix the position of the pipe of the water meter this is possible and the purpose of the present invention is to provide a water meter protection box using geothermal heat that can prevent freezing of water meters as the geothermal heat pipe that is inserted deep into the ground flows into the protection tube through the geothermal heat higher than the average temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "providing the effect of preventing freezing of water meters as the geothermal heat pipe that is higher than the average temperature flows through the geothermal tube.1 is a cross sectional view showing a water meter protection tube using geothermal heat according to the present invention figure 2 is a perspective view showing the strainer of the water meter protection cylinder using geothermal heat according to the present invention 3 is a perspective view showing a clip of a water meter protection tube using geothermal heat according to the present invention 4a to 4c are perspective views sequentially showing a clip of a water meter protection tube using geothermal heat according to the present invention figure 5 is a cross sectional view showing a state of mounting the clip of the water meter protection cylinder using geothermal heat according to the present invention figure 6a is a cross sectional view showing a water meter protection cylinder using geothermal according to an embodiment of the present invention figure 6b is a cross sectional view showing a water meter protection cylinder using geothermal heat in accordance with another embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "since the temperature of the geothermal 3 can be kept constant even if the outside temperature drops below zero because it flows in it is possible to prevent freezing of the water meter 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102106221-B1", "para_id": "para_18",