  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101484030-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "an excellent soil purification apparatus for purifying sewage discharged to a superior soil through a secondary collector a pretreatment needle settling vessel 110 having an inflow hole 111 formed at a lower side thereof so as to allow contaminated sewage to flow therein so as to gradually increase the water level from the bottom surface and to precipitate and remove contaminant particles and contaminants having a large specific gravity and a communication hole 121 for receiving the sewage introduced into the pre processing settling tank 110 and disposed above the settling tank 110 so that the water level of the sewage gradually increases and the purified water a space forming part 100 including a purifying space part 120 formed with an outflow hole 122 through which the exhaust gas flows a buoy 210 floating on the sewage flowing into the purifying space 120 and a filter material 220 compressed as the buoy 210 rises by the sewage flowing continuously a purifier 200 comprising compression means 230 for causing the filter media 220 to compress each other as the buoy 210 rises lt rti the compression means 230 includes a circulation induction plate 231 fixed at a predetermined height of the purification space 120 on the lower side of the buoy and having a plurality of flow holes 231a penetrated therethrough a moving plate 232 having a plurality of flow holes 231a formed therein so as to be able to move upward and downward in the lower space 220 of the purifying space 120 and having one end fixed to the buoy 210 and the circulation induction plate 231 and the other end is connected to the moving plate 232"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101491882-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "47 a body 31 having a space 46 is provided an opening closing ball 48 for closing and opening the water supply port 43 by buoyancy is introduced into the space 46 when water flows in or out a shock absorber 49 is provided below t