  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101396233-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "the spring is absorbed by the spring acting on the stirring wing to prevent the stirring wing from being damaged and the lifting plate is caused to behave by the spring deformed by the absorbed force and the water is automatically supplied by the measured value there is a purpose to be able.in order to accomplish the above object the present invention provides a fueling apparatus for an axial flow resource in which an axial feeder for feeding axial feed to one side of a stirring vessel is provided and an extrusion molding device is installed on one side of a lower portion of the stirring vessel a water channel 33 is formed inside the stirring shaft 31 and a water channel 33 is formed in the inside of the stirring blade 32"}, {"pat_id": "US-11970410-B2", "para_id": "para_94", "text": "in some embodiments it may be desirable for the higher elevation reservoir or tank to be underwater or under the sea surface to for example to protect or reduce exposure to body of water waves and or other kinetic energy typically concentrated near the ocean surface which may for example including but not limited to one or more or any combination of the following reduce riser fatigue or reduce vessel fatigue or increase longevity or lifespan or design life or reduce cost or reduce amount of material required or any combination thereof"}]</data>
</edge>
