 body is longer than the lower end the flange portion a plurality of first bolt holes are formed through the circumference of the disc a plurality of fitting protrusions are formed on the front surface of the disc and a step is formed on the inner side of the disc to accommodate the coupling piece in a circumferential direction rear flange and a plurality of second bolt holes are formed along the circumferential direction and a fitting hole is formed in the fitting hole the packing flange being formed on the front surface of the front flange rti gt wherein the flange portion is attached to the flange portion by an adhesive in a state where the coupling piece is seated on the stepped portion and the fitting flange is engaged with the fitting flange so that the front flange and the rear flange are combined"}, {"pat_id": "US-7238281-B2", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "the placement of first baffle 34 within inner chamber 20 reduces the turbulence of the water flowing into inner chamber 20 and directs oil and floatables to the center of passage 40 thereby enhancing the effectiveness of absorbent adsorbent material 42"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101552006-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "however since the conventional rainwater storage tanks are manufactured in a conventional manner the rainwater storage tanks need to be manufactured separately in order to have a rainwater storage tank having a capacity suitable for the building there is not provided means for eliminating the initial storm contaminated with non point pollutants so that secondary pollution may occur due to the use of the stored water contaminated with the non point sealant material in the storm water storage tank the installation work takes a long time and the installation cost is also high.summary of the invention the present invention has been made in view of the above mentioned problems of the prior art and it is an object of the present invention to provide an air conditioner which can be easily assembled and installed according to installation condition and usage amount of a building to be installed the present invention provides a built up type rainwater storage tank which can be used as water potable water fire water and washing water can be used as drinking water in an emergency and can also function as a flood control in the city when it rains.the object of the present invention is to provide a rainwater storage tank installed on a building to store rainwater in a rainfall and to use stored rainwater as various living water wherein the rainwater storage tank includes a water storage tank top for storing water a water pipe assembly having one end connected to a water inlet provided at an upper end of the water storage tank and the other end connected to a roof drain of a building a water supply pipe connected to the lower end of the water storage tank and connected to the water storage tank a water pump mounted on the transfer tube to pump the storage tank in the water storage tank an advanced water purifier connected to the water storage tank to purify and sterilize the stored water stored in the water storage tank and supply the water to the drinking water and a water spraying hose connected to the water storage tank to connect the water storage tank to the water storage tank so as to use the water storage tank as the garden water and the wash water.the assembled storm water storage tank according to the present invention can be assembled and used in a simple and quick manner so as to have the capacity of the water storage tank in accordance with the required excellent use amount and can be used as drinking water in case of emergency and also the effect of water saving and flood control of the water supply is very large and the installation cost can be remarkably reduced.1 is an installation view showing an installation state of an assembled rainwater storage tank according to the present invention fig"}, {"pat_id": "US-10941535-B2", "para_id": "para_83", "text": 