on december 20 2013 sewer pipe flow meter accordingly an object of the present invention is to provide a method of measuring a flow rate of a sewer pipe which can measure a more accurate flow rate by removing foreign matters mixed in sewage flowing through the sewage inlet pipe and measuring the water level and flow rate of the sewage in the sewage outlet pipe .according to an aspect of the present invention there is provided a sewing machine comprising a floor net secured to a floor of a manhole body in a manhole including a manhole body having a sewage inlet pipe connected to an upstream side and a sewage outlet pipe connected to a downstream side a wall vertically coupled to an edge of the bottom net and having an upper end coinciding with a lower end of the sewer outlet pipe and a lower end of the sewer outlet pipe a filtration means including a partition net dividing the space into a space and a downstream space and passing through the sewage and a foreign substance and a filter net coupled to an upper end of the wall in the downstream space a water level meter for measuring the level of the sewage discharged through the sewage discharge pipe a water level measuring device installed at the upper end of the peripheral wall of the sewage discharge pipe a flow rate measuring unit for measuring a flow rate of the discharged sewage an input unit for inputting a flow rate measurement mode a flow rate calculation unit for calculating a flow rate of the sewage and a sectional area of the sewage calculated from the inner diameter and the water level of the sewage discharge pipe a memory unit for storing a flow rate measurement program and storing a unique number of the manhole a control unit for outputting a control command to the water level meter and the flow rate meter according to an input signal of the input unit a control unit for acquiring a flow rate value from a flow rate data table for each of the water level and flow rate according to the flow rate value by t