control device 40 70 one end is connected to the collecting pipe 10 and the inlet pipes 22 52 84 provided with hydraulic pressure gauges 21 51 81 for checking the water pressure of the effluent and the inlet pipe 22 52 84 the drain pipe 23 53 85 and the main pipe 24 54 87 connected to the drain pipe 23 53 85 the inlet pipe 22 52 84 is provided with locking ends 25 52a 82 on the upper inner circumferential surface and a cover for preventing foreign matter from penetrating the upper ends of the main tubes 24 54 and 87 body parts 20 50 and 80 fastened to open and close 27 55 and 86 installed inside the body parts 20 50 80 the eluent water flowing into the inlet pipes 22 52 84 is opened and is drained to the drain pipes 23 53 85"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913996-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "as a preferred embodiment of the present invention the water level adjusting part is seated at the end of the lifting and drained by the pressure of the effluent flowing into the inlet pipe and is supported by the guide to prevent the reverse flow of the effluent by falling the hydrological member the compression spring that is installed in an upright position on the upper part of the hydrological member provides a compression force and the upper end of the compression spring is coupled and a moving ruler that determines the moving distance when the compression spring is pressurized passes through the cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913996-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "as a preferred embodiment of the present invention the water level adjusting portion is seated at the end of the lifting and turning by drainage by the pressure of the effluent flowing into the inlet pipe and by turning the vice versa to support the slide hinge to prevent the inflow of the effluent it is installed in the up and down state of the shanghai swivel hydrological member the link is installed to be rotated to the upper portion of the hydrological member the guide pipe is connected to the link and pivoted to