water and it is an object of the present invention to provide a functional grating which can prevent an odor from being generated because the inlet can be shut off and the opening and closing can be made constant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to minimize the initial excellent water remaining in the water channel does not cause water pooling the remaining water does not decay there is an effect of reducing the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_76", "text": "a margin can be provided and the amount of rainwater remaining in the waterway can be minimized so that water pooling does not occur and the remaining rainwater can be decayed or reduce the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101230730-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "according to the present invention as described above while planting vegetation on the side of the vegetation soil while water is continuously supplied to the vegetation through the water storage unit and the water supply surface rain water in the water storage unit through the water supply path formed in rain water by allowing heavy water to be filled such as eco friendly and continuous supply of moisture to the vegetation without additional management work it is very easy to maintain and manage the vegetation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101669813-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "the apparatus is formed into a rectangular box shape extending in forward and backward directions the upper part of the front surface is formed with an inflow port through which rainwater collects and an upper part of the rear surface is formed with an outlet for discharging rainwater filtered for recycling"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "as a system to recycle rainwater the rainwater recycling system 100 includes a rainwater inlet grating 10 mounted on a surface of a road 8 to blo