g through the inlet and an upper water purification unit installed at the other end of the inner hollow ceiling portion of the stormwater storage tank to pumped stormwater stored in the stor age storage tank through the nonpoint pollutant reduction apparatus to highly purify the purified water a device the piping is installed at one end so as to be submerged in the stormwater in the storm reservoir and the other end has a high pressure spray nozzle at the end and is installed in the upper hollow portion of the storm reservoir an air supply device comprising an installed water supply pipe a pump mounted on the water supply pipe and pumping rainwater in an excellent storage tank and an air supply unit mounted on an exposed part of the water supply pipe and injecting air into the rainwater pumped into the water supply pipe the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention can be achieved by a storm water storage tank.the rainwater storage tank according to the present invention prevents or minimizes the flood damage in the event of heavy rainfall and has a non point pollution source reduction device an advanced water purification device and an air supply device it is stored in a reduced state and continuously supplies the air in the storm water to be stored for a long period of time"}, {"pat_id": "EP-2914779-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the invention relates to a water filter in particular a rainwater filter in a cistern with a housing in which a sieve is arranged which divides the housing into a dirty water chamber and a pure water chamber the dirty water chamber via an inlet for water to be filtered and a waste water drain for the unfiltered water and the pure water chamber has a pure water outlet for the filtered water with a cistern overflow which opens via a siphon into the waste water drain and the further features of the preamble of claim 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200420604-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the device installed in the large sewe