dium 60 it is installed on the lower side of the filtration layer 70 and includes a sump 80 for collecting rainwater filtered through the filtration layer 70 located between the cover 40 and the distribution plate 50 is formed so as to penetrate the side 24 of the case 20 to the outside to guide the initial superiority exceeding the design capacity to the existing storm pipe further includes a pass pipe 23 the inner space 66 of the filter container 60 is filled with a filter medium including a wood chip chip processed by chipping the thin thin material filtration and adsorption capacity of non point pollutants and zeolite activated carbon for supplying nutrition to vegetation the filtration layer 70 is composed of a first filtration layer 72 composed of small particles such as sand and a second filtration layer 74 composed of crushed stone having a larger particle size than the first filtration layer 72"}]</data>
