"finish", "require", "draw", "close", "rotate", "classify", "galvanize", "install", "maintain", "extend", "case", "drain", "pin", "need", "monitor", "shape", "select", "input", "hinge", "continue", "exist", "be", "age", "rack", "dredge", "collect", "generate", "bleed", "mark"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to minimize the initial excellent water remaining in the water channel does not cause water pooling the remaining water does not decay there is an effect of reducing the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_76", "text": "a margin can be provided and the amount of rainwater remaining in the waterway can be minimized so that water pooling does not occur and the remaining rainwater can be decayed or reduce the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100636832-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "more specifically when the water level of the reservoir rises to a high level due to a failure of the existing water level control valve it is discharged through the overflow water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "US-10612227-B2", "para_id": "para_231", "text": "the storm water management system 100 can be sealed to prevent the accumulated storm water from entering infiltrating the underlying surface 10"}, {"pat_id": "US-4797028-A", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "various methods have been used in an attempt to prevent beavers from blocking the inlet of flood control risers in water reservoirs and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101501179-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "especially it is difficult to secure the site because it requires a separate site to install the contact tank and it is difficult to select the site"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor