100238498-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "therefore the weight of the flute 286 must be made to overcome the vacuum pressure temporarily applied to the upper surface 292 so that the flute 286 can be lowered in response to the fall of the sewage level in the sump pit 154"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200480951-Y1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "according to an aspect of the present invention there is provided a grating apparatus having a clogging alarm and an odor shielding function according to the present invention for introducing rainwater and sewage on a road or a ship into a sewer line buried underground an outer frame which is seated on the upper surface of the sewer installed on the surface a plurality of bearing bars spaced apart from each other by a predetermined distance on the inner side of the outer frame and having a sewage inlet formed in mutually spaced spaces an opening closing plate for opening closing the sewage inlet with a plate member having a shape corresponding to the sewage inlet one end portion of the plate is pivotally coupled to the opening closing plate and is supported on the bottom surface of the opening closing plate so as to open close the sewage inlet and the other end is coupled to the inner frame of the outer frame or the bearing bar spring at least one hydraulic pressure sensor provided on an upper surface of the opening closing plate a data transmission means for transmitting the water pressure information sensed through the water pressure sensor to the management office by wire or wirelessly wherein when the water pressure sensed by the water pressure sensor is equal to or greater than a predetermined value it is determined that the upper part of the grating is blocked and an alarm sound is generated in the management office"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102257819-B1", "para_id": "para_79", "text": "at this time since check valves are built in the upper inlet j1 and the lower inlet j2 of the hydraulic jack 2350 it is possible to maintain a stable s