e of the water the magnetic switch 123 is driven so that the circuit module 125 and the power source 121 are electrically connected and the circuit module 125 and the electrolysis network 140 are in contact with each other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100863481-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in addition the method for generating ionized water using the ionized water generating device according to the present invention includes a water inflow step s100 in which water is introduced through the inlet 110 the magnetic switch 123 due to the hydraulic pressure of the water driven is connected to the circuit module 125 and the power source 121 is electrically connected to the power supply step s200 the circuit module 125 and the electrolysis network 140 is electrically connected to the the foreign material removal step s300 in which the water passes through the strainer 144 to remove the foreign matter s300 the electrolytic reaction occurs between the first conductive network 141 and the second conductive network 142 to the conductive structure electrolysis step s400 that the ion particles are eluted from the 130 and the ionized water discharge step s500 to discharge the ion water eluted with the ion particles to the water from which the foreign matter is removed through the withdrawal unit 150 done can lose"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101847963-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in order to prevent interruption of the supply of water during an emergency including the occurrence of a leak in a water pipe and the replacement of a water pipe water is installed in the bypass pipe so that water flows along a bypass pipe connected to the water pipe and water is supplied to the water pipe a non powered emergency operating valve driven by an operating water pressure which is a hydraulic pressure difference between a water pressure of a supply side constant and a user side constant of a water supply pipe a valve body installed in the bypass pipe the valve body having an inlet through which a cons