ol device 40 70 one end is connected to the collecting pipe 10 and the inlet pipes 22 52 84 provided with hydraulic pressure gauges 21 51 81 for checking the water pressure of the effluent and the inlet pipe 22 52 84 the drain pipe 23 53 85 and the main pipe 24 54 87 connected to the drain pipe 23 53 85 the inlet pipe 22 52 84 is provided with locking ends 25 52a 82 on the upper inner circumferential surface and a cover for preventing foreign matter from penetrating the upper ends of the main tubes 24 54 and 87 body parts 20 50 and 80 fastened to open and close 27 55 and 86 installed inside the body parts 20 50 80 the eluent water flowing into the inlet pipes 22 52 84 is opened and is drained to the drain pipes 23 53 85"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913996-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "the body portion 50 is connected to the water collecting pipe 10 the hydraulic pressure gauge 51 for checking the water pressure of the effluent is installed the inlet pipe 52 is formed with a locking end 52a at the end of the discharge water is discharged a drain pipe 53 having a slide hinge 53a formed inside the upper end and draining the effluent in the opposite direction of the inflow pipe 52 and a main pipe 54 connected to the drain pipe 53 the upper end of the main pipe 54 located between the drain pipe 53 and the inlet pipe 52 is configured to be fastened to open and close the cover 55 to prevent foreign substances from penetrating"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101206997-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "making a step installing fixed tube guide means each having a predetermined shape at an inlet of the manhole and an inlet of the conduit installing a movable traction force attenuator for reducing the traction force of the traction winch between the front fixing portion of the first flexible tube and the wire of the traction winch towing the first flexible tube mounted on the flexible tube feeder equipped with the freezing facility in the state where the curable resin is impregnated into the predetermined section of the pipeline to be rehabilitated through the manhole using a towing winch inverting injecting the resin impregnated second flexible tube inside the first flexible tube pulled into the conduit using hydraulic pressure or air pressure to cause the resin impregnated portions of the first and second flexible tubes to adhere to each other by inverting the second flexible tube a heat source is supplied to the first and second flexible tubes having a state in which the second flexible tube is in close contact with the inner wall of the pipeline to harden and integrate the resin impregnated in the first and second flexible tubes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102257822-B1", "para_id": "para_79", "text": "at this time since check valves are built in the upper inlet j1 and the lower inlet j2 of the hydraulic jack 2350 it is possible to maintain a stable state because it does not leak easily unless the supplied hydraulic pressure is pressed and removed.100 flow meter sensor 110 sewage pipe 200 data collection device 300 monitoring server"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101050751-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "foul smell isolation installation of manhole the present invention relates to a malodor blocking device of the manhole and more particularly a plate in which an inlet hole is formed in the center portion to support the manhole cover to inflow the external fluid a reservoir formed in the lower end of the plate and the reservoir it is composed of a blocking film to seal the lower end is normally closed by gravity and magnetic material the blocking film automatically seals the lower end of the reservoir to smoothly block odors flowing back and forth from the water and sewage an open film is formed on the blocking film the open film is a blocking film by rotating to the contrary in rainy or rainy days the water and sewage pipes are flooded and opened to the backflowing fluid to discharge the fluid to the outside to prevent the opening of the manhole by hydraulic pressure 