north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in a slope 62 formed over a wide area for the purpose of creating grassland and forest a road 63 formed with a slope 67 at the edge so as to penetrate the slope 62 a water tank 71 provided between the front and rear walls 31 to prevent the slope 67 from sinking and a vegetation block 30 formed with a vegetation zone 33 provided with a water supply hole 44 perforated in the front wall 31 to plant landscaping trees 46 in a protruding manner an assembly block 30 30 assembled in a layered structure and a slope 67 formed in an arid or hilly area where a renewable energy generation device 100 formed with solar and wind power generation devices 60 68 is built near a field 74 or a grassland or forest management area on the slope in a slope 62 in which a plurality of afforestation blocks 30 are stacked on a slope 67 equipped to be planted in the above mentioned vegetation zone 33 a water tank 71 71 provided between the front and rear walls 31 of the afforestation blocks 30 30 assembled in the above mentioned stacked structure a vegetation zone 33 33 equipped with a vegetation wall 34 for planting landscaping trees 46 by protruding while a water supply hole 44 is perforated in the front wall 31 a moving gap 42 provided between a separate outer wall 32 in the rear wall 31 and afforestation blocks 30 30 are assembled in a stacked manner so that the moving gaps 42 are connected to each other an installation structure in a hilly area where a renewable energy power generation device for grassland and forest creation can be installed which is provided by assembling an assembly block 30 equipped with a vegetation wall 34 that is fixed to the outer section c of the vegetation block 30 connected to a water supply inlet 44 from a water tank 71 to support the lower section of the vegetation zone 33 33 while being assembled into the lower section of the above mentioned afforestation block 30 30 thereby preventing rainwater from collapsing due to subsidence on a slope 67"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_75", "text": "therefore the purpose of this invention is to provide power and equipment for collection in an economical and environmentally friendly manner by providing a renewable energy power generation device which is the main component of the present invention and a suction pump suction pipe and storage facility connected thereto"}]</data>
