ers and streams to block the inflow of salt water into water intake facilities and reinstall various fishway tunnel devices in the middle of rivers and middle dams and underwater weirs so that marine organisms can move to rivers and fish and shellfish can freely spawn in stable areas such as streams in valleys and the forestation project that improves the geological level of the river bottom to restore the natural ecosystem order and balance and maximizes ecosystem restoration activities"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromotive force generation 102d measuring point 102e reference point 103 thermocouple thermometer switch for detection sensor 103a configuration of thermocouple thermometer 103b temperature measurement limit 103c temperature 1 103d ammeter temperature scale 103e metal a 103f metal b 103g potential difference generated 103h thermocouple and compensation