er part to pass downstream of the stream"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102110404-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "in addition cleaning work to regularly remove sediment should be performed frequently and since the concrete block is small it is impossible for the worker to enter the storage tank and thus there is a problem in that it cannot be cleaned"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100805878-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "an elastic tubular body 11 which is installed in contact with the sewage pipe 1 adjacent to the river and forms a passage for discharging the fluid and installed on the outer periphery of the elastic pipe body and the river water level rises in order to block the reverse flow to press the elastic pipe to close the housing 10 to be coupled to the sewer pipe while wrapping the elastic pipe the elastic tubular body is installed on the pinch bar 21 which is installed inside the housing so as to be movable up and down from an outer circumference and the shaft bar 25 which is connected to the pinch bar while penetrating the inside and the outside of the housing while elevating along the level of the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100936376-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "it can be closed at both ends of the auxiliary frame or by opening and closing by the weight 22 of the upper coupled to the hinge 14 to block the odor rising from the drain and to block the backflow sewage but backflow when the sewer bursts or pops out from a weak place when blocked it is often better to discharge back to the road than to block when the sewer overflows due to heavy rain so it is not always good to prevent backflow of sewage.the present invention has been devised to solve the problems caused by the deodorization and insect repellent device of the conventional sewer as described above is normally closed to not send the sewage to the river to prevent odors or pests coming out to flow the sewage into the river if the water level in the stream is lower than the sewage level the sewage on the road will flow to the river and the dregs can be caught on top of it preventing foreign matter from entering the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102373416-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "however since only a sluice gate is installed in the conventional storage facility this function cannot be performed properly so there is a problem in that the purification treatment capacity of the sewage treatment plant cannot be accurately improved and the pollution of the river cannot be prevented.the purpose of the present invention which was devised in view of the above is to block the direct inflow of accidental runoff water into the buffer storage facility and to reduce non point pollution during precipitation and to link them with the sluice gate of the buffer storage facility so that the sluice gate can be installed according to the water quality"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3131661-B2", "para_id": "claim_7", "text": "a target water area such as lake water seawater river water dam water or the like is divided into a plurality of monitoring blocks and a nutrient index an organic matter index and a plankton index are calculated for each monitoring block and these indexes are calculated"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3131661-B2", "para_id": "claim_9", "text": "is divided into a plurality of monitoring blocks and the convection of the entire water area is determined based on the flow velocity water temperature and inflow outflow information into from each monitoring block"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3131661-B2", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also lake water sea water river water the target water area such as dam water is divided into a plurality of monitoring blocks and the convection of the entire water area is calculated based on the flow velocity water temperature and inflow outflow information to and from each monitoring block"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100996178-B1", "para_id": "para_64", "text": "in addition the present invention is inserted into a river structure or reservoir structure having a space in addition to the veg