material thereby reducing maintenance costs and efficiently removing suspended substances turbidity color e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102188471-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in the present invention when using the et high speed solid liquid separation device equipped with a zt generator to remove suspended substances and microorganisms when the reused water is produced from river water reservoir and sewage treated water filtration efficiency is improved by inhibiting the formation of microorganisms biofilm"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100729863-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "the present invention relates to a sludge removal and sewage treatment apparatus and method of the dredged soil and in particular the sediment and sediment deposited on the bottom of the river or reservoir using a dredger or pumpable device without draining the water of the stream or reservoir inhalation separation and purification of pollutants it is possible to carry out work while preserving and to selectively dredge only the parts that require dredging and to perform dredging to separate the gravel or sand contained in dredging soil for recycling purposes and to clean the stream the present invention relates to a sludge removal and sewage water treatment apparatus and method for dredged soil which can be re introduced into a reservoir or reservoir to prevent secondary contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101221721-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "by preventing the inflow of the river has the effect of preventing the contamination"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4163092-B2", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "for the purpose of preventing disturbances in this water use and contamination of the discharge water area in order to prevent the waste contained in rainwater from flowing into the reservoir river etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100447049-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "on the other hand according to another embodiment of the present invention can be centrally integrated management of each rainwater tortilla 20 connected