ugh the phone is the best way to prevent the contamination of the river water and also by using the method of discharging the water in the reservoir through the cyphon constituted in the sluice the substances contained in the water are combined"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101042852-B1", "para_id": "para_88", "text": "actions increase water contamination but confine water using a bottom drainage reservoir configured to discharge a large amount of water from the upstream of the stream through the bottom of the reservoir i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200422043-Y1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "it is possible to carry out work while preserving and to selectively dredge only the parts that require dredging and to perform dredging to separate the gravel or sand contained in dredging soil for recycling purposes and to clean the stream the present invention relates to a sludge removal and sewage water treatment device of dredged soil which can be re introduced into a reservoir or reservoir to prevent secondary contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101208694-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "therefore the blockage of the filter media is frequent the filtration efficiency is lowered there is a need for frequent backwashing there was a problem such that the function of storm water storage facilities to prevent the contamination of the river water is not properly performed.the present invention has been made to solve the conventional problems as described above can improve the excellent filtration efficiency and recycling degree can improve the backwashing efficiency during the backwashing of the first filtration unit and the washing of the reservoir it is possible to reduce the sludge sedimentation on the bottom surface while facilitating the drainage of washing water at the same time to perform additional filtration of rainwater without additional power and to prevent the re injury of sediment deposited on the floor surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100893952-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in this case since the rainwater continuously passes through the filter cartridge when heavy heavy rain or heavy rain occurs a backflow phenomenon occurs due to an overload and the rainwater cannot be purified but it flows directly into the river where the bridge is installed and the river is flowed into the vehicle s oil or metal powder tire powder or ascon oil on the bridge road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101489530-B1", "para_id": "para_54", "text": "this river is equipped with a sensor to measure the electrical conductivity of water to determine the degree of contamination of the flowing water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100763800-B1", "para_id": "para_273", "text": "the method of frequent discharge is the best way to prevent the contamination of river water and also by using the method of discharging the water in the reservoir through the lower part of the sluice the material binding action of the substances contained in the water it discharges pollutants such as aggregated sewage sludge and at the same time it accelerates the material acceleration material scavenging material decomposition material flotation and naturally cleans the polluted water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100763800-B1", "para_id": "para_307", "text": "actions increase water contamination but confine water using a bottom drainage reservoir configured to discharge a large amount of water from the upstream of the stream through the bottom of the reservoir i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100906421-B1", "para_id": "para_128", "text": "according to the present invention the technical aspects 1 minimize the waste of water resources solve the expected water shortage and dry river problems reduce the pollution load of the water quality ecosystem ecological destruction and budget waste due to dam construction etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102853309-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "according to the invention of a water intake contamination prevention facility utilizing a variable tidal current barrier and its operation method even when the water volume and velocity of a river fluctuate rapidly during a sudden typhoon or flood the facility can be automatically maintained thereby ensuring the safety of the facility and the water intake facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100381901-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in order to achieve the above object as well as other objects that can be easily expressed the present invention applies a contact oxidation method to increase the contact surface of the deeper contaminated river water and sewage or sewage and the contact media to reduce the contamination concentration but as crushed stone"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102328962-B1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "frequent discharge is the best way to prevent contamination of river water and if you use the method of discharging water from the storage space through the lower part of the sluice gate while discharging pollutants such as agglomerated sedimentary sludge it naturally purifies the polluted water quality by generating material acceleration material leaking material decomposition and material levitation and the upper part of the sluice gate is also used upstream of the river"}]</data>
