  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "claim_12", "text": "a structure comprising a dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 that naturally purifies polluted river water in a valley of a river or stream located higher than the sea or a large river a structure in which the lower discharge passage 223 is formed at the lower end of the above dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the above water storage device 1000 a structure in which the inflow control valve 222 is formed at one end of the lower discharge passage 223 a structure in which a power generation water movement line 331 is connected using a round or square pipe or a round square or rectangular concrete pipe configured to prevent leakage to the outside at the other end of the lower discharge passage 223 a structure in which the power generation water movement line 331 is installed in a form that goes over mountains and hills 221 and then an upward discharge line 332 is formed in a shape at the end of the power generation water movement line 331 so that it is 1 to 10 lower than the lower height and horizontal state of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 so that the power generation water discharged from the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 automatically falls downward by going over mountains and hills due to the action of gravity a structure in which a first acceleration discharge port 213 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at a high position above the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or river water stored in the storage facility 1000 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the frictional action and explosive action of materials naturally occurring between the power generation water passing through the power generation water movement line 331 that is constructed over mountains and hills a structure in which a secondary acceleration discharge port 215 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at the upper end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the material friction and material explosion that occur naturally between the power generation water passing through the above mentioned power generation water movement line 331 and the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to the outside at a position higher than the water level of the river water stored in the above mentioned dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or the above mentioned water storage device 1000 a structure in which the upper water tank 1503 is formed at the lower end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 a structure in which the lower discharge unit 1500 is formed at the lower part of the upper water tank 1503 a structure in which an emission control unit 203 is combined at the lower part of the above lower emission unit 1500 a structure in which the power generation unit 33 is combined with the lower part of the lower discharge unit 1500 the thickness and size of the upper water tank 1503 are such that the power generation water discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500 is easily discharged to the power generation unit 33 configured in the lower direction at a high speed due to the action of gravity and when the size and total discharge area of the lower discharge unit 1500 are converted to a ratio of 100 the storage capacity of the upper water tank 1503 is configured to be 1 000 to 16 000 larger in size and larger in capacity so that the power generation water flowing in through the dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the water storage device 1000 and the lower discharge passage 223 and the power generation water movement line 331 and the rising discharge line 332 is moved to the upper water tank 1503 and then discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102817242-B1", "para_id": "para_137", "text": "a structure comprising a dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 that naturally purifies polluted river water in a valley of a river or stream located higher than the sea or a large river a structure in which the lower discharge passage 223 is formed at the lower end of the above dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the above water storage device 1000 a structure in which the inflow control valve 222 is formed at one end of the lower discharge passage 223 a structure in which a power generation water movement line 331 is connected using a round or square pipe or a round square or rectangular concrete pipe configured to prevent leakage to the outside at the other end of the lower discharge passage 223 after constructing the above power generation water transfer line 331 by crossing mountains and hills 221 a structure in which a v shaped rising discharge line 332 is formed at the end of the power generation water movement line 331 so that it is 1 to 10 lower than the horizontal state and the bottom height of the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 so that the power generation water discharged from the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or water storage device 1000 automatically falls downward by gravity over mountains and hills a structure in which a first acceleration discharge port 213 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at a high position above the dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or river water stored in the storage facility 1000 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the frictional action and explosive action of materials naturally occurring between the power generation water passing through the power generation water movement line 331 that is constructed over mountains and hills a structure in which a secondary acceleration discharge port 215 for gravitational acceleration action is formed at the upper end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to discharge gaseous material molecules generated by the material friction and material explosion that occur naturally between the power generation water passing through the above mentioned power generation water movement line 331 and the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 to the outside at a position higher than the water level of the river water stored in the above mentioned dam reservoir lake movable weir 8888 or the above mentioned water storage device 1000 a structure in which the upper water tank 1503 is formed at the lower end of the above mentioned rising discharge line 332 a structure in which a lower discharge unit 1500 is formed at the lower part of the upper water tank 1503 a structure in which an emission control unit 203 is combined at the lower part of the above lower emission unit 1500 a structure in which the power generation unit 33 is combined with the lower part of the lower discharge unit 1500 the thickness and size of the upper water tank 1503 are such that the power generation water discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500 is easily discharged to the power generation unit 33 configured in the lower direction at a high speed due to the action of gravity and when the size and total discharge area of the lower discharge unit 1500 are converted to a ratio of 100 the storage capacity of the upper water tank 1503 is configured to be 1 000 to 16 000 larger in size and larger in capacity so that the power generation water flowing in through the dam reservoir lake movable reservoir 8888 or the water storage device 1000 and the lower discharge passage 223 and the power generation water movement line 331 and the rising discharge line 332 is moved to the upper water tank 1503 and then discharged through the lower discharge unit 1500"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413616-Y1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "in addition leakage of water and sewage occurs due to freezing and in the case of sewage there is a problem of causing pollution of surrounding soil and causing settlement of surrounding ground.the present invention is to solve the problems as described above sewage waterworks roads river banks and landfill leachate to prevent the sewage pipes from freezing by forming a foamed urethane layer after welding the reinforcement anchor to the outer surface of the sewage pipe the purpose is to provide a conduit freeze protection mat installation structure used for drainage work"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101039115-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "that is in the above mentioned construction method since the water pipe is connected in a long direction in one direction and the supporting force against the lateral pressure is extremely weak the water pipe easily buckles or twists due to the slight ground settlement of the water pipe buried ground there is a problem in that leakage of foreign matter and foreign matter may be generated through the gap"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413254-Y1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "however when the conventional water and sewage pipe constructed in this way is installed on the inclined surface of the ground 1 as shown in figure 1 due to the sliding phenomenon of the water and sewage pipe 10 the joint 11 of the water and sewage pipe 10 are spaced apart from each other a large amount of fluid is leaked to the outside through the separation portion there is a problem that causes serious environmental pollution of surface water and groundwater due to leakage in the case of sewage or waste water.the present invention is to solve the problems as described above by fixing the water supply pipe installed on the inclined surface to the fixed pile through the binding beam and the fastening band to prevent the sliding of the water pipe to prevent the joints from being damaged by the sliding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102898667-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "in any one of the clauses selected from clauses 1 and 2 a structure in which an operating unit 272 that is connected to the side or rear portion of the eco friendly movable barrier 8888 for preventing green algae growth formed on the upper portion of the above mentioned foundation concrete 800 and acts to erect or overturn the eco friendly movable barrier 8888 for preventing green algae growth is connected to one side and the other side of the upper portion of the above mentioned foundation concrete 800 by a support unit 297 a nature friendly eco friendly method for naturally purifying polluted river water using an eco friendly movable dam for preventing green algae characterized by a structure in which a supply unit 299 for supplying hydraulic oil required when erecting or inverting the eco friendly movable dam for preventing green algae on one side of the lower part of the above mentioned operating unit 272 is connected to a watertight member 295 that acts to prevent oil leakage while allowing rotation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200181920-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "due to the development of the industrial society the water is contaminated and the water of the river or lake cannot be used as drinking water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flas