 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100706160-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "thus in order to solve the above problems utility model registration 0413252 name manhole leakage prevention structure used in sewer road river environmental facility construction utility model registration 0385995 name manhole structure for leakage and inflow blocking utility model registration no"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102051029-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "the contaminant sensor 12 prevents the inflow of contaminated water by closing the raw water inlet valve 14 when oil leakage or rapid deterioration of water by a vessel occurs in the sea shore or river and the virus sterilization device 20 by removing harmful bacteria such as norovirus vibrio bacteria and cholera bacteria water is evenly introduced into the virus sterilizer 20 through the distribution screen 22 to remove the bacteria by contacting the raw water to the uv lamp or uvled 24"}, {"pat_id": "US-10358363-B2", "para_id": "para_43", "text": "wastewater means water from a manufacturing process municipal waste or other waters which are required to be treated prior to discharge to a receiving stream lake or other water way"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101185543-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "in other words it is necessary to develop a ubiquitous appeal management system that can monitor the quantity of water and water quality determined by various scattered water sources in real time and quickly observe analyze predict and predict urban river and ecological lake conditions.the present invention detects the quantity and quality of water inflow outflow pollutant inflow and pollutant source using inlet outflow using wide area water and monitors leakage and breakage by measuring the pressure of water pipeline to issue water quantity and water quality alarms it is to provide a ubiquitous based appeal management system that can remotely control the purification facility and analyze and predict the water balance for a long time and the water use index management method which is a dashin water usage guide"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "in this way by continuously supplying river water to rivers a certain amount of running water always flows during the dry season so that the ecosystem of the river can survive and the urban environment is greatly improved and in terms of sewer pipes as the solids content and chemical oxygen demand are lowered corrosion and breakage of pipelines can be prevented in advance and through this groundwater contamination due to leakage of contaminated water air pollution due to odor and miniaturized sewage treatment plant can be miniaturized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "the present invention relates to a joint fitting installation structure used for sewage waterworks roads river banks and landfill leachate drainage works to prevent leakage of the joints to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "in general leak treatment equipment is installed in joint sections of sewers used for sewerage waterworks roads river dikes and landfill leachate drainage to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100751573-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "that is in the above described construction method since the water supply pipe is connected in one direction long and the bearing capacity for the transverse pressure is very weak even if the slight ground subsidence of the water supply pipe is easily bent or twisted some breakage and gap may occur"}]</data>
