  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200413616-Y1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "the present invention relates to a conduit freeze protection mat installation structure used for sewage waterworks roads river dikes and landfill leachate drainage to prevent freezing of sewage pipes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413616-Y1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "in addition leakage of water and sewage occurs due to freezing and in the case of sewage there is a problem of causing pollution of surrounding soil and causing settlement of surrounding ground.the present invention is to solve the problems as described above sewage waterworks roads river banks and landfill leachate to prevent the sewage pipes from freezing by forming a foamed urethane layer after welding the reinforcement anchor to the outer surface of the sewage pipe the purpose is to provide a conduit freeze protection mat installation structure used for drainage work"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200305126-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "on one side of the solar heat collecting plate is composed of a solar heat collecting plate is connected to a conduit to transfer the temperature and a temperature controller to control the temperature and the heat collected from the solar heat collecting plate is connected to the bottom of the ball through the thermostat and the conduit it is configured to transfer the heat to the river water at the same time as it is selectively configured to transfer the heat to the river water while the temperature of the river water maintains a constant water temperature and at the same time between the buoyancy member and buoyancy member of the thread consisting of freezing and zigzag form by the role of the fish upstream relates to a water purification device using the buoyancy formula kkeunsang acting to improve the role and the contaminated water in the even that is configured to support the role of emitter and fish fins"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100408854-B1", "para_id": "para_43", "text": "in winter the floating hull 210 is submerged below a certain level by controlling the open pressure in the pipe through the valve to prevent freezing"}]</data>
