  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-6535392-B2", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "bethridge on ca transferred to the inflowing solvent before entering the thus heat exchanger 925 preheated the water and reduced the energy requirements of the system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200181920-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "due to the development of the industrial society the water is contaminated and the water of the river or lake cannot be used as drinking water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102882065-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "the present invention has been made to solve the problems of the prior art as described above and has a double sealing structure comprising an inner cover coupled to the upper end of a pipe connection socket and an outer cover coupled to the upper end of a sluice valve housing thereby preventing damage such as corrosion inside and outside of the sluice valve due to the inflow of foreign substances such as sewage from the ground and when supplying water to plants along a river the purpose is to provide a sluice valve having a double sealing structure in which a pipe connection pipe formed to be able to rotate 360 degrees is coupled to a pipe connection socket and a screw elbow and a hose is coupled to a hose connection of the screw elbow so that water can be supplied to plants along a river without tangling of the hose in any direction in the surrounding area"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100862400-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "however heat sources such as fresh water river water and sea water are temperature difference energy that is affected by the external environment such as distance from proximity to heat source ambient temperature and flow rate.in winter the coefficient of performance of heat pump system decreases and corrosion of air conditioning equipment it is easy to shorten the lifespan of the device and there is a problem that can cause secondary environmental pollution in the ecosystem when discharged in the present invention regardless of water quality problems or changes in the heat source environment the flow rate is constant throughout the year and the river or sea water the heat pump air conditioning system uses the sewage treatment water treated in the advanced sewage treatment system of the present invention which is warmer than general sewage because it has a stable water quality and maintains the temperature required for microbial activity compared to other sources"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101147332-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the remote monitoring and control system is driven using a power generated by hydropower generation in the low carbon permeable ecological structure the low carbon permeable ecological structure is a non cement material a plurality of non cement corrosion resistance pile 110 to be installed in the vertical direction by striking in the form of a grid matrix at a predetermined interval on the surface of the river a plurality of horizontal direction frames 120 in the form of spacers each coupled in a horizontal direction with the plurality of corrosion resistant piles to form a dam or beam shaped structure an ecological block 130 for purifying water which is injected into the structure along the plurality of horizontal frames to build the dam or beam structure into a permeable stream through which river water passes includes a water gate installed between the fish fish ecological block 140 and the plurality of non cement corrosion resistant piles installed in the lower portion of the water purification ecological block for use as fish or fish the low carbon permeable ecological structure is installed in a small stream the ubiquitous supervisory control system of the structure installed on the river characterized in that to control the low water by blocking only a part of the small stream rather than all"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101147332-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "the low carbon permeable ecological structure may include a plurality of non cement corrosion resistant piles installed in a vertical direction by striking a matrix at a predetermined interval on a surface of a river a plurality of horizontal direction frames in the form of spacers each coupled in a horizontal direction with the plurality of corrosion resistant piles to form a structure such as a dam or beam form an ecological block for water purification which is injected into the structure along the plurality of horizontal frames to construct a structure such as the dam or the beam into a permeable type through which river water passes and a water gate between the fish fish ecology block and the plurality of corrosion resistant piles installed under the water purification ecology block to be used as fish or fish"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101147332-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "on the other hand as another means for achieving the above described technical problem the low carbon permeable ecological structure according to the present invention a plurality of ratios are installed in the vertical direction by driving in a matrix form at regular intervals on the surface of the river cement corrosion resistance pile a plurality of horizontal direction frames in the form of spacers each coupled to the plurality of corrosion resistant piles in a horizontal direction to form a structure such as a dam or beam shape an ecological block for water purification which is injected into the structure along the plurality of horizontal frames to construct a structure such as the dam or the beam into a permeable type through which river water passes and a reef fish ecological block installed at a lower portion of the water purification ecological block to be used as fish or fish characterized in that a water gate is installed between the plurality of corrosion resistant piles to adjust the water storage amount"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101147332-B1", "para_id": "para_104", "text": "a method of monitoring and controlling a low carbon permeable ecological structure consisting of a plurality of corrosion resistant piles a plurality of horizontal framing frames in the form of spacers an ecological block for water purification and an ecological block for fishes and fishes first the low carbon permeable ecological installed at a predetermined position of the structure 100 receives the detected data from a plurality of sensors 210 to detect the conductivity water quality water temperature or quantity of river water by wire or wireless"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "in this way by continuously supplying river water to rivers a certain amount of running water always flows during the dry season so that the ecosystem of the river can survive and the urban environment is greatly improved and in terms of sewer pipes as the solids content and chemical oxygen demand are lowered corrosion and breakage of pipelines can be prevented in advance and through this groundwater contamination due to leakage of contaminated water air pollution due to odor and miniaturized sewage treatment plant can be miniaturized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "economic losses to construct sewage terminal treatment plant can be saved.the stream runoff procurement apparatus and method thereof according to the present invention always allow a certain amount of streams to flow through the river to survive the ecosystem of the stream and furthermore the contamination of the pipeline is prevented in advance so that the groundwater due to the corrosion and breakage of the sewer pipe is prevented"}, {"pat_id": "US-10859212-B2", "para_id": "para_149", "text": "thus these transfer functions are affected by physical changes in the pipeline 204 due to dents corrosion fluid density fluid flow rate fluid pressure within the pipeline 204 material surrounding the pipeline 204 and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100315306-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "corrosion of the pipelines leads to a reduction in the service life of the pipeline and a decrease in water supply capacity resulting in economic losses by increasing the load of the pump and also causing consumer complaints and complaints due to deterioration of water quality due to corrosion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100408854-B1", "para_id": "para_43", "text": "in winter the floating hull 210 is submerged below a certain level by controlling the open pressure in the pipe through the valve to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "US-5413718-A", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "then as a second step the oxygen contained in the surface water must be removed to prevent iron precipitation and corrosion of iron and steel components in the processing equipment"}, {"pat_id": "US-11162933-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "water supply systems are often intended to distribute water from a central source such as a water tower or river to consumers for use or consumption"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100555594-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "the apparatus provided in the chamber 200 is prevented from contacting with water and when external air is introduced into the apparatus chamber later the apparatus is discharged to the air inlet 201 thereby preventing corrosion of the apparatus"}, {"pat_id": "US-11519560-B2", "para_id": "para_128", "text": "to best predict the pressure at time of rupture initiation the interaction between anomalies should be appropriately considered in the assessment model"}]</data>
</edge>
