  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101788811-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "an activated carbon filtration unit in which raw water sucked from an emergency water feeder or a river or a river side is subjected to filtration treatment with a large particle while foreign substances are filtered through the sand and filtered water filtered by the sand filtration unit is re a filter cloth for holding a filter medium between the filter plates stacked in multiple means so that small foreign substances contained in the filtered water are filtered by the filter medium coated with the filter cloth while being supplied with the filtered water filtered by the activated carbon filter unit is provided a pressurized filter portion connected to a third raw milk feed inlet for feeding raw water to one side of the filter plate and connected to the other side of the third filtered water discharge pipe through which the filtered water is discharged from the filter plate and the filter cloth a membrane filter in which filtered water filtered by the filter is sucked and highly filtered to fine foreign matters a modular water production system comprising a part a filtration data storage unit for presetting and storing a state value of a water quality to be filtered by the modular water production system and a limit pressure value inside the operation unit a state of the water quality filtered by the modular water production system a water quality measurement data comparing unit for storing the data and a pressure measurement data verifying unit for checking and storing the filtration state by measuring the pressure inside each of the actuating units a water quality measurement monitoring unit a failure confirmation monitoring unit for checking the operation state of each operation unit of the modular water production system to check for a failure a system general status data storage unit in which the installation location and related information of the modular water production system a