 treated water storage tank 120b of the second storage tank 120 to the transfer sewage storage tank 120a and storing storm water and sewage water in the transfer sewage storage tank 120a and the treated water storage tank 120b and i discharging stormwater and sewage stored in the transfer sewage storage tank 120a and the treated water storage tank 120b to the sewage treatment plant and treating the sewage treatment plant 130 with stormwater and sewage lt rti the treated water recycling duct 150 may be embedded in parallel on the side of the sewage conveying pipe 140 so as to be utilized in a region having a small geographical radial gradient in order to secure the water supply end face of the combined sewage pipe 200 at the time of rainfall characterized in that the water supply and the flow control are adjustable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100523856-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "an integrated automatic control unit 300 connected to the unit and capable of checking and operating managing measurement data of the sewage treatment plant an integrated display unit 360 for displaying the measured data measured by the respective sensor units so as to be distinguishable monitoring and control unit 420 for monitoring and controlling the pollution state of rivers and rivers for water supply and sewage treatment by connecting the integrated automatic control unit distributed in various areas through a network a database unit 430 for storing measured data of quantity and water quality of each region and state information and manager information of each unit receiving the measurement data of the quantity and water quality of each area from a remote location the transmission unit for transmitting the control signal of the monitoring control unit to the sewage treatment automatic control unit or integrated automatic control unit and transmits to the external linkage engine 410 wow water quality management remote control system comprising a control system unit 400 consisting of a mobile communication terminal text transmission unit 440 for generating a short text message"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100523856-B1", "para_id": "claim_9", "text": "an integrated automatic control unit 300a connected to the apparatus unit and the automatic sewage treatment unit to check manipulate and manage the measurement data of the water tank and the sewage treatment plant an integrated display unit 360a for displaying the measured data measured by the respective sensor units so as to be distinguishable monitoring and control unit 420a for monitoring and controlling the pollution state of rivers and rivers supplying water supply and sewage by connecting the integrated automatic control unit distributed in various areas through a network a database unit 430a for storing measurement data of the obtained quantity and quality of each region state information of each part and administrator information receives the measurement data of the quantity and water quality of each area from a remote place and transmits the control signal of the monitoring control unit to the water tank automatic control unit the sewage treatment automatic control unit or the integrated automatic control unit and transmits to the external linkage engine"}]</data>
