6i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100447049-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition due to excessive wear height and river water backflow the domestic sewer pipeline system is over planned in the upstream pipeline so there is no contradiction in the downstream pipeline where all sewage and rainfall runoff are discharged to the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200334419-Y1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition due to excessive wear height and river water backflow the domestic sewer pipeline system is over planned in the upstream pipeline so there is no contradiction in the downstream pipeline where all sewage and rainfall runoff are discharged to the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200366659-Y1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition to remove contaminants contaminated sediments 13 to make a strong wear between each other in order to prevent secondary pollution is washed second by the wash water stored in the reservoir 5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "wear type rainwater chute device characterized in that to prevent the"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "the present invention can be installed at the end of a sewage pipe in contact with a river or coast while minimizing civil works and a wear type consisting of a conduction type ware and a sluice gate connecting the interlocking pipe connection to have a function of storm water and to have a function of preventing reverse flow of river or sea water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "the rainy soil chamber of patent document 4 is a buoy that adjusts the degree of opening of the connecting pipe according to the increase in flow rate in the connection pipe connecting the rain soil chamber and the drain pipe so that it can collect as much as the design capacity regardless of the increase in flow rate due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "we provide a wear type stormwater system to prevent reverse flow of river water or sea water by maintaining the state"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "it can be done and because it consists of installing a wear and a sluice gate at the top of a sewage pipe not an orifice type that requires civil engineering work there is a useful effect to simplify the installation work"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "as shown in the accompanying drawings in this embodiment the lower end of the sewage pipe 1 in contact with the river or the coast is hingedly coupled to the wear 100 erected or laid down and the sewage pipe in front of the wear 100 the vehicle collection pipe connection pipe 200 branched to the side of 1 the drive means 300 for rotating the wear 100 and the wear 100 are interlocked to open and close the entrance of the vehicle collection pipe connection pipe 200 sluice gate 400 sensors s1 s2 installed at the rear of the weir 100 to detect reverse flow of river water or seawater and the water level of ou water flowing down the sewage pipe by being installed in front of the weir 100 a control unit 500 that opens and closes the wear 100 and the sluice 400 in an interlocking manner by operating the driving means 300 by sensing a sensor s3 s4 for detecting a signal from the sensors s1 to s4"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "therefore the sensor s3 s4 for detecting the water level when there is no detection signal the wear 100 is kept in an erect state and an alarm for separate inspection is generated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "in the present embodiment two sensors s1 s2 are installed but the present invention is not limited thereto and only one sensor for detecting the level of river water or seawater may be installed and used at a predetermined height behind the wear 100"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "in addition when the sensor s3 does not respond and a signal is generated from the sensor s1 or s2 the driving means 300 made of a lifting bag is operated to raise the wear 100 to prevent reverse flow of river water or seawater"}]</data>
</edge>
