  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100658801-B1", "para_id": "para_39", "text": "the present invention is a structure for protecting the water and sewage pipe 3 installed across the ground of the river bottom 2 from the vertical pressure the vertical pressure is generated by installing a pipe protection box 10 in the connection portion of the water and sewage pipe 3 when the pressure is partially absorbed by the elastic force of the lower surface is moved downward to prevent damage and between the tube protection box 10 by installing a pipe support frame 70 is inserted into the elastic support 80 the water and sewage pipe 3 the main configuration is to prevent breakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100657177-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "that is in the above described construction method since the water supply pipe is long connected in one direction the bearing capacity for the transverse pressure is extremely weak and even if a slight ground subsidence of the water supply pipe is easily bent or twisted the breakage and gap of the water supply pipe may be generated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101185543-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "in other words it is necessary to develop a ubiquitous appeal management system that can monitor the quantity of water and water quality determined by various scattered water sources in real time and quickly observe analyze predict and predict urban river and ecological lake conditions.the present invention detects the quantity and quality of water inflow outflow pollutant inflow and pollutant source using inlet outflow using wide area water and monitors leakage and breakage by measuring the pressure of water pipeline to issue water quantity and water quality alarms it is to provide a ubiquitous based appeal management system that can remotely control the purification facility and analyze and predict the water balance for a long time and the water use index management method which is a dashin water usage guide"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200368757-Y1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "that is in the above described construction method since the water supply pipe is connected long in one direction the bearing capacity for the transverse pressure is extremely weak and even a slight ground subsidence of the water supply pipe buried can easily cause the water pipe to be bent or distorted causing breakage and gaps"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "in this way by continuously supplying river water to rivers a certain amount of running water always flows during the dry season so that the ecosystem of the river can survive and the urban environment is greatly improved and in terms of sewer pipes as the solids content and chemical oxygen demand are lowered corrosion and breakage of pipelines can be prevented in advance and through this groundwater contamination due to leakage of contaminated water air pollution due to odor and miniaturized sewage treatment plant can be miniaturized"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "economic losses to construct sewage terminal treatment plant can be saved.the stream runoff procurement apparatus and method thereof according to the present invention always allow a certain amount of streams to flow through the river to survive the ecosystem of the stream and furthermore the contamination of the pipeline is prevented in advance so that the groundwater due to the corrosion and breakage of the sewer pipe is prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101506117-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "first the high initial initial rainfall that occurs at the time of sewage or rainfall inflowing into the city can be collected in the sewage subway pipeline through the sewage discharge section and the large amount of rainfall introduced into the large amount during rainfall is increased by the water pressure the opening of the sewage water discharge pipe is reduced by rotating the rotating plate by the linkage part and the link part linked with the open front water gate and the linkage part linked thereto to prevent the inflow of rainwater and soil to the sewage water supply pipe channel and discharging it to the discharge river it is possible to reduce the dredging cost by cutting off the earth and sand and it is possible to reduce the sewage treatment cost because it is possible to collect only the planned amount of sewage in the sewage subway pipeline as well as the breakage of the sewer pipeline and manhole due to the water pressure caused by the over can be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413252-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in other words due to the change of temperature and external impacts depending on the season and the impact of the uplift and settlement of the ground the mortar inlet is easily damaged and water tightness is degraded"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100751573-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "that is in the above described construction method since the water supply pipe is connected in one direction long and the bearing capacity for the transverse pressure is very weak even if the slight ground subsidence of the water supply pipe is easily bent or twisted some breakage and gap may occur"}]</data>
