  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-11298635-B2", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "the storm water pretreatment chamber prevents premature rain garden bypass of the untreated storm water due to sediment and debris accumulation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101275853-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "it may further include a chamber 1000 having.according to the present invention only the initial excellent water can be separated and efficiently treated to fine contaminants"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3309310-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "as a result contamination in the storage space can be effectively avoided by always takes place with sinking water level in the rain overflow basin a backflow of water from the storage space to the pelvic chamber"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3309310-B1", "para_id": "para_84", "text": "conveniently an emergency overflow 15 may be provided in the region of the retaining wall 8 as needed which serves to relieve the pressure of the pelvic chamber 5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101974535-B1", "para_id": "para_89", "text": "also as described above the time point at which the initial rainwater drain valve v1 is closed closed can be closed only for a time period in which the water level precipitation amount is maintained on the high water level of the flowmeter chamber 112c when the rainwater is not continuously detected the initial rainwater exclusion valve v1 is closed closed to prevent contamination of the body portion"}, {"pat_id": "US-6398194-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "in addition to clearing dust and other particulates as well as foul odors in the air the air filter and delivery device 6 of the invention herein is also capable of dispensing pharmaceutical liquids into the water via the fresh air supply tubes 5 and the cavitation housings 4 connected to the air filter and delivery device 6 the fresh air supply tubes 5 are extended vertically to the bottom of a pond or tank and then connected to the cavitation housings 4 at an angle of 90 degrees situated on the undersid