mber 874g vibrating screen 874h drum elevator 875 air compressor 876 perforator 877 pilot and extractor 878 sand collector 879 dredger 879a pump dredger 879b bucket dredger 879c spotted shear 879d cab or control room 879e red shear 879f spotted 879g blast tank 879h blast pump 879i red 879j engine room 879k dipper dredger 879l grab dredger 879m bucket drive 879n after spotted 879o spotted winch 879p bucket 879q left and right front spotted 879r dipper 879s winch 879t anchor store 879u belt conveyor 879v grab 880 separately designated construction machinery 882 pile driver 882a boom 883 diesel pile hammer 884 steam hammer 885 hydraulic crane 885a piston motor 886 tower crane 886a names of each part of the guy derrick structure 886b guy derrick 886c main 886d boom 886e boom foil 886f turnbuckle 886g sling 886h triangular derrick 886i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921