ieving the above object is normally blocked at the distal end of the sewage pipe to block the discharge of odor and discharge of odors and when rain rains in large quantities when the rain flows to open the sewage to guide the river a discharge opening odor blocking device comprising a box frame installed at an upper end discharge port of a sewer pipe at an upper portion of the rainwater discharge chamber and seated at an outer circumference of an open sewage discharge port a primary blocking door connected to the upper end of the box frame to block odors by closing the sewage discharge outlets in usual times a second blocking door connected to the first blocking door to block the odor by blocking the sewage discharge outlet it is characterized by consisting of a hinge connecting portion to be connected to the upper side of the secondary barrier door to be separated from each other in order to open and close the plurality of blocking doors in order to correspond to the water level in accordance with the water level and water pressure of the rain flowing in large quantities in rainy weather"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102008617-B1", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "that is the box frame 10 is seated in a box shape on the outer periphery of the sewage discharge port 2 opened at the end of the sewage pipe 1 in the upper part of the rainwater discharge chamber 3 as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101619868-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the outdoor fire fighting box a control unit 8 for managing the operation of the firefighting box 100 as a whole an on off valve 2 for automatically injecting the fire fighting water upon opening a pressure gauge unit 6 connected to the transfer pipe 20 for spraying water for spraying water and for checking internal pressure changes is provided and the internal pressure state of the opening a pressure chamber 4 for transmitting the pressure to the pressure chamber 4 the control unit 8 controls the pressure change state of the pressure chamber