  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101533943-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "also when the water level rises the retractable watershed wall prevents the backwash of the river water to prevent flooding damage and the impoundment collection box having a filter net for filtering the contaminants contained in the sewage and storm seats is installed so that the contaminants do not flow into the wells and an odor chamber connected to the ceiling of the sewage pipe at an upper portion of the open the curtain can be installed to block the malodor generated in the sewer line and to move the sewer line along the moving rail to the left and right sides of the sewer line to conveniently remove and remove the contaminant lifting device connected with the wire have"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101879690-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "the stormwater inflow pipe 11 is arranged on the ceiling portion above the discharge chamber 14 of the collecting tank 10 and the discharge pipe 12 is arranged on the bottom portion of the discharge chamber 14 therefore the stormwater flowing through the storm inflow pipe 11 is quickly discharged through the discharge pipe 12 when the initial storm water is excluded and the initial stormwater with high contamination degree is discharged to the buoyancy chamber 15"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101879690-B1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "the metering water guide 30 excludes a certain amount of initial storm the initial storm is inadequate to use due to a high degree of contamination due to various pollutants in the air and in the present invention a certain amount of initial storm is stored in the user storage 300 that is discharging to the discharge pipe 12 and some rainwater flowing into the catchment tank 10 is collected in the buoyancy chamber 15 respectively"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100447049-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "on the other hand according to another embodiment of the present invention can be centrally integrated management of each rainwater tortilla 20