  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100352820-B1", "para_id": "claim_11", "text": "means for atomizing the seawater by the rotation of the centrifugal force generator and spraying the seawater into the treatment chamber it has a hot air blowing means for applying warm air to the fog of the sea water in the roof of the processing chamber open the air vent to discharge the vaporized vapor in the processing chamber out of the processing chamber a device for treating seawater characterized in that it has a means for removing a salt attached to the net while installing a net to block the ventilation hole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100352820-B1", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "the vaporized water vapor rises because of its low specific gravity but since the vent hole is opened in the roof of the processing chamber only water can be discharged smoothly from the processing chamber and separated from natural salt crystals"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100352820-B1", "para_id": "para_114", "text": "the vaporized water vapor rises due to its low specific gravity but since the vent hole for opening is open in the processing chamber roof only water can be smoothly discharged from the processing chamber and natural salt can be separated and separated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101408175-B1", "para_id": "para_85", "text": "it is therefore to be understood that the appended claims are intended to cover such modifications and changes as fall within the true scope of the invention.10 greenhouse 11 roof 111 slope 12 solar cell module 20 mining membrane 21 cattle field 30 housing 31 duct 311 perforated plate 40 ventilation part 41 frame 42 inlet 43 outlet 50 filter purifier 51 chamber 52 biofilter 53 diffusion plate 531 through hole 54 exhaust fan 60 manure processing unit 61 contaminant removing tank 62 63 methane production tank 64 filtrate tank 70 collecting tube 80 cogeneration generator 81 gas storage tank 90 excellent water collecting tank 91 water pipe h p hot water pipe m mesh mesh 100 combined animal husbandry system"}]</data>
