  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102284595-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a drainage tank that has a function to prevent the inflow of pests etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102284595-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the present invention for achieving the above object in a drainage tank configured to introduce and discharge sewage such as rain and sewage of daily life and to prevent the discharge of odors generated therein or the introduction of mice and pests accommodating sewage inside a main body having an inlet space an upper inlet part having an open upper part to introduce wastewater a side inlet part for introducing wastewater on one side and a discharge part for discharging the wastewater accommodated in the inflow space on the other side a blocking means having a blocking net seated on the main body to block foreign substances in the sewage and a vertical pipe for introducing the sewage into the inflow space and a moving pipe that moves up and down according to the level of sewage in the inflow space on the vertical pipe to block odors or prevent rats and pests from entering and is formed integrally or separately on the moving pipe to generate buoyancy according to the level of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101064335-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "in particular in addition to the heavy rainfall due to the rainy season and typhoons the recent changes in global weather patterns caused by el nino and la nia have caused local and local concentration rainfall frequently"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101064335-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in rainy weather sewage such as soil fallen leaves and vinyl flows into the sewers indiscriminately but there is no separate facility to prevent them.these dirts block the flow of rainwater by blocking the inflow of the rain gutters or the inlet of the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101064335-B1", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "as shown in figure 3 the present invention is characterized in that the jaw 11 is formed to hang the strainer 21 to filter the dirt on the upper part of the rain gutter which is floating leaves floating on the road surface cigarette butts and dirt accumulate in rain gutters to prevent rainwater or sewage inflow or flow flooding the road or these dirt accumulate in sewers through rain gutters impeding the flow of sewage overflowing sewage pipes this is to prevent it"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101229485-B1", "para_id": "para_46", "text": "to quickly drain without it being not cause any inconvenience caused to traffic and flooded with traffic accidents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200468245-Y1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the collecting basin 20 to block backflow and the collecting basin for dividing and filtering the soil sand and cigarette butts and rubbish mixed with rainwater or sewage so as to maintain a predetermined distance from the bottom and the side of the inside of the sump 20 in the rain gutter drain provided with 30 the sump 20 is of the upper and lower strait shape having a seating jaw 22b formed at the top edge of the entrance 22a to hang inside the manhole 10 via the support frame 42 of the manhole cover 40"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200468245-Y1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "according to the simple manhole of the rain gutter drain according to the present invention the manhole cover 40 fixed to the upper end step surface 14 of the opening 12 of the manhole 10 via the support frame 42 and the manhole 10 mounted to a predetermined height inside to block the backflow of the sewage and backflow of odor and is installed to maintain a certain distance from the bottom and sides of the inside of the sump 20 the sand mixed in rainwater or sewage in the rain gutter sewer having a collecting cabinet 30 for dividing and filtering cigarette butts and garbage respectively the collecting well has a seating jaw at the upper edge of the entrance so as to be suspended inside the manhole through the support frame of the manhole cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101179577-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition it is possible to minimize the initial excellent water remaining in the water channel does not cause water pooling the remaining water does not decay there is an effect of reducing the occurrence of odor and block the reproduction of pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101230730-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "according to the present invention as described above while planting vegetation on the side of the vegetation soil while water is continuously supplied to the vegetation through the water storage unit and the water supply surface rain water in the water storage unit through the water supply path formed in rain water by allowing heavy water to be filled such as eco friendly and continuous supply of moisture to the vegetation without additional management work it is very easy to maintain and manage the vegetation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "in addition the underground parking lot drainage facility for an apartment house according to the present invention is equipped with a water wheel member and a power transmission unit that converts and transmits the flow velocity of rainwater into rotational motion so that the flow velocity generated when rainwater flows into the sieve is converted into rotational motion of the sieve because it is transmitted through the rain there is an advantage of preventing a malfunction that blocks the drainage channel of the rainwater by accumulating while foreign substances such as fallen leaves contained in the rainwater are in close contact with the outer wall of the sieve.1 is a block diagram illustrating a drainage facility for an underground parking lot in an apartment house according to an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101178211-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "to quickly drain without it being not cause any inconvenience caused to traffic and flooded with traffic accidents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101124407-B1", "para_id": "para_93", "text": "as a result the blocking plate 24 blocking the drain hole 11a can prevent the pests such as mosquitoes grown in the sewage pipe from spreading to the outside while reducing the discharge of odors in the sewage pipe to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6132141-B2", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "3 is an example of a sewer rainwater switching type storage facility according to the present invention and is a diagram in the case of allowing overflow discharge to a river in the middle of rainfall.fig"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6647534-B1", "para_id": "para_60", "text": "however the present invention is not limited to this and may be applied to a cultured fish tank or a sewage treatment facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102183756-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the manhole configured to inflow and discharge sewage 1 such as rain and sewage 2 of living and to prevent the discharge of odors generated inside or the inflow of rats and pests while the grating 11 that prevents the inflow of foreign matters is seated on the upper part an integral locking net 13a is formed to prevent the inflow of foreign matters to allow the inflow of sewage 1 to the lower part while receiving the grating 11 equipped with a ball 13 a grating groove 14 that accommodates the grating 11 at the top to prevent movement and a seating plate 12 having a braille part 15 at the top to enable movement and recognition of the blind the main body 10 remaining in the lower part of the seating plate 12 of the main body 10 accommodates and remains in the sewage 1 that is introduced so that it can be discharged when a certain amount of sewage 1 is received while blocking odor and preventing the inflow of rats and pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102183756-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a portion 21 a protrusion 22 extending to the lower portion of the seating plate 12 and accommodated in the wastewater 1 of the residual portion 21 to block odor and prevent the inflow of mice and pests and a residual portion 21 depending on the pressure of the sewage 1 accommodated in a certain amount of sewage 1 the rotating plate 23 rotates so that it can be discharged when it is received and the wastewater 1 is rotated by the rotation of the rotating plate 23 on the remaining part 21 a first discharging means 20 having an outlet 24 from which it is discharged and a receiving part 31 is provided to accommodate the sewage discharged under the first discharging means 20 and a receiving part capable of discharging by the load of sewage while preventing the inflow of odors and rats and pests in the lower part the support 32 fixed from the support 31 the support 34 for accommodating the spring 33 for generating a buffering force on the support 32 and the receiving portion 31 fixed to the upper portion of the support 34 including a second discharge means 30 having a blocking plate 35 for blocking the drain hole 31a and a guide protrusion 36 and a guide groove 37 to enable smooth movement of the blocking plate 35 a manhole capable of blocking odor and guiding the blind characterized in that it is made"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102183756-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole that can block odor and guide the blind the present invention relates to a manhole capable of blocking odors and guiding the blind and more specifically to prevent the separation of various odors and pests that are generated and discharged from sewage such as internal rain and sewage and at the same time smooth drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102183756-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the present invention for achieving the above object in the manhole configured to inflow and discharge sewage such as rain and sewage of daily life discharge of odors generated inside or inflow of rats and pests inflow of foreign matter to the top while the grating to prevent the grating is seated a through hole is formed to prevent the inflow of foreign matters to allow the inflow of sewage to the lower part while receiving the grating a grating groove to accommodate the grating to prevent movement at the upper part and the upper part the main body having a seating plate having a braille part to enable movement and recognition of the blind at the bottom of the seating plate of the main body a residual portion that receives and retains the incoming sewage so that it can be discharged when receiving a certain amount of sewage while blocking odor and preventing the inflow of rats and pests and a residual portion extending to the lower portion of the seating plate protrusions that are accommodated in sewage to block odors and prevent the influx of rats and pests a rotating plate that rotates to allow discharge when receiving a certain amount of sewage according to the pressure of the sewage stored on the residual portion and a rotating plate on the residual portion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100781302-B1", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "in this case the headquarters is a control center that is provided with a main computer server that receives the processing status information such as initial rainwater inflow and outflow by the communication device 70 and issues a command thereby providing comprehensive operation management and monitoring functions"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100781302-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "therefore the present invention stores the initial rainwater containing a large number of non point pollutants in urban areas with high pollution during rainfall and stored in the initial rainwater excellent storage 10 to enable the deposition of sand particles generated at this time such as branches and plastic bags when water level is measured by sensor detection while blocking the inflow of floating garbage the rainwater inflow switch is automatically adjusted to block the inflow"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101272217-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "the support path block 230 has one side that is the surface facing the rainwater storage conduit 100 is formed in a shape corresponding to the outer surface of the rainwater storage conduit 100 hereinafter referred to as a corresp