ing the smell and backflow of road rainwater receivers that can reliably block the outflow of odor due to wastewater and also effectively cope with the backflow caused by the rainy season flood"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100710632-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "therefore in order to prevent the backflow of the odor the vinyl bag may be covered on the grating of the drain but in case of sudden rain the plastic bag may block the drain of the rainwater which may prevent the rainwater from draining and cause a safety accident due to the rainwater"}]</data>
