  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200300300-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "good product development was needed to prevent leakage.the present invention can adjust the up down left and right angles of the leak proof packing used to connect the oil exit pipe to the right sewage pipe according to the terrain and the site condition"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300300-Y1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "it is a new and useful packing that keeps it long and improves the function of the drainage.this packing has excellent leakage prevention effect and it has the effect of extending the life and function of the installed rain and sewage receiver and it is environmentally effective by preventing leakage and it is economical because it is cheap and can be used for a long time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101136508-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "therefore it is possible to fundamentally prevent the leakage of odors or pests generated by decaying miscellaneous matters accumulated in ordinary times or generated in drainage or sewers to the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101136508-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "therefore it is possible to fundamentally prevent the leakage of odors or pests generated by decaying miscellaneous matters accumulated in ordinary times or generated in drainage or sewers to the ground"}, {"pat_id": "US-5161911-A", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "this risk is sometimes present in a sanitary sewer system where there is water leakage into the sewer line through manholes cracks in sewer line joints or where improper roof downspout connections are made to the system which normally should only carry the water and sewage draining from sinks toilets washing machine drain lines and basement floor drains"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value reco