hing layer 220 to finish the outer surface with a coating the sensing line of the sensing tape 100 is composed of four strands and a separate set of two strands of the four strands is connected to the electronic tag attached to the pipe connection for the exploration of the pipeline from the outside"}, {"pat_id": "US-11060313-B2", "para_id": "para_74", "text": "the hooded vent 20n is designed to slide over the top of the snorkel riser 20j to provide a leak point into the building 1 to mitigate risk of wall collapse should flood water rise above dfe 3 the hood 20n at the top of the snorkel riser 20j is designed to prevent rain from entering into snorkel riser 20j and housing 20b"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4886659-B2", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "further the shape is not limited to that illustrated in the figure and various shapes such as a block shape a sand shape a granular shape and a lump shape can be appropriately selected and used"}, {"pat_id": "US-8439648-B2", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "a tightly fitting cap can be emplaced covering the top of the entire assembly access box and outer tube in order to prevent rain or other water from entering the access box and inspection window"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100729127-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "at this time the front end of the drain pipe 40 is fixed to the fitting groove 13 formed at the other end of the water collecting pipe 10 thereby preventing the rain and sewage leak through the joint portion"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4029133-B2", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "thereby the rainwater drained from the lower connecting pipe can be guided to the inside of the gutter and leakage from the connecting portion between the lower connecting pipe and the gutter can be reduced"}, {"pat_id": "US-12127513-B2", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in another aspect one or more of said water collection modules internal horizontal and vertical edges are made leak proof via the addition of mechanical or chemical components forming a fluid holding internal volume wherein said edge leak proof mechanical component include one of silicone gel amp sealing or silicone model seals wherein each said water collection internal volume is hydraulically connected to at least one more other water collection module s internal volume and at least one or more of said water collection module s top panel or said wall panels openings has a plug cap hose flow restrictor drip hose faucet valve spigot or similar component"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100948553-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "oil leaks contaminate soil and the oil melts in the aquifer due to rain slowly contaminating groundwater over long periods of time"}, {"pat_id": "US-9709431-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "in this example if the rain sensor indicates that there is no local precipitation but that there are water levels above a threshold the control system 100 may track property operations to determine if there is a problematic operation that may be causing water leakage within the property"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200483342-Y1", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "therefore foreign substances or impurities accumulated in the body 1 2 times a year it is possible to clean the inside of the body to remove it and the structure of the device is waterproof structure so that water can not leak"}]</data>
