  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101113989-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "a first treatment part 230 formed in a shape and including a rainwater separator 234 for separating the effluent and the oil component and a sedimentation tank 238 formed under the solid separator 232 to store the solid matter a first inlet hole 202 is formed so that the effluent treated by the first treatment unit 230 flows in a filtration sedimentation reservoir for depositing contaminants included in the effluent is formed and fines for purifying fine contaminants and effluents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100633532-B1", "para_id": "para_69", "text": "rain and rain is reduced inflow of rainwater and sewage to reduce the amount of rainwater and sewage that overflows the wear 40 is gradually reduced in this case it is accumulated in the rainwater reservoir 51 through the discharge hole 55 formed in the rainwater receiver 51 excess rainwater and sewage were discharged to reduce the weight of the rainwater receiver 51 while being pulled by the weight of the weight 91 of the restoring portion 90 connected to one side of the rotary bar 52 50 rotate counterclockwise"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0126608-Y1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "as described above the present invention combines a snow removal device with a rubber plate to drive snow to collect the debris at the bottom surface of the sedimentation basin on the sludge outlet side so that snow falls during the winter the main and driven wheels of the driving unit due to snowfall it is driven by the rated drive to cause the sliding phenomenon is not driven smoothly by indeterminate drive and the rubber plate is made semi permanent by drilling a length adjustable long hole in the rubber plate to compensate for the wear of the rubber plate due to friction with the concrete circumferential surface it can also be used to remove rain and dust during summer or snowy seasons"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101345769-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "in other words the storage tank system is primarily equipped with a sewer pipe on the road surface of the end of the filter to filter out a certain size of contaminants the predetermined amount of rainwater that is the planned sewage of the rain for the usual amount of sewage hereinafter referred to as 3q passes through if it is the screen device is conducted so as not to interfere with the discharge the odor screen to close the mouth to the sewer pipe to prevent the external outflow of sewage odor rainwater in the state provided in the upper rainwater chamber is closed when the 3q inflow sediment inflow prevention device to discharge rainwater into the sewer pipe through the mouth wearable movable beam for fresh water and discharge to the weir weir in the state that the soil inflow prevention device is closed initial excellent from the wear it is provided on the storage tank and the inclined surface upper portion of the storage tank for storing and storing the residual water and remaining on the bottom surface after sending the initial excellent water to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101345769-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "however in the case of the initial excellent residual in the weir 30 the organic matter is decayed and acts as a secondary pollutant with odor and when the height of the weir 30 is installed higher than the bottom surface of the mouth 10 as a sewer pipe to flow back since a problem may occur the wearable movable beam 600 is installed on the wear 30 so as to discharge residual rainwater and the initial excellent storage tank 700 is installed at one side of the wearable movable beam 600"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water t