  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100869052-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "the present invention to achieve the above object an adhesive tape 110 in close contact with an outer surface of a pipe material buried underground such as a water supply pipe a sewage pipe or an rain pipe sensing lines 120 formed on the outer surface of the adhesive tape at regular intervals so as to receive power from the outside in the electronic tag so as to detect leaks and damages and check the pipe positions a removable tape 130 formed on an outer surface of the sensing line a good adhesion treatment layer 140 formed on an outer surface of the detachable tape and for adhesion upon application of a material for protecting the tape consisting of the protective layer 150 formed on the outer surface of the adhesion layer in the sensing pipe that can easily detect the leakage and damage of the piping material using the detection tape 100 and the position of the pipe the sensing tape 100 is composed of a finishing layer 220 to finish the outer surface with a coating the sensing line of the sensing tape 100 is composed of four strands and a separate set of two strands of the four strands is connected to the electronic tag attached to the pipe connection for the exploration of the pipeline from the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102067925-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "in addition another object of the present invention is to prevent loss of function due to breakage of the binding connecting portion due to the settlement of the drain rain gutter and rain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100868067-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "in the practice of the present invention the filling material 400 filled in each of the storage room 240 340 may be used to fill the mortar 420 or tuscon 430 of various colors the display unit 500 the manhole characters or marks of local governments or administrative offices that manage 100 are displayed or applications such as rain or sewage are indicated.as described above the present invention is to fill the filling in the pedestal frame and the lid frame constituting the manhole to cure the curing hardening constituting the storage room in the mold the storage room is composed of the side plate reinforcement and the bottom plate integrally by doing so it is possible not only to prevent breakage of the fillings filled in the storage room but also to construct the fillings in various forms thereby producing various types of manholes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100918431-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "an object of the present invention as described above is installed in the roadside flow inlet for flowing fluid flowing on the road and discharge to the sewage pipe and the drainage hole formed on the upper side of the inner side fixed jaw a grating provided at an upper portion of the fixing jaw of the drainage hole and a frame provided between the fixing jaw and the grating to prevent breakage of the fixing jaw from an external load and having a bottom portion corresponding to the fixing jaw and a wall surface protruding at a predetermined height from the outside of the fixing jaw"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101261190-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "0173850 water meter protector accordingly it is an object of the present invention to fundamentally solve the above mentioned conventional problems and it is an object of the present invention to provide a double structure in which moisture or moisture penetration into the inside is completely blocked thereby preventing the resin foam from freezing or buoyancy and to provide a structure of a water meter protector which can be mounted regardless of the height at which the water meter can be inserted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100418252-B1", "para_id": "para_47", "text": "in addition by forming a cover 17 to block the entire upper portion of the frame 11 to prevent rain water from entering the area being processed during rain to prevent the breakage of aggregates generated in normal rain water purification the cover 17 may cover the top of the frame 11 of the floating reactor structure 1 using a sheet of water resistant and acid resistant material or support on the top of the frame 11"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200483342-Y1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "it has a cold feeling that is not in harmony with the appearance of a house or a building it is covered with the rainwater reservoir of the color pattern and built in the inside space to prevent direct exposure to direct sunlight rain and wind so that even if it is used for a long time it does not cause deformation or breakage of rainwater reservoir and can prevent water from being spoiled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200483342-Y1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "it is possible to prevent the direct exposure to direct sunlight rain and wind by preventing the rainwater storage tank of the uniform color pattern from being covered with the inside of the rainwater storage compartment or breakage of the water can be prevented and the decay of the water can be prevented and the ceiling portion is formed with a sloped slope at a constant angle so that the snow or rain can flow without falling"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102079279-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "in this configuration although it consumes electrical energy and requires installation of a separate sensor motor and controller the initial rainwater inlet 61 of the initial rainwater storage unit 60 is clogged with contaminants or the initial rainwater storage unit even if the initial rainfall is not stored due to breakage of 60 the storm guide unit 50 may be driven as a driving source based on the information detected from the sensor thereby storing the storm"}]</data>
