d easily drains water even during heavy rain or monsoon rain while preventing sewage from flowing in and blocking odors.in order to achieve the above object a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking water permeable grating according to an embodiment of the present invention comprises an outer frame forming a frame to be installed on the upper part of a rainwater drain or a drain an inner frame forming a plurality of square spaces by intersecting a plurality of horizontal and vertical bars in a grid shape inside the outer frame and a water permeable block filling the square spaces formed in the inner frame the method comprising a a preparatory step of preparing the outer frame and the inner frame and cork b a crushing step of crushing the cork into a size of 6 to 9 mm c a coating step of immersing the crushed cork in a waterproof coating solution and taking it out in a state where the coating solution has been applied d a drying step of drying the waterproof coated cork at 70 to 80 c using a vibrating device b a mixing step of mixing the dried cork with a binder and c a pressing step of pressing the mixed cork into the square space at 80 to 90 c using a heat roller"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102702375-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "referring to the drawings mentioned above a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking permeable grating s100 according to an embodiment of the present invention comprises a method for manufacturing a dirt prevention and odor blocking permeable grating 100 including an outer frame 110 forming a frame that is installed on the upper part of a rainwater drain or a drain an inner frame 120 in which a plurality of horizontal and vertical bars 121 and a plurality of vertical and vertical bars 122 intersect in a grid shape to form a plurality of square spaces 120h inside the outer frame 110 and a permeable block 130 filled in the square spaces 120h formed in the inner frame 120"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101124941-B1", "