function the water level it is a means for stably treating drainage by bypassing the rising rainwater and flowing it into the above mentioned drainage space part 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101834261-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to provide an excellent watertightness and a satisfactory workability in order to prevent leakage of sewage or rainwater through a drain pipe connection hole of a public pipeline"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101834261-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "in addition the watertightness is excellent in order to prevent leakage of sewage or rainwater through a drain pipe connection hole of the public pipeline thereby providing an excellent effect of satisfactory construction"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101834261-B1", "para_id": "para_58", "text": "in addition it is possible to secure excellent water tightness to prevent leakage of sewage or rainwater through the drain pipe connecting hole 210 of the public conduit 200 since the curved surface portion 12 of the curved surface portion 12 is formed so as to correspond to the radius of curvature of the inside of the public conduit 200 it does not interfere with the flow of the wastewater or the excellent flow that flows into the public conduit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100710632-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "therefore in order to prevent the backflow of the odor the vinyl bag may be covered on the grating of the drain but in case of sudden rain the plastic bag may block the drain of the rainwater which may prevent the rainwater from draining and cause a safety accident due to the rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100710632-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "as described above the opening and closing plate moves downward by the number of rainwater and the like and when the rainwater flows backward the opening and closing plate closes the opening to prevent the backflow of the drain opening upwards but preventing the reverse flow by the opening and closing plate"}]</data>
