  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100834924-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "the screen assembly for a composite sewage overflow dam of the present invention separates solids from a large ratio of fluid being transported and is disposed along the flood dam side during use to block interrupt the overflowing heavy rain water and to remove solids such as large wastes in turbid and dirty water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102882673-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "in claim 1 or 2 a grating for a rainwater drainage system capable of variably adjusting the drainage area for flood prevention characterized in that the upper surfaces of the fixed grating and the elevating grating are formed in a block like gently curved shape so that sediments including cigarette butts and fallen leaves accumulating on the upper surface of the grating are pushed along the gently curved surface of the upper surface of the grating by the current of water and are induced to quickly drain downward through the rainwater drainage system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102882673-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "in claim 1 or 2 a grating for a rainwater drain capable of variably adjusting the drainage area for flood prevention characterized in that the support rods forming the grating in the form of a grid structure of the above mentioned fixed grating and the lifting grating are formed below the upper surface of the grid plate thereby minimizing the accumulation of various sediments such as cigarette butts and fallen leaves around the rainwater drain on the grating"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 8