ash water tank 400 through the backwash water tank 751 the filtration tank 300 is provided at a lower portion of the filtration layer 310 of the filtration tank 300 and is disposed above the backwash water supply pipe 753 and selectively supplied with backwash air from the outside to supply air to the filtration tank 300 a backwashing air supply pipe 810 for upwardly floating the filtered suspended solids in the filter quartz layer 310 while moving upward from a lower portion of the filter quartz layer 310 the suspended solids suspended in the upper portion of the filtration layer 310 of the filtration tank 300 are transferred from the filtration tank 300 to the settling tank 200 by the backwash air supplied through the backwash air supply pipe 810 one end of which is connected to one side of the upper part of the filter element layer 310 of the filtration tank 300 the other side is connected to the central part of one side of the settling tank 200 and the other end is selectively a backwash floating transfer pipe 820 having a check valve 821 for guiding a suspended material from the filtration tank 300 to the settling tank 200 side and is connected to the backwash air supply pipe 810 through an air transfer pipe 831 and is connected to the backwash air supply pipe 810 through the air transfer pipe 831"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100528613-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and a drain pipe body 11 having coupling grooves 113 of different lengths formed in the circumferential direction with the coupling grooves 113 circumferentially formed on the gentle slope 114 the speed reducing plate 12 having a plurality of different lengths is coupled to the coupling groove 113 of the drain pipe body 11 to reduce the flow rate of the sewage and the steel ring 15 is bonded to the lower portion of the drain induction pipe 115"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100528613-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "therefore the present invention has been made in view of the problems of the prior art as described 