d on the activated carbon and move quickly in the space 167 without resistance thereby shortening the time for removing the odor.100 manhole pump station 110 manhole pump station body 111 upper space 112 lower space 113 manhole 114 exhaust pipe 115 foothold 116 doorway 117 opening door 118 railing 119 ladder 120 inlet pipe unit 121 inlet pipe 122 inlet pipe 123 curved pipe 124 diffusion guide plate 130 pump 131 discharge pipe 140 opening closing opening 141 hinge pin 142 rotating cover 143 handle 144 cover holder 150 odor exhaust device 151 lower exhaust pipe 152 exhaust fan 153 exhaust hood 154 upper exhaust pipe 155 flexible corrugated pipe 156 corrugated pipe holder 157 detachable member 160 secondary odor remover 161 door 162 casing 163 support guide 164 wire mesh box 165 activated carbon 166 activated carbon part 170 fermentation liquid part 171 inlet 172 fermentation tank 172a fermentation tank body 173 hollow section 174 ring shaped space 175 fermentation liquid storage section 176 upward protrusion 177 leakage 178 absorbing tube 179 downward protrusion pipe 180 em fermentation solution 181 water level sensor 182 body support 183 bottom 184 protruding edge wall 190 primary odor remover 191 fermentation tank 192 drain pipe 193 opening closing valve 194 dispersing drop plate 195 bubble generator 196 air hose 197 air pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913996-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "70 is opened and the effluent is collected into the sump 100 while the current groundwater level is lower than the set ground level the effluent water due to the closing pressure of the water level control device 40 70 in the water level control device of the sump well configured to block the collection of water so that the current ground level is lower than the set ground level it is possible to reduce the number of continuous water block and pumping the water level control device 40 70 one end is connected to the collecting pipe 10 and the inlet pipes 22 52 84 provided with hydra