s of the adjacent trench body block and the inner surface of the drainage passage formed in the u shaped cross sectional shape in order to suppress the generation of hydrogen sulfide gas by sulfate ions and microorganisms when decaying rainwater or sewage accumulated by the stagnant soil or residue inside the trench and to purify contaminants by the sustained release tio 2 photocatalyst alumina cement blast furnace a binder binder including slag powder nickel slag powder and silica sand a photocatalyst impregnated porous filler including zeolite powder pearlite powder feldspar powder and kaolinite powder in which the tio 2 photocatalyst is impregnated in the porous pores and water and a porous filter mortar layer cured by stacking a porous filter mortar including water is formed and the connection support fixing bracket includes a lower support portion for supporting lower ends of both ends of the adjacently connected trench body block both side support portions formed in a shape bent at a predetermined height at both ends of the lower support portion in the upper direction to surround both end side portions of the trench body block and a drainage level control member for adjusting the drainage gradient and level of the trench body block by integrally extending from both ends of the lower supporter in an outward direction of the both side supporters wherein the drainage level control member includes the lower supporter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102215278-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "an extension piece extending from a ball nut integrally formed with the extension piece and having a screw therein a ball screw coupled to the ball nut and rotated forward and backward to adjust a drainage gradient and level of the trench body block by raising and lowering the ball nut polymer concrete precast drainage using industrial by products with enhanced drainage gradient and level adjustment including and a support member that supports forward and reverse rotation while preventing