rine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102677255-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "accordingly foreign substances contained in the rainwater collected in the storage tank 20 and transported through the horizontal drain 22 are filtered thereby improving the degree of contamination caused by foreign substances when using the rainwater as vegetation water"}, {"pat_id": "US-10364563-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "soil composition therefore is a controlling factor in the leaching process i.e"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102644212-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "the method of repairing the joint of the manhole sewer pipe and drain pipe of the present invention to achieve the above object is to dig up the area around the manhole 10 where the water leak occurred and then remove the existing buried sewer pipe or the existing pipe used as the drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102644212-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "the method of repairing the joint of a manhole sewer pipe and a drain pipe according to the present invention which has the characteristics described above is easy to block water because the repair is performed using clay in a paste state with good wettability even in the process of sewage and drainage leaking to the outside of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "US-5254245-A", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "materials used for the pipe and column filter should be stainless steal coated with fired red drain tile clay for the large plant because size of the pipe and filter can be increased to any degree without being corroded"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100390652-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "a plurality of disk type clay filter 15 may be connected about the vertical axis inside the catalytic recovery 9 the pores of the filter can be selectively formed on the order of 0.1 to 1 treated through the photocatalytic oxidation reactor 7 the treated water is separated from the treated water at the outside of the disk type clay filter installed inside the catalyst recoverer 9"}, {"pat_id": "US-10501355-B2", "para_id": "para_57", "text": "the wastewater undergoes a catalytic oxidation reaction in the system in which the macromolecular hard to degrade organic materials are converted into small molecules and thereby is removed"}]</data>
