the water level plate 800 is lowered in accordance with the operation to shut off the discharge of the river water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101238571-B1", "para_id": "para_92", "text": "in the cleaning operation by installing the upstream order wall 10 to block the inflow of river water and drain the water of the cleaning section the water is exposed in the low area of the puddle while the riverbed is exposed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100960367-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "thus the water introduced into the drain pit 18d through the drain pipe 18c is stored in the drain pit 18d by the height at which the outlet 18e is formed and then discharged into the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100732805-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the plate like door 27 is installed to open and close the waterway while being coupled by the door lifting member 27 penetrating through the upper center of the upper portion of the door 27 and spaced apart from the front and rear of the door 27 to face each other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100732805-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "the door is coupled to and lifted through a pair of door frames having a shape in which lower portions are respectively inserted into and fixed to a pair of intake door walls formed integrally with the support block and a door lifting member penetrating through an upper center of the door frame"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101133277-B1", "para_id": "para_55", "text": "the initial rainwater that has passed through the rainwater inlet 11 is filled in the rainwater inlet 10 and the sludge accompanying the initial rainwater is deposited and accumulated at the rear of the rainwater inlet 10 by the barrier wall 32 and the boiling point does not settle"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100936376-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "it can be closed at both ends of the auxiliary frame or by opening and closing by the weight 22 of the upper coupled to the hinge 14 to block the odor rising from the drain and to block the backflow sewage but backflow when the sewer bursts or pops out from a weak place when blocked it is often better to discharge back to the road than to block when the sewer overflows due to heavy rain so it is not always good to prevent backflow of sewage.the present invention has been devised to solve the problems caused by the deodorization and insect repellent device of the conventional sewer as described above is normally closed to not send the sewage to the river to prevent odors or pests coming out to flow the sewage into the river if the water level in the stream is lower than the sewage level the sewage on the road will flow to the river and the dregs can be caught on top of it preventing foreign matter from entering the sewer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101640162-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "at this time a fine aggregate suspended in the liquid is injected from the polymer tank 25 into a large agglomerate thereby facilitating sedimentation of the agglomerates"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413252-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in other words due to the change of temperature and external impacts depending on the season and the impact of the uplift and settlement of the ground the mortar inlet is easily damaged and water tightness is degraded"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "according to the present invention during rain the initial rainwater containing non point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101293413-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "the buoyancy body 22 and the wire 23 which connects the water gate 21 and the buoyancy body 22 so that the buoyancy gate 21 can be opened and closed in conjunction with the lifting and lowering of the buoyancy body 22 and it is composed of a pulley 24 installed on the inner ceiling of the storage tank 10 so as to support the wire 23 the natural freshwater of the river water introduced into the storage tank 10 and the river water stored in the storage tank 10 it is preferable that it is comprised so that it may drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101931526-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "therefore the rotary damper r for removing various contaminants and suspended matters as described above is constructed such that no clearance is generated from the frame 100 or the rake 500 during the up and down movement of the lifting main screen 300 so that the front screen can be rotated easily and safely by the rotation of the motor due to the rotation of the motor according to the instruction of the driver so that the driving convenience is ensured and the drain screen can be easily and stably operated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102060765-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "therefore when heavy rain pours within a short time the other manhole of the concrete pipeline 110 is opened to drain the rainwater to the river the composite storage tank is temporarily stored in the river through the open manhole after temporarily storing the rainwater by doing so the quantity of rainwater flowing into the river can be reduced"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100893952-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in this case since the rainwater continuously passes through the filter cartridge when heavy heavy rain or heavy rain occurs a backflow phenomenon occurs due to an overload and the rainwater cannot be purified but it flows directly into the river where the bridge is installed and the river is flowed into the vehicle s oil or metal powder tire powder or ascon oil on the bridge road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101351743-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "in addition the backflow prevention film is characterized in that made of any one of leather silicon rubber.according to the drainage preventing device of the retaining wall structure according to the present invention by installing the drainage for preventing the backflow of the retaining wall structure in the drainage of the retaining wall it is possible to prevent the back soil outflow and to prevent the increase of the back ground pressure the water level of the river due to the rainy season and heavy rain in summer even if the rise occurs the reverse flow is blocked to prevent the increase of the back ground pressure which prevents the displacement settlement and collapse of the retaining wall which is effective in protecting people s property and life from disasters"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102153821-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "the rainy soil chamber of patent document 4 is a buoy that adjusts the degree of opening of the connecting pipe according to the increase in flow rate in the connection pipe connecting the rain soil chamber and the drain pipe so that it can collect as much as the design capacity regardless of the increase in flow rate due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100763800-B1", "para_id": "claim_14", "text": "in the lifting cylinder 93 is rotatably fixed to the bottom of the closed space 12 respectively the piston rod 94 the front end of the lifting block 90 respectively rotatably fixed to the lifting block each of the members for opening closing the gate 30 by rotating the rotary shaft 33 is fixed to the shaft 90 according to the expansion and contraction of the elevating cylinder 93 while the gate 30 is closed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100960370-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "thus the water introduced into the drain pit 18d through the drain pipe 18c is stored in the drain pit 18d by the height at which the outlet 18e is formed and then discharged into the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101894740-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "these excellent manholes have a hollowed rectangular shape with the lower part closed and the upper part formed with an inlet port"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100930723-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in particular when installing a drainage delay member such as gravel to block the drain hole as shown in figure 1a there is a problem that not only the soil flows from the inflow water but also the soil flows from the ground to reduce the function of the drain hole.in order to solve the above problems an object of the present invention is to provide a structure for installing a sedimentation tank and a filtration device in a facility to ground the natural water to prevent clogging and river pollution of the drain pipe and smooth the function to penetrate into the groundwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102660526-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a pool built to a predetermined depth on the banks of a stream or river a balancing tank connected to the pool by an overflow pipe and a drainage pipe to store water discharged from the pool a filtration device connected to the balancing tank and the supply pipe to filter the water in the balancing tank and connected to the pool and the water supply pipe to supply the filtered water to the pool and it includes a piping control manhole built between the pool and the balancing tank to control the overflow pipe drain pipe and water supply pipe to prevent contaminants from the pool from flowing into the balancing tank the piping control manhole is a first contaminant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the overflow pipe a second contaminant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the drainage pipe a third pollutant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the water supply pipe a first pollutant discharge pipe and a first pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle portion of the front overflow pipe of the first pollutant penetration blocking valve a second pollutant discharge pipe and a second pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle of the drainage pipe in front of the second pollutant penetration blocking valve a water damage recovery system for a swimming pool comprising a third pollutant discharge pipe and a third pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle of the water supply pipe in front of the third pollutant penetration blocking valve"}]</data>
</edge>
