ce and provided with a water supply pump 130 a downstream side main water supply pipe 102 connected to the upstream side main water supply pipe 101 through a main on off valve 110 a sprinkler bridge 200 branched from the downstream main supply pipe 102 and provided with a sprinkler opening closing valve 210 and a sprinkler head 300 installed at a lower end of the sprinkler double pipe 200 first and second main supply pipe flow meters 410 and 420 installed at the inlet and outlet ends of the main opening closing valve 110 respectively further comprising first and second sprinkler multi stage pipe flow meters 510 520 respectively installed at an inlet end and an outlet end of the sprinkler opening closing valve 210 a drain pipe 600 connected to the sprinkler bridge pipe 200 through the three way valve 610 and provided with a drain pipe meter 620 between the second sprinkler bridge pipe flow meter 520 and the sprinkler head 300 lt rti the main on off valve 110 includes a valve body 111 connected to the upstream main supply pipe 101 and the downstream main supply pipe 102 a valve cap 112 covering the upper portion of the valve body 111 a valve seat 116 formed in the valve body 111 an opening closing plate 117 installed in the valve body 111 to open and close the valve seat 116 a lifting and lowering rod 118 coupled to an upper end of the nut 117 and a nut box 119 screwed to the lifting and lowering rod 118 and an opening and closing drive means 120 for rotating the nut box 119 including the valve cap 112 includes an elevation guide portion 113 for vertically supporting the elevating and lowering rod 118 a rotation support portion 114 for rotatably supporting the nut box 119 and a reinforcing connecting portion 115 connecting the portion 113 and the rotation supporting portion 114 the opening and closing drive means 120 includes a drive motor 123 mounted on a motor mount 122 fixed to a support plate 121 integrally formed with the rotary support 114 and a driven gear 126 