north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102284577-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "drain trap type insert deformation that prevents deformation due to thermal expansion coefficient of metal material and injection member when insert molding by supplying metal bending member to prevent trench floor drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102284577-B1", "para_id": "para_51", "text": "according to the present invention the water collecting outlet is coupled to the trench coupled to the upper side of the drain trap to discharge various sewage and since the position of the trench can be moved eccentrically it can be supplied according to the shape and location of the tile and during injection molding the injection member is not supplied through the anti deformation separation groove by supplying it to the insert mold in the state of being bent during molding so that it is not affected by the coefficient of thermal expansion and prevents deformation"}]</data>
