  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-4062376-A", "para_id": "para_34", "text": "with the service conduit 27 and the leakage conduit 26 to be installed connected to the ends of the flexible wedge 52 the two conduits are moved through the ground when the snake 51 is pulled with the ground between their proximate ends being radially compacted with the rate at which the conduits may be moved depending in part on the nature of the soil"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102898667-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "in any one of the clauses selected from clauses 1 and 2 a structure in which an operating unit 272 that is connected to the side or rear portion of the eco friendly movable barrier 8888 for preventing green algae growth formed on the upper portion of the above mentioned foundation concrete 800 and acts to erect or overturn the eco friendly movable barrier 8888 for preventing green algae growth is connected to one side and the other side of the upper portion of the above mentioned foundation concrete 800 by a support unit 297 a nature friendly eco friendly method for naturally purifying polluted river water using an eco friendly movable dam for preventing green algae characterized by a structure in which a supply unit 299 for supplying hydraulic oil required when erecting or inverting the eco friendly movable dam for preventing green algae on one side of the lower part of the above mentioned operating unit 272 is connected to a watertight member 295 that acts to prevent oil leakage while allowing rotation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100407498-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "water condenses on the bottom surface of the tank due to condensation which causes the synthetic resin sheet attached by the adhesive to be separated from the wall of the tank.there is a risk that the growth of microorganisms and environmental hormones may occur due to the nature of the synthetic resin"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102069616-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore the leakage measurement of underground buried water supply pipelines is buried over a very long distance due to the nature of the pipeline and also consists of small water supply pipelines connected to many branch points"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100714781-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "therefore the leakage measurement of underground buried drainage channel is buried over a very long distance due to the nature of the pipeline and because it consists of small pipelines connected to many branch points the strange symptom of the ground where the drainage pipes pass that is water leaks and rises into the air you can see it with the naked eye or a report by looking at the state where the ground is sunk"}, {"pat_id": "US-8337121-B2", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "these sand lenses or areas of high permeability formed between adjacent grout columns result in grout walls that do not form substantially impermeable water barriers and that are susceptible to relatively high levels of water leakage or seepage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200437433-Y1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "due to the nature of the construction work the panel tank is not easy to install the seat due to the irregularities on the upper surface of the concrete foundation and if the panel tank tank cannot be maintained smoothly the water pressure is concentrated in some areas causing frequent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "JP-S5924320-B2", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "therefore the leakage detection index le given by equation 7 below the smallest model of ak is the best approximating autoregressive model"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100533127-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "this is due to the nature of the water pipe is used to use only straight pipe u shaped pipe l shaped pipe etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200443724-Y1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "due to the nature of the plastic material in the process of joining it is possible to reduce the breakage rate of the filter housing joint compared to the built in female screw that is easy to damage the pipe wall and to temporarily fill the gap by using taping means such as teflon tape without watering in case of emergency such as water leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200323735-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "this is due to the nature of the water pipe is used to use only straight pipe u shaped pipe l shaped pipe etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100726755-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "however the conventional sewage pipe structure as described above is a partial load and pressure acts at the top of the nature of the road there is no means to support or protect it so that the partial load and pressure is continuously applied to the sewer pipe joint breakage and drainage of sewage pipes occurred and even when installed on soft ground breakage of sewage pipe joints and sewage pipes occurred due to partial subsidence of the ground which caused sewage leakage through gaps of sewer pipe joints"}]</data>
</edge>
