  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_279", "text": "the piston pump is suitable for cases where the pumping amount is small and the head is large because the water pressure fluctuation is large and it is difficult to control the water quantity and the plunger pump 148 has little leakage from around the plunger 253 and is used for high pressure pumps for water and other liquids and the washington pump is suitable for the feedwater pump of a high pressure boiler because the pump is directly connected to a steam engine"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_390", "text": "13 the main problems during the operation of the pump of the conventional flood control equipment are as follows first the standard gland packing is a universal packing method using cotton or a packing material impregnated with grease in cotton second the liquid injected lantern ring attached packing 155 is the most commonly used type which installs a lantern ring in the center of the stuffing box inserts approximately the same number of packings on both sides and injects liquid into the lantern ring and third the double gland packing is a method to reduce the leakage of high pressure or harmful liquid by double layering the ordinary gland packing 155 but the pump extinguisher main part is divided into the standard gland packing 344 and the liquid injected lantern ring attached packing 346 and the double gland type packing 348 and is formed by the shaft sealing device of each pump"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_397", "text": "while the gland packing prevents leakage by sealing at the inner surface of the cylinder the mechanical seal has absolutely no leakage or only a small amount of leakage by sealing at the cross section of the cylinder"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_797", "text": "the packing properties and uses of the flood control equipment are as follows the above packing is used to prevent leakage from the joint and is