r derrick 886i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101911497-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "there is a place where a drainage facility should be installed place where the equipment is expected to be damaged by flooding a valve room where electricity is not supplied it is installed in a place where there is a risk of leakage of drainage pump due to submersion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the flood diffusion prevention system of a building structure that is installed in a multi story building structure and prevents the water flowing in due to leakage from spreading to the elevating facility space a drainage passage formed on the floor of the common space for each floor in the building structure a drainage trench installed on the upper portion of the drainage passage to shield the drainage passage and a plurality of drainage holes for draining the inflowing water into the drainage passage a drain module connected to and configured to include a pipe for discharging the water to the outside a flood detection sensor installed in the drainage module to detect whether water has flowed in a water supply shutoff valve installed in a water supply line of the building structure to block water supply by a control signal and a flood signal received from the flood detection sensor a control unit for transmitting the control signal to the water supply shut off valve so as to be blocked and it is installed in front of the opening closing door of the elevator installed in the building structure and is raised to a preset height from the floor and includes a blocking module to prevent water from flowing into the elevator when submerged the blocking module is a blocking member installed in front of the opening closing door to open or shield the front lower part of the opening closing door according to the elevation an elevating wire having one end coupled to the upper portion of the blocking member to elevate the blocking member and the flooding prevention system of a building structure characterized in that it is connected to the other end of the elevating wire and configured to include a wire driving unit for elevating and lowering the elevating wire in conjunction with the opening and closing operation of the opening and closing door"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_57", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101 not the bottom of the drain 101 so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage not living water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_69", "text": "by allowing only the drain hole 111 to pass through and to improve the drainage effect by opening both the drain hole 111 and the through holes 112 and 112a when a water leak occurs it is possible to prevent the spread of flood damage due to water leakage"}, {"pat_id": "US-11333304-B2", "para_id": "para_57", "text": "the segmentation rings may provide support to the pipe system delimit the annular airgaps of two adjacent pipe apparatuses of the pipe system define at least one segment per pipe apparatus and allow the annular airgap of any segment of the pipe system to flood when leakage from the inner or outer pipe layer into the annular airgap occurs into that segment thus affecting the at least one wireless information and communication station of that segment and notifying the central unit before one of the two opposite segmentation rings leaks and the annular airgap of an adjacent pipe segment starts to flood"}]</data>
