 of the panel vulnerable to leakage and to improve the resistance of the panel by the hydraulic pressure of the assembly tank reinforcement bracket characterized in that it is also about the installation structure"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200450491-Y1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in configuring the odor prevention device 110 to prevent the odor coming up from the ground the odor prevention device 110 includes a prevention body 112 having a seating flange 111 upward to be seated on the bottom surface of the manhole cover 105 the prevention body 112 and the first vertical portion 113 protrudes downward from the mounting flange 111 an inclined portion 114 formed to have a width narrowed inward from an end of the first vertical portion 113 a second vertical portion 115 projecting downward from the end of the inclined portion 114 a plurality of water passages 116 formed to drain a small amount of rainwater to the inclined portion 114 a discharge hole 117 formed to be opened between the second vertical portions 115 to discharge a large amount of rain and garbage deformed by the hydraulic pressure of the sewage to the water hole 116 while being drained down and after completion of drainage to return to the original state to prevent the odor coming up through the water hole 116 fixing the blocking plate 118 of a material having elasticity and excellent return force the discharge hole 117 is a sewer manhole odor prevention device characterized in that it comprises a rotating plate 120 installed so as to block the odor coming up while draining the rain and waste of the opposite"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101185420-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the water pipe inspection device equipped with a valve 130 between the manhole 110 and the water connection pipe 120 the manhole 110 is formed in a cylindrical shape so that any one is not subjected to concentrated stress due to hydraulic pressure and a b shaped mounting groove 111 is formed around the upper opening 115 and has a disc shape"}]</data>
