north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200439741-Y1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "20 235121 as described above is composed of a wire installed through the connecting ring installed in the lower flange from the upper flange to prevent the left and right flow of the bellows the end of the wire is provided with a shrinkage induction as described above since there is a disadvantage that flow by the algae generated in the water there is a problem that can not effectively guide or support the lifting and lowering of the shrinkage induction.therefore the purpose of the present invention is to solve the above mentioned problems in the prior art and to install the government drift because the floating capacity of the government drift connected by the upper flange and the rope can be divided in the subsidiary bilge to form a small size of the government drift therefore it is possible to reduce the influence of algae wind and other external forces on the government reserve so that the purpose of reducing the flow phenomenon of the bellows member is to reduce the flow phenomenon"}]</data>
