  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101259860-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a u shaped buried aqueduct made of resin material which is installed to be buried between the edge of the road and the ground or in the ground of the central separator and flows rainwater on a road surface such as a road into a sewer or underground a locking flange formed integrally with an upper opening side edge of the u shaped buried water pipe and forming a locking jaw at an end thereof square side insertion holes formed on outer peripheral surfaces of the buried water pipe facing each other and opposed to each other rti gt a horizontal retaining rod coupled to the side insertion holes of the squares facing each other on the outer circumferential surface of the buried water pipe to prevent gradient deformation of the buried water pipe and a cover channel forming a drainage groove and a drainage groove to which a top surface of the buried aqueduct is formed while both ends are coupled to each other on the locking flange to prevent separation by the locking step and a drain grating is coupled to an upper surface thereof"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101259860-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "u shaped buried water pipe a locking flange formed integrally with an upper opening side edge of the u shaped buried water pipe and forming a locking jaw at an end thereof square side insertion holes formed on outer peripheral surfaces of the buried water pipe facing each other and opposed to each other it includes and the horizontal maintenance bar to prevent the gradient deformation of the buried waterway pipe while being coupled to prevent rotation in the lateral insertion hole of the square facing each other on the outer circumferential surface of the buried waterway pipe and a cover channel forming a drainage groove and a drainage groove to which a top surface of the buried aqueduct is formed while both ends are coupled to each other on the locking flange to prevent separation by the locking step and a drain grating is coupled to an upper surface thereof"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101306471-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "a locking flange formed integrally with an upper opening side edge of the u shaped side channel and the u shaped side channel and forming a locking step at an end thereof it is provided with a side insertion hole of the square on the outer circumferential surface facing each other of the side outlet waterway pipe and installed in the side insertion hole so as to penetrate the horizontal holding rod to prevent the gradient deformation of the side outlet waterway pipe the horizontal maintenance the left and right of the rod is installed so that a pair of vertical support bar is coupled so that the side channel can be installed to be continuously installed at a certain height from the bottom surface the locking flange is characterized in that it is configured to be coupled by the fastening member to the g shaped grating mounting frame of the c shaped gripping edge portion is prevented while being separated by the locking jaw portion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a body having a box shape with an installation space inside a mounting hole formed through the side and a cylindrical flange extending from the upper surface a manhole cover that is detachably coupled to the flange to open and close the installation space in communication with the inside of the flange and it includes a guide sleeve mounted on the mounting hole to guide the cable to the installation space an installation ring is formed on the upper and side surfaces of the body and a fixing groove is formed on the side of the body recessed to a certain depth along the circumferential direction of the side a drainage channel extends downward on the inner lower surface of the body and an inclined gradient is formed on the inner lower surface of the body toward the drainage channel a manhole installed at the lower part of the installation space and filtering foreign substances contained in the water flowing into the installation space and then intermittently discharging the purified water toward the drain"}]</data>
