  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-8658095-B2", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a device for measuring oxidation reduction potential orp and a temperature in a hot water system the device comprising a a flow through cell having a plurality of ports comprising a first port and a second port b a controller c an integrated sensor component associated with the first port comprising an orp probe and a temperature detector said integrated sensor component residing at least partially inside of the flow through cell the orp probe further comprising at least one electrical connection operable to relay information to said controller wherein the orp probe is operable to measure orp in the hot water system at operating temperature and pressure and the temperature detector further comprises a plurality of negative leads and a plurality of positive leads operable to relay information to said controller wherein the controller is operable to determine whether a real time orp is within an ideal orp range and further operable to cause addition of an effective amount of oxygen or an effective amount of one or more reductants to a feedwater of the hot water system if the real time orp is not within the ideal orp range and d an external pressure balanced reference electrode assembly associated with the second port comprising a tube containing an electrolyte solution having a first end residing at least partially inside of the flow through cell and a second end a porous frit disposed on said first end and a multi fitting housing comprising a seal attached to said second end the multi fitting housing having a silver silver chloride half cell reference electrode partially immersed in said electrolyte solution and having an electrical connection operable to relay information to said controller"}, {"pat_id": "US-6030587-A", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a pressurized reactor for supercritical water oxidation comprising a pressure vessel for containing a fluid and capable of operating in excess of a supercritical temperature and a supercritical pressure of said fluid said vessel further comprising a shell and a cap portion said portions fitting together to enclose an interior space said portions having interior and exterior surfaces and a common longitudinal axis said interior space having a center point an oxidizer said oxidizer mixed with said fluid an electrical heating means a hollow protuberance located in at least one of said portions said protuberance formed along said common axis and projecting into said interior space said protuberance having an end closed to said interior surface and an end open to said exterior surface said protuberance receives said electrical heating means said electrical heating means heats said fluid in a first zone surrounding said interior center point and means for cooling said vessel exterior surface thereby cooling said interior surface and creating a second zone in said fluid along said interior surfaces wherein said fluid exists in a subcritical state said heating means and said cooling means creating a density gradient in said fluid and thereby cause a steady state convective circulation to form in said fluid"}, {"pat_id": "US-4819721-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "while the pressure is maintained the resin is cured to form a relatively hard tight fitting rigid pipe lining which effectively seals any cracks and repairs any pipe or joint deterioration to prevent further leakage either into or out of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100191220-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "however the conventional connection tube as described above is not in close contact with the insulator so it can not expect the warming effect due to the infiltration of low temperature air and water there was a dirty defect such as rapid corrosion of the fitting area due to moisture inflow of dirt and habitat of pests in addition the synthetic resin pipe itself cannot tolerate any impact or vertical load earth pressure vehicle pressure when buried and tends to be damaged easily.when the water meter is combined it is forced between the left and right connectors according to the size of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "US-8857473-B2", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "the flexible hose is pushed through the compression fitting towards the frozen blockage and emits a stream of water under pressure from the pump that erodes and eliminates the frozen blockage and return water is pushed from the blockage back to the return fitting and through the return hose to the container thereby providing a closed loop system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267401-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the air nozzle 20 is provided integrally with the injection pipe 21 and at the same time one or more are fixed so that the supplied air is sprayed so that water can circulate in the storage tank 80 and at the end of the injection pipe 21 a fitting 22 is provided so that one touch coupling with the air supply hose 23 is possible and the fitting 22 is installed on the side surface 12 of the main body 10 and the inner receiving space of the main body 10 11 is filled with anti pollution means 30 in which elvan quartz loess balls activated carbon and charcoal are mixed to prevent contamination or deterioration of stored water and a perforated groove 41 at the upper end thereof to prevent separation the formed cover plate 40 is coupled and fixed to the main body while on one side of the edge of the main body 10 a heating wire 50 for preventing freezing and a temperature at which the inside temperature is sensed to transmit a signal to the controller 70 one or more water pollution prevention units d having the sensor 60 installed and fixed are disposed on the bottom of the storage tank and fixing the water pollution prevention units installed and fixed in series or parallel when the rainwater collected through the rainwater pipe passes through the filter and is stored as water in the storage tank the stored water is contamination prevention means 30 by spraying air from the air nozzle 20 of the water pollution prevention unit d and sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267401-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "21 and one or more are fixed at the same time and a fitting 22 is provided at the end of the injection pipe 21 so that it can be one touch coupled with the air supply hose 23 the fitting 22 is the body it is installed on the side surface 12 of the 10 and the internal receiving space 11 of the main body 10 contains a mixture of elvan quartz loess balls activated carbon and charcoal so as to prevent contamination or deterioration of the stored water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267401-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "21 and one or more are fixed at the same time and a fitting 22 is provided at the end of the injection pipe 21 so that it can be one touch coupled with the air supply hose 23 the fitting 22 is the body it is installed on the side surface 12 of the 10 and the internal receiving space 11 of the main body 10 contains a mixture of elvan quartz loess balls activated carbon and charcoal so as to prevent contamination or deterioration of the stored water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101942221-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "a floating frame held on the surface by the buoyant body a stretch bending tube supported on the floating frame and extending to a vertical lower portion and having a lower end positioned close to a bottom surface a pumping unit for pumping up the low level water of the water through the expansion and contraction tube in a state of being installed on the floating frame a battery for supplying power to the pumping unit and low level water jetting means for jetting water pumped by the pumping section a second sensor part for sensing the temperature of the surface layer water is mounted on the floating frame a second sensor part for sensing the temperature of the surface layer water is mounted on the floating frame the floating frame includes a cooling unit installed inside the housing and operated by receiving power from the battery the cooling unit cooling the low level water pumped by the pumping unit a pumping unit and a purge control unit for operating the freezing unit and the heating unit based on the water temperature information transmitted from the first sensor unit and the second sensor unit the freezing portion includes a cold water induction pipe for introducing water cooled by the freezing portion is connected to the cold water induction pipe and the cold water induction pipe is provided with a plurality of cold water nozzles for ejecting water passing through the cold water induction pipe the heating unit includes and a hot water induction pipe extending toward the bottom surface is connected to the bottom surface side of the water heat exchanger for guiding the water heated by the heating unit to the bottom surface side and a plurality of hot water nozzles for spraying water into the water tank a rotating ring for connecting the water circulating device and mixing the water between the water circulating devices the rotating ring being able to rotate and maintain a horizontal state in a state where the expansion and contraction tube of each water circulating device is wrapped a support portion mounted on the expansion and contraction tube and rotatably supporting the rotary ring at a lower portion of the rotary ring a rotating ring driving unit for rotating the rotating ring at a constant speed a circulation line for circulating the rotary ring of the one side water circulation device and the rotary ring of the other side water circulation device and a cutting block circulating along the circulation line while being fixed to the circulation line and dividing the water in front of the circulation line so as to create upflow and downflow wherein the rotary ring is a pulley shaped member having a constant diameter and has an inward gear on its inward face wherein the rotary ring driving section includes an underwater motor fixed to the expansion and bellows pipe and a drive gear fixed to a drive shaft of the underwater motor and meshing with the inward gear the support portion includes a height holding holder fixed to a lower portion of the rotary ring a plurality of support arms fixed to the height holding holder and extending to a bottom surface of the rotary ring and having roller bearings at extension ends thereof and a bearing roller which is mounted on a roller bearing of the rotary ring and contacts the bottom surface of the rotary ring and rolls when the rotary ring rotates in the circulation line horizontal rods extending in a direction orthogonal to the longitudinal direction of the circulation line and having coupling grooves are fixed at predetermined intervals the cutting block is a block shaped member having an upper inclined surface and a lower inclined surface that divides the water in the forward direction of the cutting block into an upper portion and a lower portion"}, {"pat_id": "US-4630676-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "the resin is then cured to form a relatively hard tight fitting rigid pipe lining which effectively seals any cracks and repairs any pipe or joint deterioration to prevent further leakage either into or out of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "US-11774044-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "due to the thermal expansion effect of the plastic welding pipe the evacuation pipe and the cutting area are fused together and cooled to the required time to complete the welding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure