g means 21 mlss sensing means 22 orp sensing means 23 temperature according to the control signal of the control unit 6 a cleaning means 27 for cleaning the contaminants attached to the surface of the sensing means 24 is additionally mounted the washing means 27 uses antifoam water as washing water to remove contaminants in the upper and lower portions of the vortex prevention wall fitting groove 28 a female side sine wave groove 29a processed in the form of a sine wave is processed the upper and lower portions of both ends of the vortex prevention wall 26 are processed in the form of a sine wave and a sine wave groove 29b on the male side engaged with the sine wave groove 29a on the female side is processed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102435204-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the dissolved oxygen concentration sensing means 4 in the measuring tank 2 the ph sensing means 21 the mlss sensing means 22 the orp sensing means 23 and the temperature sensing means 24 are included in the measurement tank 2 it is installed at an angle of 35 to 75 degrees from the horizontal plane to accurately measure the water quality of the treated water sample and to remove the suspended substances on the surface naturally"}, {"pat_id": "US-4763682-A", "para_id": "para_36", "text": "outlet opening 57 is similarly designed to receive a fitting that is connectable for example to a drain system all of which are not shown"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102031231-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "a waste filtration passage having a plurality of first filtration holes in the first filtration to filter the wastes contained in the filthy water flowing through the effluent inlet holes a first filtration panel fitted to the first fitting support and positioned in a longitudinal direction with respect to the inner cylinder and provided with a plurality of second filtration holes at a bottom thereof to filter out filthy water and wastes from the waste filtration tank secondly a second filtration panel fitted to the second fitting support and positioned longitudinally with respect to the inner cylinder and having a plurality of third filtration holes in the center to filter out filthy water and wastes from the first filtration panel in a third filter it is made.the present invention is provided with an outer cylinder embedded in cement or mortar and the inner cylinder to be inserted into the inside of the outer cylinder but because the inner cylinder and the outer cylinder are provided in a state separated from each other the hot sewage temperature flowing into the inner cylinder side is the outer cylinder by preventing the transfer to the side it is possible to prevent the external cylinder from generating heat deformation gap due to hot temperature and also to prevent the leakage of water leaked from the inner cylinder by being absorbed by cement or mortar"}, {"pat_id": "US-5150989-A", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "while the pressure is maintained the resin is cured to form a relatively hard tight fitting rigid pipe lining which effectively seals any cracks and repairs any pipe or joint deterioration to prevent further leakage either into or out of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "US-11053668-B1", "para_id": "para_154", "text": "as an example determining the leak height may include fitting the acquired pressure data to an equation of the form pressure c 1 time where c is a constant"}]</data>
