string reinforcement scrim to increase puncture and tear resistance or another suitable waterproof sheeting material"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102435204-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "when it reaches the top an overflow pipe that discharges the treated water located at the top to the outside of the measuring tank 2 is installed the oxygen supply means 5 is a main pipe 51 and blowing means 52 installed on the inlet side of the main pipe 51 to blow wind into the main pipe 51 branch pipe 53 branching at least two from the main pipe 51 each outlet communicating with each bioreactor 1 and an opening rate adjusting means 54 installed on the branch pipe 53 to adjust the opening rate inside the branch pipe 53 the blowing means 52 includes a blower 521 blower for blowing wind into the main pipe 51 and an rpm adjusting means 522 for adjusting the amount of oxygen flowing into the main pipe 51 by adjusting the number of revolutions per unit time of the blower 521 in the measuring tank 2 the dissolved oxygen concentration sensing means 4 ph sensing means 21 mlss sensing means 22 orp sensing means 23 temperature according to the control signal of the control unit 6 a cleaning means 27 for cleaning the contaminants attached to the surface of the sensing means 24 is additionally mounted the washing means 27 uses antifoam water as washing water to remove contaminants in the upper and lower portions of the vortex prevention wall fitting groove 28 a female side sine wave groove 29a processed in the form of a sine wave is processed the upper and lower portions of both ends of the vortex prevention wall 26 are processed in the form of a sine wave and a sine wave groove 29b on the male side engaged with the sine wave groove 29a on the female side is processed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102435204-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the dissolved oxygen concentration sensing means 4 in the measuring tank 2 the ph sensing means 21 the mlss sensing means 22 the orp sensing means 23 and the temperature 