north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101654689-B1", "para_id": "para_55", "text": "in the present application the terms comprises or having and the like are used to specify that there is a feature a number a step an operation an element a component or a combination thereof described in the specification but do not preclude the presence or addition of one or more other features integers steps operations elements components or combinations thereof.1 filter block 11 11 block body 111 distribution hole 12 12 cover 13 13 support member 131 132 separation preventing protrusion 133 fastening plate 2 rainwater drain cover member 4 filter block assembly 41 filter assembly part 411 stone publication 412 connecting plate 413 fitting groove 42 seat rest portion 5 rain storm housing 51 seating jaw 52 drain passage h inlet opening"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100375130-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in the past there was a poverty that caused social controversy such as untreated and discharged to the terminal treatment discharge pipe in the untreated state contaminating the water quality of the water supply source or adversely affect the biological growth in the water.the present invention has been invented to prevent the above closed end of the present invention is to be installed in the initial sedimentation tank cold dust chamber to the front end inlet of the body having a fastening flange portion is attached to the hinge portion formed on the upper surface of the body disc it is installed to be opened and closed by means of the connecting pipe through the fastener is installed on the left and right sides of the upper connecting portion between the supports connected to the shaft of the hinge portion the fitting section of the connecting pipe through the support between the buckle is installed in the early stage of rain when a large amount of rainwater flows in at this time as the floats fastened to the left and right connectors and the floats fastened to the disks the disks in the open open state move downwards to the support point to block the inlet formed at the tip of the body"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100966019-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a partial area is deleted to form a deletion part and an inverted outward bent part is formed such that a part to be cut when the deletion part is inverted bent to face the outside the pair of square plates constituting the opening and closing plate the lower end portion is finely protruded from the first opposing vertical plate portion in the state seated on the fall prevention plate portion the upper end portion is in contact with each other or finely spaced and each length is parallel to the short direction in the middle adjacent portion of the side edge portion side edges on both sides a fitting groove portion having a straight groove shape is formed toward the inner side and is fitted and coupled to the upward bent portion and the side edge side edge portion corresponding to the upper end side half divided by the fitting groove portion"}, {"pat_id": "US-8439648-B2", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "a tightly fitting cap can be emplaced covering the top of the entire assembly access box and outer tube in order to prevent rain or other water from entering the access box and inspection window"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100729127-B1", "para_id": "para_40", "text": "at this time the front end of the drain pipe 40 is fixed to the fitting groove 13 formed at the other end of the water collecting pipe 10 thereby preventing the rain and sewage leak through the joint portion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200321399-Y1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "here the filtration unit 10 is filtered while the rain water is passed through the pitcher block 11 in the rain the heavy water is converted into the heavy water the heavy water through the reservoir block 12 the drain hole 14 and the fitting pipe 15 21"}]</data>
