stallers and the weighted value according to the type of industry using tap water usage pattern analysis data at a specific time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the method of claim 1 it is installed to open and close on the upper surface of the treatment tank when the amount of rainfall exceeding the processing capacity the inner lid to block the top of the treatment tank to induce the rainfall to flow into the discharge box road surface drainage treatment device having an initial excellent treatment function further comprising a"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102418387-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "it is common to block the bicycle paths trails and trails with a lid so as not to cause harm or discomfort to users using the trails"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2886528-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "description of the related art generally on a pavement road a drainage system is provided to prevent rainwater from being stored on the road surface during rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102060765-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "therefore when heavy rain pours within a short time the other manhole of the concrete pipeline 110 is opened to drain the rainwater to the river the composite storage tank is temporarily stored in the river through the open manhole after temporarily storing the rainwater by doing so the quantity of rainwater flowing into the river can be reduced"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101301345-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "according to the above configuration and action according to the present invention the downstream circulation hole connecting the plurality of storage block valves to communicate with each other is provided to be opened and closed by the valve so that the storage space is flexibly adjusted according to the rainfall during rain and thus the unused storage space is always kept clean"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101058919-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "this collection device is designed to automatically collect and remove only the rainwat