  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100654221-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "there are problems such as being adversely affected.as invented to solve the conventional problems as described above the object of the present invention is to easily install in the required position inside the inclined pipe in the apartment house to reduce the flow rate of the pipeline while satisfying the design construction and design standards of the sewer pipe it is to provide a flow rate reducing device of the sewage pipe installed on the inclined surface that can prevent crushing or breakage of the sewage pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101519076-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "the present invention is intended to provide a device for storing rainwater generated by intensive rainfall or the like on a sloping slope of a slope so that drainage can be facilitated effectively so that a floodwater suddenly blowing due to heavy rain or the like is provided as a separate drain pipe and provides a separate crushing structure to facilitate the drainage of the drainage which is entrained with soil floats and the like"}]</data>
