ay rainwater storage device for the filtering space characterized in that it comprises at least one overflow plate having a relatively lower height than the outer wall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101346104-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "the second vertical plate extending a certain length directly below the lower surface of the deck and relative to the permeable concrete bottom layer of the reservoir portion than the outer wall and a second filtration plate installed to be replaceable in an opening formed in an opening formed at a lower end in contact with an upper end of the overflow partition which is provided at a low height to remove the non point pollutant contained in the rainwater that overflows the overflow partition"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100487067-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "therefore the rainwater flowing on the road 28 in the direction of the arrow b in case of rainfall moves toward each grill 14 and passes through the pit chamber 16 the screening chamber 40 and the grit chamber 48 and then the leakage pipe 20"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2663214-B2", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in the rainwater treatment facility according to the present invention in the case of a combined sewer system a lower weir having a height corresponding to the water level due to initial rainfall and a higher weir are provided in a part of the sewer pipe"}, {"pat_id": "EP-1522525-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "the pit used here consists of a settling pit which is connected via an inlet to a filter shaft"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101644963-B1", "para_id": "para_78", "text": "according to one embodiment the high concentration rainfall runoff that has passed through the first stage purification facility first water purification unit of the water quality purification unit g is transferred to the treated water feet 73 through the treated the polluted river water or low concentration rainwater having passed through the two stage facility second water quality purification unit is transferred to the natural water under the treated water pit 73 and discharged to the river or supplied as reused water or if there is a subsequent linkage facility it may be configured to be transported to that facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101080805-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "like the high concentration overflow water storage tank 220 a slope a solid pit and a pump may be provided at the lower portion of the low concentration overflow water storage tank 230 and the storage stored in the low concentration overflow water storage tank 230 after the rainfall is terminated through the pump"}]</data>
