  <data key="d6">["degrade", "turbine", "retightene", "warm", "make", "disrupt", "work", "combine", "valve", "drill", "solve", "confirm", "weld", "sink", "connect", "trap", "float", "base", "indicate", "accord", "sld", "fasten", "dump", "refer", "increase", "stand", "cause", "leave", "secure", "assembly", "anchor", "have", "send", "compile", "affect", "discard", "complete", "would", "reinforce", "begin", "fix", "flow", "add", "reset", "go", "can", "trim", "fuse", "revolve", "pump", "mislay", "provide", "wrap", "chamfer", "lift", "handle", "contain", "grab", "cast", "hold", "uncoil", "ship", "bend", "balance", "set", "prevent", "compare", "attach", "scale", "meet", "depict", "rope", "correspond", "leak", "form", "measure", "divide", "plow", "eliminate", "alter", "crush", "size", "kill", "accelerate", "seal", "save", "spray", "produce", "vibrate", "switch", "limit", "occur", "wind", "depend", "couple", "equip", "repair", "pressurize", "check", "release", "mix", "inform", "push", "oil", "do", "determine", "underwater", "settle", "bubble", "pack", "create", "sonar", "alternate", "flash", "cure", "lock", "wait", "join", "deteriorate", "regulate", "surface", "ld", "baffle", "tow", "become", "fall", "hoist", "integrate", "coat", "point", "clean", "allow", "weave", "simplify", "lead", "insert", "sag", "spawn", "dry", "box", "cover", "adopt", "reduce", "surround", "plug", "may", "head", "decelerate", "warn", "bond", "hit", "designate", "freeze", "corrode", "derive", "cool", "store", "bush", "start", "fit", "design", "net", "drive", "spot", "isolate", "change", "separate", "guide", "include", "act", "incline", "operate", "should", "power", "enter", "block", "expand", "open", "blow", "supply", "absorb", "use", "define", "construct", "propeller", "stop", "port", "charge", "cut", "asphyxiate", "straighten", "could", "break", "peel", "throttle", "sense", "finish", "identify", "require", "draw", "close", "rotate", "heat", "classify", "galvanize", "avoid", "maintain", "install", "control", "case", "monitor", "fail", "shape", "input", "damage", "be", "age", "rack", "generate", "adjust", "collect", "instal", "bleed", "mark"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-4819721-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "while the pressure is maintained the resin is cured to form a relatively hard tight fitting rigid pipe lining which effectively seals any cracks and repairs any pipe or joint deterioration to prevent further leakage either into or out of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2824249-B2", "para_id": "para_66", "text": "by adopting such a structure the connector itself also generates heat so that the t shaped joint can be sufficiently heated and the effect of preventing freezing becomes more remarkable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102101131-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "due to this stress the inner circumferential surface of the water pipe becomes seriously damaged such as peeling peeling or cracking and the expansion joint which is a stretch joint is damaged due to elastic deformation due to a temperature difference and leaks are caused by this"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100780274-B1", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "it is possible to prevent the deformation or deformation in advance and even if there is a change in the ground the displacement amount can be absorbed thereby effectively preventing distortion or damage of the sewer pipe"}, {"pat_id": "US-4630676-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "the resin is then cured to form a relatively hard tight fitting rigid pipe lining which effectively seals any cracks and repairs any pipe or joint deterioration to prevent further leakage either into or out of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102714293-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "it further includes a side fixing structure 54 formed to guide steam from a steam inlet to a condensate outlet while fixing a shell 20a and a sludge drying tank 10 in a spaced state a manhole 14 formed on the top of the sludge drying tank 10 to allow a worker to enter the inside of the sludge drying tank 10 a cover body 61 joined by a fastener to block the manhole 14 a manhole cover 60 including the cover body 61 and a hot air blower 90 installed in the cover body 61 to blow high temperature hot air into the inside of the sludge drying tank 10 through the manhole 14"}, {"pat_id": "US-11774044-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "a vertical comparison time sequence allows the hydrogen concentration curve at each evacuation pipe to be derived over time and a horizontal comparison sensor position allows the specific leak position of the pipeline to be determined"}, {"pat_id": "US-11774044-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "due to the thermal expansion effect of the plastic welding pipe the evacuation pipe and the cutting area are fused together and cooled to the required time to complete the welding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_417", "text": "sixth thoroughly check and confirm whether there is any gas leakage from the valve or flange joint and tight surface of the piping system whether there is any abnormality in power consumption and whether there is any abnormality in the operation of automatic devices and monitoring devices"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flash