  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200413254-Y1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "however when the conventional water and sewage pipe constructed in this way is installed on the inclined surface of the ground 1 as shown in figure 1 due to the sliding phenomenon of the water and sewage pipe 10 the joint 11 of the water and sewage pipe 10 are spaced apart from each other a large amount of fluid is leaked to the outside through the separation portion there is a problem that causes serious environmental pollution of surface water and groundwater due to leakage in the case of sewage or waste water.the present invention is to solve the problems as described above by fixing the water supply pipe installed on the inclined surface to the fixed pile through the binding beam and the fastening band to prevent the sliding of the water pipe to prevent the joints from being damaged by the sliding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200181920-Y1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "due to the development of the industrial society the water is contaminated and the water of the river or lake cannot be used as drinking water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the ini