rner 872e discard pipe 873 aggregate spreader 874 crusher 874a gyreto crusher 874b sash frame 874c feeder hopper 874d vibrating grease repeater 874e first jaw crusher of the crushing head 874f second jaw crusher at the rear of the crushing chamber 874g vibrating screen 874h drum elevator 875 air compressor 876 perforator 877 pilot and extractor 878 sand collector 879 dredger 879a pump dredger 879b bucket dredger 879c spotted shear 879d cab or control room 879e red shear 879f spotted 879g blast tank 879h blast pump 879i red 879j engine room 879k dipper dredger 879l grab dredger 879m bucket drive 879n after spotted 879o spotted winch 879p bucket 879q left and right front spotted 879r dipper 879s winch 879t anchor store 879u belt conveyor 879v grab 880 separately designated construction machinery 882 pile driver 882a boom 883 diesel pile hammer 884 steam hammer 885 hydraulic crane 885a piston motor 886 tower crane 886a names of each part of the guy derrick structure 886b guy derrick 886c main 886d boom 886e boom foil 886f turnbuckle 886g sling 886h triangular derrick 886i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413252-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in other words due to the change of temperature and external impacts depending on the season and the impact of the uplift and settlement of the ground the mortar inlet is easily damaged and water tightness is degraded"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101484939-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "in the present invention when the building is downward the wastewater pipe is folded by the joints folded in multiple stages and when the building is raised by the buoyancy the wastewater pipe is expanded together with the joint it is possible to minimize the exposure of the various hoses supplied and discharged to the outside to avoid damage to the aesthetics and to prevent the hoses exposed to the outside from being lost by the river at a high flow rate it is possible to prevent problems such as wastewater leaking and contamination of the surroundings and to prevent the administrator from having to dispatch the hose and the wires separately by hand when the flood and the flood alert sound"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101139331-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "here the pair of band rings are arranged in a pair to the upper and lower water pipes and the upper and lower band rings installed with the water pipes therebetween are bolted to each other through the anchor bolt to support the water pipes.as described above the water pipe cross water reinforcement device according to the present invention is connected to the joint connecting panel and the water conduit is arranged on the base panel having a height control function of the water pipe and then the sand mortar layer frp cover layer by forming the nonwoven fabric layer and the gabion layer it is possible to prevent the phenomenon such as sinking bending or twisting the water supply pipe as the bottom of the river is deformed by the flow rate or scour generated in the underwater river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "the present invention relates to a joint fitting installation structure used for sewage waterworks roads river banks and landfill leachate drainage works to prevent leakage of the joints to prevent leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414850-Y1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "in general leak treatment equipment is installed in joint sections of sewers used for sewerage waterworks roads river dikes and landfill leachate drainage to prevent leakage"}]</data>
</edge>
