  <data key="d6">["manage", "place", "receive", "subject", "make", "compose", "solve", "connect", "accord", "fasten", "embed", "achieve", "cause", "leave", "have", "bag", "fix", "flow", "can", "relate", "output", "provide", "lift", "bend", "organize", "clamp", "prevent", "compare", "arrange", "inspect", "form", "measure", "calculate", "seal", "suppose", "chip", "occur", "couple", "check", "fill", "overlap", "correct", "push", "determine", "convert", "assemble", "cure", "bury", "support", "mount", "dismantle", "integrate", "deform", "locate", "seat", "may", "configure", "bond", "cool", "start", "separate", "guide", "include", "act", "perform", "open", "expand", "absorb", "use", "construct", "prefabricate", "unify", "pin", "transmit", "shape", "damage", "be", "generate", "collect", "instal", "comprise"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100906461-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "since the members have the form of connecting the small pipes to each other if the pressure such as earth pressure or hydraulic pressure acts on the sewage pipe after being buried in the ground or it is left in the air for a long time without being directly buried in the ground after the production of the small pipe and the joint member since the cooling state and the physical properties are connected differently there is a defect that the breakage occurs while the separation phenomenon occurs in the connection portion between the small pipe and the joint member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100907701-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "since the members have the form of connecting the small pipes to each other if the pressure such as earth pressure or hydraulic pressure acts on the sewage pipe after being buried in the ground or it is left in the air for a long time without being directly buried in the ground after the production of the small pipe and the joint member since the cooling state and the physical properties are connected differently there is a defect that the breakage occurs while the separation phenomenon occurs in the connection portion between the small pipe and the joint member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100780274-B1", "para_id": "para_65", "text": "it is possible to prevent the deformation or deformation in advance and even if there is a change in the ground the displacement amount can be absorbed thereby effectively preventing distortion or damage of the sewer pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200185447-Y1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "by the way the spherical frp water tank is composed of wall panels to be assembled as a whole and the cross sectional shape is formed as a rectangle so that the wall panel subjected to hydraulic pressure acts on a bending moment around the joint"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200185447-Y1", "para_id": "para_46", "text": "therefore the conventional wall panel and the wall panel is directly bonded in a planar shape the wall panels arranged adjacent to each other around the joint at the four corners are deformed by the force of the hydraulic pressure the bending moment around the junction there is an advantage to solve the problem that the leakage caused by the gap between the gap between the wall panel is opened by the action"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102267268-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "1 to 4 and 8 the support unit 300 prevents the water block 200 from being damaged or deformed due to the pressure such as sewage flowing in from the front of the water block 200 and prevents the water block 200 from being damaged"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5725558-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thereby it is supposed that the water pressure test which test inspects the presence or absence of the water leak from the joint part of the fluid pipe tube located in an annular sealed space with the hydraulic pressure of the water with which it fills in the annular sealed space can be performed"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5725558-B2", "para_id": "para_80", "text": "1a inlet tube section water pipe 1b receiving pipe part water pipe 1a pipe inner peripheral surface 1c expanded base end surface 1d large diameter inner peripheral surface 2a receiving pipe part other water pipes 2b inlet tube part other water pipes 2a pipe inner peripheral surface 2d outer peripheral surface 2e front end surface 10 cylindrical main body 20 annular water stop bag 51 wheel 70 arc shaped mounting portion 70a inner peripheral surface 70b outer peripheral surface 70c insertion front end surface 71 annular portion 71a inner peripheral surface 71b insertion front end surface 72 circular fitting part 72a inner peripheral surface 72b outer peripheral surface 72c insertion tip surface 73 lifting hook 80 support base 81 height adjustment part a hydraulic pressure tester b joint part g in pipe carry in guide device p1 water pipe fluid pipe p2 other water pipes fluid pipes x tube axis fluid tube y axis cylindrical body z axis arc shaped mounting part"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101257647-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "analog to digital converter for converting to a digital signal a microcontroller for receiving the output value of the analog to digital converter in a pin to pin pin to pin method and corrected by an algorithm and output the output signal of the microcontroller in a serial method a sensor unit comprising a plurality of measuring devices including a hydraulic pressure measuring device including a communication unit which transmits to a field collecting device of a water supply pipe management system but transmits accurate data through a parity bit check for checking crc errors a plurality of field collecting devices collecting data provided from a plurality of measuring devices forming the sensor unit a data collection device collecting data through the plurality of field collection devices a water supply pipe network gis geographic information system device that organizes and manages geographic and facility data such as pipe codes installation blocks pipe diameters pipe types buried years pipe ages joint methods and coordinates of water pipes pipeline code date of report start of construction completion of construction whether to dismantle closure depth water pressure leakage surface leakage amount leakage area leakage classification cause of damage damage type construction subsidy measures an accident management device that stores and manages data related to the water supply pipe such as contents accident route photos and personnel opinions a weight extraction device that receives the factors necessary for weight calculation from the water supply network gis device and the accident management device and calculates the weight for each factor through the opinion of an expert integrate and organize the data received from the water supply network gis device and the incident management device by block and factor and unify the limit value and the comparison unit so that the strength of data can be compared and then determine the search order of the block"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101257647-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "water supply pipe network integrity evaluation system using the hydraulic pressure measurement information according to the present invention for achieving these objects comprises a sensor unit comprising a plurality of measuring devices including the hydraulic pressure measurement device according to the present invention a plurality of field collecting devices collecting data provided from a plurality of measuring devices forming the sensor unit a data collection device collecting data through the plurality of field collection devices a water supply pipe network gis geographic information system device that organizes and manages geographic and facility data such as pipe codes installation blocks pipe diameters pipe types buried years pipe ages joint methods and coordinates of water pipes pipeline code date of report start of construction completion of construction whether to dismantle closure depth water pressure leakage surface leakage amount leakage area leakage classification cause of damage damage type construction subsidy measures an accident management device that stores and manages data related to water supply pipes such as contents accident pipeline photos and personnel opinions a weight extraction device that receives the factors necessary for weight calculation in the water supply network gis device and the accident management device and calculates a weight for each factor through opinion of an expert integrate and organize the data received from the water supply network gis device and the incident management device by block and factor and unify the limit value and the comparison unit so that the strength of data can be compared and then determine the search order of the block"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101719362-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "the method according to claim 1 the up and down adjustment device 800 two first hydraulic cylinders 811 and a second hydraulic cylinder 812 are configured between the arm clamping bracket 450 and the head clamping unit 500 coupled to the joint shaft 430 a hydraulic compression cylinder device 850 for generating the hydraulic pressure necessary for the operation of the first and second hydraulic cylinders 811 and 812 is installed in the housing 300 a flexible hose 860 may be connected between the first and second hydraulic cylinders 811 and 812 and the hydraulic compression cylinder apparatus 850 the hydraulic compression cylinder device 850 includes a cylinder block 851 in which a plurality of compression grooves 851a are formed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101026854-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "as the bottom plate construction method for the prefabricated water tank placing and curing concrete in a formwork constructed to a size that can support the water tank to form a first base chipping the first base surface and forming a joint in the same shape as the water tank arranging and assembling the base frame to the first base surface in accordance with the joint seating an angle bent to be in close contact with the inner surface of the base frame and the first base surface coupling a fixing bolt having a support member embedded in the concrete of the second base to each fastening hole of the angle and the base frame is supported so as not to be pushed by hydraulic pressure and fastening the fixing support by fastening the fixing nut to the fixing bolt making a step fixing the angle fixed by the fastening support with a set bolt to a first base seating a drain portion of the same block as a drain box and a pipe for guiding drainage of water on an upper surface of the first foundation inside the base frame placing and curing concrete so as to be gradient in the direction of the drain portion in the base frame on which the drain portion is seated to form a second foundation separating a block of the drain portion in the second foundation and installing a plurality of polyethylene sheets so that the ends overlap the upper surface of the second foundation fixing the drain box and the polyethylene sheet by heat fusion in a state in which the drain box of the drain portion is seated on the second base from which the block is separated and a plurality of fastener mounting steps mounted on a second base to prevent the flow of the polyethylene sheet by contraction so as to fix the polyethylene sheet"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932022-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "since the members have the form of connecting the small pipes to each other if the pressure such as earth pressure or hydraulic pressure acts on the sewage pipe after being buried in the ground or it is left in the air for a long time without being directly buried in the ground after the production of the small pipe and the joint member since the cooling state and the physical properties are connected differently there is a defect that the breakage occurs while the separation phenomenon occurs in the connection portion between the small pipe and the joint member"}]</data>
