  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-S6042129-Y2", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "it increases adhesive strength has a remarkable effect on water leakage prevention and durability and prevents water from leaking from joints causing damage to plants in waterways or causing damage to humans and livestock due to toxic wastewater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102101131-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "due to this stress the inner circumferential surface of the water pipe becomes seriously damaged such as peeling peeling or cracking and the expansion joint which is a stretch joint is damaged due to elastic deformation due to a temperature difference and leaks are caused by this"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200341003-Y1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "between the concrete unit structure a is grounded on both sides and forms a shape to form the same ground plane as the structure a as a whole to allow insertion the vertical body connected to the upper side by the variable joint 1 when viewed in cross section composed between the concrete unit structure a consisting of two parts 10 and the horizontal body portion 30 to each side of the central body portion of the vertical body portion 10 so that the joint device 100 can be seated after adjusting and fixing the variable joint 1 to be horizontal with the upper surface of the concrete unit structure by the height adjustment fixing bolt b with the bolt groove 31 formed on the horizontal body portion 30 the joint with the concrete unit structure variable joints of the joint apparatus 100 even though expansion and contraction occurs by forming a gap between the apparatuses 100 using a construction material such as mortar or crowd mortar to form a unit of the concrete unit structure a"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5979903-B2", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "according to this configuration when the external water pressure acts on the joint portion of the concrete structure the flexible water impervious sheet tries to swell due to the external water pressure and the first and second swelling suppression plates"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101841348-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "particularly the connection socket portion provided in the mutual connection of the water pipe is formed as a double bond type so that the construction of the water pipe can be facilitated and a reliable joint structure can be achieved so that there is no deformation due to earth pressure or external pressure during construction or after construction of the water pipe"}, {"pat_id": "JP-6120732-B2", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the example of this invention which stuck the seal sticker on the seam of the u shaped ditch channel.specific cross sectional structure of a seal.sectional drawing which stuck the sealing material on the joint part of the u shaped ditch water channel via the primer and the sealing material.sectional drawing which affixed the sealing material on the seam part of a u shaped ditch waterway.work process to attach a sealing material to the seam.work process to attach a sealing material to the seam.work process to attach a sealing material to the seam.work process to attach a sealing material to the seam.the external view of the general u shaped concrete block which comprises a u shaped ditch waterway"}]</data>
</edge>
