  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-7767093-B2", "para_id": "para_71", "text": "the presence of lead materials in water systems is significant because the water passing through lead service lines and joint packing materials could be corrosive thereby leaching lead from the lines and packing materials and increasing lead levels in the drinking water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101036278-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water leakage safe diagnosis system in sewage wastewater and leachate treatment plantsthe present invention relates to a leak safety diagnosis device for sewage wastewater and leachate treatment plant and more particularly to protect the pipe from external influences while increasing the coupling force and sealing force of the joint portion where the pipe and the pipe contact each other and to prevent the leakage of the pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromoti