6i main 886j boom 886k boom foil 886l rack 887 drag crane 887a structure of drag crane 887b hoist cable 887c dump cable 887d bucket 887e lower boom 887f retroflex cable 887g cable roller 887h boom cable 887i cable roller 887j boom hoist cable 887k cable drum 887l cable drum 887m parallel weight 888 crane with clamshell attachment 888a holding line 888b opening line 888c clamshell bucket 888d upper frame 888e lower frame 888f rack line 888g rope guide 888h boom tendon 888i bridle 888j boom hoist rope 888k front drum 888l rear drum 888m parallel weights 889 macadam roller 890 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "US-11585467-B2", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "if not treated in time the joint misalignment will cause the pipeline leakage that the sewage in the pipeline leaks and the surrounding soil gradually becomes hollow further causing the environmental pollution and the accident such as the urban road collapse which seriously affects the ecological environment and the travel safety of the residents"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102644212-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "the method of repairing the joint of the manhole sewer pipe and drain pipe of the present invention to achieve the above object is to dig up the area around the manhole 10 where the water leak occurred and then remove the existing buried sewer pipe or the existing pipe used as the drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102644212-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "the method of repairing the joint of a manhole sewer pipe and a drain pipe according to the present invention which has the characteristics described above is easy to block water because the repair is performed using clay in a paste state with good wettability even in the process of sewage and drainage leaking to the outside of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102644212-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "and after the curing and hardening of the mortar the area around the manhole is restored and cleaned up and finished s600 so that the water leak phenomenon occurring at the joint 70 of the manhole can be repaired and above all the sewage water leaking to the outside of the manhole because it is easy to block water and drains using clay rapid repair work is possible"}]</data>
