  <data key="d6">["dispose", "treat", "prevent", "house", "penetrate", "arrange", "connect", "form", "close", "insert", "suspend", "filter", "box", "have", "pass", "inject", "may", "fix", "shape", "communicate", "flow", "damage", "be", "store"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101847553-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "an excellent filtration part 100 formed in a circular pipe shape penetrating the lower sidewall of the manhole 1 to filter out contaminants and suspended matters of excellent quality and at least one or more excellent penetration block boxes 200 each having a plate top plate 210 and a box shaped block main body 220 in which water permeable holes 201 are formed on the wall surface 20 for forming a reservoir space for storing stormwater flowing through the reservoir the superfiltration unit 100 a filtration tube 110 disposed at one side of the manhole 1 in the direction of a side wall of the manhole 1 in order to treat the contaminants and dirt that may flow into the lower portion of the manhole 1 a connection pipe 120 disposed outside the sidewall of the manhole 1 so as to communicate with the other side of the filtration cylinder 110 in order to inject the storm that passes through the filtration cylinder 110 into the storage vessel 20 and and a joint pipe 130 vertically penetrating the sidewall of the manhole 1 with an accommodation space for communicating the filtration cylinder 110 and the connection pipe 120 the filtering cylinder 110 and a plurality of upper filter banks 111a which are arranged at a predetermined interval and have a semicircular shape on the upper side of the width directional section with respect to the intermediate net 111a 111 having a filter body 111b and a filtering medium 112a disposed on the lower side of the widthwise end surface of the filtration outer casing 111 with respect to the intermediate mesh 111a and an inner filtration net 112b having a circular mesh at the longitudinal end thereof and a filtration inner tube 112 housed inside the filtration outer tube 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200480536-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in addition the bellows sleeve is inserted into the connecting tube and the space between the bellows is closed thereby preventing the joint parts of the bellows sleeve and the connecting tube from being damaged and there is a fixed and leakage free effect"}]</data>
</edge>
