  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101615921-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a cylindrical vertical fixing body 114 which can be used by inserting a shaft into the water pre coupling part 112 to be connected to the water discharge front 30 of the water pipe 10 a body support member 110 including a body screw 115 a cylindrical vertical conveying body 124 for inserting the body supporting member 110 therein a conveying body screw 125 for vertically conveying the body supporting member 110 by screwing the fixing body screw 115 in correspondence with the fixing body screw 115 a shaft bar penetrating hole 123 formed in the upper end of the body 124 in a cylindrical hole shape and a rod tight contact portion 122 clogged in a roof shape from the shaft bar penetrating hole 123 and an axial rod handle 126 not shown joined to the outer peripheral surface of the vertical transfer body 124 a shaft lifting member 120 including a shaft supporting member 120 a circular body 134 mounted inside the combined body of the body supporting member 110 and the shaft lifting member 120 and formed to be long in the vertical direction and a circular body 134 formed in the upper end of the circular body 134 a coupling part 136 provided at the lower end of the circular body 134 and a coupling part 136 formed at the lower end of the circular body 134 so as to be detachably coupled to the coupling part 136 the tapper 140 includes a polygonal engaging portion 142 for fitting the engaging portion 136 and a threaded portion 142 formed on the diaphragm 12 of the water pipe 10 a thread forming shaft 130 including an inclined portion 146 formed at a lower end thereof a circular body 154 which can be mounted inside the combined body of the body supporting member 110 and the shaft lifting member 120 by replacing the thread forming shaft rod 130 and formed to be long in the vertical direction a polygonal tightening portion 152 existing at the upper end of the circular body 154 and an axial joint portion 156 existing at the lower end of the circular body 154 and a shaft and a closing bolt 160 which can tightly close the branch hole 12 by performing thread engagement with the branch hole 12 of the water pipe 10 a thread closing portion 164 which is screwed to the thread forming portion 144 formed in the branch hole 12 of the water pipe 10 a bolt fastening shaft rod 150 including a cutout 166 for cutting the closing bolt 160 of 100 of the water pipe branch"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102411899-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "however in the case of such a square water tank the inside of the water tank is complicated due to the angles 16 and 17 installed in the inside of the water tank complicatedly the drainage during cleaning is poor and many problems occur during maintenance and also the angle 16 since 17 is joined to the joint 13 of the panel 12 by welding the number of angles 16 and 17 increases in proportion to the number of welds and thus there is a problem that a lot of welding corrosion may occur"}]</data>
</edge>
