  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102434028-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in addition it is possible to suppress the load and delay that may occur according to the operation change of the management means for such verification and to optimize the installation and operation state through an active response to the external environment.the present invention provides a water pipe connection system of a prefabricated water intake tower for water intake and a method for installing the same comprising the steps of manufacturing a water pipe connection system the manufactured water pipe connection system is inspected at the inspection site and the water pipe connection system is installed at the installation site wherein the water pipe connection system is managed by monitoring facilities disposed at the inspection site and the installation site respectively the handling situation of the water pipe connection system and the surrounding environment the water pipe connection system includes an excavation hole 10 penetrating in an up stream direction at a predetermined position of the dam body 100 installed to block and confine water a water intake pipe connection system of a prefabricated water intake tower for water intake including a discharge pipe 20 having one end connected to the lower part of the water intake tower body 200 built in a prefabricated manner in the water in the reservoir and the other end extending toward the excavation hole 10"}]</data>
</edge>
