  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100846069-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "therefore it was to manually remove the dirt deposited on the bottom of the manhole every certain time"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200468245-Y1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the collecting basin 20 to block backflow and the collecting basin for dividing and filtering the soil sand and cigarette butts and rubbish mixed with rainwater or sewage so as to maintain a predetermined distance from the bottom and the side of the inside of the sump 20 in the rain gutter drain provided with 30 the sump 20 is of the upper and lower strait shape having a seating jaw 22b formed at the top edge of the entrance 22a to hang inside the manhole 10 via the support frame 42 of the manhole cover 40"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200468245-Y1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "according to the simple manhole of the rain gutter drain according to the present invention the manhole cover 40 fixed to the upper end step surface 14 of the opening 12 of the manhole 10 via the support frame 42 and the manhole 10 mounted to a predetermined height inside to block the backflow of the sewage and backflow of odor and is installed to maintain a certain distance from the bottom and sides of the inside of the sump 20 the sand mixed in rainwater or sewage in the rain gutter sewer having a collecting cabinet 30 for dividing and filtering cigarette butts and garbage respectively the collecting well has a seating jaw at the upper edge of the entrance so as to be suspended inside the manhole through the support frame of the manhole cover"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102183756-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the manhole configured to inflow and discharge sewage 1 such as rain and sewage 2 of living and to prevent the discharge of odors generated inside or the inflow of rats and pests while the grating 11 that prevents the inflow of foreign matters is seated on the upper part an integral locking net 13a is formed to prevent the inflow of foreign matters to all