le for checking the amount of the deposited foreign matter on the ground at a predetermined interval in the sewage pipe or the drainage pipe or for discharging the precipitate to the ground in the manhole cover network mounted on the upper part of the manhole and connected to the rectangular frame and the support in the transverse longitudinal direction of the frame to prevent a large foreign object or person falling into the manhole a frame formed at the edge of the manhole cover net or a hook ring is installed in each of the four corners so as to be caught by the transverse support and the lower end of the hook ring is coupled and the lower cover is formed in a vertical direction with the hook ring"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054283-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "is inserted into the manhole buried in the ground the receiving space is formed to receive the rainwater flowing through the cover mounted on the upper manhole and foreign matter contained in the sewage is connected to the drain pipe provided on the bottom of the manhole on one side a drain hole is formed and provided with a smaller than the width of the inner manhole and a blocking member provided between the soil collecting member and the inner wall of the manhole to block foreign matter contained in the rainwater and the sewage flowing through the cover from flowing between the inner wall of the manhole and the soil collecting member including one side of the soil collecting outlet where the drain hole is formed is in contact with the inner wall of the manhole in which the drain pipe is formed and the blocking member is formed in an open shape in contact with the inner wall in which the drain pipe is formed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101865757-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "a manhole body having a lid formed by spacing a plurality of penetrating holes communicating with the ground for natural discharge of rainwater and at least the upper end thereof from the bottom of the manhole body is arranged at a height corresponding to the inflow pipe and divides the inside thereof into two chambers and in order to induce deceleration of the flow velocity of the rainwater flowing from the inflow pipe to the outflow pipe there is disclosed a rainwater storage and manhole facility apparatus including a partition wall provided with a distribution hole for communicating compartments.1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101080118-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in addition the conventional technique described above has a problem in that leakage of the sewage is serious because it is difficult to cope with shrinkage expansion caused by torsion of the sewer pipe or seasonal factors.the present invention has been made to solve the various problems according to the prior art described above an object of the present invention is to facilitate the coupling between the above mentioned water outlet socket and sewage pipe while allowing the sewage pipe to be connected to the manhole using the water outlet socket the sewage pipe can be precisely combined and to provide a new structure of the manhole and the sewer pipe to prevent the external earth and sand inflow and leakage of internal sewage or rain water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200299979-Y1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "the method of claim 1 the manhole 70 is made of a structure that can be combined with the expandable square concrete box while the manhole 70 has a sealing member seating groove 72 in a rectangular shape on the upper surface of the manhole body 71"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "the present invention by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113 the rainwater from the original while performing the function of the guerrilla torrential rain flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101156757-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "the simple manhole cover is formed when the manhole cover is detached to the outside due to the high water pressure inside the manhole during the backflow of sewage due to torrential rain etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100868067-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "in the practice of the present invention the filling material 400 filled in each of the storage room 240 340 may be used to fill the mortar 420 or tuscon 430 of various colors the display unit 500 the manhole characters or marks of local governments or administrative offices that manage 100 are displayed or applications such as rain or sewage are indicated.as described above the present invention is to fill the filling in the pedestal frame and the lid frame constituting the manhole to cure the curing hardening constituting the storage room in the mold the storage room is composed of the side plate reinforcement and the bottom plate integrally by doing so it is possible not only to prevent breakage of the fillings filled in the storage room but also to construct the fillings in various forms thereby producing various types of manholes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102897725-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "and when the inflow is finished naturally blocks the inlet without any separate work thereby closely blocking the odor leaking from the bottom"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "according to the present invention during rain the initial rainwater containing non point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "it further comprises a plurality of penetration guide member 160 is filled so as to form a void around the manhole 110 in order to penetrate into the ground while temporarily storing the rain water passing through the filter unit 140