 vertical portions 115 to discharge a large amount of rain and garbage deformed by the hydraulic pressure of the sewage to the water hole 116 while being drained down and after completion of drainage to return to the original state to prevent the odor coming up through the water hole 116 fixing the blocking plate 118 of a material having elasticity and excellent return force the discharge hole 117 is a sewer manhole odor prevention device characterized in that it comprises a rotating plate 120 installed so as to block the odor coming up while draining the rain and waste of the opposite"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102352805-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the hinge 36 is eccentrically formed to block the discharge holes 38a and 38b formed to discharge rain or sewage respectively and the first blocking part 31 is formed in the shape of a hemisphere while the discharge hole 38a a manhole capable of smooth flow of rain or various types of sewage and removal of odors characterized in that it comprises"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102352805-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it relates to a manhole that allows the smooth flow and flow of rain and various types of sewage while double blocking the bad odors coming from the inside so that it is possible to block the source of the bad smells and it is possible to smoothly flow and remove odors of rain or various types of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102352805-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "a first blocking portion and a second blocking portion are provided but the hinge is eccentrically formed so as to be formed inside the main body and the first blocking portion and the second blocking portion can block the discharge hole formed to discharge rain or sewage respectively and the first blocking portion it is characterized in that it comprises a while being formed in the shape of a hemisphere the discharge means provided with an anti shock portion on the discharge hole to prevent impact and block odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102266083-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "sewage odor blocking device for manholethe present invention relates to a sewage odor blocking device for a manhole and more particularly a plate having an inlet hole formed in the center so that external fluid flows in while supporting the manhole cover a storage tube formed at the lower end of the plate and the storage container it is composed of a blocking film that closes the lower end of the bin and the barrier film automatically closes the lower end of the reservoir by gravity in normal times to smoothly block odors flowing back from the water supply and sewerage system and an open film is formed on the barrier film and the open film is a barrier film and by rotating in the opposite direction the upper and lower sewer pipes overflow in the rainy season or rain and are opened to the backflowing fluid to discharge the fluid to the outside thereby preventing the manhole from being opened by water pressure thereby preventing personal injury and the upper part of the plate by installing a blocking net on the side it is possible to filter out foreign substances in the fluid flowing through the inlet hole and prevent the water supply sewerage or odor blocking device from being blocked by foreign substances and safety information for maintaining manhole management and preventing safety accidents it relates to a sewage odor blocking device for manholes marked with"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically the present invention relates to a safety manhole cover for preventing rainwater trapping with a catch preventing part and a slope to prevent safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage during rainy weather and to prevent accidents caused by footing when a pedestrian is walking"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "there was a problem that causes an electric shock accident.in order to solve these problems the present invention prevents safety accidents due to rain