  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102240942-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "dry tube impregnation step of impregnating a resin using a resin impregnation device investigate the pipe line between the manhole at the front end and the manhole at the rear end to be repaired but in the case of a small diameter pipe insert a cctv equipped investigation equipment into the pipe to cause damage intrusion in the small diameter pipe the gradient of the small diameter pipe and the presence of obstacles"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102216269-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "now when an earthquake occurs by breaking away from the conventional manhole design and construction method it is desperately required to improve so as not to cause stress concentration torsion damage and grade defects in the inlet and drain hole joints.there is korean patent registration no"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100338306-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "conventionally in order to reduce the flow velocity of the pipeline the pipeline is laid with a gentle gradient and a drop hole or manhole is installed in the middle to adjust the step by step and in case of a cast in place concrete facility such as a box type culvert it is designed to have a small step inside the culvert to prevent crushing of the facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200338809-Y1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "the existing sewage pipe is installed by giving a gradient between the manhole and the manhole not a pressure pipe such as a water supply pipe or a gas pipeline and since sewage flows due to its natural gradient the sewage pipe is damaged in the underground state or the excellent pipe is joined to the sewage pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a body having a box shape with an installation space inside a mounting hole formed through the side and a cylindrical flange extending from the upper surface a manhole cover that is detachably coupled to the flange to open and close the installation space in communication with the inside of the flange and it includes a guide sleeve mounted on the mounting hole to guide the cable to the installation space an installation ring is formed on the upper and side surfaces of the body and a fixing groove is formed on the side of the body recessed to a certain depth along the circumferential direction of the side a drainage channel extends downward on the inner lower surface of the body and an inclined gradient is formed on the inner lower surface of the body toward the drainage channel a manhole installed at the lower part of the installation space and filtering foreign substances contained in the water flowing into the installation space and then intermittently discharging the purified water toward the drain"}]</data>
