  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102855051-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "however it is difficult to identify trash inside the manhole by manpower and if the trash is not cleaned in a timely manner the trash can block the river connection pipe connecting the manhole to the river and as a result the mixed water of sewage and rainwater cannot be discharged into the river so the inside of the manhole becomes filled with the mixed water of sewage and rainwater and the mixed water of sewage and rainwater flows back upstream of the manhole causing urban flooding"}, {"pat_id": "US-5161911-A", "para_id": "para_94", "text": "sometimes flooding problems are worse in the one part of a city than in another portion thereof because of the differences in water drainage patterns"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101955319-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "10 1673966 november 26 2016 manhole drainage and ventilation system in underground distribution line summary of the invention the present invention has been made in view of the above described problems in the prior art and it is an object of the present invention to solve the above mentioned problems it is possible to prevent secondary electric safety accidents caused by external damage such as an earthquake inside the underground pipe due to an external force such as an earthquake or the like the main purpose of this system is to provide an improved drainage system of underground distribution line to prevent flooding and to prevent electric accidents caused by flooding.a base plate 20 installed on an inner bottom surface of the underground pipe 10 a base plate 20 mounted on the base plate 20 and a plurality of underground distribution lines l which are seated on the shelves 24 and which are arranged in the vertical direction at the center of the shelves 24 1"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100675583-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "since it is closed it is possible to effectively block the phenomenon that the sewage flow back to the upper portion of the collecting manhole 20.as described above the present invention can reduce the rapid flow rate of a large amount of sewage flowing into the sewage pipe due to the rapid increase in the amount of flowing water as well as a large amount of sewage does not flow rapidly through the sewer pipe it is a very useful invention that can effectively prevent the backflow phenomenon to prevent the flooding caused by the backflow of sewage in advance thereby greatly improving the efficiency and reliability of the device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101373478-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "drain device of manholethe present invention relates to a non power drainage device of the manhole and more specifically to detect the inundation through the water level sensing buoy in the presence of the manhole inside and operate the ejector installed in the connection pipe line and the manhole pipe with a non powered water in the manhole the present invention relates to a non powered drainage device of a manhole that is quickly discharged to the outside to prevent corrosion and breakdown of facilities due to flooding inside the manhole and to maintain a clean state"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101373478-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "according to the present invention when a flooding occurs in a manhole the opening and closing valve is automatically opened by a buoy rising and falling by the water level to quickly discharge the flooded water in the manhole to the outside by the suction force generated through the ejector thereby preventing corrosion or failure of the facility due to the flooding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102165890-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "this invention has the effect of preventing malfunction or performance degradation due to flooding of various sensors or moisture exposed for a long time by forming an air pocket"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200464364-Y1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in other words the connection between the conventional sewage pipe and the manhole is difficult to completely block leakage due to its structure and when the strength of the backup material weakens due to aging and flooding of the backup material due to the fixing of the sewer pipe and the index ring using the backup material there is a problem in that it is separated from the through hole of the manhole to avoid the leakage of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101911497-B1", "para_id": "para_66", "text": "therefore in the non power source immersion prevention system of the present invention the opening and closing valve 300 is automatically opened by the access port 200 that ascends and descends by the water level when the flooding occurs in the manhole and the water is flooded in the manhole by the suction force generated through the ejector 500 water can be rapidly discharged to the outside through the suction pipe 400 to prevent corrosion or breakdown of the facility by flooding and it is possible to immediately cope with the flooding by the person without any operation the installation cost is reduced as compared with the drainage method using the conventional pump and the pause time is set during the operation by the amount of water flowing into and discharged from the water collection container 630 provided at the upper portion of the water inlet 200"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100437577-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the underground equipment is flooded inside the underground structure due to water leakage which causes a decrease in the function of the underground equipment the flooding of the cable connection material causes the shortening of the life and the failure and the leakage of the manhole during the inspection due to the excessive drainage work time there is a problem to reduce the work efficiency .the present invention has been invented in view of the above mentioned problems and prevents leakage by inserting a plurality of sealing wings formed with a plurality of sealing wings inside the duct preventing the failure of cable connection material and improving the efficiency of structure maintenance installation and it is easy to dismantle store and transport and it can be reused which can reduce the cost and the purpose is to prevent leaks more completely by fixing the escape opening prevention device with a tightening bolt on the existing flange part"}, {"pat_id": "US-4892440-A", "para_id": "para_93", "text": "sometimes flooding problems are worse in the one part of a city than in another portion thereof because of the differences in water drainage patterns"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101345691-B1", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "in the above embodiment when the flow rate increases there is a limit value in the pipeline and when the pressure rises reverse flow of sewage occurs to prevent flooding damage at the upstream site"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole structure in particular by installing a buoyancy blocking device to block the inlet by the buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom of the rainwater inlet of the manhole while performing the original function of the rainwater on the road concentrated guerrillas it is related to the structure of the manhole backflow prevention system of the road which is designed to block the inflow of the manhole in case of the backflow of sewage due to heavy rain or flood thereby preventing flooding damage in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_44", "text": "the present invention by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113 the rainwater from the original while performing the function of the guerrilla torrential rain flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole block manhole block the present invention relates to a manhole block and more specifically is manufactured by mixing recycled aggregate recycled aggregate and concrete in a certain ratio to provide sufficient strength as well as eco friendliness through efficient use of resources as well as internal flooding due to rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "because the manhole cover is structurally exposed to the ground of the road or sidewalk especially when it rains heavily there is a risk of rainwater flowing into the manhole block and internal flooding no matter how airtight the sealing treatment is"}, {"pat_id": "US-11008747-B2", "para_id": "para_66", "text": "however as with conventional separate sewer manholes it should be understood that in exceptional use such as during heavy rain flooding and or blockage the first chamber may be in liquid communication with the second chamber via the first access port and or the second access port"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200450491-Y1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "formed to discharge a large amount of rainwater and waste and a block and a rotating plate installed to be fixed or mounted in the water hole and the discharge hole to discharge the sewage and waste and to prevent odors coming up the garbage can be discharged quickly eliminating the fear of flooding and preventing odors from the manhole from rising to the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however especially in the rainy season or in the fall foreign substances such as fallen leaves can block the inlet making it difficult to drain which can easily lead to flooding and human casualties"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_95", "text": "then the risk determining module 327 may generate an alert notifying flooding and or heavy blockage at the sewer manhole 201"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_114", "text": "in some embodiments the incidents and the potential incidents may include but not limited to blockages or flooding in the sewer manhole 201 due to increasing decreasing a level of wastewater in the sewer manhole 201 unauthorized tampering of sewer manhole 201 presence of flammable gas in the sewer manhole 201 battery level and battery performance of the one or more additional sensors and the level sensor"}]</data>
</edge>
