ding to the water level of the sewage"}, {"pat_id": "US-4892440-A", "para_id": "para_93", "text": "sometimes flooding problems are worse in the one part of a city than in another portion thereof because of the differences in water drainage patterns"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101506117-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "first the high initial initial rainfall that occurs at the time of sewage or rainfall inflowing into the city can be collected in the sewage subway pipeline through the sewage discharge section and the large amount of rainfall introduced into the large amount during rainfall is increased by the water pressure the opening of the sewage water discharge pipe is reduced by rotating the rotating plate by the linkage part and the link part linked with the open front water gate and the linkage part linked thereto to prevent the inflow of rainwater and soil to the sewage water supply pipe channel and discharging it to the discharge river it is possible to reduce the dredging cost by cutting off the earth and sand and it is possible to reduce the sewage treatment cost because it is possible to collect only the planned amount of sewage in the sewage subway pipeline as well as the breakage of the sewer pipeline and manhole due to the water pressure caused by the over can be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100868067-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole such as rainwater and sewage and in particular the appearance is beautiful and firmly constructed to not only beautify the appearance of the city but also to prevent breakage caused by the impact of the lumbar impact or pressurization of the weight during use and also prevent slippage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100971995-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "therefore it is virtually impossible to install a decompression valve in a jurisdiction block where a manhole structure is mainly installed in a road network where city traffic is frequent"}]</data>
