  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102541418-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "the maintenance guide groove part 42 is separated from the manhole 20 by erecting the backflow and fall prevention combination pad member 50 while the lifting position limiting bracket 40 is fixed to the manhole 20"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100444623-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "however if the precision construction is not made the watertightness is lost so much care is required during construction and even if the precision construction is performed the elevation of the ground due to the external conditions that is the temperature change and the external impact according to the season if sinking occurs the soldering parts are damaged and water tightness is degraded which leads to a problem of leakage of sewage and in some cases development of a hole or a connection socket of a manhole"}]</data>
