90 tandem roller 891 tamping roller 892 tire roller 893 tractor 894 trailer 895 ram 896 lead 897 coolant cooling 898 pile 899 helmet 900 fuel pump 901 cam 902 fuel tank 903 starting device 904 boom front pin 905 cad work 906 adapter 907 fish finder sonar 908 drilling machine for crude oil 909 manganese nodule 910 scoop net 911 suction collecting machine 912 seabed mineral mining robot 913 periscope 914 rubber balloon 915 wire rope chain 916 double structure pipeline automatic pneumatic valve transport device 917 core drill 918 bio pipe skid 919 rubber tire 920 burner boom 921 harmful red tide microorganism 922 pollution free natural gas 923 air nozzle 924 mineral gathering trough 925 updraft 926 downdraft 927 yellow dust fine dust 928 piers bridge columns 929 fish farms 930 chemicals 931 cement 932 nets for securing fishery resources 933 barges or quarantine ships 934 seaweed 935 sawtooth plows 936 boreholes 937 pipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100458619-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the non excavation overall repair method of supplying the impregnating tube to the inside of the molding apparatus and supplying compressed air or water to harden and cure the impregnated tube in the pipeline with hot water supplied by expanding the impregnated tube in the pipeline installing a forming end 50 having a forming hole 52 at one end of the tube 40 mixing the fast curable unsaturated resin with f a and materials with the impeller device 70 impregnating the tube 40 into the mixed quick curable unsaturated resin and f a and material installing a wholesaler device 60 to block the conduit 2 of the manhole 1 to prevent excessive extension of the impregnation tube 40 after connecting the forming end 50 to the impregnating tube 40 the impregnating tube 40 in the forming apparatus 10 by bending 90 toward the conduit 2 in the inside of the manhole 91 and injecting air to reverse insert step non excavation pipeline repair method using a molding end and a bottom wholesale characterized in that it comprises the step of lining in the pipe line 2 by supplying a water temperature of 85 to the reverse insert impregnated tube 40"}, {"pat_id": "US-5361799-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "the cracks are caused by shifts in the surrounding ground temperature changes that affect the cement and wear from auto traffic and so forth"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100477145-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "in addition even if precision construction is performed if the soil is raised and settled due to external conditions that is seasonal temperature changes and external shocks the soldering parts are damaged and watertightness is deteriorated"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101080118-B1", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "third the connection structure between the manhole and the sewer pipe of the present invention is due to the phenomenon that the inner wall surface of the manhole is contracted or expanded due to seasonal factors for example outside air temperature during use of the manhole and in the outer circumferential surface of the exponential socket and the manhole even if a gap is generated between the inner circumferential surface of the connection hole of the wall a leak can be prevented through an index ring installed at a corresponding portion between the exponential socket and the inner wall of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100444623-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "however if the precision construction is not made the watertightness is lost so much care is required during construction and even if the precision construction is performed the elevation of the ground due to the external conditions that is the temperature change and the external impact according to the season if sinking occurs the soldering parts are damaged and water tightness is degraded which leads to a problem of leakage of sewage and in some cases development of a hole or a connection socket of a manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200413252-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in other words due to the change of temperature and external impacts depending on the season and the impact of the uplift and settlement of the ground the mortar inlet is easily damaged and water tightness is degraded"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100718246-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "the method of claim 1 the inlet means a winch positioned in the other manhole to insert the folded liner located in the manhole on one side into the buried pipe a wire connected at one end to the winch and at the other end to a liner and mobile device that can move along the inside of the buried pipe to connect the wire connected to the winch to the liner deformation tube insertion method for preventing deformation due to temperature changes including"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4964402-B2", "para_id": "para_79", "text": "it is a whole block diagram of the management system of a water treatment facility.it is a schematic diagram of a manhole pump facility.it is a front view in a control box.it is a front view of a controller.it is a block diagram of a controller.it is a flowchart figure of an automatic drainage process.it is a timing chart figure which shows the drive timing of the pump by a reverse drive means.it is a block diagram of a monitoring control server.it is a facility condition screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.it is an operating current history management screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.it is a pump daily report screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.it is an alarm management screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.it is an alarm detail screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.it is an apparatus operation condition display screen figure displayed on the client terminal side.4 pump 6 controller 7 monitoring control server management device 13 internet communication line 14 manhole water tank 17 control box 18 water level sensor 19 temperature sensor temperature detection means 22 pump breaker 27 communication unit communication means 30 breaker sensor 33 automatic calling means 38 packet charging communication network communication network 39 information display means 51 operating current management screen 63 alarm details screen 64 device status display screen"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102008089-B1", "para_id": "para_42", "text": "1 is a diagram illustrating an example of a system for monitoring a state of underground facilities using a manhole cover based on a low power wide area network lpwan 2 is a block diagram of a wireless communication terminal system incorporating a smart metering based temperature sensor according to the present invention 3 is a block diagram for explaining the configuration of the wireless communication terminal shown in fig"}]</data>
</edge>
