  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100681956-B1", "para_id": "para_172", "text": "as described above the manhole having a multi structure according to the present invention when the sewage contaminated into the rainwater inlet space or the initial rainwater is usually introduced through the lifting floating means provided in the manhole this is discharged into the sewage inlet space which is purified at the sewage treatment plant and discharged to the stream to prevent the pollution of the stream.when clean rainwater flows into the rainwater inlet space it passes through the storm drain and discharges into the stream to protect the river ecosystem"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100757303-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a manhole type body each having a sewage inlet pipe and an outlet pipe for guiding sewage of the sewer pipe to the sewage treatment plant through the first accommodation chamber the second accommodation chamber which is in communication with the first accommodation chamber among the accommodation chambers and the third accommodation chamber which is isolated from the first accommodation chamber are installed inside the body so as to communicate with each other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100757303-B1", "para_id": "para_53", "text": "a manhole type body installed with a sewage inlet pipe and an outlet pipe respectively in contact with the first accommodation room of any one of the rooms to guide the sewage of the sewer pipe to the sewage treatment plant through the first accommodation room the second accommodation chamber which is in communication with the first accommodation chamber among the accommodation chambers and the third accommodation chamber which is isolated from the first accommodation chamber are installed inside the body so as to communicate with each other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101484891-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "the sedimentation paper 400 is provided with a path of at least several hundred meters or more and is formed in the form of a stream using a terrain thereby minimizing contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102660526-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a pool built to a predetermined depth on the banks of a stream or river a balancing tank connected to the pool by an overflow pipe and a drainage pipe to store water discharged from the pool a filtration device connected to the balancing tank and the supply pipe to filter the water in the balancing tank and connected to the pool and the water supply pipe to supply the filtered water to the pool and it includes a piping control manhole built between the pool and the balancing tank to control the overflow pipe drain pipe and water supply pipe to prevent contaminants from the pool from flowing into the balancing tank the piping control manhole is a first contaminant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the overflow pipe a second contaminant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the drainage pipe a third pollutant penetration blocking valve installed in the middle part of the water supply pipe a first pollutant discharge pipe and a first pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle portion of the front overflow pipe of the first pollutant penetration blocking valve a second pollutant discharge pipe and a second pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle of the drainage pipe in front of the second pollutant penetration blocking valve a water damage recovery system for a swimming pool comprising a third pollutant discharge pipe and a third pollutant discharge pipe control valve installed in the middle of the water supply pipe in front of the third pollutant penetration blocking valve"}]</data>
</edge>
