  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100900679-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "prevents weathering erosion and leakage of concrete by waste water and various chemical gases and prevents accidents and safety by preventing the occurrence of irregularities on the road by having the height adjusting granular pipe having the same height and inclination of the manhole cover and road surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100900679-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "each pouring part of concrete material is finished by manhole body made of synthetic resin material invert and top plate frame and has high corrosion resistance to prevent weathering erosion and leakage of concrete by wastewater and various chemical gases"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100900679-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "through this the wastewater flowing into the manhole body 10 and various chemical gases generated therefrom touch the upper frame 41 made of synthetic resin material having high corrosion resistance thereby preventing weathering and erosion of the pour portion 47 formed therein"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101287038-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "the present invention is universally applicable to manholes used for various purposes such as sewage water pipes water pipes and communication pipes and prevents cracking loosening and separation of the wj connection even in three dimensional deformation due to uneven sedimentation or erosion of the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101287038-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "the corrugation part 43 according to the embodiment absorbs the relative displacement of the manhole and the connection tube caused by partial erosion or unequal sedimentation of the ground layer in the state of engagement with the connection tube to prevent cracking relaxation or adhesive separation"}]</data>
</edge>
