  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101859056-B1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "according to the present invention only a crush stone is installed at the lower end of the reservoir structure so as to penetrate not only the reservoir of the storm but also the stormwater and by implementing the water circulation system penetrating into the ground through the reservoir with the upper reservoir and the lower reservoir it is possible to keep reservoirs and infiltration for water circulation and thus to prevent flooding even in temporary storms in areas where the impervious area is wide and the effect on the water circulation system is large.brief description of the drawings fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "in addition the storm recycling method is mounted on the road surface to block the inflow of large solids by storm inflow grating a solids removing step installed on the bottom of the rainwater inlet grating to remove the medium solids flowing into the rainwater a porous filtration screen step of removing fine solids in the rainwater that has undergone the solids removal step a rainwater storage step of storing rainwater introduced through the porous filtration step a filtration step for purifying water to remove contaminants in rainwater formed on the upper and lower trench conduits the rainwater flowing from the lower trench conduit flows into the groundwater layer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_32", "text": "on the other hand the storm recycling method the step of mounting on the surface of the road 8 to block the inflow of large solids to the storm inflow grating 10 a solids removal step installed on the bottom of the rainwater inlet grating 10 to remove the medium solids introduced with the rainwater a porous filtration screen step of removing fine solids in the rainwater that has undergone the solids removal step a rainwater storage step of storing rainwater introduced through the porous filtration step a water