cause leakage and the breakage of the partition wall due to expansion in summer.the present invention has been made in view of the above problems the object of the present invention not only can adjust the height of the main body according to the change of rainwater and sewage but also a plurality of the main body by fixing a single reinforcing beam and coupling force and by increasing the stiffness of the body to prevent distortion of the body due to water pressure and further provided with a support beam in the body to improve the durability and to adjust the length of the body in accordance with temperature changes to prevent damage to the body to provide sewage and storm divider assemblies for sewage pipes with"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100416293-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "conventionally since the raw water which has been settled through the initial settler is sent to the flow adjusting tank to supply a predetermined amount to the subsequent reaction tank the processing time is long and the sedimentation tank and the flow adjusting tank are separately required but the present invention requires a separate settling tank and a flow adjusting tank it is not necessary and the processing time can be shortened to about 0.5 to 3 hours thereby increasing the processing efficiency.as described above the present invention divides the water tank of the water quality adjustment tank 10 into the blocking wall 40 but the blocking wall 40 is lifted up and down by the lifting part 30 and the water quality of the incoming raw water and by measuring the flow rate to control the blocking wall 40 the transfer valve 60 the storm discharge valve 70 it is possible to increase the treatment efficiency of the sewage treatment system in response to the water quality change of the incoming water no settling basin or flow adjustment tank is required and the treatment efficiency of the system can be improved"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100781790-B1", "para_id": "para_84", "text": "keep the rising state so that the part 212 is blocked by rain storm consists of a floating lifting means 24 consisting of the lower float 23 to prevent the output"}]</data>
