  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101533943-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "in this way the entire amount of the sewage introduced into the combined sewer line is normally collected into the sewage water collection line but when a large amount of storm is introduced as in the case of rainfall the large amount of storm is collected and sent to the sewage end treatment plant the efficiency of the sewage treatment system is lowered due to the overload of the sewage treatment system the breakage of the sewage water collection pipe and the manhole opening and closing the upper part of the sewage water pipe may be damaged and the sewage treatment plant is excessively incurred in the sewage treatment plant the sewer pipe of the sewer pipe is required"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101012226-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in addition the conventional partition wall has a problem that the shrinkage phenomenon occurs in the winter the lifting phenomenon occurs on the mating surface to cause leakage and the breakage of the partition wall due to expansion in summer.the present invention has been made in view of the above problems the object of the present invention not only can adjust the height of the main body according to the change of rainwater and sewage but also a plurality of the main body by fixing a single reinforcing beam and coupling force and by increasing the stiffness of the body to prevent distortion of the body due to water pressure and further provided with a support beam in the body to improve the durability and to adjust the length of the body in accordance with temperature changes to prevent damage to the body to provide sewage and storm divider assemblies for sewage pipes with"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102079279-B1", "para_id": "para_52", "text": "in this configuration although it consumes electrical energy and requires installation of a separate sensor motor and controller the initial rainwater inlet 61 of the initial rainwater storage unit 60 is clogged with contaminant