  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102714328-B1", "para_id": "para_445", "text": "the reason is that when the eco friendly movable weir for preventing green algae constructed according to the present invention is installed in a river with a structure of a dam reservoir lake or estuary and a structure of an eco friendly movable weir for preventing green algae 8888 that operates up and down to block a large amount of water green algae will not be generated by various reactions that occur naturally in the polluted river water and instead the polluted river water will be naturally purified into clean river water with a heavy specific gravity and at the same time the polluted river water will be naturally revived by preferentially discharging the clean bottom water with a heavy specific gravity thereby producing eco friendly electricity that is friendly to nature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102898667-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "a structure in which the above mentioned green algae prevention eco friendly movable weir frame 830 and white paper 88 are combined to block the inflow of polluted river water with a light specific gravity on top of the above mentioned green algae prevention eco friendly movable weir 8888 is formed a structure in which a plurality of bolt units 919 for siphon plate joining are connected to the upper part of the eco friendly movable frame 830 for preventing the occurrence of green algae so as to preferentially discharge clean river water with a high specific gravity a nature friendly environmentally friendly method for naturally purifying polluted river water by using an eco friendly movable weir for preventing green algae which is configured by combining a siphon plate 929 that acts to preferentially discharge polluted river water with a light specific gravity to the upper part of the siphon plate joining bolt unit 919 formed on the upper part of the eco friendly movable weir frame 830 for preventing green algae and forming a siphon passage 833 for di