  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101453163-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "the apparatus for treating contaminants in an early stage rainwater contaminant and a combined sewage pipe according to the present invention comprises a pretreatment tank 10 provided with a knocking screen 11 on the inlet 10a side and an outlet 10b of the pretreatment tank 10 a filtration tank 20 having a radial filtration device 21 including a cylindrical screen 23 connected via an inlet pipe 22 and a filtration layer 24 arranged in a multi stage radial configuration around the outer periphery of the cylindrical screen 23 a floating oil filtration membrane 30 formed on the upper front end surface of the filtration tank 24 and a weir formed on the filtration tank 20"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100633532-B1", "para_id": "para_63", "text": "the amount of sewage flowing through the rainwater and sewage inlets 23 may not exceed the weir 40 and the rainfall may be small even in rainy weather"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101266939-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "the method of claim 1 the initial rainwater collecting weir is the same as the initial upper water level of the upper weir the initial rainwater is filled in the initial rainwater storage tank while the initial rainwater is transferred to the initial rainwater storage tank through the contaminant blocking pipe rainwater filtration and collection device excluding the initial excellent after the rain reaches the upper end of the water level to perform the function of overflowing the rainwater to the top"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101345769-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "in other words the storage tank system is primarily equipped with a sewer pipe on the road surface of the end of the filter to filter out a certain size of contaminants the predetermined amount of rainwater that is the planned sewage of the rain for the usual amount of sewage hereinafter referred to as 3q passes through if it is the screen device is conducted so as not to interfere with the discharge the odor screen to close the mouth to the sewer pipe to prevent the external outflow of sewage odor rainwater in the state provided in the upper rainwater chamber is closed when the 3q inflow sediment inflow prevention device to discharge rainwater into the sewer pipe through the mouth wearable movable beam for fresh water and discharge to the weir weir in the state that the soil inflow prevention device is closed initial excellent from the wear it is provided on the storage tank and the inclined surface upper portion of the storage tank for storing and storing the residual water and remaining on the bottom surface after sending the initial excellent water to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101345769-B1", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "however in the case of the initial excellent residual in the weir 30 the organic matter is decayed and acts as a secondary pollutant with odor and when the height of the weir 30 is installed higher than the bottom surface of the mouth 10 as a sewer pipe to flow back since a problem may occur the wearable movable beam 600 is installed on the wear 30 so as to discharge residual rainwater and the initial excellent storage tank 700 is installed at one side of the wearable movable beam 600"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100447049-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "in the case of rainwater storms installed upstream the rainwater is collected at least 10 times the maximum amount of sewage during rainfall and thus the sewage flowing into rainwater stormwater installed downstream of the sewage flows in excess amount"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2663214-B2", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in the rainwater treatment facility according to the present invention in the case of a combined sewer system a lower weir having a height corresponding to the water level due to initial rainfall and a higher weir are provided in a part of the sewer pipe"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2663214-B2", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "therefore it is possible to separately treat the