  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1892343-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "to prevent the possible torque perpendicular to the flow direction 10 the forced plates 32 engage laterally in the guide slot 12 of the abutment 30 and reduce the possible torque of the lifting platform 17 when lowering perpendicular to the flow direction 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102562679-B1", "para_id": "claim_3", "text": "in any one selected from claims 1 and 2 deep dredging of the river having a large length maintenance and construction of the embankment of the dredged river so that it does not collapse using the civil engineering material after installing the foundation concrete on the bottom and side of the river the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing algal bloom for both ado and hydroelectric power generation is installed in a multi level step in the upper part to store a large amount of river water to produce eco friendly electricity while polluted after installing an eco friendly artificial fish farm combined rainwater storage tank at the inlet of rivers rivers dams and reservoirs which acts to purify river water naturally and at the same time to prevent flood damage the embankment is equipped with the automatic control system and the monitoring using an eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing algal blooms for both a fishway and hydroelectric power generation which is configured by combining a camera and the remote control system a large amount of river water is stored to prevent flood damage in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102562679-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "in any one selected from claims 1 and 2 a process of storing a large amount of river water by using an eco friendly movable weir 101 installed in the river or stream 2000 for preventing algal bloom for both fish and hydroelectric power generation structure a water reservoir 700 provided to store river water at a high place near the river or stream 2000 a structure in which a pump 33 is configured in the vicinity of the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing the occurrence of algal bloom for both fish and hydroelectric power generation a structure in which a pumping channel 701 is formed between the pump 33 and the water reservoir 700 a structure in which a drop channel 702 is formed between the water reservoir 700 and the river or stream 2000 after the pumped storage pump 703 is installed at the lower end of the falling waterway 702 river water is stored inside the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing algae for both fish and hydroelectric power generation during the day and then the fisheye and hydroelectric power at night the river water stored inside the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing the occurrence of combined algal bloom is pumped by using the pump 33 and the pumping waterway 701 to pump the opposite river water and stored in the water storage 700 and then the using the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing the occurrence of algal blooms which is configured to perform pumped power generation by using the pumped storage pump 703 of the falling waterway 702 stores a large amount of river water to generate pumped storage power at the same time it plays the role of a large rainwater storage tank that acts to prevent flood damage in advance and at the same time clean river water with a heavy specific gravity is constantly discharged through the bottom water discharge port 7777 for fishermen formed at the bottom to prevent algae from occurring electricity is produced using an eco friendly electricity system and a pumped storage power generation system that works to prevent green algae which is characterized by a nature friendly and eco friendly pumped storage power generation method that works to revive the natural ecosystem and at the same time naturally purify polluted river water at the same time it increases fishery resources by using naturally formed fisheries and at the same time acts as a large rainwater storage tank to prevent flood damage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102562679-B1", "para_id": "para_472", "text": "after the pumped storage pump 703 is installed at the lower end of the falling waterway 702 river water is stored inside the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing algae for both fish and hydroelectric power generation during the day and then the fisheye and hydroelectric power at night the river water stored inside the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing the occurrence of combined algal bloom is pumped by using the pump 33 and the pumping waterway 701 to pump the opposite river water and stored in the water storage 700 and then the using the eco friendly movable weir 101 for preventing the occurrence of algal blooms which is configured to perform pumped power generation by using the pumped storage pump 703 of the falling waterway 702 stores a large amount of river water to generate pumped storage power at the same time it plays the role of a large rainwater storage tank that acts to prevent flood damage in advance and at the same time clean river water with a heavy specific gravity is constantly discharged through the bottom water discharge port 7777 for fishermen formed at the bottom to prevent algae from occurring suggests a nature friendly and eco friendly pumped storage power generation method that works to revive the natural ecosystem and at the same time naturally purify polluted river water"}]</data>
</edge>
