eral interface of the pipeline 200 changes in temperature pressure humidity shocks vibrations toxic gases along with the position along the pipeline 200 and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "according to the freeze protection firefighting apparatus according to the present invention in order to prevent the freezing and freezing of the pipeline in which fire water is discharged from a fire hydrant a hose reel a fire truck etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "the heater unit 600 serves to prevent damage to the pipeline 510 due to volume expansion caused by freezing and freezing of the fire fighting water in the pipeline 510 due to the influence of low temperature in the winter season"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_74", "text": "on the other hand both the heater unit 600 and the water temperature detection unit 700 to prevent the fire water provided in the pipeline 510 is frozen in the winter and freezing may be disposed inside the fire box 530"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_76", "text": "the heater unit 600 and the water temperature detection unit 700 are both electrically connected to the control unit 800 and when the temperature of the fire water in the pipeline 510 sensed by the water temperature detection unit 700 is below the freezing point the control unit 800 provides power to the heater unit 600 to directly supply heat to the fire water in the pipeline 510 to prevent freezing by freezing of the pipeline 510"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_86", "text": "on the other hand both the heater unit 600 and the water temperature detection unit 700 to prevent the fire water provided in the pipeline 510 is frozen in the winter and freezing may be disposed inside the fire box 530"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101244452-B1", "para_id": "para_87", "text": "the heater unit 600 and the water temperature detection unit 700 are both electrically connected to the con