  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-11098926-B2", "para_id": "para_564", "text": "here is also shown possible connection 369 to collect and transport runoff water that might not been treated properly to the pipeline 329 to prevent contamination of the northern section 204 and to be used in power plants 300 and subsequently to be used for replenishment of the depleting geothermal reservoirs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100654221-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "there are problems such as being adversely affected.as invented to solve the conventional problems as described above the object of the present invention is to easily install in the required position inside the inclined pipe in the apartment house to reduce the flow rate of the pipeline while satisfying the design construction and design standards of the sewer pipe it is to provide a flow rate reducing device of the sewage pipe installed on the inclined surface that can prevent crushing or breakage of the sewage pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100447049-B1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition due to excessive wear height and river water backflow the domestic sewer pipeline system is over planned in the upstream pipeline so there is no contradiction in the downstream pipeline where all sewage and rainfall runoff are discharged to the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200334419-Y1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition due to excessive wear height and river water backflow the domestic sewer pipeline system is over planned in the upstream pipeline so there is no contradiction in the downstream pipeline where all sewage and rainfall runoff are discharged to the river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100399293-B1", "para_id": "para_59", "text": "economic losses to construct sewage terminal treatment plant can be saved.the stream runoff procurement apparatus and method thereof according to the present invention always allow a certain amount of streams to flow through the river to survive the ecosystem of the stream and furthermore the contamination of the pipeline is prevented in advance so that the groundwater due to the corrosion and breakage of the sewer pipe is prevented"}, {"pat_id": "US-12013155-B2", "para_id": "para_585", "text": "here is also shown possible connection 369 to collect and transport runoff water that might not be treated properly to the pipeline 329 to prevent contamination of the northern section 204 and to be used in power plants 300 and subsequently to be used for replenishment of the depleting geothermal reservoirs"}]</data>
</edge>
