 one making it possible to prevent the closed end which is has excellent sewage treatment plant hameuroseo be leaked to solid stream through a solid to a discharge formed in an upper initial settling tank inlet"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100957464-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "therefore the lower end of the odor prevention unit is also mounted to both sides left and right around the center line.odor prevention and dirt collection device for rain gutter collection basin of the present invention performs the function of a dirt collection device to prevent impurities from flowing into the flow pipe and odor to prevent the odor inside the rain gutter collection basin to leak outside not only does it perform the function of prevention but it also fulfills the first purpose of the rainwater collecting basin without clogging by collecting impurities through a large outflow hole formed in the upper part of the collecting network when an excessive amount of impurities and dirt are instantaneously introduced"}, {"pat_id": "JP-5378872-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "thus conventionally as a drainage device that is attached to a water collecting tank in a side groove and prevents the release of odors mosquitoes etc"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3466513-B1", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "at least one sensor device can expediently be provided in order to determine the degree of contamination of the retaining elements"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3466513-B1", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "due to the different design of the cross section the retaining element can be individually adapted to the installation situation in the respective rain overflow basin"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3466513-B1", "para_id": "para_67", "text": "in the event that the rain overflow basin 1 is busy or there is a blockage in the area of the retaining element 8 the water can thus flow from the basin chamber 5 to the basin overflow 7 via the emergency overflow 16 without being cleaned"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3647134-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "even if it is blocked by the disk cylinder the water will flow down in the downstream direction due to the rotation of the disk so the residue in the sedimentation basin that does not have a screen dust remover for lifting the residue even during rain other dust removal work can be eliminated"}]</data>
