  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101308064-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "the rainwater flowing into the non point contaminant removing device 10 may be rainwater collected from a roof of a building in addition to the above mentioned sump well"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101408175-B1", "para_id": "para_85", "text": "it is therefore to be understood that the appended claims are intended to cover such modifications and changes as fall within the true scope of the invention.10 greenhouse 11 roof 111 slope 12 solar cell module 20 mining membrane 21 cattle field 30 housing 31 duct 311 perforated plate 40 ventilation part 41 frame 42 inlet 43 outlet 50 filter purifier 51 chamber 52 biofilter 53 diffusion plate 531 through hole 54 exhaust fan 60 manure processing unit 61 contaminant removing tank 62 63 methane production tank 64 filtrate tank 70 collecting tube 80 cogeneration generator 81 gas storage tank 90 excellent water collecting tank 91 water pipe h p hot water pipe m mesh mesh 100 combined animal husbandry system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101662794-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "when the flow rate of the rainwater in the trough 20 is increased due to a large amount of rainfall the rainwater passes through the drain hole 22 and a large contaminant such as a part of leaves that can be accumulated on the bus stop roof 10 is discharged directly to the drain port 22 without passing through the catch 21"}]</data>
