  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101177255-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "contained in the air which causes a problem that can contaminate the water stored in the water tank.accordingly the present invention has been made to solve the above described problems the object of which is to forcibly vent the air inside the stainless steel cylindrical unit assembly type circular water tank to facilitate the flow of air the air due to the enclosed environment it is to provide a ventilation system of a stainless steel cylindrical unit assembled round water tank to prevent contamination in advance.according to the present invention for achieving the above object a bottom plate a circular cylindrical body installed on the top of the bottom plate an upper plate installed on the upper portion of the cylindrical body to cover and protect the cylindrical body the cylindrical body and the top plate a stainless steel cylindrical unit assembly type circular water tank having a finish installed to enclose a solar heat collecting plate wherein the solar heat collecting plate is fixed to the top plate and collects solar heat through a plurality of solar heat collecting cells and is collected through the solar heat collecting plate"}, {"pat_id": "US-5730179-A", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "in this respect it would be desirable if a rainwater collection device were provided which is part of a relatively closed system to prevent contamination of collected rainwater from fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "US-10377649-B2", "para_id": "para_87", "text": "the fermentation tank is preferably washed between different batches of microbial growth to remove attached growth at the waterline which may cause build up of contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102684272-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a rainwater storage bin with a structure where the bottom and sides are closed and the top is open forming a rainwater storage space inside to collect and store rainwater a cover plate that is installed to cover and seal the upper surface of the rainwater storage box has a plurality of rainwater inlet holes formed through it to guide rainwater to the rainwater storage space and has a plurality of wick exposure holes through which a wick is installed it consists of a wick installed through the wick exposure hole to absorb rainwater stored in the rainwater storage space and guide it to the upper surface of the cover plate after covering the rainwater storage box with a cover plate and installing a wick vegetation is planted on the cover plate and installed on the roof of the building to realize rooftop greening and improve the urban heat island the wick is made of non woven fabric and is manufactured by impregnating it with a treatment solution and drying it to increase antibacterial properties heat insulation adhesion fixation and anti contamination properties the treatment solution contains 5.5 by weight of hydroxyproline 4.5 by weight of triclosan 3.5 by weight of sodium methylsiliconate 3.0 by weight of sodium orthosilicate a green roof module responsive to heat reduction requirements characterized by 2.5 by weight of prostaglandin and the remainder being polyurethane resin"}]</data>
</edge>
