  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-4602939-B2", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "the elbow body e prevents corrosion and dust accumulation and contamination due to the wind and rain of the elbow and serves as an installation base for laying the sensor unit s which is an accessory device and the overflow water that has passed through the elbow"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100402289-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "there was no deterioration of the treated water or efficiency of the wind pressure and air volume of the blower 15b and only the contamination of the membrane increased resulting in a shortening of the membrane life due to membrane contamination such as a decrease in the amount of treated water.the present invention has been made to solve the problems of the prior art the flow control and the aeration and membrane separation function can be performed at the same time in the aeration and membrane separation tank facility is minimized hollow fiber membrane of the aeration and membrane separation tank it is protected by this separate facility to remove the metering tank and sedimentation tank at the same time to prevent contamination of the hollow fiber membrane and the waste water to be transported to each tank is made by the natural discharge the transfer pump is removed to reduce the manufacturing cost of the device it is an object of the present invention to provide a wastewater treatment method and apparatus for reducing power usage costs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200178694-Y1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "rotating so that the livestock sewage on the atomized ultra mirror is blown by the strong wind of the blower installed in the rear of the evaporator and evaporated into the atmosphere to prevent river water and groundwater contamination and odor pollution and bacterial infection"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4931039-B2", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "measurement procedure the procedure for measuring the degree of contamination of raw water by the water quality monitoring apparatus shown in fig"}]</data>
