e is a problem that can not effectively guide or support the lifting and lowering of the shrinkage induction.therefore the purpose of the present invention is to solve the above mentioned problems in the prior art and to install the government drift because the floating capacity of the government drift connected by the upper flange and the rope can be divided in the subsidiary bilge to form a small size of the government drift therefore it is possible to reduce the influence of algae wind and other external forces on the government reserve so that the purpose of reducing the flow phenomenon of the bellows member is to reduce the flow phenomenon"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200439741-Y1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "force is at work therefore the contraction induction weight 11 is in the form of having a floating force in the upper portion and thus has a self supporting force to be raised and lowered in the guide pipe 60 and standing in the water and the floating capacity of the government yugu 2 is an auxiliary floating hole 20 since it is a form of dividing in even if the size of the government piece 2 is made small the flow of the bellows member 5 is reduced by reducing the influence of birds wind and other external forces act on the government piece 2"}, {"pat_id": "US-11505962-B2", "para_id": "para_234", "text": "a method of manufacturing and using a five device in one water collecting and decelerating fruit and nut collecting and decelerating wind diffusing and redirecting multi function transversable ridge and seam multi function twist locking base carapace which has at least one first three hundred and sixty degree orientational carapace panel at least one second three hundred and sixty degree orientational carapace panel a water ejecting fruit and nut discharging wind diffusing crown carapace nozzle at least one breadth wise carapace panel connecting seam at least one mid panel water directing water decelerating fruit and nut decelerating wind diffusing ridge seam a