  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101974919-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "wherein the control unit controls the water circulation unit to move to the first installation point when the water circulation unit is out of the setting radius based on the location information provided by the gps module the frame is provided with a weather vane and is controlled so as to be able to maintain the position by discharging water to the discharge port in the direction opposite to the wind direction so as to prevent movement according to the wind direction when the frame moves by the wind the angle adjusting means includes a center bar provided at a center of the frame a guide raised and lowered along the center bar and a connection link connected between the guide and the solar panel the lower end of the solar panel is connected to the frame by a hinge structure so as to be rotatable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b the