  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-3976072-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "according to the automatic detection system for small scale septic tank abnormality detection disclosed in patent document 1 even if a failure of the septic tank blower is detected by an abnormal current and an abnormality in treated water quality can be detected by the water quality sensor the contents of the septic tank abnormality aeration failure mainly due to blower failure stop aeration failure due to piping damage leakage due to damage cracking of tank body flooding in tank due to malfunction of discharge pump flooding in tank due to abnormal discharge destination etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101192702-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "on the other hand in the past a water leakage management system using a leak detection sensor such as a leak detection sensor cable or an electrode sensor has been proposed but due to the huge construction cost it is caused by flooding or leaking of a computer center semiconductor line special process machinery and power plant etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200335039-Y1", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "therefore the groundwater leakage or flooding is minimized through the basement outer wall where the waterproofing is not performed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_53", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102456914-B1", "para_id": "para_108", "text": "it is most preferable to be formed to be located at a depth of 15 cm to 30 cm underwater from the surface of the water tank because it is flooded to the upper part of the wheel causing a problem of flooding or leakage toward vehicle parts"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101013539-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "conventional sewage pipe repair method introduced to date as described above is not only has advantages and disadvantages according to the construction method but also is divided into the exponential method to index the leakage or flooding method and reinforcement method to reinforce the damaged pipeline conventionally the repair method has no method of preparing for such leaks and inundations due to the damage that may occur after the completion of repair of damaged pipelines"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200464364-Y1", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in other words the connection between the conventional sewage pipe and the manhole is difficult to completely block leakage due to its structure and when the strength of the backup material weakens due to aging and flooding of the backup material due to the fixing of the sewer pipe and the index ring using the backup material there is a problem in that it is separated from the through hole of the manhole to avoid the leakage of sewage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101911497-B1", "para_id": "para_37", "text": "there is a place where a drainage facility should be installed place where the equipment is expected to be damaged by flooding a valve room where electricity is not supplied it is installed in a place where there is a risk of leakage of drainage pump due to submersion"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100437577-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "the underground equipment is flooded inside the underground structure due to water leakage which causes a decrease in the function of the underground equipment the flooding of the cable connection material causes the shortening of the life and the failure and the leakage of the manhole during the inspection due to the excessive drainage work time there is a problem to reduce the work efficiency .the present invention has been invented in view of the above mentioned problems and prevents leakage by inserting a plurality of sealing wings formed with a plurality of sealing wings inside the duct preventing the failure of cable connection material and improving the efficiency of structure maintenance installation and it is easy to dismantle store and transport and it can be reused which can reduce the cost and the purpose is to prevent leaks more completely by fixing the escape opening prevention device with a tightening bolt on the existing flange part"}, {"pat_id": "US-7403839-B1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "such sensors 12 can be hard wired into the electrical supply of the structure or battery operated but are preferably hard wired and include a battery backup in the event of a power failure a condition where flooding is more likely"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102464092-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "due to the interruption there is a high risk of facility flooding and sewage leakage and water quality deterioration problems frequently occurred due to the occurrence of capitalization due to over aeration due to continuous aeration time maintenance during leakage.republic of korea patent registration 10 1579488no"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100587771-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "therefore the groundwater leakage or flooding is minimized through the basement outer wall where the waterproofing is not performed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the flood diffusion prevention system of a building structure that is installed in a multi story building structure and prevents the water flowing in due to leakage from spreading to the elevating facility space a drainage passage formed on the floor of the common space for each floor in the building structure a drainage trench installed on the upper portion of the drainage passage to shield the drainage passage and a plurality of drainage holes for draining the inflowing water into the drainage passage a drain module connected to and configured to include a pipe for discharging the water to the outside a flood detection sensor installed in the drainage module to detect whether water has flowed in a water supply shutoff valve installed in a water supply line of the building structure to block water supply by a control signal and a flood signal received from the flood detection sensor a control unit for transmitting the control signal to the water supply shut off valve so as to be blocked and it is installed in front of the opening closing door of the elevator installed in the building structure and is raised to a preset height from the floor and includes a blocking module to prevent water from flowing into the elevator when submerged the blocking module is a blocking member installed in front of the opening closing door to open or shield the front lower part of the opening closing door according to the elevation an elevating wire having one end coupled to the upper portion of the blocking member to elevate the blocking member and the flooding prevention system of a building structure characterized in that it is connected to the other end of the elevating wire and configured to include a wire driving unit for elevating and lowering the elevating wire in conjunction with the opening and closing operation of the opening and closing door"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_57", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101 not the bottom of the drain 101 so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage not living water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100439852-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "by the way the water flowing through the water pipe is also transported with foreign matters lighter than water and these foreign matters are adsorbed by the air valve and the distillation valve to form a gap and cause an accident such as leakage and flooding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101980335-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "according to an aspect of the present invention there is provided an all surface circulation injection device for flooding a water surface through a buoyant body an air intake pipe for sucking outside air and a suction pipe composed of a flexible hose a circulating pump for sucking and discharging the deep water and the outside air by extending the suction port to the deep layer an oil leakage preventing rope used to be hung on hooks formed on the buoyant body a filtration device which is composed of a filtration net that is laid on the outer circumferential surface of the suction pipe to filter suspended substances or foreign matter to prevent clogging of the suction port"}]</data>
</edge>
