  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-9771712-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "a sump pump connects directly to the sewer drain pipe using a drain pipe coupler or is located adjacent thereto within the tank where overflow from the drain triggers the sump pump to discharge fluid and sewage into an outlet pipe and out of the basement to prevent flooding and contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101194503-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "multi function water storage system and method for reducing the contamination by initial rain and preventing a city from flooding the present invention relates to a multi functional next generation storage system and storage method that can be easily applied to urban areas and can be used to control the initial excellent pollution load caused by rainfall to prevent urban flooding and to reuse water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101674110-B1", "para_id": "para_41", "text": "it will be understood by those skilled in the art that various changes and modifications may be made without departing from the scope of the present invention.1 rainwater catcher 2 3 by drain pipe 4 infiltration ball 10 penetration ditch 10a infiltration ditch inflow section 11 perforated fan for flow equalization 12 shovel rake 12a contamination 13 flooding bumps 14 drainage filter fiber 15 observation 15a 15b plug 20 pretreatment tank 20a pretreatment tank inflow section 21 sand pack 22 stagnant water outlet 30 runoff water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101724155-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "field of the invention 0001 the present invention relates to a rainwater purification plant the present invention relates to rainwater purification and water supply facilities for trees and more particularly to a rainwater purification and water supply facility for trees which comprises a sidewalk covered with concrete and asphalt a rainwater flowing along a sidewalk and a road surface it is introduced into the reservoir soil and supplied to the foundation soil again through many wicks to prevent contamination of the river or ground water prevent flooding due to heavy rainfall improve the urban aesthetics and prevent the trees from dry the present invention relates to a rainwater purification and water supply facility for trees"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101038336-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "by dispersing rainwater it is possible to prevent flooding of roads and low lying houses and to help counter flooding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102479290-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "therefore the storage tank only serves to prevent flooding by temporarily storing rainwater but it is difficult to reuse the stored rainwater because the water quality is not good"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102228908-B1", "para_id": "para_61", "text": "as described above the water supply air discharge facility 100 according to the present invention can stably discharge the air inside the water supply pipe 200 to the outside in a normal operating state and the valve chamber due to the abnormal pressure of the water supply pipe 200 in addition to being able to efficiently cope with the occurrence of abnormalities on the water supply pipe 200 side such as flooding of 110 it is possible to prevent contamination of the water supply pipe 200 due to flooding of the valve chamber 110"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101937611-B1", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "therefore in the sewage odor removal system of the present invention the supply water flowing into the spraying housing moves downward through the upper discharge hole of the adjustment inlet so as to dissolve and store the stored medicine and at the same time since the supply water is discharged by adjusting the gap between the drain pipe 112a and the drain pipe 112a it is possible to sufficiently dissolve the chemicals and to discharge them and also it is possible to safely and accurately sense the return pipe line condition by protecting the detection sensor and to prevent flooding of the sensing sensor to prevent contamination and damage and to selectively maintain deodorization direction sterilization or a mixture of these as needed to maintain the state of the best sewage line it is effective"}]</data>
