, {"pat_id": "KR-101063307-B1", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "not only burnout occurred but there was a problem of property damage due to flooding due to drainage.the present invention is to solve the above problems the air is compressed in the inside of the air pressure tank by the suction force of the drain pump during the drainage process was compressed in the air pressure tank when the water in the drain pipe back flow after the completion of drainage as the air expands it supports the check valve for preventing the backflow to prevent water hammer and at the same time to discharge the end of the drain pipe to constitute a water collecting tank drainage device equipped with a water hammer prevention air pressure tank to remove the foreign matter caught in the filter net of the drain pump biodegradation that is sucked together with water by suction power of the drainage pump when the drainage pump is installed by installing a vacuum netting connecting socket to which the vacuum gauge is connected to the suction end of the drainage pump and a plurality of foreign matter crushing blades are provided"}]</data>
