  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101291991-B1", "para_id": "para_84", "text": "thereby breakage of the said reverse osmosis membrane can be prevented more reliably"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_539", "text": "16 a high pressure bowl tank 303 is formed on the upper side of a conventional low level water collection tank 34 in the shape of a soccer ball or a popping pressure mechanism and a spring 186 type safety valve 473 is formed on the side of the tank 34 and is made of the material of the tank 303 using the stainless steel casting product hsc ks symbol h steel s stainless c casting of the korean industrial standard ksd 4103 and then installed"}, {"pat_id": "US-6838007-B2", "para_id": "para_19", "text": "the discharge line can also include a means to prevent a forward flow leak during tablet addition to the concentrate tank such means can include a block valve in the concentrate discharge line"}, {"pat_id": "US-8617390-B2", "para_id": "para_33", "text": "a downstream pressure system may also be used to draw gases out of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "US-11738314-B2", "para_id": "para_56", "text": "the cleaned water output from the membrane unit can be passed through a check valve 37 back into the collection launder 41 while the brines oxides acids and inert materials are redirected through port 35 to a collection vat 36"}]</data>
