 power supply signal transmission unit and groundwater upper protection device capable of underwater discharge sterilization treatment"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101131116-B1", "para_id": "para_29", "text": "in addition by installing a heating wire to prevent freezing waves in the underground water protection unit and by configuring a controller to supply power according to the temperature it is possible to automatically control according to temperature changes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101131116-B1", "para_id": "para_122", "text": "in addition by installing a heating wire to prevent freezing waves in the underground water protection unit and by configuring a controller to supply power according to the temperature it is possible to automatically control according to temperature changes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-0161642-B1", "para_id": "para_35", "text": "therefore when a backflow occurs from the hot water storage tank 12 due to the breakage of the check valve 13 the temperature of the cold water of the cold water storage tank 10 is increased to be higher than the minimum cooling temperature"}, {"pat_id": "US-4773991-A", "para_id": "para_12", "text": "the pressure switch 28 thereby protects the pump against cavitation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101862825-B1", "para_id": "para_21", "text": "in addition according to another embodiment of the present invention a sodium hypochlorite generation system based on normal temperature control of liquid phase dechlorination and backflow prevention of chlorine injection has an inverse number in response to shortage of water supply pressure due to chlorine injection through the vacuum pressure of the injector this prevents chlorine and water from being corroded.fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102355027-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "an outer housing 10 having a frame structure having a predetermined size the inner housing 20 is installed inside the outer housing 10 the upper surface is opened to accommodate the object to be treated therein a stirring unit 30 installed 