north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "JP-2926400-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "it is attached to the front side to remove the sediment accumulated in the intake garden 7 regularly or irregularly and to reduce the water level in the closed intake well 20 indicated by the water level detector 22"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100805878-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "an elastic tubular body 11 which is installed in contact with the sewage pipe 1 adjacent to the river and forms a passage for discharging the fluid and installed on the outer periphery of the elastic pipe body and the river water level rises in order to block the reverse flow to press the elastic pipe to close the housing 10 to be coupled to the sewer pipe while wrapping the elastic pipe the elastic tubular body is installed on the pinch bar 21 which is installed inside the housing so as to be movable up and down from an outer circumference and the shaft bar 25 which is connected to the pinch bar while penetrating the inside and the outside of the housing while elevating along the level of the river"}]</data>
