  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200300300-Y1", "para_id": "para_20", "text": "in addition the elastic packing 1 is interposed between the end pipe 12 and the connecting pipe 13 the elasticity is generated it is possible to adjust a slight angle in any direction 360 and can adjust the angle of the connecting pipe 13 it is possible to construct a natural slope suitable for the terrain and to prevent the breakage and departure from natural phenomena such as repeated ground subsidence and elevation so that the life of the rainwater receiver can be extended"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102895527-B1", "para_id": "para_11", "text": "in addition the buffer support guide airtight tube is further provided with a water leakage prevention protection means and the water leakage prevention protection means comprises an inner elastic airtight tube fitted while wrapping around the buffer support guide airtight tube an outer elastic airtight tube fitted while wrapping around the inner elastic airtight tube connected to the buffer support guide airtight tube a water leakage filling space formed between the inner elastic airtight tube and the outer elastic airtight tube a buffer protection support tube fitted while wrapping around the outer elastic airtight tube operating support grooves formed on the inner surface of the outer elastic airtight tube arranged while wrapping around the inner elastic airtight tube an elevation guide support part connected and fixed to the operating support groove formed on the outer elastic airtight tube and supporting the inner elastic airtight tube a position detection sensor connected and fixed to the inner elastic airtight tube connected to the buffer support guide airtight tube one end of which is connected and fixed to the inner surface of the outer elastic airtight tube and the other end of which is connected and fixed to the inner surface of the outer elastic airtight tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102895527-B1", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "the above leakage blocking protection means 32 comprises an inner elastic seal tube 321 made of a synthetic resin material having elasticity which is fitted while wrapping around the buffer support guide seal tube 30 and then attached and fixed to the buffer support guide seal tube 30 an outer elastic seal tube 322 made of a synthetic resin material having elasticity which is fitted while wrapping around the inner elastic seal tube 321 fastened to the buffer support guide seal tube 30 a leakage filling space 323 formed between the inner elastic seal tube 321 and the outer elastic seal tube 322 and filled with leaking water a buffer protection support tube 324 fitted while wrapping around the outer elastic seal tube 322 and attached and fixed to the outer elastic seal tube 322 and a buffer protection support tube 324 arranged while wrapping around the inner elastic seal tube 321"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4612696-B2", "para_id": "para_49", "text": "on the other hand in order to estimate the amount of water leakage it is necessary to determine the representative pressure for each mesh"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100444623-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "however if the precision construction is not made the watertightness is lost so much care is required during construction and even if the precision construction is performed the elevation of the ground due to the external conditions that is the temperature change and the external impact according to the season if sinking occurs the soldering parts are damaged and water tightness is degraded which leads to a problem of leakage of sewage and in some cases development of a hole or a connection socket of a manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in the flood diffusion prevention system of a building structure that is installed in a multi story building structure and prevents the water flowing in due to leakage from spreading to the elevating facility space a drainage passage formed on the floor of the common space for each floor in the building structure a drainage trench installed on the upper portion of the drainage passage to shield the drainage passage and a plurality of drainage holes for draining the inflowing water into the drainage passage a drain module connected to and configured to include a pipe for discharging the water to the outside a flood detection sensor installed in the drainage module to detect whether water has flowed in a water supply shutoff valve installed in a water supply line of the building structure to block water supply by a control signal and a flood signal received from the flood detection sensor a control unit for transmitting the control signal to the water supply shut off valve so as to be blocked and it is installed in front of the opening closing door of the elevator installed in the building structure and is raised to a preset height from the floor and includes a blocking module to prevent water from flowing into the elevator when submerged the blocking module is a blocking member installed in front of the opening closing door to open or shield the front lower part of the opening closing door according to the elevation an elevating wire having one end coupled to the upper portion of the blocking member to elevate the blocking member and the flooding prevention system of a building structure characterized in that it is connected to the other end of the elevating wire and configured to include a wire driving unit for elevating and lowering the elevating wire in conjunction with the opening and closing operation of the opening and closing door"}]</data>
</edge>
