  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100908323-B1", "para_id": "para_7", "text": "an object of the present invention is to fasten the first pipe coupling and the second pipe coupling of the connecting portion for connecting the sewage receiver and the rain pipe to the face to face to minimize the overall height of the first pipe coupling and the second pipe coupling second the present invention provides a sewage receiver that can bury a pipe connected to a pipe coupling deeper from the ground to prevent freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_103", "text": "the upper plate 60 is installed on the upper end of the block 50 but by using the own weight of the upper plate 60 the upper tank 60 is seated and fixed on the upper end of the uppermost connecting block 50 thereby closing the vertical water tank 1a is formed s240 and finally the rain inlet pipe 64 is coupled to the inlet pipe coupling hole 61 formed in the upper plate 60 and then in the same position as the ground as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200181883-Y1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "it is designed to prevent clogging of gravel layer by blocking pipes of solids garbage gravel sand contained in rainwater.the present invention forms a plurality of through holes 2 in the rain pipe 1 and each through hole 2 is provided with a penetrating hole 3 having a filter 6 foreign matter contained in the rainwater rubble 14 by preventing the inflow into the water by preventing the blockage of the permeable ground rubble to improve the excellent water permeation function to prevent the overflow of the river and also to easily combine the coupling case 5 to the fixed case 4 it can be easy to install the filter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100792022-B1", "para_id": "para_103", "text": "the upper plate 60 is installed on the upper end of the block 50 but by using the own weight of the upper plate 60 the upper tank 60 is seated and fixed on the upper end of the uppermost connecting block 50 thereby closing the vertical water tank 1a is formed s240 and finally the rain inlet pipe 64 is coupled to the inlet pipe coupling hole 61 formed in the upper plate 60 and then in the same position as the ground as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101983371-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "at the same time the tree branches it is a natural friendly environment that cleans polluted river water by creating a large artificial rain farm for artificial rainwater storage which is composed of large scale rainwater reservoirs which acts to prevent the pollution of the river environment by pulverizing the quality and garbage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the initial ignition source 95 utility pole 96 transformer 97 reducer bushing socket 99 flashing warning light 100 paraffin nozzle plug 101 pressure gauge 102 bimetallic sensor 102a thermocouple configuration 102b thermal current generation 102c thermal electromotive force generation 102d measuring point 102e reference point 103 thermocouple thermometer switch for detection sensor 103a configuration of thermocouple thermometer 103b temperature measurement limit 103c temperature 1 103d ammeter temperatur