he partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body is coupled to the top of the body a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve a freeze proof shape memory alloy spring having an upper end coupled to the inside of the partition wall a stopper coupled to a lower end of the freeze protection shape memory alloy spring it is coupled to the lower end of the body to receive the stopper the top is open and comprises a freeze proof coupling having a water discharge pipe at the bottom a freezing hole is formed at the bottom of the body at room temperature through the fire valve and the stopper to form a sealed structure the fire retardant shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve and water is injected through the water injection port the sprinkler with a freeze protection structure characterized in that the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring is tensioned at a predetermined freezing temperature so that water flows out through the freeze protection hole and the water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "in the sprinkler a body having a cylindrical shape and having an open top and having at least one water jet it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner diameter of the body the outer peripheral surface of the partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body is coupled to the top of the body a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve it is coupled to the lower end of the body and the freeze proof coupling body having an upper portion and a water discharge pipe in the lower portion a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring coupled to one side of the freeze protection assembly a stopper accommodated inside the freeze protection assembly and coupled to a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring a freezing hole is formed at the bottom of the body at room temperature through the fire valve and the stopper to form a sealed structure the fire retardant shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve and water is injected through the water injection port sprinkler having a freeze protection structure characterized in that the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined freezing temperature water flows through the freeze protection hole and the water discharge pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_14", "text": "the present invention in order to solve the problems of the conventional sprinkler in the sprinkler the body is composed of a cylindrical upper portion is open and at least one water spray port on the side it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner diameter of the body the outer peripheral surface of the partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body is coupled to the top of the body a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve a freeze proof shape memory alloy spring having an upper end coupled to the inside of the partition wall a stopper coupled to a lower end of the freeze protection shape memory alloy spring it is coupled to the lower end of the body to receive the stopper the top is open and comprises a freeze proof coupling having a water discharge pipe at the bottom the freezing hole is formed at the lower end of the body and at room temperature the fireproof valve and the stopper form a sealed structure and the fireproof shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_15", "text": "a sprinkler comprising a body having a cylindrical shape the top of which is open and having at least one water jet it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition having an outer diameter of a predetermined size smaller than the inner diameter of the body the outer peripheral surface of the partition has a top plate of a predetermined thickness to seal the top of the body coupled to the top a water pipe coupling portion a fire prevention valve accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall at a lower side of the upper plate a fireproof shape memory alloy spring coupled to the lower side of the upper plate and accommodated between an inner circumferential surface of the body and an outer circumferential surface of the partition wall and coupled with a fire valve it is coupled to the lower end of the body and the freeze proof coupling body having an upper portion and a water discharge pipe in the lower portion a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring coupled to one side of the freeze protection assembly a stopper accommodated inside the freeze protection assembly and coupled to a freeze protection shape memory alloy spring the freezing hole is formed at the lower end of the body and at room temperature the fireproof valve and the stopper form a sealed structure and the fireproof shape memory alloy spring is compressed at a predetermined fire temperature to open the fire valve"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "according to the present invention in the sprinkler the body 1 having a cylindrical shape the top is open and at least one water injection port 101 on the side it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition 201 having an outer diameter smaller than the inner diameter of the body 1 the outer peripheral surface of the partition 201 to seal the upper end of the body 1 a water pipe coupling part 2 having an upper plate 202 having a predetermined thickness and coupled to an upper end of the body 1 a fire valve 3 received below the upper plate 202 between the inner circumferential surface of the body 1 and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall 201 a fire prevention shape memory alloy spring 21 coupled to the lower side of the upper plate 202 and accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body 1 and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall 201 and coupled to the fire valve 3 a freeze proof shape memory alloy spring 22 having an upper end coupled to the partition 201 a stopper 221 coupled to a lower end of the freeze protection shape memory alloy spring 22 it is coupled to the lower end of the body 1 to receive the stopper 221 the top is open and comprises a freeze proof coupling body 4 having a water discharge pipe 401 at the bottom the lower end of the body 1 is formed with a freeze protection hole 102 at room temperature through the fire valve 3 and the stopper 221 to form a sealed structure the fire proof shape memory alloy spring 21 is predetermined the water is injected through the water injection port 101 by compressing at the fire temperature of the fire valve 3 and the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring 22 is tensioned at a predetermined freezing temperature to freeze proof hole 102 and it provides a sprinkler with a freeze protection structure characterized in that the water flows through the water discharge pipe 401"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102064947-B1", "para_id": "para_31", "text": "a sprinkler comprising a body 1 having a cylindrical shape and having an open top and having at least one water jet 101 on a side surface thereof it is connected to the sprinkler water supply pipe and has a partition 201 having an outer diameter smaller than the inner diameter of the body 1 the outer peripheral surface of the partition 201 to seal the upper end of the body 1 a water pipe coupling part 2 having an upper plate 202 having a predetermined thickness and coupled to an upper end of the body 1 a fire valve 3 received below the upper plate 202 between the inner circumferential surface of the body 1 and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall 201 a fire prevention shape memory alloy spring 21 coupled to the lower side of the upper plate 202 and accommodated between the inner circumferential surface of the body 1 and the outer circumferential surface of the partition wall 201 and coupled to the fire valve 3 it is coupled to the lower end of the body 1 the freeze proof coupling body 4 having an upper portion and a water discharge pipe 401 in the lower portion a freeze proof shape memory alloy spring 22 coupled to one side of the freeze proof coupling body 4 a stopper 221 accommodated inside the freeze protection assembly 4 and coupled to the freeze protection shape memory alloy spring 22 the lower end of the body 1 is formed with a freeze protection hole 102 at room temperature through the fire valve 3 and the stopper 221 to form a sealed structure the fire proof shape memory alloy spring 21 is predetermined the water is injected through the water injection port 101 by being compressed at the fire temperature of the fire valve 3 and the freeze proof shape memory alloy spring 22 is compressed at a predetermined freezing temperature to freeze proof hole 102 and water can flow through the water discharge pipe 401"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102561600-B1", "para_id": "para_17", "text": "in addition a sensor for detecting the internal temperature of the hydrant and a heating wire for supplying heat are provided inside the hydrant housing to keep the inside of the hydrant warm thereby exhibiting an advantageous effect of protecting the hydrant from freezing in winter.1 is a view of a replacement process of an antifreeze hydrant according to the prior art 2 and 3 are views of an automatic heating antifreeze hydrant according to an embodiment of the present invention 4 and 5 show only some configurations to show the operating principle of the automatic heating antifreeze hydrant according to the present invention figure 6 is an internal heating component using a hot wire of the antifreeze hydrant according to the present invention 7 is a coupling structure of the lower end of the middle pipe which is a part of the antifreeze hydrant according to the present invention 8 and 9 are the coupling structure of the upper end of the intermediate pipe which is a part of the non freezing hydrant according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102561600-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "in the present invention a heating wire is disposed inside the housing to supply heat in order to prevent freezing before water supply during a cold wave in winter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101153202-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "it can be achieved by the manufacturing method.the present invention is excellent in durability by manufacturing a pipe for pipes using a transparent polycarbonite and at the same time by allowing a plurality of pipes to be connected in succession using a clamp or coupling bolt the inside can be clearly seen from the outside exposed pipe the internal condition of the pipe can be observed with the naked eye without any equipment and the strength is so excellent that the shape is not deformed or broken even under strong external impact and the inner surface is very smooth the transfer speed is very fast so that a large amount of air or fluid can be transferred within a unit time and the color of the pipe changes according to the temperature of the air or fluid to be transported"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102061131-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a rectangular heating element for dissipating heat in accordance with the supply of power a rectangular heating element housing in which an electric cable connection hole is formed at one side and the bottom surface is concave so as to have a predetermined curvature while the heating element is inserted and wrapped therein an upper cover having an upper surface having a curved flat shape having a predetermined curvature and a lower surface protruding integrally formed with an insertion groove for fitting and coupling an upper end of the heating element housing a lower cover coupled to a lower portion of the upper cover to surround the heating element housing and having a through hole formed at a bottom thereof so that the heating element housing is partially exposed a thermal pad provided in a space between the upper cover and the heating element housing to block heat exchange with the outside a bimetal provided in an inner space of the heating element housing to automatically block a temperature rise of the heating element a heat transfer pad further coupled to a bottom surface of the heat generator housing to expand a heat transfer area of the heat generator housing or to be contacted along a curved surface of the pipe and the electrical cable connection hole of the heating element housing is provided in pairs one side of the connection hole includes a power member is drawn into the housing and the other connection hole includes a lamp member drawn out of the housing to indicate the operating state of the heating element strip connecting holes for connecting the strip of the pipe band is further formed at both edges of the upper cover the lamp member has a structure in which the lamp is coupled to the end of the bellows type cable having a predetermined length the heat transfer pad has a rectangular flexible metal belt structure as a whole pads are integrally formed at regular intervals on both left and right sides of the body portion constituting the center line of the metal belt structure and connecting strips of pipe bands to the end of the pad portion"}, {"pat_id": "US-4203805-A", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "the pumps 182 and 192 like pumps 132 and 134 are submersible and hence any heat generated thereby is utilized to raise the temperature of the water in the storage system"}, {"pat_id": "US-4211609-A", "para_id": "para_50", "text": "the pumps 182 and 192 like pumps 132 and 134 are submersible and hence any heat generated thereby is utilized to raise the temperature of the water in the storage system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101811240-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a power supply system for supplying power to a freezing prevention device for a fire fighting water supply pipe the freeze protection device includes ring grooves 14 and 14a in which elastic rings 13 and 13a are seated on the inside and ring grooves 14a and 14b which are divided into right and left sides and are positioned on one outer peripheral edge of the fire water supply pipe 40 and a motor fixing base 11 having a motor groove 11a in which a forward and reverse rotation motor 12 having a motor shaft 12a is inserted and fixed is formed at the right end thereof a rectangular electric energizing fi