  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-8211296-B2", "para_id": "para_56", "text": "the side stream thereby created can be used to introduce any additive such as for example a corrosion inhibitor into the flow of source water"}, {"pat_id": "US-8857473-B2", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "the flexible hose is pushed through the compression fitting towards the frozen blockage and emits a stream of water under pressure from the pump that erodes and eliminates the frozen blockage and return water is pushed from the blockage back to the return fitting and through the return hose to the container thereby providing a closed loop system"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101400074-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "further the present invention has an effect of improving the safety of the entire system including a display unit for monitoring and displaying the oxidant concentration at each of a plurality of points in the main stream pipe.1 is a block diagram of a ballast water treatment system in accordance with an embodiment of the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101983371-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "at the same time the tree branches it is a natural friendly environment that cleans polluted river water by creating a large artificial rain farm for artificial rainwater storage which is composed of large scale rainwater reservoirs which acts to prevent the pollution of the river environment by pulverizing the quality and garbage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102028873-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "the method of claim 1 further comprising a processing device for pulverizing and processing the contaminated river water into ultra fine particles the processing device a contaminated stream water final discharge pipe configured at an end of the river water processing box coupled with the water gate a driven shaft and a drive shaft by connecting one side and the other side of the processing apparatus a driven gear and a driving gear disposed on one side of the driven shaft and one side of the drivin