e 12 vertically connected between both ends of the bottom frame 12 it is formed with a visible wave collecting device 20 in the configuration a height adjustment means h and a coupling angle adjustment means l are provided at a connection portion with the contaminant collection device operation body portion 60 of the visible green flow collection device 20 the height adjustment means h is applied to have a height adjustment function of the visible green flow collecting device 20 by selecting one of a ball bearing screw bar rail and gear type the coupling angle adjustment means l has a structure in which an upper connection shaft 41 of which length is adjusted is installed on the vertical fixing shaft 31 and a hinge coupling part 42a is provided on the bottom fixing shaft 42 so that the upper connection shaft since the length of 41 is applied to increase or decrease the length of 41 the thorny bluish collecting device 20 having a configuration in which the vertical angle of the thorny bluish collecting device 20 is applied differently is attached to the front or the rear of the contaminant collecting device and used"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102207359-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "in the thorny sapphire removal device applied in combination with a contaminant collecting device to remove the thorny greens growing in water the center of the visible green water collection device is located at the rear side and both side portions at the front side and the upper frame 11 and the bottom frame 12 form a semi ellipse shape to form a semi elliptic shape and the side wall screen net 21 is installed and the bottom screen net 22 is installed between the front frame 13 and the elliptical bottom frame 12 connected vertically between both ends of the bottom frame 12"}]</data>
