  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200181883-Y1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "it is designed to prevent clogging of gravel layer by blocking pipes of solids garbage gravel sand contained in rainwater.the present invention forms a plurality of through holes 2 in the rain pipe 1 and each through hole 2 is provided with a penetrating hole 3 having a filter 6 foreign matter contained in the rainwater rubble 14 by preventing the inflow into the water by preventing the blockage of the permeable ground rubble to improve the excellent water permeation function to prevent the overflow of the river and also to easily combine the coupling case 5 to the fixed case 4 it can be easy to install the filter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101983371-B1", "para_id": "para_24", "text": "at the same time the tree branches it is a natural friendly environment that cleans polluted river water by creating a large artificial rain farm for artificial rainwater storage which is composed of large scale rainwater reservoirs which acts to prevent the pollution of the river environment by pulverizing the quality and garbage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_1169", "text": "main switch button for off control 67 auxiliary switch button 68 input of display for vertical multistage pump or computer network input 69 current pressure value or set pressure value pressure setting value recognition nameplate 70 memory 71 power cable 73 disaster prevention material mixer 74 turbine water turbine 75 cloth cover 76 solenoid valve 77 ad balloon 78 airship 79 gas cylinder 80 air compressor 81 mobile service 82 portable terminal 83 low pressure cutoff valve 84 emergency valve 85 pressure reducing valve 86 first pressure check sensor 87 second pressure check sensor 88 electronic control unit 89 disaster prevention piping line or pumping pipe 89a vertical positive pipe 89b vertical downward pipe 90 ball valve handle 91 drencher head 92 valve body internal disc 93 emergency siren 94 spark or lightning as the ini