2016628-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "including a rod and one side is fixedly coupled to both ends of the hinge shaft and the other side is composed of second connecting rods respectively coupled to both side plates of the strainer the strainer is the main weight of the rotating drainage plate if the amount of rainwater flowing into the opening is relatively small by limiting the rotation of the rotary drainage guide plate by the self load of the strainer to close the drain hole to block the odor flowing back from the sewer rain water when the amount of is relatively large the rotation drainage guide plate rotates downward to facilitate the inflow of rain water while the manure the present invention provides a sewer rain gutter having a bad smell counter current blocking function and a dirt filtering function for filtering dirt by a net"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100699326-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "wow connected to the connecting pipe 41 by bypassing the initial excellent drainage portion 20 and at least one connection valve 42 formed with one or more connection valves 42 at the connection pipe 41 it is connected to the connection pipe 41 of the purified water connection valve part 40 to receive rainwater the lower center is formed with a drain valve 51a the cylindrical shape having a support column 51b formed around the drain valve 51a while forming the water purification plant 51 a strainer 52 having a mesh shape is formed inside the water purification plant 51 and the primary water purification unit 50 including a cover 53 which closes the upper portion of the water purification plant 51"}]</data>
