  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102537944-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a plurality of fresh water tanks that naturally fall from a natural water supply source and receive and store water including a jurisdiction server for remote control of the freshwater tank in the forest fire fighting water management system the plurality of fresh water tanks are installed on one side of the mountain and one of the two connected to the water supply pipe is located above the other one the fresh water tank includes a water tank for receiving water therein including evacuation space where people can be located the two fresh water tanks connected by the water supply pipe are connected by two water supply pipes among the two water supply pipes a one of them includes a valve on one side so that the water contained in the upper water tank is dropped by the opening of the valve and the water is transferred to the lower water tank b the other one by using a pump the water contained in the lower freshwater tank is transferred to the upper freshwater tank when the valve is opened for the transfer of water a collision between water transferred from the upper water tank to the lower water tank and water transferred from the lower water tank to the upper water tank is prevented from occurring the water supply pipe is buried in the ground to prevent the water supply pipe from freezing and interfering with water supply between each water tank the jurisdiction server by selectively controlling the water supply pipe of the water supply source the valve of the water supply pipe of the fresh water tank or the pump of the water supply pipe of the fresh water tank according to the water level information of each fresh water tank it is possible to adjust the water to each fresh water tank by building a database based on the identification information of the freshwater tank and the identification information of the mountain in advance and providing it as information it is easy to use the water in the freshwater tank necessary for firefighting in case of disaster the fresh water tank a hose connector connected to the water tank is configured on the outside the hose connector is wound by a large reel and the fire hose connected to the hose connector is coupled to the flight means the hose connector of the fresh water tank is coupled to the fresh water tank by extending the pipe downward from the lower flange part and securing a separation space between the lower flange part and the upper surface of the fresh water tank to provide a plurality of ball valve plates arranged in the circumferential direction the hose connector is configured to be rotated by the rotation of the ball valve so that the movement of the fire hose connected to the hose connector is flexible"}, {"pat_id": "US-6237620-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "this expense can be considerable when it is realized that the pipes constituting the plumbing system for conveyance of water throughout the vehicle boat yacht cottage or lodge may proceed in relatively inaccessible regions which may require removal of a structural component of the mobile home boat yacht cottage or lodge in order to provide access to the freeze damaged length of pipe or the particular fitting adversely affected by the freezing temperature in the winter months"}]</data>
</edge>
