ipe bridges 938 anodes electrode plates 939 cooling air bubbles 940 bits 941 marine tunnel traffic devices dock hull deck top sdu hull deck center sdm dock hull deck bottom s dl machinery room floor surface top mfgu machinery room floor surface mfg machinery room floor surface bottom mfgl valve body center line vbcl or pbcl fire water level bottom wld fire water level wl l discharge level wlu pump body pb pump body vertical line pbvl pump body horizontal center line pbcl equatorial line el north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100610531-B1", "para_id": "para_73", "text": "rainwater drained through the drain pipes 104 formed on the lower four sides of the storage tank 101 as described above can suppress the forest fire while flowing down the mountain and at the same time block the flame to prevent the forest fire to spread to other places"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "in a slope 62 formed over a wide area for the purpose of creating grassland and forest a road 63 formed with a slope 67 at the edge so as to penetrate the slope 62 a water tank 71 provided between the front and rear walls 31 to prevent the slope 67 from sinking and a vegetation block 30 formed with a vegetation zone 33 provided with a water supply hole 44 perforated in the front wall 31 to plant landscaping trees 46 in a protruding manner an assembly block 30 30 assembled in a layered structure and a slope 67 formed in an arid or hilly area where a renewable energy generation device 100 formed with solar and wind power generation devices 60 68 is built near a field 74 or a grassland or forest management area on the slope in a slope 62 in which a plurality of afforestation blocks 30 are stacked on a slope 67 equipped to be planted in the above mentioned vegetation zone 33 a water tank 71 71 provided between the front and rear walls 31 of the afforestation blocks 30 30 assembled in the above mentioned stacked structure a vegetation zone 33 33 equipped with a vegetation wall 34 for planting landscaping trees 46 by protruding while a water supply hole 44 is perforated in the front wall 31 a moving gap 42 provided between a separate outer wall 32 in the rear wall 31 and afforestation blocks 30 30 are assembled in a stacked manner so that the moving gaps 42 are connected to each other an installation structure in a hilly area where a renewable energy power generation device for grassland and forest creation can be installed which is provided by assembling an assembly block 30 equipped with a vegetation wall 34 that is fixed to the outer section c of the vegetation block 30 connected to a water supply inlet 44 from a water tank 71 to support the lower section of the vegetation zone 33 33 while being assembled into the lower section of the above mentioned afforestation block 30 30 thereby preventing rainwater from collapsing due to subsidence on a slope 67"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_25", "text": "in a slope 62 formed over a wide area for the purpose of creating grassland and forest a road 63 formed with a slope 67 at the edge so as to penetrate the slope 62 a water tank 71 provided between the front and rear walls 31 to prevent the slope 67 from sinking and a vegetation block 30 formed with a vegetation zone 33 provided with a water supply hole 44 perforated in the front wall 31 to plant landscaping trees 46 in a protruding manner an assembly block 30 30 assembled in a layered structure and a slope 67 formed in an arid or hilly area where a renewable energy generation device 100 formed with solar and wind power generation devices 60 68 is built near a field 74 or a grassland or forest management area on the slope"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_56", "text": "in addition a vegetation zone 33 for creating a forest 47 is provided on the vegetation zone 33 on the upper side"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_74", "text": "here the invention is that the installation of the second renewable energy power generation device 100 installed to prevent subsidence due to the harmful gas 49 or rainwater on the slope is preferably installed in a hilly area 64 where sunlight and wind power are well transmitted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102851468-B1", "para_id": "para_75", "text": "therefore the purpose of this invention is to provide power and equipment for collection in an economical and environmentally friendly manner by providing a renewable energy power generation device which is the main component of the present invention and a suction pump suction pipe and storage facility connected thereto"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102561269-B1", "para_id": "para_72", "text": "4 the main functions and configuration of the electronic control unit 180 which sprays the fire fighting water stored in the above described fire fighting water storage tank to the forest fire occurrence point and performs the main functions necessary for forest fire monitoring are simply shown in a block diagram"}]</data>
