north pole np south pole sp longitude ld latitude lt road surface upper part glu road surface lower part gll road surface lower part gld sea level upper part slu sea level sll sea level lower part sld outside the machine room omr inside the machine room mr inside the machine room imr top of the spray nozzle a body of the spray nozzle b bottom of the spray nozzle c"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100415814-B1", "para_id": "claim_5", "text": "in the forest air supply system for compressing the forest air in the storage tank and moving it to a specific place to selectively discharge to a plurality of discharge places determining whether the storage tank t 1 is mounted determining whether the main valve is open if the storage tank is not mounted outputting the corresponding information to the key operation panel provided at the discharge location if the main valve is not opened outputting a main valve closing message and its cause to the key control panel checking whether an auxiliary valve opening request signal is applied from the key control panel when the main valve is opened setting a discharge time of the forest atmosphere by the user when the diffusion time is set opening the auxiliary solenoid valve corresponding to the unique number of the key operation panel operated by the user to discharge the forest atmosphere checking whether or not the spread setting time set by the user arrives the air supply method of the forest characterized in that the operation is completed by closing the auxiliary valve opened when the diffusion set time arrives"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100415814-B1", "para_id": "para_30", "text": "on the other hand the present invention is a forest air supply system for compressing the forest air in the storage tank and selectively discharge to a plurality of discharge places by moving to a specific place whether or not the storage tank t 1 is equipped if it is determined and not mounted outputting the corresponding information to the key operation panel provided at the discharge location judging whether the main valve is open and outputting the main valve closing message and its cause to the key operation panel when the main valve is not opened checking whether an auxiliary valve opening request signal is applied from the key control panel when the main valve is opened setting a discharge time of the forest atmosphere by the user when the diffusion time is set opening the auxiliary solenoid valve corresponding to the unique number of the key operation panel operated by the user to discharge the forest atmosphere checking whether or not the spread setting time set by the user arrives when the diffusion set time arrives there is provided a forest air supply method comprising the step of closing the open auxiliary valve to terminate the operation"}]</data>
