om the supply pipe 75 by a pressurizing pump 68 so that drainage of rainwater is promoted by the drainage pipe 70 drainage accelerator in drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_23", "text": "therefore when it is used for a long period of time it is deposited with soil or impurities due to the flow of rainwater in addition the blowing rain formed from the sudden occurrence of the heavy rain overflows the drainage capacity of the existing buried drain pipe resulting in an accident leading to the collapse as landslides in the valley or the soft area will be"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_28", "text": "a separate water storage tank 62 for storing water in an upper section of a drainage path 52 buried in an inclined land adjacent to the vegetation block 30 and a drainage pipe 70 at a side wall 72 of the water storage tank 62 and a branch pipe 76 connected at one side between the sections of the supply pipe 75 is connected to the inlet port 79 of the drain pipe 70 while being pushed downward and the discharge port 77 is provided with a high pressure water jetted from the supply pipe 75 by the pressurizing pump 68 so that drainage of the rainwater is promoted by the drainage pipe 70"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "at this time when there is a gap between the manhole body and the water inlet or drainage pipe rainwater or sewage may leak so when the inlet or drainage pipe is connected to the manhole body a hole is formed in the manhole body"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101715378-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "a drain pipe 100 buried in the ground a superior receiving part 200 installed at a predetermined distance from the drainage port 40 installed between the boundary between the sidewalk 10 and the roadway 20 and the roadway 20 and connected to the drainage pipe 100 a foreign matter blocking unit 300 installed on the upstream side of the excellent receiving unit 200 to block the floating foreign material from 